 its head in its hood while it is sleeping.',50,NULL,'Sewaddle','1','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-10','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Foongus','They show off their Poké Ball caps to lure prey, but very few Pokémon are fooled by this.',90,NULL,'Amoonguss','10','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-100','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has a body and heart of steel. Its glare is sufficient to make even an unruly Pokémon obey it.',120,NULL,'Cobalion','100','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('bw3-101','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'N','101','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('bw3-102','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This is an extremely rare Meowth card. Maybe good fortune will come to you if you hold this card!',60,NULL,'Meowth','102','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('bw3-11','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown.',60,NULL,'Shelmet','11','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-12','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Shelmet','Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements.',90,NULL,'Accelgor','12','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw3-13','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its head sprouts horns as sharp as blades. Using whirlwind-like movements, it confounds and swiftly cuts opponents.',110,NULL,'Virizion','13','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw3-14','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter.',60,NULL,'Victini','14','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw3-15','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter.',70,NULL,'Victini','15','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw3-16','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon lives in caves in volcanoes. The fire within the tuft on its head can reach 600° F.',70,NULL,'Pansear','16','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-17','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Pansear','A flame burns inside its body. It scatters embers from its head and tail to sear its opponents.',90,NULL,'Simisear','17','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-18','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Using their very hot, flame-covered tongues, they burn through Durant\'s steel bodies and consume their insides.',90,NULL,'Heatmor','18','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-19','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon was believed to have been born from the sun. When it evolves, its entire body is engulfed in flames.',70,NULL,'Larvesta','19','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-2','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,'Sewaddle','Forests where Swadloon live have superb foliage because the nutrients they make from fallen leaves nourish the plant life.',70,NULL,'Swadloon','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-20','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies.',80,NULL,'Larvesta','20','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-21','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Larvesta','When volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona\'s fire provided a replacement for the sun.',110,NULL,'Volcarona','21','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw3-22','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'By vibrating its cheeks, it emits sound waves imperceptible to humans. It uses the rhythm of these sounds to talk.',60,NULL,'Tympole','22','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-23','sui',NULL,NULL,2,'Tympole','It lives in water and on land. It uses its long, sticky tongue to capture prey.',80,NULL,'Palpitoad','23','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-24','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Palpitoad','It increases the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists. It can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch.',140,NULL,'Seismitoad','24','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw3-25','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,3,'Cover Fossil','Restored from a fossil, this Pokémon can dive to depths beyond half a mile.',90,NULL,'Tirtouga','25','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-26','match',NULL,NULL,4,'Tirtouga','They can live both in the ocean and on land. A slap from one of them is enough to open a hole in the bottom of a tanker.',140,NULL,'Carracosta','26','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw3-27','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon formed from icicles bathed in energy from the morning sun. It sleeps buried in snow.',50,NULL,'Vanillite','27','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-28','match',NULL,NULL,2,'Vanillite','It conceals itself from enemy eyes by creating many small ice particles and hiding among them.',80,NULL,'Vanillish','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-29','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Vanillish','If both heads get angry simultaneously, this Pokémon expels a blizzard, burying everything in snow.',130,NULL,'Vanilluxe','29','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw3-3','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Swadloon','Upon finding a small Pokémon, it weaves clothing for it from leaves, using cutters on its arms and sticky silk.',130,NULL,'Leavanny','3','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw3-30','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'With its thin, veil-like arms wrapped around the body of its opponent, it sinks to the ocean floor.',80,NULL,'Frillish','30','Common','Pokémon'),('bw3-31','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,3,'Frillish','The fate of ships and crew that wander into Jellicent\'s habitats: all sunken, all lost, all vanished.',110,NULL,'Jellicent','31','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw3-32','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.',80,NULL,'Cryogonal','32','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw3-33','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.',80,NULL,'Cryogonal','33','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw3-34','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It generates powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.',130,NULL,'Kyurem','34','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw3-35','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When thunderclouds cover the sky, it will appear. It can catch lightning with