thorita','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-57','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Gothorita','Starry skies thousands of light-years away are visible in the space distorted by their intense psychic power.',130,NULL,'Gothitelle','57','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-58','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy.',90,NULL,'Golett','58','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-59','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,4,'Golett','It flies around the sky at Mach speeds. Removing the seal on its chest makes its internal energy go out of control.',130,NULL,'Golurk','59','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw6-6','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Often targeted by bird Pokémon, it desperately resists by releasing poison from its tail spikes.',60,NULL,'Wurmple','6','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-60','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.',70,NULL,'Cubone','60','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-61','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Cubone','From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.',100,NULL,'Marowak','61','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-62','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When endangered, it may protect itself by raising its magnetism and drawing iron objects to its body.',80,NULL,'Nosepass','62','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-63','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It move by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.',60,NULL,'Baltoy','63','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-64','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,'Baltoy','An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light.',90,NULL,'Claydol','64','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-65','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'They were discovered a hundred years ago in an earthquake fissure. Inside each one is an energy core.',70,NULL,'Roggenrola','65','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-66','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,3,'Roggenrola','Because its energy was too great to be contained, the energy leaked and formed orange crystals.',90,NULL,'Boldore','66','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-67','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,4,'Boldore','The solar energy absorbed by its body\'s orange crystals is magnified internally are fired from its mouth.',140,NULL,'Gigalith','67','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw6-68','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When they encounter foes bigger than themselves, they try to throw them. They always travel in packs of five.',100,NULL,'Throh','68','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-69','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Tying their belts gets them pumped and makes their punches more destructive. Disturbing their training angers them.',90,NULL,'Sawk','69','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-7','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Wurmple','It wraps silk around the branches of a tree. It drinks rainwater on its silk while awaiting evolution.',80,NULL,'Silcoon','7','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-70','HiRON',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity.',100,NULL,'Stunfisk','70','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-71','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Terrakion-EX','71','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('bw6-72','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.',70,NULL,'Murkrow','72','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-73','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Murkrow','If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called \"Summoner of Night.\"',110,NULL,'Honchkrow','73','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-74','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.',60,NULL,'Houndour','74','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-75','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Houndour','The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever.',100,NULL,'Houndoom','75','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-76','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sprays a foul fluid from its rear. Its stench spreads over a mile radius, driving Pokémon away.',60,NULL,'Stunky','76','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-77','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,'Stunky','It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it.',90,NULL,'Skuntank','77','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-78','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.',60,NULL,'Aron','78','Common','Pokémon'),('bw6-79','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,3,'Aron','For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes it steely body against others to fight over territory.',90,NULL,'Lairon','79','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-8','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Silcoon','Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen.',120,NULL,'Beautifly','8','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-80','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,4,'Lairon','While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.',140,NULL,'Aggron','80','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw6-81','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Registeel-EX','81','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('bw6-82','match',NULL,NULL,4,'Nosepass','It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force.',110,NULL,'Probopass','82','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-83','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Durant dig nests in mountains. They build their complicated, interconnected tunnels into mazes.',70,NULL,'Durant','83','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-84','HiRON',NULL,NULL,1,'Swablu','If it bonds with a person, it will gently envelop the friend with its soft wings, then hum.',70,NULL,'Altaria','84','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw6-85','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Rayquaza-EX','85','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('bw6-86','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It attacks using its huge mouth. While its a