ong and compete with each other for food, they always eat too much.',90,NULL,'Zweilous','96','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw6-97','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Zweilous','This brutal Pokémon travels the skies on its six wings. Anything that moves seems like a foe to it, triggering its attack.',150,NULL,'Hydreigon','97','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw6-98','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Zweilous','The heads on their arms do not have brains. They use all three heads to consume and destroy everything.',150,NULL,'Hydreigon','98','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw6-99','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives high among the treetops. It can us its tail as freely and cleverly as its hands.',60,NULL,'Aipom','99','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-1','Kanako Eo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.',50,NULL,'Oddish','1','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-10','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude.',70,NULL,'Shaymin','10','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-100','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.',130,NULL,'Black Kyurem','100','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-101','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Black Kyurem-EX','101','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('bw7-102','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.',130,NULL,'White Kyurem','102','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-103','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'White Kyurem-EX','103','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('bw7-104','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It gnaws on hard objects to wear down its fangs, which grow constantly during its lifetime.',30,NULL,'Rattata','104','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-105','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Rattata','With its long fangs, this surprisingly violent Pokémon 