tomach. When it is angered, the intensity of the flame increases.',90,NULL,'Pignite','25','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-26','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,'Pignite','It has mastered fast and powerful fighting moves. It grows a beard of fire.',150,NULL,'Emboar','26','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-27','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100 F.',70,NULL,'Darumaka','27','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-28','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Darumaka','When one is injured in a fierce battle, it hardens into a stone-like form. Then it meditates and sharpens its mind.',110,NULL,'Darmanitan','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-29','Kanako Eo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It shelters itself in its shell then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.',60,NULL,'Squirtle','29','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-3','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,'Gloom','Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.',140,NULL,'Vileplume','3','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-30','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,'Squirtle','It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.',80,NULL,'Wartortle','30','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-31','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,4,'Wartortle','The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.',140,NULL,'Blastoise','31','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-32','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Overwhelmed by enigmatic abilities, it suffers a constant headache. It sometimes uses mysterious powers.',60,NULL,'Psyduck','32','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-33','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When headaches stimulate its brain cells, which are usually inactive, it can use a mysterious power.',70,NULL,'Psyduck','33','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-34','match',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Psyduck','It is seen swimming dynamically and elegantly using its well-developed limbs and flippers.',80,NULL,'Golduck','34','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-35','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Psyduck','When its forehead shines mysteriously, Golduck can use the full extent of its power.',90,NULL,'Golduck','35','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-36','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The oil-filled tail functions as a buoy, so it\'s fine even in rivers with strong currents.',70,NULL,'Marill','36','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-37','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Marill','Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are.',90,NULL,'Azumarill','37','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-38','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It carries food all day long. When someone is lost in the mountains, it shares that food.',80,NULL,'Delibird','38','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-39','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing.',60,NULL,'Oshawott','39','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-4','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Gloom','When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.',110,NULL,'Bellossom','4','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-40','match',NULL,NULL,1,'Oshawott','Strict training is how it learns its flowing double-scalchop technique.',90,NULL,'Dewott','40','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-41','match',NULL,NULL,3,'Dewott','One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody.',140,NULL,'Samurott','41','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-42','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.',70,NULL,'Ducklett','42','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-43','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Ducklett','Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap their wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles.',90,NULL,'Swanna','43','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-44','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'If its veil-like arms stun and wrap a foe, that foe will be dragged miles below the surface, never to return.',80,NULL,'Frillish','44','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-45','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Frillish','Its body is mostly seawater. It\'s said there\'s a castle of ships Jellicent have sunk on the seafloor.',100,NULL,'Jellicent','45','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-46','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.',90,NULL,'Cryogonal','46','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-47','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It crosses the world, running over the surfaces of oceans and rivers. It appears at scenic waterfronts.',110,NULL,'Keldeo','47','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-48','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'By blasting water from its hooves, it can glide across water. It excels at using leg moves while battling.',90,NULL,'Keldeo','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-49','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Keldeo-EX','49','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('bw7-5','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.',80,NULL,'Tangela','5','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-50','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It occasionally uses an electric shock to recharge a fellow Pikachu that is in a weakened state.',60,NULL,'Pikachu','50','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-51','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on contact.',50,NULL,'Voltorb','51','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-52','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Voltorb','It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.',80,NULL,'Electrode','52','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-53','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Research is progressing on storing lightning in Electabuzz so this energy can be used at any time.',80,NULL,'Electabuzz','53','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-54','BERUBURI',NULL,NULL,3,'Electabuzz','The instant it presses the tips of its tails onto an opponent, it sends over 20,000 volts of electricity into the foe.'