L,'It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot.',60,NULL,'Croagunk','64','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-65','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.',70,NULL,'Croagunk','65','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-66','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Croagunk','The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac.',90,NULL,'Toxicroak','66','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-67','Hideaki Hakozaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Cresselia-EX','67','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('bw7-68','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams.',60,NULL,'Munna','68','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-69','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,3,'Munna','The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten.',100,NULL,'Musharna','69','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-7','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.',70,NULL,'Scyther','7','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-70','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The heart-shaped mark left on a body after a Woobat has been attached to it is said to bring good fortune.',60,NULL,'Woobat','70','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-71','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Woobat','It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble.',80,NULL,'Swoobat','71','Rare','Pokémon'),('bw7-72','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Using the feelers on its head and tail, it picks up vibrations in the air to determine its prey\'s location and state.',70,NULL,'Venipede','72','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-73','match',NULL,NULL,3,'Venipede','Storing energy for evolution, it sits. But, when predators approach, it moves to stab them with poison spikes.',100,NULL,'Whirlipede','73','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-74','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Whirlipede','It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.',150,NULL,'Scolipede','74','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-75','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.',60,NULL,'Gothita','75','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-76','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,'Gothita','They use hypnosis to control people and Pokémon. Tales of Gothorita leading people astray are told in every corner.',80,NULL,'Gothorita','76','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-77','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The melodies sung by Meloetta have the power to make Pokémon that hear them happy or sad.',80,NULL,'Meloetta','77','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-78','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It digs deep burrows to live in. When in danger, it rolls up its body to withstand attacks.',70,NULL,'Sandshrew','78','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-79','BERUBURI',NULL,NULL,1,'Sandshrew','The spikes on its body are made up of its hardened hide. It rolls up and attacks foes with its spikes.',90,NULL,'Sandslash','79','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-8','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'No matter how heavy its opponents, it flings them far away with its prized horn.',100,NULL,'Heracross','8','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('bw7-80','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It clamps on to its chosen prey then jabs the stinger on its tail into the prey while it\'s stunned with surprise.',70,NULL,'Gligar','80','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-81','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Gligar','It dances silently through the sky. When it approaches prey, it can land a critical hit in an instant.',100,NULL,'Gliscor','81','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('bw7-82','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.',70,NULL,'Makuhita','82','Common','Pokémon'),('bw7-83','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It makes an inescapable coni