,'Eevee','By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry.',90,NULL,'Glaceon','BW90','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW91','The Pokémon Company Art Team',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Eevee','If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.',90,NULL,'Jolteon','BW91','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW92','The Pokémon Company Art Team',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee','Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather.',90,NULL,'Espeon','BW92','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW93','The Pokémon Company Art Team',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','When exposed to the moon\'s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power.',100,NULL,'Umbreon','BW93','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW94','The Pokémon Company Art Team',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.',60,NULL,'Eevee','BW94','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW95','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Champions Festival','BW95','Promo','Trainer'),('bwp-BW96','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Tornadus-EX','BW96','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW97','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.',60,NULL,'Eevee','BW97','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW98','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe Mew to be the ancestor of Pokémon.',60,NULL,'Mew','BW98','Promo','Pokémon'),('bwp-BW99','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back.',110,NULL,'Genesect','BW99','Promo','Pokémon'),('cel25-1','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It will reveal itself before a pure-hearted Trainer by shining its bright, rainbow-colored wings.',130,'E','Ho-Oh','1','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-10','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail.',130,'E','Zekrom','10','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-11','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its DNA is said to contain the genetic codes of all Pokémon, so it can use all kinds of techniques.',60,'E','Mew','11','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('cel25-12','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When the horns on its head shine in seven colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life.',120,'E','Xerneas','12','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-13','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Whether or not it\'s a Pokémon from this world is a mystery. When it\'s in a jam, it warps away to a safe place to hide.',60,'E','Cosmog','13','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-14','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,3,'Cosmog','As it absorbs light, Cosmoem continues to grow. Its golden shell is surprisingly solid.',90,'E','Cosmoem','14','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-15','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Cosmoem','It sometimes summons unknown powers and life-forms here to this world from holes that lead to other worlds.',160,'E','Lunala','15','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('cel25-16','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Zacian V','16','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('cel25-17','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This legendary Pokémon is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling Kyogre.',130,'E','Groudon','17','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-18','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Zamazenta V','18','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('cel25-19','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.',120,'E','Yveltal','19','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-2','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When Reshiram\'s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world\'s weather.',130,'E','Reshiram','2','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-20','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has the power to control time. It appears in Sinnoh-region myths as an ancient deity.',130,'E','Dialga','20','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-21','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Cosmoem','In writings from the distant past, it\'s called by the name \"the beast that devours the sun.\"',170,'E','Solgaleo','21','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('cel25-22','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm.',130,'E','Lugia','22','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-23','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Professor\'s Research (Professor Oak)','23','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('cel25-24','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Professor\'s Research (Professor Oak)','24','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('cel25-25','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its DNA is said to contain the genetic codes of all Pokémon, so it can use all kinds of techniques.',60,'E','Mew','25','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('cel25-3','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.',130,'E','Kyogre','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-4','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has the ability to distort space. It is described as a deity in Sinnoh-region mythology.',130,'E','Palkia','4','Rare','Pokémon'),('cel25-5','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has small electric sacs on both its cheeks. If threatened, it looses electric charges from the sacs.',60,'E','Pikachu','5','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('cel25-6','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,190,'E','Flying Pikachu V','6','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('cel25-7','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Flying Pikachu V',NULL,310,'E','Flying Pikachu VMAX','7','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('cel25-8','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Surfing Pikachu V','8','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('cel25-9','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,'Surfing Pikachu V',NULL,310,'E','Surfing Pikachu VMAX','9','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('dc1-1','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'No matter how heavy the cargo, we can transport it to our destination with ease, thanks to Numel.',70,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Numel','1','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-10','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They all cry out at once to let us know when they spot an enemy. It really helps out!',50,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Baltoy','10','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-11','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Team Magma\'s Baltoy','Claydol\'s beam can seize opponents and keep them from moving. Long-range attacks are its specialty!',90,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Claydol','11','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dc1-12','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Aron, which even devour metal, can eat and destroy enemy ships in an instant.',60,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Aron','12','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-13','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Team Magma\'s Aron','When Lairon uses Take Down, the impact from its solid body is enough to destroy concrete!',90,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Lairon','13','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-14','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,4,'Team Magma\'s Lairon','Aggron\'s metal horns can smash through any defenses, no matter how strong!',140,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Aggron','14','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dc1-15','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Groudon-EX','15','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('dc1-16','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Poochyena can easily detect invading foes with its acute sense of smell. It\'s an excellent lookout!',60,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Poochyena','16','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-17','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Poochyena\'s nose can identify any scent. It\'s very useful for reconnaissance.',60,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Poochyena','17','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-18','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Team Aqua\'s Poochyena','Thanks to Mightyena\'s outstanding leadership, it\'s very good at combination attacks that can leave a foe helpless.',100,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Mightyena','18','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-19','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,'Team Magma\'s Poochyena','This Pokémon is loyal to its master. It will protect its partner to the end, no matter what.',100,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Mightyena','19','Common','Pokémon'),