'),('dc1-32','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Team Magma\'s Secret Base','32','Uncommon','Trainer'),('dc1-33','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Double Aqua Energy','33','Uncommon','Energy'),('dc1-34','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Double Magma Energy','34','Uncommon','Energy'),('dc1-4','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Team Aqua\'s Spheal','It provides support by making paths of ice. It can win any battle as long as it\'s on ice.',90,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Sealeo','4','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-5','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,4,'Team Aqua\'s Sealeo','It\'s good at attacks that freeze opponents with a powerful cold snap. Then, it pulverizes a frozen foe with its sharp tusks!',140,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Walrein','5','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dc1-6','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Kyogre-EX','6','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('dc1-7','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its flexible body, which allows it to squeeze into any cracks, comes in handy when invading enemy hideouts.',70,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Grimer','7','Common','Pokémon'),('dc1-8','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Team Aqua\'s Grimer','It immobilizes its opponents by wrapping them in its huge, poisonous body. It\'ll smoosh you, too!',110,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Muk','8','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dc1-9','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Seviper\'s tail is a sharp blade. It can even poison you!',90,NULL,'Team Aqua\'s Seviper','9','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-1','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A strange seed was planted on its back at birth. The plant sprouts and grows with this Pokémon.',60,NULL,'Bulbasaur','1','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-10','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'He loves to show off his vast knowledge. This expressive Pikachu is like a middle-aged man.',90,NULL,'Detective Pikachu','10','Rare','Pokémon'),('det1-11','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its pantomime skills are wonderful. You may become enraptured while watching it, but next thing you know, Mr. Mime has made a real wall.',80,NULL,'Mr. Mime','11','Rare','Pokémon'),('det1-12','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon was created by years of horrific gene splicing and DNA engineering experiments.',130,NULL,'Mewtwo','12','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('det1-13','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,2,'Machoke','It grasps its opponents with its four arms and twists them up in an intricate hold. People call it \"the Machamp special.\"',160,NULL,'Machamp','13','Rare','Pokémon'),('det1-14','Framestore',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Recordings of Jigglypuff\'s strange lullabies can be purchased from department stores. These CDs can be found near the bedding area.',60,NULL,'Jigglypuff','14','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-15','Framestore',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It grows close to others easily and is also easily spoiled. The disparity between its face and its actions makes many young people wild about it.',70,NULL,'Snubbull','15','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-16','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It checks out whatever\'s around it by licking everything. If you don\'t clean off a spot where it\'s licked you, you\'ll break out in a rash!',100,NULL,'Lickitung','16','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-17','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While it can transform into anything, each Ditto apparently has its own strengths and weaknesses when it comes to transformations.',60,NULL,'Ditto','17','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('det1-18','Framestore',NULL,NULL,4,'Vigoroth','The world\'s laziest Pokémon. It moves to another spot when there\'s no food left within its reach.',180,NULL,'Slaking','18','Rare','Pokémon'),('det1-2','Framestore',NULL,NULL,3,'Lombre','If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can\'t help breaking out into a dance.',140,NULL,'Ludicolo','2','Rare','Pokémon'),('det1-3','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It scatters its shining spores around itself. Even though they\'re dangerous, nighttime tours of forests where Morelull live are popular.',50,NULL,'Morelull','3','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-4','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The flame on its tail indicates Charmander\'s life force. If it is healthy, the flame burns brightly.',60,NULL,'Charmander','4','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-5','Framestore',NULL,NULL,3,'Charmeleon','When expelling a blast of superhot fire, the red flame at the tip of its tail burns more intensely.',180,NULL,'Charizard','5','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('det1-6','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,3,'Growlithe','Legends tell of its fighting alongside a general and conquering a whole country.',120,NULL,'Arcanine','6','Rare','Pokémon'),('det1-7','Framestore',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Using psychokinesis gives it a headache, so it normally passes the time spacing out and doing as little as possible.',80,NULL,'Psyduck','7','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-8','Framestore',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In the distant past, they were fairly strong, but they have become gradually weaker over time.',30,NULL,'Magikarp','8','Common','Pokémon'),('det1-9','MPC Film',NULL,NULL,1,'Frogadier','It creates throwing stars out of compressed water. When it spins them and throws them at high speed, these stars can split metal in two.',140,NULL,'Greninja','9','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('dv1-1','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is called the \"Mirage Pokémon\" because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.',40,NULL,'Dratini','1','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-10','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.',100,NULL,'Latios','10','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-11','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.',120,NULL,'Rayquaza','11','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-12','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp.',40,NULL,'Axew','12','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-13','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly.',50,NULL,'Axew','13','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-14','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Axew','Since a broken tusk will not grow back, they diligently sharpen their tusks on river rocks after they\'ve been fighting.',70,NULL,'Fraxure','14','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-15','match',NULL,NULL,2,'Axew','Their tusks can shatter rocks. Territory battles between Fraxure can be intensely violent.',80,NULL,'Fraxure','15','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-16','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,'Fraxure','They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel.',140,NULL,'Haxorus','16','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-17','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It races through narrow caves, using its sharp claws to catch prey. The skin on its face is harder than a rock.',110,NULL,'Druddigon','17','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-18','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Exp. Share','18',NULL,'Trainer'),('dv1-19','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'First Ticket','19',NULL,'Trainer'),('dv1-2','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is called the \"Mirage Pokémon\" because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.',40,NULL,'Dratini','2','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-20','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Super Rod','20','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('dv1-21','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can produce ultracold air. Its body is frozen.',130,NULL,'Kyurem','21',NULL,'Pokémon'),('dv1-3','Hajime Kusajima',NULL,NULL,2,'Dratini','If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.',70,NULL,'Dragonair','3','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-4','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Dratini','If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.',70,NULL,'Dragonair','4','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-5','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Dragonair','It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.',150,NULL,'Dragonite','5','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-6','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.',50,NULL,'Bagon','6','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-7','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,'Bagon','Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.',80,NULL,'Shelgon','7','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-8','BERUBURI',NULL,NULL,2,'Shelgon','As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.',140,NULL,'Salamence','8','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('dv1-9','Hideaki Hakozaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is covered in a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.',100,NULL,'Latias','9','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('g1-1','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Venusaur-EX','1','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-10','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Leafeon-EX','10','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-11','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Charizard-EX','11','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-12','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Charizard-EX',NULL,220,NULL,'M Charizard-EX','12','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-13','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Ninetales-EX','13','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-14','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.',60,NULL,'Ponyta','14','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-15','DemizuPosuka',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ponyta','Very competitive, this Pokémon will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it.',90,NULL,'Rapidash','15','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-16','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Found near the mouth of a volcano. This fire-breather\'s body temperature is nearly 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit.',80,NULL,'Magmar','16','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-17','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Blastoise-EX','17','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-18','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Blastoise-EX',NULL,220,NU