endary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.',120,NULL,'Zapdos','29','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('g1-3','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antennae on its head to drive away enemies.',40,NULL,'Caterpie','3','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-30','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Even though it has no eyes, it can sense obstacles using ultrasonic waves it emits from it mouth.',50,NULL,'Zubat','30','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-31','Kanako Eo',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zubat','Once it bites, it will not stop draining energy from the victim even if it gets too heavy to fly.',70,NULL,'Golbat','31','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-32','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is always vacantly lost in thought, but no one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail.',50,NULL,'Slowpoke','32','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-33','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.',50,NULL,'Gastly','33','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-34','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,'Gastly','It licks with its gaseous tongue to steal the victim\'s life force. It lurks in darkness for prey.',70,NULL,'Haunter','34','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-35','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Haunter','Hiding in people\'s shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake.',130,NULL,'Gengar','35','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('g1-36','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It wiggles its hips as it walks. It can cause people to dance in unison with it.',70,NULL,'Jynx','36','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-37','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,160,NULL,'Meowstic-EX','37','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-38','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Lives about one yard underground where it feeds on plant roots. It sometimes appears aboveground.',50,NULL,'Diglett','38','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-39','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,1,'Diglett','In battle, it digs through the ground and strikes the unsuspecting foe from an unexpected direction.',90,NULL,'Dugtrio','39','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-4','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Caterpie','A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.',70,NULL,'Metapod','4','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-40','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It hefts a Graveler repeatedly to strengthen its entire body. It uses every type of martial arts.',70,NULL,'Machop','40','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-41','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,'Machop','Its muscular body is so powerful, it must wear a power-save belt to be able to regulate its motions.',90,NULL,'Machoke','41','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-42','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,'Machoke','Its four ruggedly developed arms can launch a flurry of 1,000 punches in just two seconds.',150,NULL,'Machamp','42','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('g1-43','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Found in fields and mountains. Mistaking them for boulders, people often step or trip on them.',60,NULL,'Geodude','43','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-44','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,3,'Geodude','With a free and uncaring nature, it doesn\'t mind if pieces break off while it rolls down mountains.',100,NULL,'Graveler','44','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-45','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,3,'Graveler','It tumbles down mountains, leaving grooves from peak to base. Stay clear of these grooves.',150,NULL,'Golem','45','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('g1-46','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Golem-EX','46','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('g1-47','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick.',90,NULL,'Hitmonlee','47','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-48','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.',90,NULL,'Hitmonchan','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-49','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is inept at turning because of its four short legs. It can only charge and run in one direction.',80,NULL,'Rhyhorn','49','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-5','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,'Metapod','It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.',130,NULL,'Butterfree','5','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('g1-50','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.',60,NULL,'Clefairy','50','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-51','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,'Clefairy','Its hearing is so acute it can hear a pin drop over half a mile away. It lives on quiet mountains.',90,NULL,'Clefable','51','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-52','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able to create walls out of thin air by miming.',70,NULL,'Mr. Mime','52','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-53','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Adores round objects. It wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change.',60,NULL,'Meowth','53','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-54','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Meowth','Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant.',90,NULL,'Persian','54','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('g1-55','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.',60,NULL,'Doduo','55','Common','Pokémon'),('g1-56','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,1,'Doduo','An odd species that is rarely found. The three heads respectively represent joy, sadness, and anger.',90,NULL,'Dodrio','56','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-57','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'After heightening its will to fight by whipping itself with its three tails, it charges at full speed.',110,NULL,'Tauros','57','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-58','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.',130,NULL,'Snorlax','58','Rare','Pokémon'),('g1-59','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Clemont','59'