ukui','148','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('sm1-149','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Team Skull Grunt','149','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('sm1-15','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Fomantis',NULL,210,NULL,'Lurantis-GX','15','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-150','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Fomantis',NULL,210,NULL,'Lurantis-GX','150','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-151','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Lapras-GX','151','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-152','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee',NULL,200,NULL,'Espeon-GX','152','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-153','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Cosmoem',NULL,250,NULL,'Lunala-GX','153','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-154','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee',NULL,200,NULL,'Umbreon-GX','154','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-155','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Cosmoem',NULL,250,NULL,'Solgaleo-GX','155','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-156','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Tauros-GX','156','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-157','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Yungoos',NULL,210,NULL,'Gumshoos-GX','157','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('sm1-158','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nest Ball','158','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('sm1-159','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Rotom Dex','159','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('sm1-16','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it drowses the day away, it nourishes itself by sucking from tree roots. It wakens at the fall of night, wandering off in search of a new tree.',60,NULL,'Morelull','16','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-160','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Switch','160','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('sm1-161','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ultra Ball','161','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('sm1-162',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Psychic Energy','162','Rare Secret','Energy'),('sm1-163',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Metal Energy','163','Rare Secret','Energy'),('sm1-164',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Grass Energy','164','Common','Energy'),('sm1-165',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Fire Energy','165','Common','Energy'),('sm1-166',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Water Energy','166','Common','Energy'),('sm1-167',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Lightning Energy','167','Common','Energy'),('sm1-168',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Psychic Energy','168','Common','Energy'),('sm1-169',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Fighting Energy','169','Common','Energy'),('sm1-17','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,'Morelull','It emits flickering spores that cause drowsiness. When its prey succumb to sleep, this Pokémon feeds on them by sucking in their energy.',100,NULL,'Shiinotic','17','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-170',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Darkness Energy','170','Common','Energy'),('sm1-171',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Metal Energy','171','Common','Energy'),('sm1-172',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Fairy Energy','172','Common','Energy'),('sm1-18','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A delectable aroma pours from its body. They are often swallowed whole by Toucannon lured by that wafting deliciousness.',60,NULL,'Bounsweet','18','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-19','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,'Bounsweet','The sepals on its head developed to protect its body. These are quite hard, so even if pecked by bird Pokémon, this Pokémon is totally fine.',90,NULL,'Steenee','19','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-2','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,3,'Caterpie','Its shell is filled with its soft innards. It doesn\'t move much because of the risk it might carelessly spill its innards out.',80,NULL,'Metapod','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-20','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Steenee','Its long, striking legs aren\'t just for show but to be used to kick with skill. In victory, it shows off by kicking the defeated, laughing boisterously.',140,NULL,'Tsareena','20','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-21','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s both clever and loyal, but if a stranger tries to invade its territory, it barks threateningly.',80,NULL,'Growlithe','21','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-22','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Growlithe','Overflowing with beauty and majesty, this strong Pokémon appears in ancient Eastern folklore.',130,NULL,'Arcanine','22','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-23','sui',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Coal is the source of Torkoal\'s energy. Large amounts of coal can be found in the mounts where they live.',110,NULL,'Torkoal','23','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-24','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While grooming itself, it builds up fur inside its stomach. It sets the fur alight and spews fiery attacks, which change based on how it coughs.',70,NULL,'Litten','24','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-25','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,2,'Litten','At its throat, it bears a bell of fire. The bell rings brightly whenever this Pokémon spits fire.',90,NULL,'Torracat','25','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-26','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,3,'Torracat','This Pokémon has a violent, selfish disposition. If it\'s not in the mood to listen, it will ignore its Trainer\'s orders with complete nonchalance.',160,NULL,'Incineroar','26','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-27','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Torracat',NULL,250,NULL,'Incineroar-GX','27','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-28','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'As a result of headaches so fierce they cause it to cry, it sometimes uses psychokinesis without meaning to.',70,NULL,'Psyduck','28','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-29','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Psyduck','It is said that the red part of its forehead grants supernatural powers to those who posses one, so it was over-hunted in the past.',90,NULL,'Golduck','29','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-3','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Metapod','Close examination of its large eyes reveals that each eye is composed of a myriad of tiny eyes.',130,NULL,'Butterfree','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-30','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s still not very good at walking. Its Trainers should train this Pokémon to walk every day.',60,NULL,'Poliwag','30','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-31','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,'Poliwag','It marches over the land in search of bug Pokémon to eat. Then it takes them underwater so it can dine on them where it\'s safe.',90,NULL,'Poliwhirl','31','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-32','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,3,'Poliwhirl','Its percentage of body fat is nearly zero. Its body is entirely muscle, which makes it heavy and forces its swimming prowess to develop.',150,NULL,'Poliwrath','32','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-33','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The hardness of its shell surpasses the hardness of a diamond. In days gone by, people used the shells to make shields.',60,NULL,'Shellder','33','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-34','Yoshinobu Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Shellder','Its hard shell cannot be shattered—not even by a bomb. The contents of the shell remain unknown.',120,NULL,'Cloyster','34','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-35','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Lapras-GX','35','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-36','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Pursued by Mareanie for the branches on its head, this Pokémon will sometimes snap its own branches off as a diversion while it escapes.',80,NULL,'Corsola','36','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-37','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Fishermen keep an eye out for Wingull in the sky, because wherever they\'re circling, the ocean sure to be is teeming with fish Pokémon.',60,NULL,'Wingull','37','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-38','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Wingull','Gathering food is the work of young males. They store food in their capacious beaks and carry it back to others waiting in the nest.',100,NULL,'Pelipper','38','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-39','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon snorts body fluids from its nose, blowing balloons to smash into its foes. It\'s famous for being a hard worker.',70,NULL,'Popplio','39','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-4','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'No matter how much it eats, the mushrooms growing on its back steal away most of the nutrients it consumes.',60,NULL,'Paras','4','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-40','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,'Popplio','A skillful dancer, it creates a sequence of water balloons as it dances, and briskly bombards it enemies.',90,NULL,'Brionne','40','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-41','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Brionne','It controls its water balloons with song. The melody is learning from others of its kind and is passed down from one generation to the next.',150,NULL,'Primarina','41','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-42','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Brionne',NULL,250,NULL,'Primarina-GX','42','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-43','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,4,'Crabrawler','It just throws punches indiscriminately. In times of desperation, it can lop off its own pincers and fire them like rockets.',140,NULL,'Crabominable','43','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-44','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it\'s in trouble, its eyes moisten and begin to shine. The shining light attracts its comrades, and they stand together against their enemies.',30,NULL,'Wishiwashi','44','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-45','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It crawls onto the land in search of food. Its water bubble allows it to breathe and protects its soft head.',60,NULL,'Dewpider','45','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-46','match',NULL,NULL,2,'Dewpider','It delivers headbutts with the water bubble on its head. Small Pokémon get sucked into the bubble, where they drown.',100,NULL,'Araquanid','46','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-47','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives in shallow seas, such as areas near a beach. It can eject its internal organs, which it uses to engulf its prey or battle enemies.',60,NULL,'Pyukumuku','47','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-48','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It stuns its prey with psychokinesis and then grinds them to mush with its strong teeth. Even Shellder\'s shell is no match for it.',110,NULL,'Bruxish','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-49','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives in the depths beyond the reach of sunlight. It flashes lights on its antennae to communicate with others of its kind.',70,NULL,'Chinchou','49','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-5','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,3,'Paras','The large mushroom on its back controls it. It often fights over territory with Shiinotic.',110,NULL,'Parasect','5','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-50','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Chinchou','This Pokémon flashes a bright light that blinds its prey. This creates an opening for it to deliver an electrical attack.',110,NULL,'Lanturn','50','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-51','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Grubbin','From the food it digests, it generates electricity, and it stores this energy in its electric sac.',90,NULL,'Charjabug','51','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-52','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,3,'Charjabug','It produces electricity via an electrical organ in its abdomen. It overwhelms bird Pokémon with shocking beams of electrical energy.',150,NULL,'Vikavolt','52','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-53','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The long hairs on its back act as lightning rods. The bolts of lightning it attracts are stored as energy in its electric sac.',70,NULL,'Togedemaru','53','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-54','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sleeps in caves during the day. It has no eyes, so to check its surroundings while flying, it emits ultrasonic waves.',50,NULL,'Zubat','54','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-55','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zubat','Its thick fangs are hollow like straws, making them unexpectedly fragile. These fangs are specialized for sucking blood.',80,NULL,'Golbat','55','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-56','DemizuPosuka',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Golbat','Both its legs became wings, and as a result, it can\'t move well on the ground. All it can do is crawl around.',130,NULL,'Crobat','56','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-57','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The crystals on Grimer\'s body are lumps of toxins. If one falls off, lethal poisons leak out.',80,NULL,'Alolan Grimer','57','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-58','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,4,'Alolan Grimer','While it\'s unexpectedly quiet and friendly, if it\'s not fed any trash for a while, it will smash its Trainer\'s furnishings and eat up the fragments.',120,NULL,'Alolan Muk','58','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-59','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It finds really fun dreams tasty. When it makes friends with people, it may show them the most delicious dreams it\'s ever eaten.',70,NULL,'Drowzee','59','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-6','DemizuPosuka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'One solid blow from its horns is enough to split apart a large tree. Its greatest rival in Alola is Vikavolt.',110,NULL,'Pinsir','6','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-60','OOYAMA',NULL,NULL,2,'Drowzee','As a matter of course, it makes anyone it meets fall asleep and has a taste of their dreams. Anyone having a good dream, it carries off.',110,NULL,'Hypno','60','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-61','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee',NULL,200,NULL,'Espeon-GX','61','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-62','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It plunges the poison spike on its head into its prey. When the prey has weakened, Mareanie deals the finishing blow with its 10 tentacles.',60,NULL,'Mareanie','62','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-63','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Mareanie','Toxapex crawls along the ocean floor on its 12 legs. It leaves a trail of Corsola bits scattered in its wake.',110,NULL,'Toxapex','63','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-64','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is gaseous and frail. It slowly grows as it collects dust from the atmosphere.',60,NULL,'Cosmog','64','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-65','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,3,'Cosmog','Motionless as if dead, its body is faintly warm to the touch. In the distant past, it was called the cocoon of the stars.',90,NULL,'Cosmoem','65','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-66','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,'Cosmoem',NULL,250,NULL,'Lunala-GX','66','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-67','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It was originally brought in from another region, but now Makuhita from Alola are more famous.',80,NULL,'Makuhita','67','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-68','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,4,'Makuhita','It is known for its fantastic strength, but as it grows older, it focuses more on training Makuhita.',130,NULL,'Hariyama','68','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-69','Kanako Eo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The hexagonal cavity is its ear. It walks in the direction of sounds it hears, but if the sounds cease, it panics and topples over.',70,NULL,'Roggenrola','69','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-7','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When this Pokémon senses danger, a sweet fluid oozes from the tip of its heads. The taste of it disgusts bird Pokémon.',50,NULL,'Surskit','7','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-70','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,4,'Roggenrola','It explores caves in search of underground water. It\'s not comfortable around water, so this Pokémon takes great care in lapping it up.',110,NULL,'Boldore','70','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-71','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,'Boldore','Known for its hefty horsepower, this Pokémon is a popular partner for construction workers.',160,NULL,'Gigalith','71','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-72','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It punches so much, its pincers often come off from overuse, but they grow back quickly. What little meat they contain is rich and delicious.',80,NULL,'Crabrawler','72','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-73','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They form groups of roughly 20 individuals. Their mutual bond is remarkable—they will never let down a comrade.',110,NULL,'Passimian','73','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-74','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It takes control of anyone who puts a hand in its mouth. And so it adds to the accumulation of its sand-mound body.',80,NULL,'Sandygast','74','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-75','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,4,'Sandygast','Buried beneath the castle are masses of dried-up bones from those whose vitality it has drained.',130,NULL,'Palossand','75','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-76','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'When the sun goes down, it becomes active. It runs around town on a chase for good food for the boss of its nest—Raticate.',40,NULL,'Alolan Rattata','76','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-77','match',NULL,NULL,3,'Alolan Rattata','This gourmet Pokémon is particular about the taste and freshness of its food. Restaurants where Raticate live have a good reputation.',120,NULL,'Alolan Raticate','77','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-78','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon was not originally found in Alola. Human actions caused a surge in their numbers, and they went feral. They\'re prideful and crafty.',70,NULL,'Alolan Meowth','78','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-79','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Alolan Meowth','Its round face and smooth coat—softer than the most high-class velvet—have made this a very popular Pokémon in Alola.',90,NULL,'Alolan Persian','79','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-8','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Surskit','Its wings and antennae don\'t cope well with moisture. After a rain, it faces sunward to dry off.',90,NULL,'Masquerain','8','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm1-80','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee',NULL,200,NULL,'Umbreon-GX','80','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-81','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If they scent the faintest trace of blood, they rush to attack en masse. When alone, they\'re rather cowardly.',60,NULL,'Carvanha','81','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-82','Yumi',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Carvanha','It has a sad history. In the past, its dorsal fin was a treasured foodstuff, so this Pokémon became a victim of overfishing.',110,NULL,'Sharpedo','82','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-83','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It submerges itself in sand and moves as if swimming. This wise behavior keeps its enemies from finding it and maintains its temperature.',70,NULL,'Sandile','83','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-84','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Sandile','They move in groups of a few individuals. A female is often the leader of the group, and the males will gather food.',90,NULL,'Krokorok','84','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-85','Hajime Kusajima',NULL,NULL,3,'Krokorok','Its unique faculty of sight can detect small prey more than 30 miles away, even in the midst of a sandstorm.',150,NULL,'Krookodile','85','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-86','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its head sports an altered form of whiskers made of metal. When in communication with its comrades, its whiskers wobble to and fro.',50,NULL,'Alolan Diglett','86','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-87','match',NULL,NULL,2,'Alolan Diglett','Its shining gold hair provides it with protection. It\'s reputed that keeping any of its fallen hairs will bring bad luck.',100,NULL,'Alolan Dugtrio','87','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-88','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its feathers, which fall off as it grows, are thin and sharp. In times long past, warriors used them as swords.',110,NULL,'Skarmory','88','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-89','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,3,'Cosmoem',NULL,250,NULL,'Solgaleo-GX','89','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm1-9','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This wary Pokémon uses photosynthesis to store up energy during the day, while becoming active at night.',60,NULL,'Rowlet','9','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-90','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its growls make its opponents uneasy. This laid-back Pokémon tends to sleep half the day.',70,NULL,'Snubbull','90','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-91','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Snubbull','More timid than Snubbull, this Pokémon is doted on by young people amused at the contrast between its looks and its attitude.',110,NULL,'Granbull','91','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-92','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It feeds on the nectar and pollen of flowers. Because it\'s able to sense auras, it can identify which flowers are about to bloom.',30,NULL,'Cutiefly','92','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-93','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Cutiefly','It rolls up pollen into puffs. It makes many different varieties, some used as food and others used in battle.',60,NULL,'Ribombee','93','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-94','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'After a 10-hour struggle, a fisherman was able to pull one up and confirm its existence.',60,NULL,'Dratini','94','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-95','hatachu',NULL,NULL,2,'Dratini','From time immemorial, it has been venerated by agricultural peoples as an entity able to control the weather.',90,NULL,'Dragonair','95','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm1-96','Hiroyuki Yamamoto',NULL,NULL,4,'Dragonair','Incur the wrath of this normally calm Pokémon at your peril, because it will smash everything to smithereens before it\'s satisfied.',160,NULL,'Dragonite','96','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm1-97','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Farmers whose fields are troubled by bug Pokémon appreciate Spearow for its vigorous appetite and look after it.',60,NULL,'Spearow','97','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-98','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Spearow','Drawings of a Pokémon resembling Fearow can be seen in murals from deep in ancient history.',90,NULL,'Fearow','98','Common','Pokémon'),('sm1-99','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Kangaskhan\'s maternal love is so deep that it will brave death to protect its offspring.',130,NULL,'Kangaskhan','99','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-1','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,260,NULL,'Pheromosa & Buzzwole-GX','1','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm10-10','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.',60,NULL,'Venonat','10','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-100','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It is always bursting with energy. To make itself stronger, it keeps on fighting even if it loses.',60,NULL,'Tyrogue','100','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm10-101','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by 10.',90,NULL,'Hitmontop','101','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm10-102','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It knows how people and Pokémon feel by looking at their auras. It doesn\'t approach dangerous opponents.',70,NULL,'Riolu','102','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-103','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Lands visited by Landorus grant such bountiful crops that it has been hailed as \"The Guardian of the Fields.\"',120,NULL,'Landorus','103','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-104','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its hard pincers are well suited to both offense and defense. Fights between two Crabrawler are like boxing matches.',80,NULL,'Crabrawler','104','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-105','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,4,'Crabrawler','It stores coldness in its pincers and pummels its foes. It can even smash thick walls of ice to bits!',140,NULL,'Crabominable','105','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-106','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It appeared from an Ultra Wormhole. Each one appears to be made up of many life-forms stacked one on top of each other.',120,NULL,'Stakataka','106','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-107','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,250,NULL,'Greninja & Zoroark-GX','107','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm10-108','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a weakness for shiny things. It\'s been known to sneak into the nests of Gabite—noted collectors of jewels—in search of treasure.',70,NULL,'Murkrow','108','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-109','sadaji',NULL,NULL,2,'Murkrow',NULL,210,NULL,'Honchkrow-GX','109','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm10-11','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Venonat','The scales it scatters will paralyze anyone who touches them, making that person unable to stand.',90,NULL,'Venomoth','11','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-110','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They\'re such cowards that they won\'t hunt alone. When five or so of them get together, they suddenly turn ferocious!',60,NULL,'Carvanha','110','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-111','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Carvanha','People believe that carrying one of its discarded fangs will prevent mishaps at sea, so the fangs are made into accessories.',110,NULL,'Sharpedo','111','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-112','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A Pokémon that was formed by 108 spirits. It is bound to a fissure in an odd keystone.',60,NULL,'Spiritomb','112','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-113','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Alola, where it\'s warm all year round, is a comfortable environment for this Pokémon. Sometimes you\'ll even see it outside of deserts.',60,NULL,'Sandile','113','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-114','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Alola, where it\'s warm all year round, is a comfortable environment for this Pokémon. Sometimes you\'ll even see it outside of deserts.',70,NULL,'Sandile','114','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-115','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,'Sandile','Krokorok really hates it when its body gets cold. On nights when the temperature drops, it digs deep into the desert sands.',90,NULL,'Krokorok','115','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm10-116','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Krokorok','When it spots prey, even at a distance of over 30 miles, it swims through the desert as if it were water, then jumps out and chomps them.',150,NULL,'Krookodile','116','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-117','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Frogadier','It creates throwing stars out of compressed water. When it spins them and throws them at high speed, these stars can split metal in two.',130,NULL,'Greninja','117','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-118','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It draws prey near with its blinking lights and then wraps them up in its long tentacles and holds them in place.',60,NULL,'Inkay','118','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-119','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,1,'Inkay','When it comes to strong hypnosis, there\'s an endless number of people who utilize Malamar for their nefarious deeds.',100,NULL,'Malamar','119','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-12','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Venonat',NULL,200,NULL,'Venomoth-GX','12','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm10-120','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,260,NULL,'Lucario & Melmetal-GX','120','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm10-121','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although it\'s powerful enough to dig right through volcanic rock, it doesn\'t allow itself to be seen very often.',50,NULL,'Alolan Diglett','121','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-122','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,'Alolan Diglett','Its metallic whiskers are heavy, so it\'s not very fast, but it has the power to dig through bedrock.',80,NULL,'Alolan Dugtrio','122','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-123','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.',60,NULL,'Aron','123','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-124','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,3,'Aron','It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies.',90,NULL,'Lairon','124','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm10-125','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,4,'Lairon','It claims an entire mountain as its own. The more wounds it has, the more it has battled, so don\'t take it lightly.',170,NULL,'Aggron','125','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-126','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,2,'Riolu','It concentrates its mental energy and fires off mysterious waves called auras, which can crush boulders of large size to dust.',130,NULL,'Lucario','126','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-127','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This ancient bug Pokémon was altered by Team Plasma. They upgraded the cannon on its back.',130,NULL,'Genesect','127','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-128','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It melts particles of iron and other metals found in the subsoil, so it can absorb them into its body of molten steel.',70,NULL,'Meltan','128','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-129','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,4,'Meltan','Revered long ago for its capacity to create iron from nothing, for some reason it has come back to life after 3,000 years.',150,NULL,'Melmetal','129','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-13','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Even though its body is extremely skinny, it is blindingly fast when catching its prey.',50,NULL,'Bellsprout','13','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-130','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,260,NULL,'Gardevoir & Sylveon-GX','130','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm10-131','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'On nights with many shooting stars, they gather in packs and dance in circles. If you should see them, something good will happen!',60,NULL,'Cleffa','131','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm10-132','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They\'re popular, but they\'re rare. Trainers who show them off recklessly may be targeted by thieves.',60,NULL,'Clefairy','132','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-133','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Clefairy','It can\'t help but hear a pin drop from over half a mile away, so it lives deep in the mountains where there aren\'t many people or Pokémon.',110,NULL,'Clefable','133','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-134','Yumi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Recordings of Jigglypuff\'s strange lullabies can be purchased from department stores. These CDs can be found near the bedding area.',70,NULL,'Jigglypuff','134','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-135','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,'Jigglypuff','Thanks to its bouncy body and fine fur, this Pokémon is sought after. Holding one in your arms while you sleep feels great.',110,NULL,'Wigglytuff','135','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm10-136','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The shell seems to be filled with joy. It is said that it will share good luck when treated kindly.',50,NULL,'Togepi','136','Common','Pokémon'),('sm10-137','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Togepi','It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings.',80,NULL,'Togetic','137','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm10-138','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Togetic','As everyone knows, it visits peaceful regions, bringing them gifts of kindness and sweet blessings.',140,NULL,'Togekiss','138','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm10-139','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To protect itself, it shoots cotton from its body. When it gets wet in the rain, its cotton grows moist and heavy, and it can\'t move as well.',50,NULL,'Cottonee','139',