igh speed.',70,NULL,'Drilbur','118','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-119','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,'Drilbur','It can help in tunnel construction. Its drill has evolved into steel strong enough to bore through iron plates.',120,NULL,'Excadrill','119','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-12','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'These mysterious Pokémon evolve when they receive electrical stimulation while they are in the same place as Shelmet.',70,NULL,'Karrablast','12','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-120','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Unidentified Fossil','Once thought to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon, some of the latest research suggests that may not be the case.',80,NULL,'Archen','120','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-121','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Archen','This ancient Pokémon\'s plumage is delicate, so if anyone other than an experienced professional tries to restore it, they will fail.',130,NULL,'Archeops','121','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-122','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Its charge is strong enough to break through a giant castle wall in one blow. This Pokémon is spoken of in legends.',140,NULL,'Terrakion','122','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm11-123','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The melodies sung by Meloetta have the power to make Pokémon that hear them happy or sad.',90,NULL,'Meloetta','123','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-124','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This is Zygarde when about 10% of its pieces have been assembled. It leaps at its opponent\'s chest and sinks its sharp fangs into them.',90,NULL,'Zygarde','124','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-125','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,270,NULL,'Umbreon & Darkrai-GX','125','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm11-126','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,280,NULL,'Mega Sableye & Tyranitar-GX','126','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm11-127','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'There are a hundred or so of them living in Alola\'s waste-disposal site. They\'re all hard workers who eat a lot of trash.',80,NULL,'Alolan Grimer','127','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-128','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a weakness for shiny things. It\'s been known to sneak into the nests of Gabite—noted collectors of jewels—in search of treasure.',70,NULL,'Murkrow','128','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-129','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a weakness for shiny things. It\'s been known to sneak into the nests of Gabite—noted collectors of jewels—in search of treasure.',70,NULL,'Murkrow','129','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-13','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lures people in with its Poké Ball pattern, then releases poison spores. Why it resembles a Poké Ball is unknown.',40,NULL,'Foongus','13','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-130','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Murkrow','It will absolutely not forgive failure from or betrayal by its goons. It has no choice in this if it wants to maintain the order of the flock.',110,NULL,'Honchkrow','130','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-131','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They will cooperate to steal eggs from the nests of bird Pokémon, but fights break out to determine which one gets to eat the eggs.',70,NULL,'Sneasel','131','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-132','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,'Sneasel',NULL,200,NULL,'Weavile-GX','132','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm11-133','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It digs through the ground with its hard claws and crunches down gems with its thick pointy teeth. Carbink is its favorite food.',80,NULL,'Sableye','133','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-134','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,4,'Skorupi','It takes pride in its strength. Even though it can tear foes apart, it finishes them off with powerful poison.',140,NULL,'Drapion','134','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-135','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws.',70,NULL,'Purrloin','135','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-136','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Purrloin','Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night.',100,NULL,'Liepard','136','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-137','Yumi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'They move in small groups, walking around lazily. Anyone who makes eye contact gets smacked with a headbutt.',70,NULL,'Scraggy','137','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-138','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Scraggy','This Pokémon may be rude, but it takes very good care of its family, its friends, and its turf.',110,NULL,'Scrafty','138','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-139','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When this legendary Pokémon\'s wings and tail feathers spread wide and glow red, it absorbs the life force of living creatures.',130,NULL,'Yveltal','139','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm11-14','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,2,'Foongus','They show off their Poké Ball caps to lure prey, but very few Pokémon are fooled by this.',100,NULL,'Amoonguss','14','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-140','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This troublemaker sends anything and everything to faraway places using its loop, which can warp space.',130,NULL,'Hoopa','140','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm11-141','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Mawile-GX','141','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm11-142','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,3,'Karrablast','Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances.',130,NULL,'Escavalier','142','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-143','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To protect itself, it shoots cotton from its body. When it gets wet in the rain, its cotton grows moist and heavy, and it can\'t move as well.',60,NULL,'Cottonee','143','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-144','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cottonee','This nuisance sneaks into people\'s homes, where it hides important things and scatters cotton all over the place.',80,NULL,'Whimsicott','144','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-145','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sneaks into people\'s homes and steals electricity from their outlets. When your electric bill seems off, it\'s the handiwork of this rascal.',70,NULL,'Dedenne','145','Uncommon','Pokémon'),