ocks. Territory battles between Fraxure can be intensely violent.',90,NULL,'Fraxure','155','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-156','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Fraxure','They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel.',150,NULL,'Haxorus','156','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm11-157','hatachu',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The red skin on its face is harder than rock. In narrow caves, it squares off against its enemies and charges face-first right into them.',120,NULL,'Druddigon','157','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-158','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Fruits are its favorite foods. This gourmet carefully picks out just the ripe ones using its sonar.',60,NULL,'Noibat','158','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-159','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Noibat','Although it has a violent disposition, if you give it a nice ripe fruit that it loves, Noivern will suddenly become tame.',120,NULL,'Noivern','159','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-16','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Fomantis','For self-protection, it pretends to be a bug Pokémon. Both of its arms bear keen-edged petals.',110,NULL,'Lurantis','16','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-160','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,1,'Poipole',NULL,210,NULL,'Naganadel-GX','160','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm11-161','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It checks out whatever\'s around it by licking everything. If you don\'t clean off a spot where it\'s licked you, you\'ll break out in a rash!',100,NULL,'Lickitung','161','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-162','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,4,'Lickitung','A contest is under way to determine which one can stick its tongue out the farthest. The current record is…more than 82 feet.',130,NULL,'Lickilicky','162','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm11-163','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Kangaskhan protects its child by keeping it in its pouch. It has zero forgiveness for those who harm its child and will beat them down.',130,NULL,'Kangaskhan','163','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm11-164','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They live in groups. The one with the longest, thickest, and most-scarred horns is the boss of the herd.',110,NULL,'Tauros','164','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-165','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Every day, it tilts its head in the same rhythm. A long time ago, people raised these Pokémon to serve as clocks.',60,NULL,'Hoothoot','165','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-166','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Hoothoot','With eyes that can see in pitch-darkness, it never lets its prey escape. Some even call it \"the emperor of dark nights.\"',90,NULL,'Noctowl','166','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-167','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The way Slakoth lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same.',50,NULL,'Slakoth','167','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-168','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The way Slakoth lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same.',70,NULL,'Slakoth','168','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-169','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,'Slakoth','Its heartbeat is fast and its blood so agitated that it can\'t sit still for one second.',90,NULL,'Vigoroth','169','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-17','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because of its sweet, delicious aroma, bird Pokémon are always after it, but it\'s not intelligent enough to care.',60,NULL,'Bounsweet','17','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-170','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,4,'Vigoroth','The world\'s laziest Pokémon. It moves to another spot when there\'s no food left within its reach.',180,NULL,'Slaking','170','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm11-171','Sekio',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'With nerves of steel, nothing can perturb it. It is more agile and active than it appears.',70,NULL,'Bidoof','171','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-172','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Bidoof','It busily makes its nest with stacks of branches and roots it has cut up with its sharp incisors.',120,NULL,'Bibarel','172','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm11-173','sowsow',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It hides food under its long fur, but it sometimes forgets about it 