'The males will do whatever the females tell them. They give the females most of their food. Due to malnutrition, the males can\'t evolve.',70,NULL,'Salandit','98','Common','Pokémon'),('sm11-99','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Salandit','Salazzle lives deep in caves and forces the Salandit it has attracted with its pheromones to serve it.',110,NULL,'Salazzle','99','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm115-1','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Perhaps because it would like to grow up quickly, it has a voracious appetite, eating a hundred leaves a day.',60,NULL,'Caterpie','1','Common','Pokémon'),('sm115-10','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its entire body is burning. When it breathes, the temperature rises. When it sneezes, flames shoot out!',90,NULL,'Magmar','10','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm115-11','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Using psychokinesis gives it a headache, so it normally passes the time spacing out and doing as little as possible.',60,NULL,'Psyduck','11','Common','Pokémon'),('sm115-12','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Alolan home cooking involves drying Slowpoke tails and then simmering them into a salty stew.',70,NULL,'Slowpoke','12','Common','Pokémon'),('sm115-13','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In many places, there are folktales of stardust falling into the ocean and becoming Staryu.',50,NULL,'Staryu','13','Common','Pokémon'),('sm115-14','PLANETA Otani',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Staryu',NULL,190,NULL,'Starmie-GX','14','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm115-15','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In the distant past, they were fairly strong, but they have become gradually weaker over time.',30,NULL,'Magikarp','15','Common','Pokémon'),('sm115-16','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Magikarp',NULL,230,NULL,'Gyarados-GX','16','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm115-17','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It likes swimming around with people on its back. In the Alola region, it\'s an important means of transportation over water.',120,NULL,'Lapras','17','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm115-18','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,N