LL,NULL,2,'Unidentified Fossil','In ancient times, it lived in warm seas. It disguised itself as seaweed to ambush its prey and devoured them whole when they got close.',90,NULL,'Lileep','10','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-100','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Even though its helpless, gaseous body can be blown away by the slightest breeze, it doesn\'t seem to care.',60,NULL,'Cosmog','100','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-101','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,3,'Cosmog','The king who ruled Alola in times of antiquity called it the \"cocoon of the stars\" and built an altar to worship it.',90,NULL,'Cosmoem','101','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-102','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Cosmoem','Records of it exist in writings from long, long ago, where it was known by the name \"the beast that calls the moon.\"',160,NULL,'Lunala','102','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-103','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It slips into the shadows of others and mimics their powers and movements. As it improves, it becomes stronger than those it\'s imitating.',60,NULL,'Marshadow','103','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-104','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It slithers toward people. Then, without warning, it triggers the explosion of its own head. It\'s apparently one kind of Ultra Beast.',110,NULL,'Blacephalon','104','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-105','otumami',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Burrows at high speed in search of food. The tunnels it leaves are used as homes by Diglett.',110,NULL,'Onix','105','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-106','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It moves less than an inch a year, but when it\'s in a jam, it will spin and drill down into the ground in a split second.',80,NULL,'Nosepass','106','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-107','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its jaws are strong enough to crush rocks but so heavy that it can\'t get up if it flips over. Sandile seize those moments as their chance.',50,NULL,'Trapinch','107','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-108','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its jaws are strong enough to crush rocks but so heavy that it can\'t get up if it flips over. Sandile seize those moments as their chance.',60,NULL,'Trapinch','108','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-109','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,'Trapinch','It vibrates its wings to generate ultrasonic waves, causing its prey to faint. Then it buries the prey alive in the sand to preserve it.',80,NULL,'Vibrava','109','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-11','otumami',NULL,NULL,3,'Lileep','Normally, it lived on shallow sea shoals. When the tide went out, this Pokémon came up on land to search for prey.',150,NULL,'Cradily','11','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-110','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Vibrava',NULL,240,NULL,'Flygon-GX','110','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-111','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Unidentified Fossil','When restored Anorith are released into the ocean, they don\'t thrive, because the water composition has changed since their era.',90,NULL,'Anorith','111','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-112','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,2,'Anorith','It lived on land and went out into the sea to hunt for prey. Its sharp claws were its greatest weapon.',150,NULL,'Armaldo','112','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-113','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with Kyogre.',130,NULL,'Groudon','113','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-114','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It makes its way swiftly through the soil by putting both claws together and rotating at high speed.',70,NULL,'Drilbur','114','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-115','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,4,'Drilbur','It can help in tunnel construction. Its drill has evolved into steel strong enough to bore through iron plates.',140,NULL,'Excadrill','115','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-116','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,2,'Tympole','When they vibrate the bumps on their heads, they can make waves in water or earthquake-like vibrations on land.',90,NULL,'Palpitoad','116','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-117','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,3,'Palpitoad','It increases the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists. It can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch.',160,NULL,'Seismitoad','117','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-118','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When it tightens its belt, it becomes stronger. Wild Throh use vines to weave their own belts.',120,NULL,'Throh','118','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-119','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It follows Pangoro around like a henchman. When Pancham makes a big mistake, its leaf gets taken away.',70,NULL,'Pancham','119','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-12','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The bunches of fruit growing around the necks of Tropius in Alola are especially sweet compared to those in other regions.',120,NULL,'Tropius','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-120','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Pancham','This rowdy Pokémon boasts great physical strength. Many Trainers are also smitten by its lively character.',130,NULL,'Pangoro','120','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-121','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its hard pincers are well suited to both offense and defense. Fights between two Crabrawler are like boxing matches.',80,NULL,'Crabrawler','121','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-122','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,4,'Crabrawler','It stores coldness in its pincers and pummels its foes. It can even smash thick walls of ice to bits!',140,NULL,'Crabominable','122','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-123','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As they develop, their disposition grows more violent and aggressive. Many Trainers find them too much to handle and abandon them.',60,NULL,'Rockruff','123','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-124','so-taro',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','It has no problem ignoring orders it doesn\'t like. It doesn\'t seem to mind getting hurt at all—as long as it can finish off its opponent.',120,NULL,'Lycanroc','124','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-125','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They use their saliva to stick leaves to their shoulders. You can tell what troop they belong to from the position of the leaves.',110,NULL,'Passimian','125','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-126','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It likes the shovel on its head, so Sandygast will get serious and fight any children who come to take it back.',80,NULL,'Sandygast','126','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-127','OOYAMA',NULL,NULL,4,'Sandygast','Each of its grains of sand has its own will. Palossand eats small Pokémon and siphons away their vital essence while they\'re still alive.',140,NULL,'Palossand','127','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-128','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s impulsive, selfish, and fickle. It\'s very popular with some Trainers who like giving it the attention it needs.',70,NULL,'Alolan Meowth','128','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-129','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Alolan Meowth',NULL,200,NULL,'Alolan Persian-GX','129','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-13','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It chats with others using the sounds of its colliding antennae. These sounds are fall hallmarks.',60,NULL,'Kricketot','13','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-130','Sekio',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'There are a hundred or so of them living in Alola\'s waste-disposal site. They\'re all hard workers who eat a lot of trash.',80,NULL,'Alolan Grimer','130','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-131','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,4,'Alolan Grimer','There are over a hundred kinds of poison inside its body. Chemical reactions between different poisons are the source of its vitality.',140,NULL,'Alolan Muk','131','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-132','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They\'re such cowards that they won\'t hunt alone. When five or so of them get together, they suddenly turn ferocious!',50,NULL,'Carvanha','132','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-133','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The only thing unlucky about Absol is its appearance. It protects fields and warns people of disaster, so one ought to be grateful for it.',100,NULL,'Absol','133','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-134','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'After shredding its prey, it sharpens its blades on a stone by the river. Each Pawniard has its own favorite sharpening stone.',60,NULL,'Pawniard','134','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-135','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,'Pawniard','No matter how strong the Bisharp, it\'s said that if the blade on its head is chipped, it will retire from its position as the boss.',120,NULL,'Bisharp','135','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-136','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Although it\'s alien to this world and a danger here, it\'s apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives.',150,NULL,'Guzzlord','136','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-137','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'After fleeing a volcanic eruption, it ended up moving to an area of snowy mountains. Its ice shell is as hard as steel.',60,NULL,'Alolan Sandshrew','137','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-138','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Alolan Sandshrew','It runs across snow-covered plains at high speeds. It developed thick, sharp claws to plow through the snow.',120,NULL,'Alolan Sandslash','138','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-139','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,4,'Onix','Tempered underground under high pressure and heat, its body is harder than any metal.',170,NULL,'Steelix','139','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-14','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Kricketot','It crosses its knifelike arms in front of its chest when it cries. It can compose melodies ad lib.',100,NULL,'Kricketune','14','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-140','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A cunning and terrifying Pokémon, its cuteness makes opponents let down their guard—and then it swallows them whole with its huge jaws.',70,NULL,'Mawile','140','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-141','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Nosepass','Although it can control its units known as Mini-Noses, they sometimes get lost and don\'t come back.',130,NULL,'Probopass','141','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-142','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,3,'Cosmoem','Sometimes the result of its opening an Ultra Wormhole is that energy and life-forms from other worlds are called here to this world.',170,NULL,'Solgaleo','142','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-143','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,240,NULL,'Togepi & Cleffa & Igglybuff-GX','143','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-143a','0313',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,240,NULL,'Togepi & Cleffa & Igglybuff-GX','143a','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('sm12-144','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They\'re popular, but they\'re rare. Trainers who show them off recklessly may be targeted by thieves.',50,NULL,'Clefairy','144','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-145','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Alolan Vulpix','The reason it guides people all the way down to the mountain\'s base is that it wants them to hurry up and leave.',110,NULL,'Alolan Ninetales','145','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-146','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'A Pokémon that lives by water. It moves quickly on land by bouncing on its big tail.',60,NULL,'Azurill','146','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-147','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To protect itself, it shoots cotton from its body. When it gets wet in the rain, its cotton grows moist and heavy, and it can\'t move as well.',40,NULL,'Cottonee','147','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-148','Yumi',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cottonee','This nuisance sneaks into people\'s homes, where it hides important things and scatters cotton all over the place.',70,NULL,'Whimsicott','148','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-149','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s not safe without the power of a flower, but it will keep traveling around until it finds one with the color and shape it wants.',30,NULL,'Flabébé','149','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-15','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Their coloring changes according to the season and can be slightly affected by the temperature and humidity as well.',60,NULL,'Deerling','15','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-150','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s not safe without the power of a flower, but it will keep traveling around until it finds one with the color and shape it wants.',40,NULL,'Flabébé','150','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-151','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,'Flabébé','It raises flowers and uses them as weapons. The more gorgeous the blossom, the more power it contains.',70,NULL,'Floette','151','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-152','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Floette','It controls the flowers it grows. The petal blizzards that Florges triggers are overwhelming in their beauty and power.',130,NULL,'Florges','152','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-153','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To entangle its opponents in battle, it extrudes white threads as sweet and sticky as cotton candy.',60,NULL,'Swirlix','153','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-154','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,'Swirlix','It can distinguish the faintest of scents. It puts its sensitive sense of smell to use by helping pastry chefs in their work.',110,NULL,'Slurpuff','154','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-155','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','Once a fight breaks out, it will unflinchingly charge at dragon Pokémon that are many times larger than itself.',110,NULL,'Sylveon','155','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-156','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,280,NULL,'Arceus & Dialga & Palkia-GX','156','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-157','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,270,NULL,'Reshiram & Zekrom-GX','157','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-158','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,280,NULL,'Naganadel & Guzzlord-GX','158','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-159','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If a child it has made friends with is bullied, Drampa will find the bully\'s house and burn it to the ground.',120,NULL,'Drampa','159','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-16','sui',NULL,NULL,2,'Deerling','They migrate according to the seasons. People can tell the season by looking at Sawsbuck\'s horns.',100,NULL,'Sawsbuck','16','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-160','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It smacks the scales on its head against rocks or against the ground to frighten its opponents. It can also contact its friends with these noises.',60,NULL,'Jangmo-o','160','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-161','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It smacks the scales on its head against rocks or against the ground to frighten its opponents. It can also contact its friends with these noises.',70,NULL,'Jangmo-o','161','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-162','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Jangmo-o','It makes noise by clanging its scales together. When the rhythm has reached its peak, Hakamo-o attacks.',80,NULL,'Hakamo-o','162','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-163','hatachu',NULL,NULL,2,'Hakamo-o','When it howls after finishing off its prey, the metallic sounds of its celebrating comrades can be heard from all around.',160,NULL,'Kommo-o','163','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-164','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This is its form when it has absorbed overwhelming light energy. It fires laser beams from all over its body.',110,NULL,'Ultra Necrozma','164','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-165','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,240,NULL,'Mega Lopunny & Jigglypuff-GX','165','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-166','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The question of why only Eevee has such unstable genes has still not been solved.',60,NULL,'Eevee','166','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-167','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The question of why only Eevee has such unstable genes has still not been solved.',60,NULL,'Eevee','167','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-168','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It\'s always practicing its singing because it wants to improve. Even when it\'s asleep, it keeps singing in its dreams!',60,NULL,'Igglybuff','168','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-169','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it did more and more with its tail, its hands became clumsy. It makes its nest high in the treetops.',60,NULL,'Aipom','169','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-17','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sends its feathers, which are as sharp as blades, flying in attack. Its legs are strong, so its kicks are also formidable.',50,NULL,'Rowlet','17','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-170','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Aipom','In their search for comfortable trees, they get into territorial disputes with groups of Passimian. They win about half the time.',100,NULL,'Ambipom','170','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-171','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it finds honey, its crescent mark glows. It always licks its paws because they are soaked with honey.',60,NULL,'Teddiursa','171','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-172','Hiroki Asanuma',NULL,NULL,3,'Teddiursa','With its ability to distinguish any aroma, it unfailingly finds all food buried deep underground.',140,NULL,'Ursaring','172','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-173','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has feuded with Seviper for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.',100,NULL,'Zangoose','173','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-174','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon has excellent judgment. If it decides it can\'t defeat an opponent, it immediately turns tail and vamooses.',60,NULL,'Lillipup','174','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-175','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,'Lillipup','The longer its black fur grows, the harder and more impervious it gets. Claws and fangs can\'t easily penetrate it.',100,NULL,'Herdier','175','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-176','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Herdier','It pays no mind to the cold, thanks to its long warm coat. Stoutland in Alola look a little uncomfortable.',150,NULL,'Stoutland','176','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-177','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its powerful legs and sturdy claws, it can crack even the hard shells of Shellder and pluck out their insides.',60,NULL,'Rufflet','177','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-178','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Rufflet','The more scars it has on its front, the more heroic it\'s considered to be. Those with many scars on their back are mocked by the flock.',130,NULL,'Braviary','178','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-179','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They make their home in deserts. They can generate their energy from basking in the sun, so eating food is not a requirement.',60,NULL,'Helioptile','179','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-18','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sends its feathers, which are as sharp as blades, flying in attack. Its legs are strong, so its kicks are also formidable.',60,NULL,'Rowlet','18','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-180','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,'Helioptile','They flare their frills and generate energy. A single Heliolisk can generate sufficient electricity to power a skyscraper.',100,NULL,'Heliolisk','180','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-181','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It boasts power enough to split large trees in half. The organ on its rear releases an odor that it uses to communicate with others of its kind.',80,NULL,'Stufful','181','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-182','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Stufful','It waves its hands wildly in intimidation and warning. Life is over for anyone who doesn\'t run away as fast as possible.',120,NULL,'Bewear','182','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-183','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A Pokémon weapon developed for a specific mission, it went berserk during an experiment, so it was cryogenically frozen.',110,NULL,'Type: Null','183','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-184','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,2,'Type: Null',NULL,210,NULL,'Silvally-GX','184','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-185','inose yukie',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Beastite','185','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm12-186','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bellelba & Brycen-Man','186','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm12-187','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chaotic Swell','187','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm12-188','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Clay','188','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm12-189','Ken Sugimori/Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cynthia & Caitlin','189','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm12-19','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Rowlet','This narcissistic Pokémon is a clean freak. If you don\'t groom it diligently, it will stop listening to you.',80,NULL,'Dartrix','19','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-190