,NULL,2,NULL,'A Pokémon that races across the land. It is said that one is born every time a new volcano appears.',130,NULL,'Entei','28','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-29','0313',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'You can tell how it\'s feeling by the smoke spouting from its shell. Tremendous velocity is a sign of good health.',110,NULL,'Torkoal','29','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-3','sui',NULL,NULL,2,'Oddish','Smells incredibly foul! However, around one out of a thousand people enjoy sniffing its nose-bending stink.',80,NULL,'Gloom','3','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-30','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter.',70,NULL,'Victini','30','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-31','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can deftly dodge its foe\'s attacks while shooting fireballs from its nose. It roasts berries before it eats them.',80,NULL,'Tepig','31','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-32','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,4,'Tepig','The more it eats, the more fuel it has to make the fire in its stomach stronger. This fills it with even more power.',110,NULL,'Pignite','32','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-33','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,4,'Pignite','It can throw a fire punch by setting its fists on fire with its fiery chin. It cares deeply about its friends.',170,NULL,'Emboar','33','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-34','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When battling opponents, it sprays fire from its five horns. The max temperature of the flames can reach nearly 5,500 degrees Fahrenheit.',80,NULL,'Larvesta','34','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-35','Hiroyuki Yamamoto',NULL,NULL,3,'Larvesta',NULL,210,NULL,'Volcarona-GX','35','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-36','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When they\'re young, they live with a pride. Once they\'re able to hunt prey on their own, they\'re kicked out and have to make their own way.',70,NULL,'Litleo','36','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-37','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,'Litleo','The males are usually lazy, but when attacked by a strong foe, a male will protect its friends with no regard for its own safety.',130,NULL,'Pyroar','37','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-38','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,270,NULL,'Blastoise & Piplup-GX','38','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-39','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If you carelessly approach it because it\'s cute, the boss of the pack, Ninetales, will appear and freeze you.',60,NULL,'Alolan Vulpix','39','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-4','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Gloom',NULL,240,NULL,'Vileplume-GX','4','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-40','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Using psychokinesis gives it a headache, so it normally passes the time spacing out and doing as little as possible.',60,NULL,'Psyduck','40','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-41','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,'Psyduck','Even fast-swimming fish Pokémon can be disabled by Golduck. It brings them to a standstill and seizes them.',110,NULL,'Golduck','41','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-42','sui',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','Clean, clear waters are its usual habitat. When it\'s about to be attacked by an invading enemy, it dives into the water to hide.',110,NULL,'Vaporeon','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-43','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They will cooperate to steal eggs from the nests of bird Pokémon, but fights break out to determine which one gets to eat the eggs.',70,NULL,'Sneasel','43','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-44','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sneasel','One Weavile will trip a Sandshrew and flip it over, and then another Weavile will deal the finishing blow with its sharp claws.',90,NULL,'Weavile','44','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-45','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It swims along with its mouth open and swallows down seawater along with its food. It sprays excess water out of its nostrils.',120,NULL,'Wailmer','45','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-46','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,4,'Wailmer','They eat so many fish Pokémon that when Wailord become too numerous, fishermen have to chase them off.',200,NULL,'Wailord','46','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-47','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It feeds mainly on ice and snow. It\'s only able to survive in a limited number of places in the warm Alola region.',60,NULL,'Snorunt','47','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-48','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,'Snorunt','It freezes its prey and chews them whole. However, it prefers to eat Pokémon like Vanillite that are already frozen.',120,NULL,'Glalie','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-49','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'They can\'t swim well yet, and they move much faster by rolling. When they\'re happy, they clap fins.',60,NULL,'Spheal','49','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-5','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.',70,NULL,'Tangela','5','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-50','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'They can\'t swim well yet, and they move much faster by rolling. When they\'re happy, they clap fins.',70,NULL,'Spheal','50','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-51','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,3,'Spheal','It has a very sensitive nose. It touches new things with its nose to examine them.',100,NULL,'Sealeo','51','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-52','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,4,'Sealeo','It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks.',160,NULL,'Walrein','52','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-53','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'A mythical Pokémon said to have swelled the seas with rain and tidal waves. It battled with Groudon.',130,NULL,'Kyogre','53','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-54','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It doesn\'t like to be taken care of. It\'s difficult to bond with since it won\'t listen to its Trainer.',60,NULL,'Piplup','54','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-55','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,'Piplup','It lives alone, away from others. Apparently, every one of them believes it is the most important.',80,NULL,'Prinplup','55','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-56','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Prinplup','It swims as fast as a jet boat. The edges of its wings are sharp and can slice apart drifting ice.',160,NULL,'Empoleon','56','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-57','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When the water warms, they inflate the flotation sac on their heads and drift languidly on the sea in packs.',70,NULL,'Phione','57','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-58','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'By vibrating its cheeks, it emits sound waves imperceptible to humans and warns others of danger.',60,NULL,'Tympole','58','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-59','Yumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When attacked, it uses its feathers to splash water, escaping under cover of the spray.',60,NULL,'Ducklett','59','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-6','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,'Tangela','It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.',140,NULL,'Tangrowth','6','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-60','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,'Ducklett','Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap their wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles.',110,NULL,'Swanna','60','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-61','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.',130,NULL,'Black Kyurem','61','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-62','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Wishiwashi assemble in this formation to face off against strong foes. It boasts a strength that earned it the name \"demon of the sea.\"',180,NULL,'Wishiwashi','62','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-63','sadaji',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,130,NULL,'Wishiwashi-GX','63','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-64','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When two Dewpider meet, they display their water bubbles to each other. Then the one with the smaller bubble gets out of the other\'s way.',60,NULL,'Dewpider','64','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-65','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,'Dewpider','It usually passes its time in the water. When its belly is full, it stores its subdued prey in the water bubble on its head.',100,NULL,'Araquanid','65','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-66','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its nature is to store up electricity. Forests where nests of Pikachu live are dangerous, since the trees are so often struck by lightning.',70,NULL,'Pikachu','66','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-67','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,'Pikachu','As electricity builds up inside its body, it becomes more aggressive. One theory is that the electricity buildup is actually causing stress.',120,NULL,'Raichu','67','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-68','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s frequently the cause of power outages, which is why some power plants send out electrical signals that it can\'t stand.',60,NULL,'Magnemite','68','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-69','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,'Magnemite','Delicate equipment can malfunction in areas inhabited by Magneton, which send out mysterious electrical signals.',80,NULL,'Magneton','69','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-7','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It may plummet from the sky. If attacked by a Spearow, it will violently shake its leaves.',50,NULL,'Sunkern','7','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-70','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee','Its lungs contain an organ that creates electricity. The crackling sound of electricity can be heard when it exhales.',100,NULL,'Jolteon','70','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-71','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its two antennae glow softly to lure in prey, making it a useful Pokémon for night fishing.',60,NULL,'Chinchou','71','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-72','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,'Chinchou','When the bacteria living inside its antennae absorb Lanturn\'s bodily fluids, a strong luminescent effect is produced.',110,NULL,'Lanturn','72','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-73','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it\'s surprised or agitated, the 14 fur spikes on its back will stand up involuntarily.',80,NULL,'Togedemaru','73','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-74','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it\'s surprised or agitated, the 14 fur spikes on its back will stand up involuntarily.',70,NULL,'Togedemaru','74','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-75','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,270,NULL,'Solgaleo & Lunala-GX','75','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-76','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its thin, balloon-like body is inflated by horribly toxic gases. It reeks when it is nearby.',60,NULL,'Koffing','76','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-77','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,2,'Koffing','If one of the twin Koffing inflates, the other one deflates. It constantly mixes its poisonous gases.',100,NULL,'Weezing','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-78','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although it still can\'t fly, its jumping power is outstanding. It jumps way up into trees and plucks the buds from the branches.',60,NULL,'Natu','78','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-79','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Natu','It\'s said that while this Pokémon has the power to predict the future, it\'s not powerful enough to change the future it sees.',80,NULL,'Xatu','79','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-8','Yumi',NULL,NULL,1,'Sunkern','As the hot season approaches, the petals on this Pokémon\'s face become more vivid and lively.',90,NULL,'Sunflora','8','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-80','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.',60,NULL,'Ralts','80','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-81','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,'Ralts','The cheerful spirit of its Trainer gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.',80,NULL,'Kirlia','81','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-82','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,'Kirlia','Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce.',160,NULL,'Gallade','82','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-83','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It doggedly pursues its prey wherever it goes. However, the chase is abandoned at sunrise.',40,NULL,'Duskull','83','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-84','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,3,'Duskull','Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away.',90,NULL,'Dusclops','84','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-85','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,'Dusclops','It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.',160,NULL,'Dusknoir','85','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm12-86','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Research continues on this Pokémon, which could be the power source of a unique motor.',70,NULL,'Rotom','86','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-87','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its habitat is dark forests and caves. It emits ultrasonic waves from its nose to learn about its surroundings.',60,NULL,'Woobat','87','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-88','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Woobat','It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble.',90,NULL,'Swoobat','88','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-89','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Its movements are powered by a mysterious energy. It has continued to move since ancient times, so its power may soon run out.',90,NULL,'Golett','89','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-9','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It\'s proud of its thick horn. In Alola, its biggest rival is Vikavolt, which it\'s always fighting with.',130,NULL,'Heracross','9','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-90','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,4,'Golett','Some say that ancient people invented Golurk to serve as a laborer. It follows its master\'s orders faithfully.',140,NULL,'Golurk','90','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-91','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It vanishes into seaweed and remains perfectly still to avoid attacks from large Pokémon. Rotten seaweed is its main food source.',60,NULL,'Skrelp','91','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-92','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,'Skrelp','This vicious Pokémon sprays a poisonous liquid on opponents that come near. For whatever reason, it gets along really well with Dhelmise.',120,NULL,'Dragalge','92','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-93','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'By imitating the voice of a child, it causes people to get hopelessly lost deep in the forest. It\'s trying to make friends with them.',60,NULL,'Phantump','93','Common','Pokémon'),('sm12-94','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Phantump','It\'s feared as a ghost of the forest. Lumberjacks bring along Fire types, which Trevenant hates, when they enter the forest.',120,NULL,'Trevenant','94','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-95','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Oricorio-GX','95','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm12-96','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although it\'s a quiet, lonely Pokémon, if you try to look at what\'s under its rag, it will become agitated and resist violently.',70,NULL,'Mimikyu','96','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-97','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although it\'s a quiet, lonely Pokémon, if you try to look at what\'s under its rag, it will become agitated and resist violently.',70,NULL,'Mimikyu','97','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm12-98','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It wraps its prey in green seaweed and sucks away their vitality. It only likes to go after big prey like Wailord.',130,NULL,'Dhelmise','98','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm12-99','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Even though its helpless, gaseous body can be blown away by the slightest breeze, it doesn\'t seem to care.',50,NULL,'Cosmog','99','Common','Pokémon'),('sm2-1','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Even though its body is extremely skinny, it is blindingly fast when catching its prey.',60,NULL,'Bellsprout','1','Common','Pokémon'),('sm2-10','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter.',70,NULL,'Victini','10','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm2-100','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Hakamo-o',NULL,240,NULL,'Kommo-o-GX','100','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm2-101','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The eggs laid by Chansey are rich in nutrients and a favorite food of many Pokémon.',110,NULL,'Chansey','101','Common','Pokémon'),('sm2-102','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,4,'Chansey','Even