ite foods are Wingull and Pikipek. It attacks with a powerful kick and grasps them firmly in its talons.',130,NULL,'Talonflame','111','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm2-112','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Despite its adorable appearance, when it gets angry and flails about, its arms and legs could knock a pro wrestler sprawling.',70,NULL,'Stufful','112','Common','Pokémon'),('sm2-113','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Stufful','This immensely dangerous Pokémon possesses overwhelming physical strength. Its habitat is generally off-limits.',130,NULL,'Bewear','113','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm2-114','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is born asleep, and it dies asleep. All its movements are apparently no more than the results of it tossing and turning in its dreams.',80,NULL,'Komala','114','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm2-115','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Drampa-GX','115','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm2-116','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aether Paradise Conservation Area','116','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-117','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Altar of the Moone','117','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-118','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Altar of the Sunne','118','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-119','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aqua Patch','119','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-12','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Litwick','The spirits it absorbs fuel its baleful fire. It hangs around hospitals waiting for people to pass on.',80,NULL,'Lampent','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm2-120','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Brooklet Hill','120','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-121','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Choice Band','121','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-121a','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Choice Band','121a','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-122','Yoshinobu Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Energy Loto','122','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sm2-123','Toyste Beach',NULL,NU