nder\'s life force. If it is healthy, the flame burns brightly.',70,NULL,'Charmander','18','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-18a','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The flame on its tail indicates Charmander\'s life force. If it is healthy, the flame burns brightly.',70,NULL,'Charmander','18a','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-19','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Charmander','It lashes about with its tail to knock down its foe. It then tears up the fallen opponent with sharp claws.',90,NULL,'Charmeleon','19','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-2','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Caterpie','Its shell is filled with its soft innards. It doesn\'t move much because of the risk it might carelessly spill its innards out.',80,NULL,'Metapod','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-20','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Charmeleon',NULL,250,NULL,'Charizard-GX','20','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-21','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Ho-Oh-GX','21','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-22','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Very intelligent, it roasts berries before eating them. It likes to help people.',70,NULL,'Pansear','22','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-23','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Pansear','A flame burns inside its body. It scatters embers from its head and tail to sear its opponents.',90,NULL,'Simisear','23','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-24','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Using their very hot, flame-covered tongues, they burn through Durant\'s steel bodies and consume their insides.',110,NULL,'Heatmor','24','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-25','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Salandit',NULL,200,NULL,'Salazzle-GX','25','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-26','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The shell on its back is chemically unstable and explodes violently if struck. The hole in its stomach is its weak point.',130,NULL,'Turtonator','26','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-27','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It exhales air colder than -58 degrees Fahrenheit. Elderly people in Alola call this Pokémon by an older name—Keokeo.',60,NULL,'Alolan Vulpix','27','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-28','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Alolan Vulpix','It creates drops of ice in its coat and showers them over its enemies. Anyone who angers it will be frozen stiff in an instant.',110,NULL,'Alolan Ninetales','28','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-29','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Known to shoot down flying bugs with precision blasts of ink from the surface of the water.',60,NULL,'Horsea','29','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-3','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Metapod','Close examination of its large eyes reveals that each eye is composed of a myriad of tiny eyes.',120,NULL,'Butterfree','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-30','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Horsea','Its body bristles with sharp spikes. Carelessly trying to touch it could cause fainting from the spikes.',80,NULL,'Seadra','30','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-31','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Seadra','It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning.',140,NULL,'Kingdra','31','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-32','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although weak and helpless, this Pokémon is incredibly fertile. They exist in such multitudes, you\'ll soon grow tired of seeing them.',30,NULL,'Magikarp','32','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-33','so-taro',NULL,NULL,4,'Magikarp','A tale is told of a town that angered Gyarados. Before the sun rose the next day, flames utterly consumed the town, leaving not a trace behind.',150,NULL,'Gyarados','33','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-34','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The fur on its body naturally repels water. It can stay dry, even when it plays in the water.',60,NULL,'Marill','34','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-35','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,3,'Marill','Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of living things on riverbeds.',120,NULL,'Azumarill','35','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-36','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. It waters plants with it using its tail.',70,NULL,'Panpour','36','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-37','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,'Panpour','The high-pressure water expelled from its tail is so powerful, it can destroy a concrete wall.',90,NULL,'Simipour','37','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-38','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it unleashes its psychic power from the protuberance on its head, the grating sound of grinding teeth echoes through the area.',100,NULL,'Bruxish','38','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-39','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Tapu Fini-GX','39','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-39a','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Tapu Fini-GX','39a','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-4','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'During the day, it stays in the cold underground to avoid the sun. It grows by bathing in moonlight.',50,NULL,'Oddish','4','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-40','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A plan was recently announced to gather many Pikachu and make an electric power plant.',60,NULL,'Pikachu','40','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-41','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Pikachu','It unleashes electric shocks that can reach 100,000 volts. When agitated, it can knock out even an Indian elephant.',110,NULL,'Raichu','41','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-42','match',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Half of all sudden blackouts are caused by Electabuzz gathering at electric power plants and gobbling up electricity.',80,NULL,'Electabuzz','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-43','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,4,'Electabuzz','It pushes the tips of its tails against its foes and then lets loose a high-voltage current. Its foes are burned to a crisp in an instant.',140,NULL,'Electivire','43','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-44','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While one alone doesn\'t have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning.',40,NULL,'Tynamo','44','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-45','OOYAMA',NULL,NULL,2,'Tynamo','It wraps itself around its prey and paralyzes it with electricity from the round spots on its sides. Then it chomps.',90,NULL,'Eelektrik','45','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-46','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,'Eelektrik','With their sucker mouths, they suck in prey. Then they use their fangs to shock the prey with electricity.',140,NULL,'Eelektross','46','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-47','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The spiny fur on its back is normally at rest. When this Pokémon becomes agitated, its fur stands on end and stabs into its attackers.',80,NULL,'Togedemaru','47','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-48','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Slowpoke','A poisonous bite reacted with its system, blessing it with the enhanced intellect of a genius. It has full control of its psychic powers.',120,NULL,'Slowking','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-49','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It hates light and shock. If attacked, it inflates its body to build up its counterstrike.',120,NULL,'Wobbuffet','49','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-5','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,'Oddish','Smells incredibly foul! However, around one out of a thousand people enjoy sniffing its nose-bending stink.',80,NULL,'Gloom','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-50','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'In battle, it uses its bladed tail to counter any Zangoose. It secretes a deadly venom in its tail.',100,NULL,'Seviper','50','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-51','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It doggedly pursues its prey wherever it goes. However, the chase is abandoned at sunrise.',60,NULL,'Duskull','51','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-52','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,3,'Duskull','Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away.',90,NULL,'Dusclops','52','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-53','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,'Dusclops','It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.',150,NULL,'Dusknoir','53','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-54','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes off guard to jab them with toxic fingers.',60,NULL,'Croagunk','54','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-55','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Croagunk','It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency.',110,NULL,'Toxicroak','55','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-56','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It discovers what is going on around it by using the feelers on its head and tail. It is brutally aggressive.',70,NULL,'Venipede','56','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-57','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,3,'Venipede','Protected by a hard shell, it spins its body like a wheel and crashes furiously into its enemies.',90,NULL,'Whirlipede','57','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-58','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,4,'Whirlipede','It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.',160,NULL,'Scolipede','58','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-59','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The organ that emits its intense psychic power is sheltered by its ears to keep power from leaking out.',60,NULL,'Espurr','59','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-6','chibi',NULL,NULL,3,'Gloom','The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up.',140,NULL,'Vileplume','6','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-60','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,'Espurr','When in danger, it raises its ears and releases enough psychic power to grind a 10-ton truck to dust.',90,NULL,'Meowstic','60','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-61','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Born from a sand mound playfully built by a child, this Pokémon embodies the grudges of the departed.',80,NULL,'Sandygast','61','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-62','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,4,'Sandygast','Possessed people controlled by this Pokémon transformed its sand mound into a castle. As it evolved, its power to curse grew ever stronger.',130,NULL,'Palossand','62','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-63','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Necrozma-GX','63','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-64','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Machoke',NULL,250,NULL,'Machamp-GX','64','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-65','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Strong, but not too bright, this Pokémon can shatter even a skyscraper with its charging Tackles.',80,NULL,'Rhyhorn','65','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-66','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,4,'Rhyhorn','Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.',110,NULL,'Rhydon','66','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-67','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,4,'Rhydon','From holes in its palms, it fires out Geodude. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions.',160,NULL,'Rhyperior','67','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-68','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.',90,NULL,'Lunatone','68','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-69','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Solar energy is the source of its power, so it is strong during the daytime. When it spins, its body shines.',90,NULL,'Solrock','69','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-7','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.',80,NULL,'Tangela','7','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-70','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can discern the physical and emotional states of people, Pokémon, and other natural things from the shape of their aura waves.',70,NULL,'Riolu','70','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-71','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Riolu','Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle.',120,NULL,'Lucario','71','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-72','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping.',90,NULL,'Sawk','72','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-73','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'While guarding its weak points with its pincers, it looks for an opening and unleashes punches. When it loses, it foams at the mouth and faints.',80,NULL,'Crabrawler','73','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-74','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,4,'Crabrawler','It aimed for the top but got lost and ended up on a snowy mountain. Being forced to endure the cold, this Pokémon evolved and grew fur.',140,NULL,'Crabominable','74','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-75','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','The more intimidating the opponent it faces, the more this Pokémon\'s blood boils. It will attack with no regard for its own safety.',110,NULL,'Lycanroc','75','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-76','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','Its quick movements confuse its enemies. Well equipped with claws and fangs, it also uses the sharp rocks in its mane as weapons.',110,NULL,'Lycanroc','76','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-77','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The mud stuck to Mudbray\'s hooves enhances its grip and its powerful running gait.',80,NULL,'Mudbray','77','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-78','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,3,'Mudbray','It spits a mud that provides resistance to both wind and rain, so the walls of old houses were often coated with it.',130,NULL,'Mudsdale','78','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-79','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They form groups of roughly 20 individuals. Their mutual bond is remarkable—they will never let down a comrade.',110,NULL,'Passimian','79','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-8','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,4,'Tangela','It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.',140,NULL,'Tangrowth','8','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-80','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,150,NULL,'Marshadow-GX','80','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-81','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its incisors, it gnaws through doors and infiltrates people\'s homes. Then, with a twitch of its whiskers, it steals whatever food it finds.',40,NULL,'Alolan Rattata','81','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-82','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Alolan Rattata','It forms a group of Rattata, which it assumes command of. Each group has its own territory, and disputes over food happen often.',120,NULL,'Alolan Raticate','82','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-83','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'A Grimer, which had been brought in to solve a problem with garbage, developed over time into this form.',80,NULL,'Alolan Grimer','83','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-84','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Alolan Grimer',NULL,220,NULL,'Alolan Muk-GX','84','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-85','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a cunning yet savage disposition. It waits for parents to leave their nests, and then it sneaks in to steal their eggs.',70,NULL,'Sneasel','85','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-86','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sneasel','They travel in groups of four or five, leaving signs for one another on trees and rocks. They bring down their prey with coordinated attacks.',90,NULL,'Weavile','86','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-87','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers.',120,NULL,'Darkrai','87','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-88','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Darkrai-GX','88','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-88a','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Darkrai-GX','88a','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-89','OOYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Opponents who stare at the flashing of the light-emitting spots on its body become dazed and lose their will to fight.',60,NULL,'Inkay','89','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-9','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are timid and grow uneasy when not in a swarm with others of their kind. The pattern on their backs differs slightly from one to another.',60,NULL,'Ledyba','9','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-90','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Inkay','It wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, and it forces others to do whatever it wants.',100,NULL,'Malamar','90','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-91','Yumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.',60,NULL,'Ralts','91','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-92','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,'Ralts','The cheerful spirit of its Trainer gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.',80,NULL,'Kirlia','92','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-92a','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,'Ralts','The cheerful spirit of its Trainer gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.',80,NULL,'Kirlia','92a','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-93','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Kirlia',NULL,230,NULL,'Gardevoir-GX','93','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm3-94','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A sudden transformation of Carbink, its pink, glimmering body is said to be the loveliest sight in the whole world.',90,NULL,'Diancie','94','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm3-95','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It feeds on the nectar and pollen of flowers. Because it\'s able to sense auras, it can identify which flowers are about to bloom.',30,NULL,'Cutiefly','95','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-96','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,'Cutiefly','It rolls up pollen into puffs. It makes many different varieties, some used as food and others used in battle.',70,NULL,'Ribombee','96','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm3-97','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It scatters spores that flicker and glow. Anyone seeing these lights falls into a deep slumber.',60,NULL,'Morelull','97','Common','Pokémon'),('sm3-98','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,'Morelull','Forests where Shiinotic live are treacherous to enter at night. People confused by its strange lights can never find their way home again.',100,NULL,'Shiinotic','98','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm3-99','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Noibat',NULL,200,NULL,'Noivern-GX','99','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm35-1','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A strange seed was planted on its back at birth. The plant sprouts and grows with this Pokémon.',70,NULL,'Bulbasaur','1','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-10','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Entei-GX','10','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm35-10a','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Entei-GX','10a','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm35-11','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Coal is the source of Torkoal\'s energy. Large amounts of coal can be found in the mountains where they live.',110,NULL,'Torkoal','11','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-12','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves.',80,NULL,'Larvesta','12','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-13','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Larvesta','A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales.',120,NULL,'Volcarona','13','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-14','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth.',130,NULL,'Reshiram','14','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-15','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While grooming itself, it builds up fur inside its stomach. It sets the fur alight and spews fiery attacks, which change based on how it coughs.',60,NULL,'Litten','15','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-16','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Litten','At its throat, it bears a bell of fire. The bell rings brightly whenever this Pokémon spits fire.',90,NULL,'Torracat','16','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-17','Emi Ando',NULL,NULL,2,'Torracat','This Pokémon has a violent, selfish disposition. If it\'s not in the mood to listen, it will ignore its Trainer\'s orders with complete nonchalance.',170,NULL,'Incineroar','17','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-18','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is small but rough and tough. It won\'t hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves.',70,NULL,'Totodile','18','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-19','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Totodile','If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth.',90,NULL,'Croconaw','19','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-2','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,4,'Bulbasaur','There is a plant bulb on its back. When it absorbs nutrients, the bulb is said to blossom into a large flower.',100,NULL,'Ivysaur','2','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-20','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,'Croconaw','It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.',160,NULL,'Feraligatr','20','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-21','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To fire its poison spikes, it must inflate its body by drinking over 2.6 gallons of water all at once.',90,NULL,'Qwilfish','21','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-22','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It swims by rotating its two tails like a screw. When it dives, its flotation sac collapses.',60,NULL,'Buizel','22','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-23','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Buizel','It floats using its well-developed flotation sac. It assists in the rescues of drowning people.',100,NULL,'Floatzel','23','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-24','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said to live in a gap in the spatial dimension parallel to ours. It appears in mythology.',130,NULL,'Palkia','24','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-25','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is born with a wondrous power that lets it bond with any kind of Pokémon.',60,NULL,'Manaphy','25','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-26','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It crosses the world, running over the surfaces of oceans and rivers. It appears at scenic waterfronts.',110,NULL,'Keldeo','26','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-27','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It lets out billows of steam and disappears into the dense fog. It\'s said to live in mountains where humans do not tread.',130,NULL,'Shining Volcanion','27','Rare Shining','Pokémon'),('sm35-28','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A plan was recently announced to gather many Pikachu and make an electric power plant.',60,NULL,'Pikachu','28','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-29','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Pikachu',NULL,210,NULL,'Raichu-GX','29','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm35-3','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,'Ivysaur','By spreading the broad petals of its flower and catching the sun\'s rays, it fills its body with power.',160,NULL,'Venusaur','3','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-30','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It was discovered when Poké Balls were introduced. It is said that there is some connection.',60,NULL,'Voltorb','30','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-31','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Voltorb','It explodes in response to even minor stimuli. It is feared, with the nickname of \"The Bomb Ball.\"',90,NULL,'Electrode','31','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-32','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The rain clouds it carries let it fire thunderbolts at will. They say that it descended with lightning.',120,NULL,'Raikou','32','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-33','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.',70,NULL,'Plusle','33','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-34','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Exposure to electricity from Minun and Plusle promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles.',70,NULL,'Minun','34','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-35','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world.',130,NULL,'Zekrom','35','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-36','DemizuPosuka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest.',70,NULL,'Ekans','36','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-37','kodama',NULL,NULL,3,'Ekans','The pattern on its belly appears to be a frightening face. Weak foes will flee just at the sight of the pattern.',120,NULL,'Arbok','37','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-38','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It wiggles its hips as it walks. It can cause people to dance in unison with it.',90,NULL,'Jynx','38','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-39','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Mewtwo-GX','39','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm35-4','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head.',60,NULL,'Shroomish','4','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-40','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe Mew to be the ancestor of Pokémon.',30,NULL,'Shining Mew','40','Rare Shining','Pokémon'),('sm35-41','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.',110,NULL,'Latios','41','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-42','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Generations have believed that any wish written on a note on its head will come true when it awakens.',70,NULL,'Shining Jirachi','42','Rare Shining','Pokémon'),('sm35-43','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy.',90,NULL,'Golett','43','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-44','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,4,'Golett','It is said that Golurk were ordered to protect people and Pokémon by the ancient people who made them.',140,NULL,'Golurk','44','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-45','Emi Ando',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Able to conceal itself in shadows, it never appears before humans, so its very existence was the stuff of myth.',70,NULL,'Marshadow','45','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm35-46','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Its skin is very hard, so it is unhurt even if stepped on by sumo wrestlers. It smiles when transmitting electricity.',110,NULL,'Stunfisk','46','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-47','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A Pokémon that was formed by 108 spirits. It is bound to a fissure in an odd keystone.',60,NULL,'Spiritomb','47','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm35-48','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws.',60,NULL,'Purrloin','48','Common','Pokémon'),('sm35-49','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,'Purrloin','Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night.',90,N