on'),('sm4-21','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,4,'Piloswine','A frozen Mamoswine was dug from ice dating back 10,000 years. This Pokémon has been around a long, long, long time.',180,NULL,'Mamoswine','21','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-22','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has superb accuracy. The water it shoots out can strike even moving prey from more than 300 feet.',60,NULL,'Remoraid','22','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-23','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Remoraid','It has a tendency to want to be in holes. It prefers rock crags or pots and sprays ink from them before attacking.',100,NULL,'Octillery','23','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-24','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive.',70,NULL,'Corphish','24','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-25','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,'Corphish','It is a ruffian that uses its pincers to pick up and toss out other Pokémon from its pond.',110,NULL,'Crawdaunt','25','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-26','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A tough Pokémon that is perfectly fine even in dirty water. However, due to its ragged, shabby appearance, it isn\'t popular.',30,NULL,'Feebas','26','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-27','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Feebas','Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all.',120,NULL,'Milotic','27','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm4-28','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is said to have slept in a glacier for thousands of years. Its body can\'t be melted, even by magma.',130,NULL,'Regice','28','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm4-29','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'For the most part, it makes its home along the seashore. Its color and form differ according to its habitat and the quality of its food.',60,NULL,'Shellos','29','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-3','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Kakuna','May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.',120,NULL,'Beedrill','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-30','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A plan was recently announced to gather many Pikachu and make an electric power plant.',60,NULL,'Pikachu','30','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-31','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Pikachu','It only evolves to this form in the Alola region. According to researchers, its diet is one of the causes of this change.',110,NULL,'Alolan Raichu','31','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm4-32','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its body is a magnetic stone. Iron sand attaches firmly to the portions of its body that are particularly magnetic.',60,NULL,'Alolan Geodude','32','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-33','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,3,'Alolan Geodude','Its preferred food is dravite. After it has eaten this mineral, crystals form inside the Pokémon, rising to the surface of part of its body.',100,NULL,'Alolan Graveler','33','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-34','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Alolan Graveler',NULL,250,NULL,'Alolan Golem-GX','34','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm4-35','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It glides using its cape-like membrane. Electrical energy scatters from it, shocking its friends and foes alike.',60,NULL,'Emolga','35','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-36','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Should a strange light be seen flickering in an abandoned building, Gastly is lurking there.',50,NULL,'Gastly','36','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-37','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Gastly','It strikes at humans from total darkness. Those licked by its cold tongue grow weaker with each passing day until they die.',70,NULL,'Haunter','37','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-38','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Haunter','Should you feel yourself attacked by a sudden chill, it is evidence of an approaching Gengar. There is no escaping it. Give up.',130,NULL,'Gengar','38','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm4-39','so-taro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It will use any means necessary to frighten people and absorb their life energy. It practices constantly to hone its skill 