rienced Trainers, so it\'s best suited to veteran Trainers.',110,NULL,'Oranguru','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-49','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Nihilego-GX','49','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm4-5','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives in arid locations. Its yellow flowers bloom once a year.',60,NULL,'Cacnea','5','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-50','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can spontaneously become enraged. Everyone near it clears out as it rampages and the resulting loneliness makes it angrier still.',60,NULL,'Mankey','50','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-51','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,'Mankey','It has been known to become so angry that it dies as a result. Its face looks peaceful in death, however.',90,NULL,'Primeape','51','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-52','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When it thinks of its deceased mother, it weeps loudly. Mandibuzz that hear its cries will attack it from the air.',70,NULL,'Cubone','52','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-53','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.',130,NULL,'Regirock','53','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-54','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,3,'Shellos','It has strong regenerative capabilities. Even if parts of it are bitten off by fish Pokémon, it will return to normal within a few hours.',120,NULL,'Gastrodon','54','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-55','Kanako Eo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Despite its adorable appearance, when it gets angry and flails about, its arms and legs could knock a pro wrestler sprawling.',70,NULL,'Stufful','55','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-56','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,3,'Stufful','This immensely dangerous Pokémon possesses overwhelming physical strength. Its habitat is generally off-limits.',130,NULL,'Bewear','56','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm4-57','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Buzzwole-GX','57','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm4-58','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Around dawn, its ominous howl echoes through the area to announce that this is its territory.',60,NULL,'Houndour','58','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-59','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Houndour','Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper.',110,NULL,'Houndoom','59','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-6','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,'Cacnea','It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day\'s desert heat.',110,NULL,'Cacturne','6','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-60','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'They cannot see, so they tackle and bite to learn about their surroundings. Their bodies are covered in wounds.',70,NULL,'Deino','60','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-61','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Deino','The two heads do not get along. Whichever head eats more than the other gets to be the leader.',90,NULL,'Zweilous','61','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-62','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Zweilous','The heads on their arms do not have brains. They use all three heads to consume and destroy everything.',160,NULL,'Hydreigon','62','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-63','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,210,NULL,'Guzzlord-GX','63','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm4-63a','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,210,NULL,'Guzzlord-GX','63a','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm4-64','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses its docile-looking face to lull foes into complacency, then bites with its huge, relentless jaws.',80,NULL,'Mawile','64','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-65','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.',60,NULL,'Aron','65','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-66','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,3,'Aron','It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies.',100,NULL,'Lairon','66','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-67','Yoshinobu Saito',NULL,NULL,4,'Lairon','It claims an entire mountain as its own. The more wounds it has, the more it has battled, so don\'t take it lightly.',170,NULL,'Aggron','67','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm4-68','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.',130,NULL,'Registeel','68','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-69','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Karrablast','Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances.',120,NULL,'Escavalier','69','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-7','OOYAMA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'These mysterious Pokémon evolve when they receive electrical stimulation while they are in the same place as Shelmet.',60,NULL,'Karrablast','7','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-70','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Kartana-GX','70','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm4-71','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It hugely inflates its stomach and sings a mysterious melody. If you hear this melody, you\'ll become sleepy right away.',60,NULL,'Jigglypuff','71','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-72','0313',NULL,NULL,2,'Jigglypuff','It sheds its fine fur when the seasons change. The fur is gathered and spun into a luxurious yarn.',120,NULL,'Wigglytuff','72','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm4-73','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Legends say it can share eternal life. It slept for a thousand years in the form of a tree before its revival.',130,NULL,'Xerneas','73','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm4-74','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Exeggcute',NULL,220,NULL,'Alolan Exeggutor-GX','74','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm4-75','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It expresses its feelings by smacking its scales. Metallic sounds echo through the tall mountains where Jangmo-o lives.',60,NULL,'Jangmo-o','75','Common','Pokémon'),('sm4-76','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Jangmo-o','It leaps at its prey with a courageous shout. Its scaly punches tear its opponents to shreds.',90,NULL,'Hakamo-o','76','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm4-77','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Hakamo-o','When it spots enemies, it threatens them by jingling the scales on its tail. Weak opponents will crack and flee in panic.',160,NULL,'Kommo-o','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('s