','15','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-16','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Fennekin','When the twig is plucked from its tail, friction sets the twig alight. The flame is used to send signals to its allies.',90,NULL,'Braixen','16','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-17','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Braixen','Using psychic power, it generates a fiery vortex of 5,400 degree Fahrenheit, incinerating foes swept into this whirl of flame.',150,NULL,'Delphox','17','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-18','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'They set off on their own from their pride and live by themselves to become stronger. These hot-blooded Pokémon are quick to fight.',70,NULL,'Litleo','18','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-19','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,'Litleo','With fiery breath of more than 10,000 degrees Fahrenheit, they viciously threaten any challenger. The females protect the pride\'s cubs.',120,NULL,'Pyroar','19','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-2','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,3,'Exeggcute','As it grew taller and taller, it outgrew its reliance on psychic powers, while within it awakened the power of the sleeping dragon.',160,NULL,'Alolan Exeggutor','2','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-20','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Palkia-GX','20','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-21','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It protects its skin by covering its body in delicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air, it keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings.',50,NULL,'Froakie','21','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-22','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It protects its skin by covering its body in delicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air, it keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings.',70,NULL,'Froakie','22','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-23','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Froakie','Its swiftness is unparalleled. It can scale a tower of more than 2,000 feet in a minute\'s time.',80,NULL,'Frogadier','23','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-24','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Frogadier',NULL,230,NULL,'Greninja-GX','24','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-25','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Through controlled expulsions of internal gas, it can expel water like a pistol shot. At close distances, it can shatter rock.',60,NULL,'Clauncher','25','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-26','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,'Clauncher','By expelling water from the nozzle in the back of its claw, it can move at a speed of 60 knots.',100,NULL,'Clawitzer','26','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-27','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,3,'Unidentified Fossil','This calm Pokémon lived in a cold land where there were no violent predators like Tyrantrum.',90,NULL,'Amaura','27','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-28','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,4,'Amaura','Using its diamond-shaped crystals, it can instantly create a wall of ice to block an opponent\'s attack.',160,NULL,'Aurorus','28','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-29','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Using air of -150 degrees Fahrenheit, they freeze opponents solid. They live in herds above the snow line on mountains.',60,NULL,'Bergmite','29','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-2a','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,'Exeggcute','As it grew taller and taller, it outgrew its reliance on psychic powers, while within it awakened the power of the sleeping dragon.',160,NULL,'Alolan Exeggutor','2a','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-3','match',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'In the spring, it grows berries with the texture of frozen treats around its belly.',80,NULL,'Snover','3','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-30','sowsow',NULL,NULL,4,'Bergmite','The way several Bergmite huddle on its back makes it look like an aircraft carrier made of ice.',140,NULL,'Avalugg','30','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-31','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain.',160,NULL,'Volcanion ◇','31','Rare Prism Star','Pokémon'),('sm6-32','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it comes across enemies or potential prey, this Pokémon smashes its water-bubble-covered head into them.',60,NULL,'Dewpider','32','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-33','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Dewpider','Despite what its appearance suggests, it cares for others. If it finds vulnerable, weak Pokémon, it protectively brings them into its water bubble.',100,NULL,'Araquanid','33','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-34','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sends out electromagnetic waves, which let it float through the air. Touching it while it\'s eating electricity will give you a full-body shock.',60,NULL,'Magnemite','34','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-35','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Magnemite','It has about three times the electrical power of Magnemite. For some reason, outbreaks of this Pokémon happen when lots of sunspots appear.',90,NULL,'Magneton','35','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-36','Yoshinobu Saito',NULL,NULL,2,'Magneton','As it zooms through the sky, this Pokémon seems to be receiving signals of unknown origin, while transmitting signals of unknown purpose.',150,NULL,'Magnezone','36','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-37','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The frills on either side of its head have cells that generate electricity when exposed to sunlight.',60,NULL,'Helioptile','37','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-38','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,'Helioptile','It stimulates its muscles with electricity, boosting the strength in its legs and enabling it to run 100 yards in five seconds.',100,NULL,'Heliolisk','38','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-39','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It appeared from the Ultra Wormhole. It raided a power plant, so people think it energizes itself with electricity.',120,NULL,'Xurkitree','39','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-4','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Snover','It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards.',130,NULL,'Abomasnow','4','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-40','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.',70,NULL,'Rotom','40','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-41','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that its emergence gave humans the intelligence to improve their quality of life.',60,NULL,'Uxie','41','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-42','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sleeps at the bottom of a lake. Its spirit is said to leave its body to fly on the lake\'s surface.',70,NULL,'Mesprit','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-43','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is thought that Uxie, Mesprit and Azelf all came from the same egg.',60,NULL,'Azelf','43','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-44','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has enough psychic energy to blast everything within 300 feet of itself, but it has no control over its power.',60,NULL,'Espurr','44','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-45','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Espurr','The eyeball patterns on the interior of its ears emit psychic energy. It keeps the patterns tightly covered because that power is too immense.',90,NULL,'Meowstic','45','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-46','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'If anyone dares to grab its hilt, it wraps a blue cloth around that person\'s arm and drains that person\'s life energy completely.',50,NULL,'Honedge','46','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-47','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'If anyone dares to grab its hilt, it wraps a blue cloth around that person\'s arm and drains that person\'s life energy completely.',60,NULL,'Honedge','47','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-48','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Honedge','The complex attack patterns of its two swords are unstoppable, even for an opponent greatly accomplished at swordplay.',80,NULL,'Doublade','48','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-49','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Doublade','Apparently, it can detect the innate qualities of leadership. According to legend, whoever it recognizes is destined to become king.',150,NULL,'Aegislash','49','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-5','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The powder that covers its body regulates its temperature, so it can live in any region or climate.',30,NULL,'Scatterbug','5','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-50','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It flashes the light-emitting spots on its body, which drains its opponent\'s will to fight. It takes the opportunity to scuttle away and hide.',60,NULL,'Inkay','50','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-51','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,2,'Inkay','It lures prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids.',90,NULL,'Malamar','51','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-52','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It looks just like rotten kelp. It hides from foes while storing up power for its evolution.',60,NULL,'Skrelp','52','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-53','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,'Skrelp','Tales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live, never to return.',120,NULL,'Dragalge','53','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-54','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place.',80,NULL,'Hoopa','54','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-55','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Ultra Beast is well enough liked to be chosen as a first partner in its own world.',70,NULL,'Poipole','55','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-56','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Poipole',NULL,210,NULL,'Naganadel-GX','56','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-57','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The skull it wears on its head is that of its dead mother. According to some, it will evolve when it comes to terms with the pain of her death.',60,NULL,'Cubone','57','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-58','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,4,'Grotle','Small Pokémon occasionally gather on its unmoving back to begin building their nests.',180,NULL,'Torterra','58','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-59','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Monferno','It tosses its enemies around with agility. It uses all its limbs to fight in its own unique style.',130,NULL,'Infernape','59','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-6','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The powder that covers its body regulates its temperature, so it can live in any region or climate.',40,NULL,'Scatterbug','6','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-60','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth.',50,NULL,'Gible','60','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-61','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Gible','Shiny objects are its passion. It can be found in its cave, scarcely moving, its gaze fixed on the jewels it\'s amassed or Carbink it has caught.',80,NULL,'Gabite','61','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-62','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Gabite','The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey.',150,NULL,'Garchomp','62','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-63','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.',60,NULL,'Croagunk','63','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-64','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,'Croagunk','Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal.',100,NULL,'Toxicroak','64','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-65','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'There\'s no point to the leaf in its mouth, aside from an effort to look cool. It\'s mischievous, so it\'s not well suited to inexperienced Trainers.',70,NULL,'Pancham','65','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-66','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'They stretch and then contract, yanking their rocks along with them in bold hops. They eat seaweed that washes up on the shoreline.',70,NULL,'Binacle','66','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-67','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,3,'Binacle','Barbaracle\'s legs and hands have minds of their own, and they will move independently. But they usually follow the head\'s orders.',130,NULL,'Barbaracle','67','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-68','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,'Unidentified Fossil','Its immense jaws have enough destructive force that it can chew up an automobile. It lived 100 million years ago.',90,NULL,'Tyrunt','68','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-69','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,'Tyrunt','Nothing could stop this Pokémon 100 million years ago, so it behaved like a king.',160,NULL,'Tyrantrum','69','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-7','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Scatterbug','The beaks of birds can\'t begin to scratch its stalwart body. To defend itself, it spews powder.',70,NULL,'Spewpa','7','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-70','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against.',80,NULL,'Hawlucha','70','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-71','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This is Zygarde\'s form when about 10% of its cells have been gathered. It runs across the land at speeds greater than 60 mph.',90,NULL,'Zygarde','71','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-72','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s thought to be monitoring the ecosystem. There are rumors that even greater power lies hidden within it.',130,NULL,'Zygarde','72','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-73','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,200,NULL,'Zygarde-GX','73','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-74','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.',120,NULL,'Diancie ◇','74','Rare Prism Star','Pokémon'),('sm6-75','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon has lived with people since times long ago. It can sense when its Trainer is in the dumps and will stick close by its Trainer\'s side.',70,NULL,'Rockruff','75','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-76','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','Bathed in the setting sun of evening, Lycanroc has undergone a special kind of evolution. An intense fighting spirit underlies its calmness.',120,NULL,'Lycanroc','76','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-77','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A mysterious life-form called an Ultra Beast. Witnesses saw it pulverize a dump truck with a single punch.',130,NULL,'Buzzwole','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-78','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,3,'Pancham','From the slight twitches of its bamboo leaf, it deduces its opponent\'s movements. It\'s eager to tussle but kindhearted toward its companions.',130,NULL,'Pangoro','78','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-79','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Yveltal-GX','79','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-8','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Spewpa','The patterns on this Pokémon\'s wings depend on the climate and topography of its habitat. It scatters colorful scales.',130,NULL,'Vivillon','8','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-80','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'A dangerous Ultra Beast, it appears to be eating constantly, but for some reason its droppings have never been found.',160,NULL,'Guzzlord','80','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-81','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,'Prinplup','The three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. The leader has the biggest horns.',160,NULL,'Empoleon','81','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-82','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Dialga-GX','82','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-83','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it finds a flower it likes, it dwells on that flower its whole life long. It floats in the wind\'s embrace with an untroubled heart.',30,NULL,'Flabébé','83','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-84','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it finds a flower it likes, it dwells on that flower its whole life long. It floats in the wind\'s embrace with an untroubled heart.',40,NULL,'Flabébé','84','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-85','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,'Flabébé','When the flowers of a well-tended flower bed bloom, it appears and celebrates with an elegant dance.',70,NULL,'Floette','85','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-86','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,2,'Floette','In times long past, governors of castles would invite Florges to create flower gardens to embellish the castle domains.',120,NULL,'Florges','86','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-87','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee','When this Pokémon sights its prey, it swirls its ribbonlike feelers as a distraction. A moment later, it pounces.',90,NULL,'Sylveon','87','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm6-88','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses its tail to absorb electricity from power plants or from outlets in houses, and then it fires the electricity from its whiskers.',60,NULL,'Dedenne','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-89','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It inserts its horn into chinks in metal, absorbing metal ions. For some reason, it collects keys.',70,NULL,'Klefki','89','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-9','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'If it has sunshine and water, it doesn\'t need to eat, because it can generate energy from the leaves on its back.',70,NULL,'Skiddo','9','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-90','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Xerneas-GX','90','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-91','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its source of protection is its slimy, germ-laden mucous membrane. Anyone who touches it needs some thorough hand-washing.',40,NULL,'Goomy','91','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-92','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its source of protection is its slimy, germ-laden mucous membrane. Anyone who touches it needs some thorough hand-washing.',50,NULL,'Goomy','92','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-93','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,'Goomy','This Pokémon\'s mucous can dissolve anything. Toothless, it sprays mucous on its prey. Once they\'re nicely dissolved, it slurps them up.',80,NULL,'Sliggoo','93','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-94','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,'Sliggoo','It gets picked on because it\'s meek. But then, whoever teased it gets to feel the full force of its horns and a good swatting from its thick tail.',160,NULL,'Goodra','94','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm6-95','PLANETA Otani',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,NULL,'Ultra Necrozma-GX','95','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm6-96','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is told in mythology that this Pokémon was born before the universe even existed.',160,NULL,'Arceus ◇','96','Rare Prism Star','Pokémon'),('sm6-97','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has ears like shovels. Digging holes strengthens its ears so much that they can sever thick roots effortlessly.',70,NULL,'Bunnelby','97','Common','Pokémon'),('sm6-98','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,3,'Bunnelby','As powerful as an excavator, its ears can reduce dense bedrock to rubble. When it\'s finished digging, it lounges lazily.',130,NULL,'Diggersby','98','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm6-99','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Historically, in the Kalos region, these Pokémon were the designated guardians of the king.',90,NULL,'Furfrou','99','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-1','Masako Yamashita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its bud looks like a human face. Because of the bud, it is rumored to be a type of legendary mandrake plant.',60,NULL,'Bellsprout','1','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-10','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Grovyle','It agilely leaps about the jungle and uses the sharp leaves on its arms to strike its prey.',140,NULL,'Sceptile','10','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm7-100','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'One kind of Ultra Beast. Witnesses have seen it burn down a forest by expelling gas from its two arms.',140,NULL,'Celesteela','100','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm7-101','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'One of the Ultra Beast life-forms, it was observed cutting down a gigantic steel tower with one stroke of its blade.',60,NULL,'Kartana','101','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm7-102','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Stakataka-GX','102','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm7-103','Yumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its steel-hard stone head, it headbutts indiscriminately. This is because of the stress it feels at being unable to fly.',60,NULL,'Bagon','103','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-104','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'With its steel-hard stone head, it headbutts indiscriminately. This is because of the stress it feels at being unable to fly.',70,NULL,'Bagon','104','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-105','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,3,'Bagon','They lurk deep within caves—motionless, neither eating nor drinking. Why they don\'t die is not known.',90,NULL,'Shelgon','105','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm7-106','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Shelgon','It flies around on its wings, which have 