n hang from above.',50,NULL,'Treecko','7','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-70','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Cosmoem','It is said to be a female evolution of Cosmog. When its third eye activates, away it flies to another world.',160,NULL,'Lunala','70','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm7-71','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It usually lives underground. It searches for food while boring its way through the ground at 50 miles per hour.',100,NULL,'Onix','71','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-72','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.',70,NULL,'Phanpy','72','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-73','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,3,'Phanpy','The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow.',130,NULL,'Donphan','73','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm7-74','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil.',60,NULL,'Larvitar','74','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-75','Hironobu Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,'Larvitar','Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain.',80,NULL,'Pupitar','75','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm7-76','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper.',70,NULL,'Meditite','76','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-77','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,'Meditite','Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe\'s next move.',90,NULL,'Medicham','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm7-78','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.',60,NULL,'Baltoy','78','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-79','Yumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Baltoy','It is said that it originates from clay dolls made by an ancient civilization.',110,NULL,'Claydol','79','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm7-8','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Small hooks on the bottom of its feet catch on walls and ceilings. That is how it can hang from above.',70,NULL,'Treecko','8','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-80','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world.',120,NULL,'Regirock','80','Rare','Pokémon'),('sm7-81','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'This legendary Pokémon is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling Kyogre.',130,NULL,'Groudon','81','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm7-82','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Sandygast',NULL,210,NULL,'Palossand-GX','82','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm7-83','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Strong impacts can knock it out of its shell. This Pokémon was born from mutated nanoparticles.',90,NULL,'Minior','83','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm7-84','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When the sun goes down, it becomes active. It runs around town on a chase for good food for the boss of its nest—Raticate.',40,NULL,'Alolan Rattata','84','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-85','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Alolan Rattata',NULL,200,NULL,'Alolan Raticate-GX','85','Rare Holo GX','Pokémon'),('sm7-86','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses its claws to poke holes in eggs so it can slurp out the insides. Breeders consider it a scourge and will drive it away or eradicate it.',60,NULL,'Sneasel','86','Common','Pokémon'),('sm7-87','Hironobu Yoshida',NULL,NULL,3,'Pupitar','If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.',170,NULL,'Tyranitar','87','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm7-88','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is feared. When its gemstone eyes begin to glow with a sinister shine, it\'s believed that Sableye will steal people\'s spirits away.',70,NULL,'Sableye','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sm7-89','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,4,'Onix','It chews its way through boulders with its sturdy jaws. Its eyes can see in the darkness underground.',190,NULL,'Steelix','89','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('sm7-9','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'T