ould be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant.',60,'G','Mankey','107','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-108','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,1,'Mankey','Some researchers theorize that Primeape remains angry even when inside a Poké Ball.',90,'G','Primeape','108','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-109','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Primeape','It imbues its fists with the power of the rage that it kept hidden in its heart. Opponents struck by these imbued fists will be shattered to their core.',140,'G','Annihilape','109','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-11','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Until recently, people living in the mountains would ride on the back of these Pokémon to traverse the mountain paths.',60,'G','Skiddo','11','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-110','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It never skips its daily yoga training. It heightens its inner strength through meditation.',60,'G','Meditite','110','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-111','Jerky',NULL,NULL,1,'Meditite','Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe\'s next move.',90,'G','Medicham','111','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-112','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night.',70,'G','Riolu','112','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-113','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night.',70,'G','Riolu','113','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-114','Nurikabe',NULL,NULL,2,'Riolu','It\'s said that no foe can remain invisible to Lucario, since it can detect auras—even those of foes it could not otherwise see.',130,'G','Lucario','114','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-115','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It submerges itself in sand and moves as if swimming. This wise behavior keeps its enemies from finding it and maintains its temperature.',70,'G','Sandile','115','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-116','kantaro',NULL,NULL,2,'Sandile','Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals.',100,'G','Krokorok','116','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-117','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,3,'Krokorok','After clamping down with its powerful jaws, it twists its body around to rip its prey in half.',170,'G','Krookodile','117','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-118','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its elegant finishing moves—performed by nimbly leaping around using its wings—are polished in the forest where it was born and raised.',70,'G','Hawlucha','118','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-119','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Silicobra\'s neck pouch, which can inflate and deflate like a balloon, gets more elastic each time Silicobra sheds its skin.',80,'G','Silicobra','119','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-12','Gemi',NULL,NULL,2,'Skiddo','It can sense the feelings of others by touching them with its horns. This species has assisted people with their work since 5,000 years ago.',130,'G','Gogoat','12','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-120','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,3,'Silicobra','It will expand its body as much as it can and then contract itself, blasting out sand with enough force to wash away a dump truck.',140,'G','Sandaconda','120','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-121','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The elemental composition of the rocks that form its body were found to match the bedrock of a land far away from this Pokémon\'s habitat.',130,'G','Stonjourner','121','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-122','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Klawf hangs upside-down from cliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf can\'t remain in this position for long because its blood rushes to its head.',130,'G','Klawf','122','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-123','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Klawf hangs upside-down from cliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf can\'t remain in this position for long because its blood rushes to its head.',250,'G','Great Tusk ex','123','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-124','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This seems to be the Winged King mentioned in an old expedition journal. 