,1,'Pawniard','This Pokémon commands a group of several Pawniard. Groups that are defeated in territorial disputes are absorbed by the winning side.',120,'G','Bisharp','133','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-134','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Bisharp','Only a Bisharp that stands above all others in its vast army can evolve into Kingambit.',170,'G','Kingambit','134','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-135','kantaro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its well-developed jaw and fangs are strong enough to crunch through boulders, and its thick fat makes for an excellent defense.',70,'G','Maschiff','135','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-136','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Its well-developed jaw and fangs are strong enough to crunch through boulders, and its thick fat makes for an excellent defense.',80,'G','Maschiff','136','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-137','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,3,'Maschiff','Mabosstiff loves playing with children. Though usually gentle, it takes on an intimidating look when protecting its family.',130,'G','Mabosstiff','137','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-138','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Bombirdier uses the apron on its chest to bundle up food, which it carries back to its nest. It enjoys dropping things that make loud noises.',110,'G','Bombirdier','138','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-139','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,3,'Pineco','Its entire body is shielded by a steel-hard shell. What lurks inside this shell is a total mystery.',120,'G','Forretress','139','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-14','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Sprigatito','Floragato deftly wields the vine hidden beneath its long fur, slamming the hard flower bud against its opponents.',90,'G','Floragato','14','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-140','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.',60,'G','Varoom','140','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-141','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.',80,'G','Varoom','141','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-142','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Varoom','It creates a gas out of poison and minerals from rocks. It then detonates the gas in its cylinders— now numbering eight—to generate energy.',140,'G','Revavroom','142','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-143','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It creates a gas out of poison and minerals from rocks. It then detonates the gas in its cylinders— now numbering eight—to generate energy.',220,'G','Iron Treads ex','143','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-144','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away.',110,'G','Chansey','144','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-145','chibi',NULL,NULL,2,'Chansey','The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.',150,'G','Blissey','145','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-146','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.',90,'G','Zangoose','146','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-147','aoki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s Seviper\'s archrival. To threaten those it encounters, it fans out the claws on its front paws.',110,'G','Zangoose','147','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-148','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying.',60,'G','Starly','148','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-149','kantaro',NULL,NULL,1,'Starly','Recognizing their own weakness, they always live in a group. When alone, a Staravia cries noisily.',80,'G','Staravia','149','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-15','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Floragato','This Pokémon uses the reflective fur lining its cape to camouflage the stem of its flower, creating the illusion that the flower is floating.',160,'G','Meowscarada','15','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-150','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Staravia','When Staravia evolve into Staraptor, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings.',150,'G','Staraptor','150','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-151','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'No matter how much it stuffs its belly with food, it is always anxious about getting hungry again. So, it stashes berries in its cheeks and tail.',60,'G','Skwovet','151','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-152','kantaro',NULL,NULL,2,'Skwovet','This Pokémon makes off with heaps of fallen berries by wrapping them in its tail, which is roughly twice the length of its body.',120,'G','Greedent','152','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-153','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In search of happy feelings—such as joy and gratitude—Indeedee bustles around, taking diligent care of people and other Pokémon.',90,'G','Indeedee','153','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-154','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesn\'t use it for anything other than foraging.',60,'G','Lechonk','154','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-155','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesn\'t use it for anything other than foraging.',60,'G','Lechonk','155','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-156','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesn\'t use it for anything other than foraging.',70,'G','Lechonk','156','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-157','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Lechonk','Oinkologne is proud of its fine, glossy skin. It emits a concentrated scent from the tip of its tail.',120,'G','Oinkologne','157','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-158','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,'Lechonk','Oinkologne is proud of its fine, glossy skin. It emits a concentrated scent from the tip of its tail.',260,'G','Oinkologne ex','158','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-159','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The pair sticks together no matter what. They split any food they find exactly in half and then eat it together.',30,'G','Tandemaus','159','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-16','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The ball of threads wrapped around its body is elastic enough to deflect the scythes of Scyther, this Pokémon\'s natural enemy.',40,'G','Tarountula','16','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-160','yuu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The pair sticks together no matter what. They split any food they find exactly in half and then eat it together.',40,'G','Tandemaus','160','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-161','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,'Tandemaus','The larger pair protects the little ones during battles. When facing strong opponents, the whole group will join the fight.',70,'G','Maushold','161','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-162','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Green-feathered flocks hold the most sway. When they\'re out searching for food in the mornings and evenings, it gets very noisy.',70,'G','Squawkabilly','162','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-163','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Apparently Cyclizar has been allowing people to ride on its back since ancient times. Depictions of this have been found in 10,000-year-old murals.',110,'G','Cyclizar','163','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-164','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It can sprint at over 70 mph while carrying a human. The rider\'s body heat warms Cyclizar\'s back and lifts the Pokémon\'s spirit.',110,'G','Cyclizar','164','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-165','kantaro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thanks to a behavior of theirs known as \"synchronizing,\" an entire flock of these Pokémon can attack simultaneously in perfect harmony.',110,'G','Flamigo','165','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv1-166','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Thanks to a behavior of theirs known as \"synchronizing,\" an entire flock of these Pokémon can attack simultaneously in perfect harmony.',NULL,'G','Arven','166','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv1-167','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Beach Court','167','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv1-168','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Crushing Hammer','1