','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-207','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'This Pokémon is a glutton, but it\'s bad at getting food. It teams up with a Tatsugiri to catch prey.',160,'G','Dondozo','207','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-208','zig',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.',70,'G','Pachirisu','208','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-209','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pawmo','Pawmot\'s fluffy fur acts as a battery. It can store the same amount of electricity as an electric car.',130,'G','Pawmot','209','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-21','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It protects itself from enemies by emitting oil from the fruit on its head. This oil is bitter and astringent enough to make someone flinch.',60,'G','Smoliv','21','Common','Pokémon'),('sv1-210','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it twitches its nose, it can tell where someone is sleeping and what that person is dreaming about.',70,'G','Drowzee','210','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-211','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The horns on its head provide a strong power that enables it to sense people\'s emotions.',70,'G','Ralts','211','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-212','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,1,'Ralts','It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.',90,'G','Kirlia','212','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-213','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon is smooth and moist to the touch. Yeast in Fidough\'s breath induces fermentation in the Pokémon\'s vicinity.',60,'G','Fidough','213','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-214','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This friendly Pokémon doesn\'t like being alone. Pay it even the slightest bit of attention, and it will follow you forever.',70,'G','Greavard','214','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv1-215','Nelnal',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all