ies. It flies around easily, even while carrying prey that weighs more than 220 lbs.',150,'G','Talonflame','30','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-31','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When Litleo are young, female Pyroar will teach them how to hunt. Once the Litleo mature, they will leave the pride and set out on their own.',70,'G','Litleo','31','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-32','Uta',NULL,NULL,2,'Litleo','The females of a pride work together to bring down prey. It\'s thanks to them that their pride doesn\'t starve.',120,'G','Pyroar','32','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-33','Haru Akasaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is incredibly popular, possibly because its passionate dancing is a great match with the temperament of Paldean people.',90,'G','Oricorio','33','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-34','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It lies on warm rocks and uses the heat absorbed by its square-shaped scales to create fire energy.',80,'G','Fuecoco','34','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-35','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It lies on warm rocks and uses the heat absorbed by its square-shaped scales to create fire energy.',90,'G','Fuecoco','35','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-36','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,3,'Fuecoco','The combination of Crocalor\'s fire energy and overflowing vitality has caused an egg-shaped fireball to appear on the Pokémon\'s head.',110,'G','Crocalor','36','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-37','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Crocalor',NULL,340,'G','Skeledirge ex','37','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-38','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Burnt charcoal came to life and became a Pokémon. Possessing a fiery fighting spirit, Charcadet will battle even tough opponents.',60,'G','Charcadet','38','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-39','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Burnt charcoal came to life and became a Pokémon. Possessing a fiery fighting spirit, Charcadet will battle even tough opponents.',80,'G','Charcadet','39','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-4','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It likes to make its shell thicker by adding layers of tree bark. The additional weight doesn\'t bother it.',70,'G','Pineco','4','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-40','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'G','Chi-Yu ex','40','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-41','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It swims by jetting water from its horns. The most notable characteristic of the Aqua Breed is its high body fat, which allows it to float easily.',130,'G','Paldean Tauros','41','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-42','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'An underpowered, pathetic Pokémon. It may jump high on rare occasions but never more than seven feet.',30,'G','Magikarp','42','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-43','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,4,'Magikarp','Once it appears, it goes on a rampage. It remains enraged until it demolishes everything around it.',180,'G','Gyarados','43','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-44','saino misaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The fur on its body naturally repels water. It can stay dry even when it plays in the water.',70,'G','Marill','44','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-45','En Morikura',NULL,NULL,1,'Marill','Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are.',120,'G','Azumarill','45','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-46','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It carries food all day long. There are tales about lost people who were saved by the food it had.',90,'G','Delibird','46','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-47','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a Luvdisc to someone you love.',70,'G','Luvdisc','47','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-48','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'On hot days, these Pokémon press their ice cube heads together and pass the time cooling each other down.',110,'G','Eiscue','48','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-49','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon migrated to Paldea from distant lands long ago. The gel secreted by its feathers repels water and grime.',60,'G','Quaxly','49','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-5','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Pineco',NULL,270,'G','Forretress ex','5','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-50','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon migrated to Paldea from distant lands long ago. The gel secreted by its feathers repels water and grime.',70,'G','Quaxly','50','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-51','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,'Quaxly','These Pokémon constantly run through shallow waters to train their legs, then compete with each other to see which of them kicks most gracefully.',90,'G','Quaxwell','51','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-52','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Quaxwell',NULL,320,'G','Quaquaval ex','52','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-53','Sekio',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This species left the ocean and began living on land a very long time ago. It seems to be closely related to Wailmer.',90,'G','Cetoddle','53','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-54','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This species left the ocean and began living on land a very long time ago. It seems to be closely related to Wailmer.',100,'G','Cetoddle','54','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-55','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,3,'Cetoddle','This Pokémon wanders around snowy, icy areas. It protects its body with powerful muscles and a thick layer of fat under its skin.',180,'G','Cetitan','55','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-56','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When Veluza discards unnecessary flesh, its mind becomes honed and its psychic power increases. The spare flesh has a mild but delicious flavor.',130,'G','Veluza','56','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-57','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and converts the heat into ice energy. The higher the temperature, the more energy Frigibax stores.',60,'G','Frigibax','57','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-58','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and converts the heat into ice energy. The higher the temperature, the more energy Frigibax stores.',70,'G','Frigibax','58','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-59','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Frigibax','Arctibax freezes the air around it, protecting its face with an ice mask and turning its dorsal fin into a blade of ice.',90,'G','Arctibax','59','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-6','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It loves sweet nectar. To keep all the nectar to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.',130,'G','Heracross','6','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-60','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Arctibax','This Pokémon blasts cryogenic air out from its mouth. This air can instantly freeze even liquid-hot lava.',160,'G','Baxcalibur','60','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-61','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'G','Chien-Pao ex','61','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-62','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it is angered, it immediately discharges the energy stored in the pouches in its cheeks.',70,'G','Pikachu','62','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-63','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,190,'G','Pikachu ex','63','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-64','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,'Pikachu','Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked.',140,'G','Raichu','64','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-65','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The electromagnetic waves emitted by the units at the sides of its head expel antigravity, which allows it to float.',50,'G','Magnemite','65','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-66','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It rolls to move. If the ground is uneven, a sudden jolt from hitting a bump can cause it to explode.',70,'G','Voltorb','66','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-67','Scav',NULL,NULL,1,'Voltorb','The more energy it charges up, the faster it gets. But this also makes it more likely to explode.',90,'G','Electrode','67','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-68','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble.',40,'G','Shinx','68','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-69','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble.',70,'G','Shinx','69','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-7','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives in tropical jungles. The bunch of fruit around its neck is delicious. The fruit grows twice a year.',110,'G','Tropius','7','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-70','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,'Shinx','Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.',90,'G','Luxio','70','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-71','aoki',NULL,NULL,1,'Luxio','It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young.',150,'G','Luxray','71','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-72','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon generates electricity when it digests food. It uses its five hard teeth to scrape seaweed off surfaces and eat it.',80,'G','Pincurchin','72','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-73','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This Pokémon generates electricity when it digests food. It uses its five hard teeth to scrape seaweed off surfaces and eat it.',90,'G','Pincurchin','73','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-74','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has underdeveloped electric sacs on its cheeks. These sacs can produce electricity only if Pawmi rubs them furiously with the pads on its forepaws.',50,'G','Pawmi','74','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-75','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,'Pawmi','When its group is attacked, Pawmo is the first to leap into battle, defeating enemies with a fighting technique that utilizes electric shocks.',80,'G','Pawmo','75','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-76','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Pawmo','This Pokémon normally is slow to react, but once it enters battle, it will strike down its enemies with lightning-fast movements.',140,'G','Pawmot','76','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-77','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Tadbulb shakes its tail to generate electricity. If it senses danger, it will make its head blink on and off to alert its allies.',50,'G','Tadbulb','77','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-78','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Tadbulb shakes its tail to generate electricity. If it senses danger, it will make its head blink on and off to alert its allies.',60,'G','Tadbulb','78','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-79','PLANETA Yamashita',NULL,NULL,3,'Tadbulb',NULL,280,'G','Bellibolt ex','79','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-8','Yoriyuki Ikegami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'At night, Combee sleep in a group of about a hundred, packed closely together in a lump.',50,'G','Combee','8','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-80','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When its wings catch the wind, the bones within produce electricity. This Pokémon dives into the ocean, catching prey by electrocuting them.',60,'G','Wattrel','80','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-81','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When its wings catch the wind, the bones within produce electricity. This Pokémon dives into the ocean, catching prey by electrocuting them.',60,'G','Wattrel','81','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-82','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wattrel','Kilowattrel inflates its throat sac to amplify its electricity. By riding the wind, this Pokémon can fly over 430 miles in a day.',120,'G','Kilowattrel','82','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-83','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When its huge eyes waver, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.',70,'G','Jigglypuff','83','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-84','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,2,'Jigglypuff','It has a very fine fur. Take care not to make it angry, or it may inflate steadily and hit with a body slam.',110,'G','Wigglytuff','84','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-85','sowsow',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is incredibly slow and dopey. It takes five seconds for it to feel pain when under attack.',80,'G','Slowpoke','85','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-86','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Slowpoke',NULL,270,'G','Slowking ex','86','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-87','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy.',70,'G','Misdreavus','87','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-88','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Misdreavus','Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power.',90,'G','Mismagius','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-89','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.',60,'G','Spiritomb','89','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-9','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,2,'Combee','It houses its colony in cells in its body and releases various pheromones to make those grubs do its bidding.',120,'G','Vespiquen','9','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-90','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is normally very innocent. When it is staring at something invisible, it is unblinking and utterly silent.',70,'G','Gothita','90','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-91','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,'Gothita','This Pokémon will hypnotize children to put them to sleep before carrying them away. Be wary of nights when the starlight is bright.',90,'G','Gothorita','91','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-92','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,2,'Gothorita','Gothitelle unleashes psychic energy and shows opponents dreams of the universe\'s end. These dreams are apparently ethereal and beautiful.',150,'G','Gothitelle','92','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-93','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,'G','Dedenne ex','93','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-94','Toshinao Aoki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'People used to mistake Oranguru for a human when they saw it issue command after command to the other Pokémon of the forest.',120,'G','Oranguru','94','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-95','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'If it loses its shovel, it will stick something else— like a branch—in its head to make do until it finds another shovel.',90,'G','Sandygast','95','Common','Pokémon'),('sv2-96','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,4,'Sandygast','The terrifying Palossand drags smaller Pokémon into its sandy body. Once its victims are trapped, it drains them of their vitality whenever it pleases.',150,'G','Palossand','96','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv2-97','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon lives in dark places untouched by sunlight. When it appears before humans, it hides itself under a cloth that resembles a Pikachu.',70,'G','Mimikyu','97','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-98','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Charcadet','The fiery blades on its arms burn fiercely with the lingering resentment of a sword wielder who fell before accomplishing their goal.',140,'G','Ceruledge','98','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv2-99','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,'Rellor','The body that supports the ball barely moves. Therefore, it is thought that the true body of this Pokémon is actually inside the ball.',70,'G','Rabsca','99','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-1','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'During the day, it stays in the cold underground to avoid the sun. It grows by bathing in moonlight.',50,'G','Oddish','1','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-10','Nobuhiro Imagawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Foongus','Be wary of the poisonous spores it releases. Mushrooms resembling Amoonguss\'s caps will grow out of anywhere the spores touch.',110,'G','Amoonguss','10','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-100','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is said that a dog Pokémon that died in the wild without ever interacting with a human was reborn as this Pokémon.',80,'G','Greavard','100','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-101','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,3,'Greavard','Houndstone spends most of its time sleeping in graveyards. Among all the dog Pokémon, this one is most loyal to its master.',140,'G','Houndstone','101','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-102','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Greavard',NULL,260,'G','Houndstone ex','102','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-103','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives about one yard underground, where it feeds on plant roots. It sometimes appears aboveground.',50,'G','Diglett','103','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-104','Nelnal',NULL,NULL,1,'Diglett','Its three heads bob separately up and down to loosen the soil nearby, making it easier for it to burrow.',90,'G','Dugtrio','104','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-105','KYUPIYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Born deep underground, this Pokémon becomes a pupa after eating enough dirt to make a mountain.',70,'G','Larvitar','105','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-106','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,'Larvitar','This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body.',80,'G','Pupitar','106','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-107','Nobuhiro Imagawa',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It hunts without twitching a muscle by pulling in its prey with powerful magnetism. But sometimes it pulls natural enemies in close.',90,'G','Nosepass','107','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-108','Scav',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its two whiskers provide a sensitive radar. Even in muddy waters, it can detect its prey\'s location.',70,'G','Barboach','108','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-109','0313',NULL,NULL,3,'Barboach','It is extremely protective of its territory. If any foe approaches, it attacks using vicious tremors.',140,'G','Whiscash','109','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-11','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With a voice like a human child\'s, it cries out to lure adults deep into the forest, getting them lost among the trees.',60,'G','Phantump','11','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-110','Mizue',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying.',30,'G','Bonsly','110','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-111','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s a digger, using its claws to burrow through the ground. It causes damage to vegetable crops, so many farmers have little love for it.',70,'G','Drilbur','111','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-112','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'For some reason, this Pokémon smiles slightly when it emits a strong electric current from the yellow markings on its body.',120,'G','Stunfisk','112','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-113','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,4,'Bunnelby','The fur on its belly retains heat exceptionally well. People used to make heavy winter clothing from fur shed by this Pokémon.',140,'G','Diggersby','113','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-114','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This Pokémon punches trees and eats the berries that drop down, training itself and getting food at the same time.',90,'G','Crabrawler','114','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-115','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,4,'Crabrawler','The detached pincers of these Pokémon are delicious. Some Trainers bring Lechonk into the mountains just to search for them.',160,'G','Crabominable','115','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-116','Jerky',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is very friendly when it\'s young. Its disposition becomes vicious once it matures, but it never forgets the kindness of its master.',60,'G','Rockruff','116','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-117','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','This Pokémon uses its rocky mane to slash any who approach. It will even disobey its Trainer if it dislikes the orders it was given.',130,'G','Lycanroc','117','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-118','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Toedscool lives in muggy forests. The flaps that fall from its body are chewy and very delicious.',60,'G','Toedscool','118','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-119','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Toedscool','These Pokémon gather into groups and form colonies deep within forests. They absolutely hate it when strangers approach.',130,'G','Toedscruel','119','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-12','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Phantump','Small roots that extend from the tips of this Pokémon\'s feet can tie into the trees of the forest and give Trevenant control over them.',140,'G','Trevenant','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-120','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'G','Klawf ex','120','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-121','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It absorbs nutrients from cave walls. The petals it wears are made of crystallized poison.',60,'G','Glimmet','121','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-122','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It absorbs nutrients from cave walls. The petals it wears are made of crystallized poison.',70,'G','Glimmet','122','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-123','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Glimmet',NULL,270,'G','Glimmora ex','123','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-124','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,230,'G','Koraidon ex','124','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-125','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Charmeleon',NULL,330,'G','Charizard ex','125','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-126','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'After losing a territorial struggle, Wooper began living on land. The Pokémon changed over time, developing a poisonous film to protect its body.',60,'G','Paldean Wooper','126','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-127','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'After losing a territorial struggle, Wooper began living on land. The Pokémon changed over time, developing a poisonous film to protect its body.',70,'G','Paldean Wooper','127','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-128','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Paldean Wooper','When attacked, this Pokémon will retaliate by sticking thick spines out from its body. It\'s a risky move that puts everything on the line.',140,'G','Paldean Clodsire','128','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-129','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,'Paldean Wooper','When attacked, this Pokémon will retaliate by sticking thick spines out from its body. It\'s a risky move that puts everything on the line.',140,'G','Paldean Clodsire','129','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-13','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It feels relaxed in tight, dark places and has been known to use its Trainer\'s pocket or bag as a nest.',70,'G','Rowlet','13','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-130','rika',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee','When exposed to the moon\'s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power.',110,'G','Umbreon','130','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-131','Scav',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.',50,'G','Houndour','131','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-132','Kurata So',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.',70,'G','Houndour','132','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-133','Haru Akasaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Houndour','If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away.',130,'G','Houndoom','133','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-134','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Houndour',NULL,270,'G','Houndoom ex','134','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-135','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'G','Absol ex','135','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-136','Bun Toujo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.',130,'G','Darkrai','136','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-137','Kedamahadaitai Yawarakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'By exposing foes to the blinking of its luminescent spots, Inkay demoralizes them, and then it seizes the chance to flee.',60,'G','Inkay','137','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-138','Nelnal',NULL,NULL,2,'Inkay','It\'s said that Malamar\'s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events.',120,'G','Malamar','138','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-139','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It taunts its prey and lures them into narrow, rocky areas where it then sprays them with toxic gas to make them dizzy and take them down.',70,'G','Salandit','139','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-14','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Rowlet','Supremely sensitive to the presence of others, it can detect opponents standing behind it, flinging its sharp feathers to take them out.',90,'G','Dartrix','14','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-140','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,'Salandit','Salazzle makes its opponents light-headed with poisonous gas, then captivates them with alluring movements to turn them into loyal servants.',120,'G','Salazzle','140','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-141','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,'Scyther','This Pokémon\'s pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object they get ahold of into bits.',140,'G','Scizor','141','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-142','Takeshi Nakamura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'People fashion swords from Skarmory\'s shed feathers, so this Pokémon is a popular element in heraldic designs.',120,'G','Skarmory','142','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-143','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It chomps with its gaping mouth. Its huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed.',90,'G','Mawile','143','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-144','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Ancient people believed that the pattern on Bronzor\'s back contained a mysterious power.',70,'G','Bronzor','144','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-145','Nobuhiro Imagawa',NULL,NULL,3,'Bronzor','In ages past, this Pokémon was revered as a bringer of rain. It was found buried in the ground.',140,'G','Bronzong','145','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-146','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,4,'Nosepass','It uses three small units to catch prey and battle enemies. The main body mostly just gives orders.',150,'G','Probopass','146','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-147','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Drilbur','Known as the Drill King, this Pokémon can tunnel through the terrain at speeds of over 90 mph.',120,'G','Excadrill','147','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-148','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Pawniard will fearlessly challenge even powerful foes. In a pinch, it will cling to opponents and pierce them with the blades all over its body.',70,'G','Pawniard','148','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-149','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,'Pawniard','This Pokémon commands a group of several Pawniard. Groups that are defeated in territorial disputes are absorbed by the winning side.',110,'G','Bisharp','149','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-15','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Dartrix',NULL,320,'G','Decidueye ex','15','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-150','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,4,'Bisharp','Only a Bisharp that stands above all others in its vast army can evolve into Kingambit.',180,'G','Kingambit','150','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-151','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it\'s in trouble, it curls up into a ball, makes its fur spikes stand on end, and then discharges electricity indiscriminately.',80,'G','Togedemaru','151','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-152','Nobuhiro Imagawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They live as a group, but when the time comes, one strong Meltan will absorb all the others and evolve.',70,'G','Meltan','152','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-153','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,4,'Meltan',NULL,300,'G','Melmetal ex','153','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-154','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.',60,'G','Varoom','154','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-155','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.',70,'G','Varoom','155','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-156','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,1,'Varoom',NULL,280,'G','Revavroom ex','156','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-157','satoma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sheds many layers of skin as it grows larger. During this process, it is protected by a rapid waterfall.',70,'G','Dratini','157','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-158','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,'Dratini','They say that if it emits an aura from its whole body, the weather will begin to change instantly.',100,'G','Dragonair','158','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-159','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Dragonair',NULL,330,'G','Dragonite ex','159','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-16','Kurata So',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its sweat is sweet, like syrup made from boiled-down fruit. Because of this, Bounsweet was highly valued in the past, when sweeteners were scarce.',60,'G','Bounsweet','16','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-160','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Swablu','If it bonds with a person, it will gently envelop the friend with its soft wings, then hum.',120,'G','Altaria','160','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-161','hatachu',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Drampa is a kind and friendly Pokémon—up until it\'s angered. When that happens, it stirs up a gale and flattens everything around.',120,'G','Drampa','161','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-162','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.',60,'G','Pidgey','162','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-163','Kariya',NULL,NULL,1,'Pidgey','Very protective of its sprawling territorial area, this Pokémon will fiercely peck at any intruder.',90,'G','Pidgeotto','163','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-164','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pidgeotto',NULL,280,'G','Pidgeot ex','164','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-165','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'There are records of a lost human child being raised by a childless Kangaskhan.',130,'G','Kangaskhan','165','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-166','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its ability to evolve into many forms allows it to adapt smoothly and perfectly to any environment.',70,'G','Eevee','166','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-167','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A Pokémon with abundant curiosity. It shows an interest in everything, so it always zigzags.',70,'G','Zigzagoon','167','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-168','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zigzagoon','It uses its explosive speed and razor-sharp claws to bring down prey. Running along winding paths is not its strong suit.',110,'G','Linoone','168','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-169','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.',50,'G','Swablu','169','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-17','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Bounsweet','Steenee spreads a sweet scent that makes others feel invigorated. This same scent is popular for antiperspirants.',90,'G','Steenee','17','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-170','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is far brighter than the average child, and Lillipup won\'t forget the love it receives or any abuse it suffers.',50,'G','Lillipup','170','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-171','Kariya',NULL,NULL,2,'Lillipup','The black fur that covers this Pokémon\'s body is dense and springy. Even sharp fangs bounce right off.',90,'G','Herdier','171','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-172','Keisin',NULL,NULL,3,'Herdier','Stoutland is immensely proud of its impressive moustache. It\'s said that moustache length is what determines social standing among this species.',160,'G','Stoutland','172','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-173','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon has a kind heart. By touching with its feelers, Audino can gauge other creatures\' feelings and physical conditions.',100,'G','Audino','173','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-174','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'These Pokémon live in herds of about 20 individuals. Bouffalant that betray the herd will lose the hair on their heads for some reason.',120,'G','Bouffalant','174','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-175','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s very sensitive to danger. The sound of Corviknight\'s flapping will have Bunnelby digging a hole to hide underground in moments.',70,'G','Bunnelby','175','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-176','saino misaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its stomach fills most of its torso. It wanders the same path every day, searching for fresh food.',70,'G','Yungoos','176','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-177','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Yungoos','Once it finds signs of prey, it will patiently stake out the location, waiting until the sun goes down.',120,'G','Gumshoos','177','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-178','Taiga Kayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores berries in its cheeks. When there are no berries to be found, Skwovet will stuff pebbles into its cheeks to stave off its cravings.',60,'G','Skwovet','178','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-179','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Skwovet',NULL,260,'G','Greedent ex','179','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-18','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Steenee','This Pokémon is proud and aggressive. However, it is said that a Tsareena will instantly become calm if someone touches the crown on its calyx.',160,'G','Tsareena','18','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-180','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesn\'t use it for anything other than foraging.',60,'G','Lechonk','180','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-181','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesn\'t use it for anything other than foraging.',70,'G','Lechonk','181','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-182','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesn\'t use it for anything other than foraging.',70,'G','Lechonk','182','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-183','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,2,'Lechonk','Oinkologne is proud of its fine, glossy skin. It emits a concentrated scent from the tip of its tail.',120,'G','Oinkologne','183','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-184','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Lechonk','This Pokémon sends a flowerlike scent wafting about. Well-developed muscles in its legs allow it to leap more than 16 feet with no trouble at all.',130,'G','Oinkologne','184','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-185','Hiroki Asanuma',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon apparently ties the base of its neck into a knot so that the energy stored in its belly does not escape from its beak.',120,'G','Flamigo','185','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-186','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Arven','186','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv3-187','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Brassius','187','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv3-188','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Geeta','188','Rare','Trainer'),('sv3-189','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Letter of Encouragement','189','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv3-19','Masako Tomii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It protects itself from enemies by emitting oil from the fruit on its head. This oil is bitter and astringent enough to make someone flinch.',50,'G','Smoliv','19','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3-190','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Ortega','190','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv3-191','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL