ual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.',30,'G','Cleffa','202','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-203','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Born deep underground, this Pokémon becomes a pupa after eating enough dirt to make a mountain.',70,'G','Larvitar','203','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-204','KYUPIYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.',50,'G','Houndour','204','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-205','Oku',NULL,NULL,2,'Scyther','This Pokémon\'s pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object they get ahold of into bits.',140,'G','Scizor','205','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-206','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.',60,'G','Varoom','206','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-207','Jerky',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.',60,'G','Pidgey','207','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-208','Jerky',NULL,NULL,1,'Pidgey','Very protective of its sprawling territorial area, this Pokémon will fiercely peck at any intruder.',90,'G','Pidgeotto','208','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-209','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesn\'t use it for anything other than foraging.',60,'G','Lechonk','209','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-21','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,'Dolliv','This calm Pokémon is very compassionate. It will share its delicious, nutrient-rich oil with weakened Pokémon.',140,'G','Arboliva','21','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3-210','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'G','Eiscue ex','210','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-211','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Pupitar',NULL,340,'G','Tyranitar ex','211','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3-212','5ban Graphics',NULL,