,1,'Poliwag','This Pokémon\'s sweat is a slimy mucus. When captured, Poliwhirl can slither from its enemies\' grasp and escape.',90,'G','Poliwhirl','176','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-177','Tetsu Kayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Machop','Its formidable body never gets tired. It helps people by doing work such as the moving of heavy goods.',100,'G','Machoke','177','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-178','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Hidden beneath a tangle of vines that grows nonstop even if the vines are torn off, this Pokémon\'s true appearance remains a mystery.',80,'G','Tangela','178','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-179','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s known for its top-notch pantomime skills. It protects itself from all sorts of attacks by emitting auras from its fingers to create walls.',90,'G','Mr. Mime','179','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-18','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pidgeotto','It spreads its gorgeous wings widely to intimidate enemies. It races through the skies at Mach-2 speed.',130,'G','Pidgeot','18','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-180','Yano Keiji',NULL,NULL,2,'Antique Helix Fossil','This Pokémon is a member of an ancient, extinct species. Omanyte paddles through water with its 10 tentacles, looking like it\'s just drifting along.',100,'G','Omanyte','180','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-181','rika',NULL,NULL,2,'Dratini','They say that if it emits an aura from its whole body, the weather will begin to change instantly.',100,'G','Dragonair','181','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-182','PLANETA Yamashita',NULL,NULL,4,'Ivysaur',NULL,340,'G','Venusaur ex','182','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-183','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Charmeleon',NULL,330,'G','Charizard ex','183','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-184','PLANETA Yamashita',NULL,NULL,3,'Wartortle',NULL,330,'G','Blastoise ex','184','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-185','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,'Ekans',NULL,270,'G','Arbok ex','185','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'