 its balance. No matter how friendly you are, it will get angry and bite you if you touch its whiskers.',70,'G','Raticate','20','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-200','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Wartortle',NULL,330,'G','Blastoise ex','200','Special Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-201','Shinya Komatsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Kadabra',NULL,310,'G','Alakazam ex','201','Special Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-202','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'G','Zapdos ex','202','Special Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-203','Cona Nitanda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Erika\'s Invitation','203','Special Illustration Rare','Trainer'),('sv3pt5-204','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Giovanni\'s Charisma','204','Special Illustration Rare','Trainer'),('sv3pt5-205','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,180,'G','Mew ex','205','Hyper Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-206','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Switch','206','Hyper Rare','Trainer'),('sv3pt5-207',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Basic Psychic Energy','207','Hyper Rare','Energy'),('sv3pt5-21','Gemi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Due to its short wings, it can\'t fly long distances. It wanders about restlessly and pecks at bug Pokémon.',50,'G','Spearow','21','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-22','Gemi',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Spearow','Carrying food through Fearow\'s territory is dangerous. It will snatch the food away from you in a flash!',90,'G','Fearow','22','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-23','Kedamahadaitai Yawarakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The eggs of bird Pokémon are its favorite food. It swallows eggs whole, so sometimes an egg gets stuck, and Ekans faints.',70,'G','Ekans','23','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-24','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,'Ekans',NULL,270,'G','Arbok ex','24','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-25','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it is angered, it immediately discharges the energy stored in the pouches in its cheeks.',60,'G','Pikachu','25','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-26','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,'Pikachu','Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked.',120,'G','Raichu','26','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-27','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It burrows into the ground to create its nest. If hard stones impede its tunneling, it uses its sharp claws to shatter them and then carries on digging.',60,'G','Sandshrew','27','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-28','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Sandshrew','It climbs trees by hooking on with its sharp claws. Sandslash shares the berries it gathers, dropping them down to Sandshrew waiting below the tree.',120,'G','Sandslash','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-29','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses its hard incisor teeth to crush and eat berries. The tip of a female Nidoran\'s horn is a bit more rounded than the tip of a male\'s horn.',60,'G','Nidoran ♀','29','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-3','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Ivysaur',NULL,340,'G','Venusaur ex','3','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-30','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,2,'Nidoran ♀','If the group is threatened, these Pokémon will band together to assault enemies with a chorus of ultrasonic waves.',90,'G','Nidorina','30','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-31','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,3,'Nidorina','It pacifies offspring by placing them in the gaps between the spines on its back. The spines will never secrete poison while young are present.',170,'G','Nidoqueen','31','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-32','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Small but brave, this Pokémon will hold its ground and even risk its life in battle to protect the female it\'s friendly with.',60,'G','Nidoran ♂','32','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-33','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,2,'Nidoran ♂','It\'s nervous and quick to act aggressively. The potency of its poison increases along with the level of adrenaline present in its body.',90,'G','Nidorino','33','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-34','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,3,'Nidorino','Nidoking prides itself on its strength. It\'s forceful and spirited in battle, making use of its thick tail and diamond-crushing horn.',170,'G','Nidoking','34','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-35','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its adorable behavior and cry make it highly popular. However, this cute Pokémon is rarely found.',60,'G','Clefairy','35','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-36','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,2,'Clefairy','Their ears are sensitive enough to hear a pin drop from over a mile away, so they\'re usually found in quiet places.',100,'G','Clefable','36','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-37','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As each tail grows, its fur becomes more lustrous. When held, it feels slightly warm.',70,'G','Vulpix','37','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-38','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Vulpix',NULL,260,'G','Ninetales ex','38','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-39','saino misaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When its huge eyes waver, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.',70,'G','Jigglypuff','39','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-4','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'From the time it is born, a flame burns at the tip of its tail. Its life would end if the flame were to go out.',70,'G','Charmander','4','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-40','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,3,'Jigglypuff',NULL,250,'G','Wigglytuff ex','40','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-41','Scav',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Zubat live in caves, down where the sun\'s light won\'t reach. In the morning, they gather together to keep each other warm as they sleep.',40,'G','Zubat','41','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-42','Scav',NULL,NULL,1,'Zubat','Its feet are tiny, but this Pokémon walks skillfully. It sneaks up on sleeping prey before sinking in its fangs and slurping up blood.',80,'G','Golbat','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-43','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'During the day, it stays in the cold underground to avoid the sun. It grows by bathing in moonlight.',60,'G','Oddish','43','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-44','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,'Oddish','What appears to be drool is actually sweet honey. It is very sticky and clings stubbornly if touched.',70,'G','Gloom','44','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-45','Sekio',NULL,NULL,2,'Gloom','The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up.',140,'G','Vileplume','45','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-46','Yoriyuki Ikegami',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The mushrooms, known as tochukaso, are controlling the bug. Even if the bug bugs the mushrooms, they tell it to bug off.',70,'G','Paras','46','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-47','Yoriyuki Ikegami',NULL,NULL,2,'Paras','The bug is mostly dead, with the mushroom on its back having become the main body. If the mushroom comes off, the bug stops moving.',120,'G','Parasect','47','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-48','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Poison oozes from all over its body. It catches small bug Pokémon at night that are attracted by light.',70,'G','Venonat','48','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-49','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Venonat','The wings are covered with dustlike scales. Every time it flaps its wings, it looses highly toxic dust.',90,'G','Venomoth','49','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-5','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,'Charmander','If it becomes agitated during battle, it spouts intense flames, incinerating its surroundings.',100,'G','Charmeleon','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-50','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives about one yard underground, where it feeds on plant roots. It sometimes appears aboveground.',50,'G','Diglett','50','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-51','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,'Diglett','Its three heads bob separately up and down to loosen the soil nearby, making it easier for it to burrow.',90,'G','Dugtrio','51','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-52','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'All it does is sleep during the daytime. At night, it patrols its territory with its eyes aglow.',70,'G','Meowth','52','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-53','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,'Meowth','Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness.',110,'G','Persian','53','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-54','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is constantly wracked by a headache. When the headache turns intense, it begins using mysterious powers.',70,'G','Psyduck','54','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-55','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Psyduck','When it swims at full speed using its long, webbed limbs, its forehead somehow begins to glow.',110,'G','Golduck','55','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-56','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness.',60,'G','Mankey','56','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-57','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,'Mankey','It becomes wildly furious if it even senses someone looking at it. It chases anyone that meets its glare.',120,'G','Primeape','57','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-58','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has a brave and trustworthy nature. It fearlessly stands up to bigger and stronger foes.',80,'G','Growlithe','58','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-59','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,4,'Growlithe','An ancient picture scroll shows that people were captivated by its movement as it ran through prairies.',150,'G','Arcanine','59','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-6','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Charmeleon',NULL,330,'G','Charizard ex','6','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-60','Kurata So',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In rivers with fast-flowing water, this Pokémon will cling to a rock by using its thick lips, which act like a suction cup.',60,'G','Poliwag','60','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-61','Kurata So',NULL,NULL,1,'Poliwag','This Pokémon\'s sweat is a slimy mucus. When captured, Poliwhirl can slither from its enemies\' grasp and escape.',90,'G','Poliwhirl','61','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-62','Kurata So',NULL,NULL,2,'Poliwhirl','Poliwrath is skilled at both swimming and martial arts. It uses its well-trained arms to dish out powerful punches.',160,'G','Poliwrath','62','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-63','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Abra can teleport in its sleep. Apparently the more deeply Abra sleeps, the farther its teleportations go.',50,'G','Abra','63','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-64','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Abra','This Pokémon\'s telekinesis is immensely powerful. To prepare for evolution, Kadabra stores up psychic energy in the star on its forehead.',80,'G','Kadabra','64','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-65','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Kadabra',NULL,310,'G','Alakazam ex','65','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-66','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Always brimming with power, it passes time by lifting boulders. Doing so makes it even stronger.',70,'G','Machop','66','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-67','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Machop','Its formidable body never gets tired. It helps people by doing work such as the moving of heavy goods.',100,'G','Machoke','67','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-68','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Machoke','With four arms that react more quickly than it can think, it can execute many punches at once.',180,'G','Machamp','68','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-69','Jerky',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its bud looks like a human face. Because of the bud, it is rumored to be a type of legendary mandrake plant.',60,'G','Bellsprout','69','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-7','kantaro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it feels threatened, it draws its limbs inside its shell and sprays water from its mouth.',60,'G','Squirtle','7','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-70','Jerky',NULL,NULL,2,'Bellsprout','It spits out Poison Powder to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of Acid.',90,'G','Weepinbell','70','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-71','Jerky',NULL,NULL,3,'Weepinbell','Once ingested into this Pokémon\'s body, even the hardest object will melt into nothing.',150,'G','Victreebel','71','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-72','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is mostly made of water. A Tentacool out in the ocean is very hard to spot, because its body blends in with the sea.',60,'G','Tentacool','72','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-73','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,'Tentacool','Its 80 tentacles can stretch and shrink freely. Tentacruel ensnares prey in a net of spread-out tentacles, delivering venomous stings to its catch.',120,'G','Tentacruel','73','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-74','Uta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It uses both hands to climb precipitous cliffs. People who see it in action have been known to take up bouldering.',80,'G','Geodude','74','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-75','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,'Geodude','It travels by rolling down cliffs. If it falls into a river, it will explode with its last gasp.',110,'G','Graveler','75','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-76','Uta',NULL,NULL,4,'Graveler',NULL,330,'G','Golem ex','76','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-77','Nurikabe',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If you\'ve been accepted by Ponyta, its burning mane is mysteriously no longer hot to the touch.',70,'G','Ponyta','77','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-78','Nurikabe',NULL,NULL,1,'Ponyta','The fastest runner becomes the leader, and it decides the herd\'s pace and direction of travel.',100,'G','Rapidash','78','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-79','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is incredibly slow and dopey. It takes five seconds for it to feel pain when under attack.',80,'G','Slowpoke','79','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-8','kantaro',NULL,NULL,2,'Squirtle','It cleverly controls its furry ears and tail to maintain its balance while swimming.',100,'G','Wartortle','8','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-80','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,2,'Slowpoke','When a Slowpoke went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a Shellder. That made it evolve into Slowbro.',130,'G','Slowbro','80','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-81','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The electromagnetic waves emitted by the units at the sides of its head expel antigravity, which allows it to float.',60,'G','Magnemite','81','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-82','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,'Magnemite','Three Magnemite are linked by a strong magnetic force. Earaches will occur if you get too close.',90,'G','Magneton','82','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-83','KG-2000',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They use a plant stalk as a weapon, but not all of them use it in the same way. Several distinct styles of stalk fighting have been observed.',90,'G','Farfetch\'d','83','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-84','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.',70,'G','Doduo','84','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-85','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,'Doduo','An odd species that is rarely found. The three heads respectively represent joy, sadness, and anger.',100,'G','Dodrio','85','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-86','aoki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Thanks to its thick fat, cold seas don\'t bother it at all, but it gets tired pretty easily in warm waters.',80,'G','Seel','86','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-87','aoki',NULL,NULL,2,'Seel','It sunbathes on the beach after meals. The rise in its body temperature helps its digestion.',130,'G','Dewgong','87','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-88','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies.',80,'G','Grimer','88','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-89','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,4,'Grimer','It\'s thickly covered with a filthy, vile sludge. It is so toxic, even its footprints contain poison.',150,'G','Muk','89','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-9','PLANETA Yamashita',NULL,NULL,3,'Wartortle',NULL,330,'G','Blastoise ex','9','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-90','Nelnal',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is encased in a shell that is harder than diamond. Inside, however, it is surprisingly tender.',70,'G','Shellder','90','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-91','Nelnal',NULL,NULL,3,'Shellder','Cloyster that live in seas with harsh tidal currents grow large, sharp spikes on their shells.',130,'G','Cloyster','91','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-92','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It wraps its opponent in its gas-like body, slowly weakening its prey by poisoning it through the skin.',50,'G','Gastly','92','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-93','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Gastly','It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.',80,'G','Haunter','93','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-94','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Haunter','To steal the life of its target, it slips into the prey\'s shadow and silently waits for an opportunity.',130,'G','Gengar','94','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-95','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.',120,'G','Onix','95','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-96','Mousho',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It remembers every dream it eats. It rarely eats the dreams of adults because children\'s are much tastier.',80,'G','Drowzee','96','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-97','Mousho',NULL,NULL,2,'Drowzee','When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of psi moves, such as Hypnosis and Confusion.',110,'G','Hypno','97','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-98','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it senses danger approaching, it cloaks itself with bubbles from its mouth so it will look bigger.',70,'G','Krabby','98','Common','Pokémon'),('sv3pt5-99','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,3,'Krabby','Its oversized claw is very powerful, but when it\'s not in battle, the claw just gets in the way.',140,'G','Kingler','99','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-1','Yoriyuki Ikegami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It secretes a thick, sweet-scented syrup from the tip of its head. It lives on weed-choked ponds.',50,'G','Surskit','1','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-10','OKUBO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Often found in gardens, this Pokémon has hairs on its body that it uses to assess its surroundings.',50,'G','Blipbug','10','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-100','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel',NULL,260,'G','Toxtricity ex','100','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-101','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It was born in a layer of rock salt deep under the earth. This species was particularly treasured in the old days, as they would share precious salt.',60,'G','Nacli','101','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-102','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It was born in a layer of rock salt deep under the earth. This species was particularly treasured in the old days, as they would share precious salt.',70,'G','Nacli','102','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-103','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,3,'Nacli','This Pokémon dry cures its prey by spraying salt over them. The curing process steals away the water in the prey\'s body.',100,'G','Naclstack','103','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-104','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,4,'Naclstack','Garganacl will rub its fingertips together and sprinkle injured Pokémon with salt. Even severe wounds will promptly heal afterward.',160,'G','Garganacl','104','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-105','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Klawf hangs upside-down from cliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf can\'t remain in this position for long because its blood rushes to its head.',120,'G','Klawf','105','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-106','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon apparently ties the base of its neck into a knot so that energy stored in its belly does not escape from its beak.',110,'G','Flamigo','106','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-107','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This mysterious Pokémon has some similarities to a creature that an old book introduced as Slither Wing.',140,'G','Slither Wing','107','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-108','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'G','Sandy Shocks ex','108','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-109','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'The fear poured into an ancient ritual vessel has clad itself in rocks and dirt to become a Pokémon.',140,'G','Ting-Lu','109','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-11','Haru Akasaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Blipbug','As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.',80,'G','Dottler','11','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-110','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Zubat live in caves, down where the sun\'s light won\'t reach. In the morning, they gather together to keep each other warm as they sleep.',50,'G','Zubat','110','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-111','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Zubat','Its feet are tiny, but this Pokémon walks skillfully. It sneaks up on sleeping prey before sinking in its fangs and slurping up blood.',80,'G','Golbat','111','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-112','Uta',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Golbat','This Pokémon flaps its four wings skillfully. Crobat can fly through cramped caves without needing to slow down.',130,'G','Crobat','112','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-113','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because of this Pokémon\'s ability to detect danger, people mistook Absol as a bringer of doom.',100,'G','Absol','113','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-114','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Opponents that get drawn in by its adorable behavior come away with stinging scratches from its claws and stinging pride from its laughter.',60,'G','Purrloin','114','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-115','Yoshioka',NULL,NULL,1,'Purrloin','This stealthy Pokémon sneaks up behind prey without making any sound at all. It competes with Thievul for territory.',100,'G','Liepard','115','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-116','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room.',70,'G','Trubbish','116','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-117','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,3,'Trubbish','The toxic liquid it launches from its right arm is so virulent that it can kill a weakened creature instantly.',120,'G','Garbodor','117','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-118','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.',130,'G','Yveltal','118','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-119','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Cunning and cautious, this Pokémon survives by stealing food from others. It erases its tracks with swipes of its tail as it makes off with its plunder.',70,'G','Nickit','119','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-12','Oku',NULL,NULL,1,'Dottler','It emits psychic energy to observe and study what\'s around it—and what\'s around it can include things over six miles away.',130,'G','Orbeetle','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-120','SIE NANAHARA',NULL,NULL,1,'Nickit','With a lithe body and sharp claws, it goes around stealing food and eggs. Boltund is its natural enemy.',110,'G','Thievul','120','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-121','Cona Nitanda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Hunger hormones affect its temperament. Until its hunger is appeased, it gets up to all manner of evil deeds.',70,'G','Morpeko','121','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-122','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,'Nymble','When it decides to fight all out, it stands on its previously folded legs to enter Showdown Mode. It neutralizes its enemies in short order.',120,'G','Lokix','122','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-123','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is possible that the creature listed as Brute Bonnet in a certain book could actually be this Pokémon.',120,'G','Brute Bonnet','123','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-124','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,230,'G','Roaring Moon ex','124','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-125','Po-Suzuki',NULL,NULL,4,'Onix','It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.',180,'G','Steelix','125','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-126','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.',70,'G','Jirachi','126','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-127','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Mossy caves are their preferred dwellings. Enzymes contained in mosses help Ferroseed\'s spikes grow big and strong.',70,'G','Ferroseed','127','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-128','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,3,'Ferroseed','Its spikes are harder than steel. This Pokémon crawls across rock walls by stabbing the spikes on its feelers into the stone.',140,'G','Ferrothorn','128','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-129','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With their large mandibles, these Pokémon can crunch their way through rock. They work together to protect their eggs from Sandaconda.',70,'G','Durant','129','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-13','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It has its third set of legs folded up. When it\'s in a tough spot, this Pokémon jumps over 30 feet using the strength of its legs.',40,'G','Nymble','13','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-130','aoki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The blue eye on the sword\'s handguard is the true body of Honedge. With its old cloth, it drains people\'s lives away.',60,'G','Honedge','130','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-131','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The blue eye on the sword\'s handguard is the true body of Honedge. With its old cloth, it drains people\'s lives away.',60,'G','Honedge','131','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-132','Bun Toujo',NULL,NULL,2,'Honedge','The two swords employ a strategy of rapidly alternating between offense and defense to bring down their prey.',90,'G','Doublade','132','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-133','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,'Honedge','The two swords employ a strategy of rapidly alternating between offense and defense to bring down their prey.',90,'G','Doublade','133','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-134','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,3,'Doublade','Its potent spectral powers allow it to manipulate others. It once used its powers to force people and Pokémon to build a kingdom to its liking.',150,'G','Aegislash','134','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-135','toriyufu',NULL,NULL,3,'Doublade',NULL,330,'G','Aegislash ex','135','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-136','Tonji Matsuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Able to cut down anything with a single strike, it became known as the Fairy King\'s Sword, and it inspired awe in friend and foe alike.',120,'G','Zacian','136','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-137','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Crocalor',NULL,330,'G','Skeledirge ex','137','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-138','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When attacked, this Pokémon will wield the tendrils on its body like fists and pelt the opponent with a storm of punches.',140,'G','Orthworm','138','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-139','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,2,'Gimmighoul',NULL,260,'G','Gholdengo ex','139','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-14','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has its third set of legs folded up. When it\'s in a tough spot, this Pokémon jumps over 30 feet using the strength of its legs.',50,'G','Nymble','14','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-140','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,'Swablu',NULL,260,'G','Altaria ex','140','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-141','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Tatsugiri is an extremely cunning Pokémon. It feigns weakness to lure in prey, then orders its partner to attack.',70,'G','Tatsugiri','141','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-142','Taiga Kayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In recent years, this species has been very helpful in cyberspace. These Pokémon will go around checking to make sure no suspicious data exists.',60,'G','Porygon','142','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-143','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Porygon','After artificial intelligence was implemented in Porygon2, the Pokémon began using a strange language that only other Porygon2 understand.',90,'G','Porygon2','143','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-144','hatachu',NULL,NULL,2,'Porygon2','Some say an additional program made this Pokémon evolve, but even academics can\'t agree on whether Porygon-Z is really an evolution.',150,'G','Porygon-Z','144','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-145','aspara',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for prey from the tops of trees. When it spots its favorite food, Bounsweet, Aipom gets excited and pounces.',60,'G','Aipom','145','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-146','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,'Aipom','It uses its tails for everything. If it wraps both of its tails around you and gives you a squeeze, that\'s proof it really likes you.',100,'G','Ambipom','146','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-147','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon needs to be milked every day, or else it will fall ill. The flavor of Miltank milk changes with the seasons.',120,'G','Miltank','147','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-148','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When Whismur cries, the sound of its own voice startles it, making the Pokémon cry even louder. It cries until it\'s exhausted, then it falls asleep.',70,'G','Whismur','148','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-149','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,2,'Whismur','The force of this Pokémon\'s loud voice isn\'t just the sound—it\'s also the wave of air pressure that blows opponents away and damages them.',100,'G','Loudred','149','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-15','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Though it looks like Tentacool, Toedscool is a completely different species. Its legs may be thin, but it can run at a speed of 30 mph.',50,'G','Toedscool','15','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-150','LINNE',NULL,NULL,3,'Loudred','This Pokémon can do more than just shout. To communicate with others of its kind, it\'ll emit all sorts of sounds from the holes in its body.',160,'G','Exploud','150','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-151','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Each Spinda\'s spot pattern is different. With its stumbling movements, it evades opponents\' attacks brilliantly!',80,'G','Spinda','151','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-152','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can\'t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.',50,'G','Swablu','152','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-153','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'The pair sticks together no matter what. They split any food they find exactly in half and then eat it together.',30,'G','Tandemaus','153','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-154','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The pair sticks together no matter what. They split any food they find exactly in half and then eat it together.',40,'G','Tandemaus','154','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-155','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Tandemaus',NULL,230,'G','Maushold ex','155','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-156','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'G','Bombirdier ex','156','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-157','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Apparently Cyclizar has been allowing people to ride on its back since ancient times. Depictions of this have been found in 10,000-year-old murals.',120,'G','Cyclizar','157','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-158','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s possible that Iron Jugulis, an object described in an old book, may actually be this Pokémon.',130,'G','Iron Jugulis','158','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-159','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Ancient Booster Energy Capsule','159','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-16','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Though it looks like Tentacool, Toedscool is a completely different species. Its legs may be thin, but it can run at a speed of 30 mph.',60,'G','Toedscool','16','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-160','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Counter Catcher','160','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-161','AYUMI ODASHIMA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Cursed Duster','161','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-162','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Defiance Vest','162','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-163','AYUMI ODASHIMA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Earthen Vessel','163','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-164','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Future Booster Energy Capsule','164','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-165','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Larry','165','Common','Trainer'),('sv4-166','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Luxurious Cape','166','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-167','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Mela','167','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-168','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Norman','168','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-169','Cona Nitanda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Parasol Lady','169','Common','Trainer'),('sv4-17','Toshinao Aoki',NULL,NULL,2,'Toedscool','It coils its 10 tentacles around prey and sucks out their nutrients, causing the prey pain. The folds along the rim of its head are a popular delicacy.',120,'G','Toedscruel','17','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-170','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Professor Sada\'s Vitality','170','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-171','hncl',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Professor Turo\'s Scenario','171','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-172','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Rika','172','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-173','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Roark','173','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-174','yuu',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Shauntal','174','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-175','AYUMI ODASHIMA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,120,'G','Snorlax Doll','175','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-176','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Technical Machine: Blindside','176','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-177','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Technical Machine: Devolution','177','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-178','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Technical Machine: Evolution','178','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-179','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Technical Machine: Turbo Energize','179','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-18','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It drains the life-force from vegetation, causing nearby forests to instantly wither and fields to turn barren.',130,'G','Wo-Chien','18','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-180','inose yukie',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Techno Radar','180','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-181','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Tulip','181','Uncommon','Trainer'),('sv4-182',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Medical Energy','182','Uncommon','Energy'),('sv4-183','OKUBO',NULL,NULL,3,'Dwebble','Its thick claws are its greatest weapons. They\'re mighty enough to crack Rhyperior\'s carapace.',130,'G','Crustle','183','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-184','Tetsu Kayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Blipbug','As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.',80,'G','Dottler','184','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-185','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,'Toedscool','It coils its 10 tentacles around prey and sucks out their nutrients, causing the prey pain. The folds along the rim of its head are a popular delicacy.',120,'G','Toedscruel','185','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-186','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'This Pokémon makes its home near volcanoes. At the end of the day, Magby soaks in magma, resting and recovering from the day\'s fatigue.',30,'G','Magby','186','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-187','Takeshi Nakamura',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'No records exist of this species being caught. Data is lacking, but the Pokémon\'s traits match up with an object described in an old book.',130,'G','Iron Moth','187','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-188','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that several Snorunt gather under giant leaves and live together in harmony.',60,'G','Snorunt','188','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-189','rika',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It swims along with a school of Remoraid, and they\'ll all fight together to repel attackers.',30,'G','Mantyke','189','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-19','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'This Pokémon makes its home near volcanoes. At the end of the day, Magby soaks in magma, resting and recovering from the day\'s fatigue.',30,'G','Magby','19','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-190','Taiga Kayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Vanillite','It blasts enemies with cold air reaching −148 degrees Fahrenheit, freezing them solid. But it spares their lives afterward—it\'s a kind Pokémon.',90,'G','Vanillish','190','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-191','Oku',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Wimpod gather in swarms, constantly on the lookout for danger. They scatter the moment they detect an enemy\'s presence.',70,'G','Wimpod','191','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-192','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When Veluza discards unnecessary flesh, its mind becomes honed and its psychic power increases. The spare flesh has a mild but delicious flavor.',120,'G','Veluza','192','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-193','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises.',70,'G','Plusle','193','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-194','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.',70,'G','Minun','194','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-195','matazo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.',60,'G','Blitzle','195','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-196','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Joltik latch on to other Pokémon and suck out static electricity. They\'re often found sticking to Yamper\'s hindquarters.',40,'G','Joltik','196','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-197','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Flittle','It emits psychic power from the gaps between its multicolored frills and sprints at speeds greater than 120 mph.',120,'G','Espathra','197','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-198','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon was born inside a treasure chest about 1,500 years ago. It sucks the life-force out of scoundrels who try to steal the treasure.',70,'G','Gimmighoul','198','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-199','Nurikabe',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This legendary Pokémon is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling Kyogre.',130,'G','Groudon','199','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-2','kantaro',NULL,NULL,1,'Surskit','The antennae have distinctive patterns that look like eyes. When it rains, they grow heavy, making flight impossible.',100,'G','Masquerain','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-20','LINNE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon lives in caves in volcanoes. The fire within the tuft on its head can reach 600 degrees Fahrenheit.',70,'G','Pansear','20','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-200','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Mienfoo','Delivered at blinding speeds, kicks from this Pokémon can shatter massive boulders into tiny pieces.',100,'G','Mienshao','200','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-201','0313',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This is its form when its shell has fallen off. The color of its core depends on the materials that made up the food it ate.',70,'G','Minior','201','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-202','kodama',NULL,NULL,4,'Naclstack','Garganacl will rub its fingertips together and sprinkle injured Pokémon with salt. Even severe wounds will promptly heal afterward.',160,'G','Garganacl','202','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-203','Takeshi Nakamura',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This mysterious Pokémon has some similarities to a creature that an old book introduced as Slither Wing.',140,'G','Slither Wing','203','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-204','Shinya Komatsu',NULL,NULL,3,'Trubbish','The toxic liquid it launches from its right arm is so virulent that it can kill a weakened creature instantly.',120,'G','Garbodor','204','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-205','Masako Tomii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.',130,'G','Yveltal','205','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-206','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Hunger hormones affect its temperament. Until its hunger is appeased, it gets up to all manner of evil deeds.',70,'G','Morpeko','206','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-207','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is possible that the creature listed as Brute Bonnet in a certain book could actually be this Pokémon.',120,'G','Brute Bonnet','207','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-208','nisimono',NULL,NULL,4,'Onix','It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.',180,'G','Steelix','208','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-209','Kurata So',NULL,NULL,3,'Ferroseed','Its spikes are harder than steel. This Pokémon crawls across rock walls by stabbing the spikes on its feelers into the stone.',140,'G','Ferrothorn','209','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-21','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,'Pansear','When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets.',100,'G','Simisear','21','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('sv4-210','Takumi Wada',NULL,NULL,3,'Doublade','Its potent spectral powers allow it to manipulate others. It once used its powers to force people and Pokémon to build a kingdom to its liking.',150,'G','Aegislash','210','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-211','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for prey from the tops of trees. When it spots its favorite food, Bounsweet, Aipom gets excited and pounces.',60,'G','Aipom','211','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-212','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,2,'Whismur','The force of this Pokémon\'s loud voice isn\'t just the sound—it\'s also the wave of air pressure that blows opponents away and damages them.',100,'G','Loudred','212','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-213','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can\'t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.',50,'G','Swablu','213','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-214','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,2,'Porygon2','Some say an additional program made this Pokémon evolve, but even academics can\'t agree on whether Porygon-Z is really an evolution.',150,'G','Porygon-Z','214','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-215','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Apparently Cyclizar has been allowing people to ride on its back since ancient times. Depictions of this have been found in 10,000-year-old murals.',120,'G','Cyclizar','215','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-216','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s possible that Iron Jugulis, an object described in an old book, may actually be this Pokémon.',130,'G','Iron Jugulis','216','Illustration Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-217','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Snorunt',NULL,250,'G','Froslass ex','217','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-218','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,2,'Charcadet',NULL,260,'G','Armarouge ex','218','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-219','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Gabite',NULL,320,'G','Garchomp ex','219','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-22','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain.',130,'G','Volcanion','22','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-220','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Steenee',NULL,310,'G','Tsareena ex','220','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-221','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,3,'Wimpod',NULL,270,'G','Golisopod ex','221','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-222','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'G','Tapu Koko ex','222','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-223','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,230,'G','Iron Hands ex','223','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-224','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,'Yamask',NULL,260,'G','Cofagrigus ex','224','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-225','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'G','Iron Valiant ex','225','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-226','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'G','Hoopa ex','226','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-227','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel',NULL,260,'G','Toxtricity ex','227','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-228','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'G','Sandy Shocks ex','228','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-229','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,230,'G','Roaring Moon ex','229','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-23','Gemi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It lies on warm rocks and uses the heat absorbed by its square-shaped scales to create fire energy.',80,'G','Fuecoco','23','Common','Pokémon'),('sv4-230','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,3,'Doublade',NULL,330,'G','Aegislash ex','230','Ultra Rare','Pokémon'),('sv4-231','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,2,'Gim