le Rare','Pokémon'),('sv6-24','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This mischief-loving Pokémon is full of curiosity. It battles by drawing out the type-based energy contained within its masks.',110,'H','Teal Mask Ogerpon','24','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv6-25','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'H','Teal Mask Ogerpon ex','25','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv6-26','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As its body grows larger, its six warm tails become more beautiful, with a more luxurious coat of fur.',70,'H','Vulpix','26','Common','Pokémon'),('sv6-27','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,'Vulpix','It has nine long tails and fur that gleams gold. It is said to live for 1,000 years.',120,'H','Ninetales','27','Common','Pokémon'),('sv6-28','Gapao',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It\'s said that in ancient times, when volcanoes were more active, there were many more Slugma than there are now.',80,'H','Slugma','28','Common','Pokémon'),('sv6-29','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Slugma',NULL,270,'H','Magcargo ex','29','Double Rare','Pokémon'),('sv6-3','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'These Pokémon judge one another based on pincers. Thicker, more impressive pincers make for more popularity with the opposite gender.',110,'H','Pinsir','3','Common','Pokémon'),('sv6-30','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Coal is the source of Torkoal\'s energy. Large amounts of coal can be found in the mountains where they live.',130,'H','Torkoal','30','Common','Pokémon'),('sv6-31','Jerky',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its fiery rear end is fueled by gas made in its belly. Even rain can\'t extinguish the fire.',60,'H','Chimchar','31','Common','Pokémon'),('sv6-32','Scav',NULL,NULL,1,'Chimchar','It skillfully controls the intensity of the fire on its tail to keep its foes at an ideal distance.',90,'H','Monferno','32','Common','Pokémon'),('sv6-33','Takumi Wada',NULL,NULL,1,'Monferno','Its crown of fire is indicative of its fiery nature. It is beaten by none in terms of quickness.',140,'H','Infernape','33','Rare','Pokémon'),('sv6-34','osare',NULL,NULL,