',NULL,NULL,2,'Flaaffy',NULL,160,'H','Ampharos','109','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-11','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,'Growlithe','An ancient picture scroll shows that people were captivated by its movement as it ran through prairies.',130,'G','Arcanine','11','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-110','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'H','Darkrai ex','110','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-111','matazo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,70,'H','Pawniard','111','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-112','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Pawniard',NULL,100,'H','Bisharp','112','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-113','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,'Bisharp',NULL,170,'H','Kingambit','113','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-114','Susumu Maeya',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'H','Picnicker','114','Promo','Trainer'),('svp-115','Uninori',NULL,NULL,2,'Grookey','The faster a Thwackey can beat out a rhythm with its two sticks, the more respect it wins from its peers.',100,'H','Thwackey','115','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-116','Kazumasa Yasukuni',NULL,NULL,1,'Monferno','Its crown of fire is indicative of its fiery nature. It is beaten by none in terms of quickness.',140,'H','Infernape','116','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-117','mingo',NULL,NULL,1,'Snorunt','It freezes prey by blowing its −58 degree Fahrenheit breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey.',90,'H','Froslass','117','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-118','Shimaris Yukichi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Tatsugiri is an extremely cunning Pokémon. It feigns weakness to lure in prey, then orders its partner to attack.',70,'H','Tatsugiri','118','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-119','Natsumi Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has no problem drinking dirty water. An organ inside Toxel\'s body filters such water into a poisonous liquid that is harmless to Toxel.',70,'G','Toxel','119','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-12','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'This Pokémon is a glutton, but it\'s bad at getting food. It teams up with a Tatsugiri to catch prey.',150,'G','Dondozo','12','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-120','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,'Larvitar','This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body.',80,'G','Pupitar','120','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-121','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,3,'Varoom','It creates a gas out of poison and minerals from rocks. It then detonates the gas in its cylinders— now numbering eight—to generate energy.',140,'G','Revavroom','121','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-122','Po-Suzuki',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.',160,'H','Snorlax','122','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-123','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This mischief-loving Pokémon is full of curiosity. It battles by drawing out the type-based energy contained within its masks.',110,'H','Teal Mask Ogerpon','123','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-124','yuu',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'G','Iono','124','Promo','Trainer'),('svp-125','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Charcadet',NULL,260,'G','Armarouge ex','125','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-126','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Finizen',NULL,340,'H','Palafin ex','126','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-127','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,220,'H','Walking Wake ex','127','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-128','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,220,'H','Iron Leaves ex','128','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-129','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its peach-shaped shell serves as storage for a potent poison. It makes poisonous mochi and serves them to people and Pokémon.',80,'H','Pecharunt','129','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-13','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Much remains unknown about this creature. It resembles Cyclizar, but it is far more ruthless and powerful.',120,'G','Miraidon','13','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-130','Oku',NULL,NULL,4,'Bisharp','Only a Bisharp that stands above all others in its vast army can evolve into Kingambit.',180,'G','Kingambit','130','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-131','akagi',NULL,NULL,1,'Seadra',NULL,310,'H','Kingdra ex','131','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-132','SIE NANAHARA',NULL,NULL,1,'Frogadier',NULL,300,'G','Greninja ex','132','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-133','Natsumi Yoshida',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ledyba','When the stars flicker in the night sky, it flutters about, scattering a glowing powder.',90,'H','Ledian','133','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-134','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,3,'Crabrawler','Though its punches are powerful, this Pokémon\'s movements are sluggish. It blows icy bubbles from its mouth to immobilize its opponents.',160,'H','Crabominable','134','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-135','Keisin',NULL,NULL,2,'Drifloon','They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can\'t be a fixed destination.',130,'H','Drifblim','135','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-136','Tonji Matsuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'These Pokémon can crush a car with no more than a headbutt. Bouffalant with more hair on their heads hold higher positions within the herd.',100,'H','Bouffalant','136','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-137','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They swim with dance-like motions and cause whirlpools to form. Horsea compete to see which of them can generate the biggest whirlpool.',60,'G','Horsea','137','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-138','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,1,'Porygon','After artificial intelligence was implemented in Porygon2, the Pokémon began using a strange language that only other Porygon2 understand.',90,'G','Porygon2','138','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-139','hncl',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light.',110,'G','Latias','139','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-14','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This seems to be the Winged King mentioned in an old expedition journal. It was said to have split the land with its bare fists.',130,'G','Koraidon','14','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-140','DOM',NULL,NULL,2,'Tinkatuff','This intelligent Pokémon has a very daring disposition. It knocks rocks into the sky with its hammer, aiming for flying Corviknight.',140,'G','Tinkaton','140','Promo','Pokémon'),('svp-141','Tetsu Kayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Ho