armed many into raising this Pokémon.',50,'D','Gossifleur','20','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-200','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Marnie','200','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh1-201','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Professor\'s Research (Professor Magnolia)','201','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh1-202','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Team Yell Grunt','202','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh1-203','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Lapras V',NULL,320,'D','Lapras VMAX','203','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh1-204','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Morpeko V',NULL,300,'D','Morpeko VMAX','204','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh1-205','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Stonjourner V',NULL,330,'D','Stonjourner VMAX','205','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh1-206','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,4,'Snorlax V',NULL,340,'D','Snorlax VMAX','206','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh1-207','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bede','207','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh1-208','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Marnie','208','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh1-209','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Professor\'s Research (Professor Magnolia)','209','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh1-21','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Gossifleur','The cotton on the head of this Pokémon can be spun into a glossy, gorgeous yarn—a Galar regional specialty.',80,'D','Eldegoss','21','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-210','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Team Yell Grunt','210','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh1-211','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Zacian V','211','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh1-212','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,230,'D','Zamazenta V','212','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh1-213','Yoshinobu Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Air Balloon','213','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh1-214','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Metal Saucer','214','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh1-215','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Ordinary Rod','215','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh1-216','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Quick Ball','216','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh1-22','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While young, it has six gorgeous tails. When it grows, several new tails are sprouted.',70,'D','Vulpix','22','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-23','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,1,'Vulpix','It is said to live 1,000 years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers.',120,'D','Ninetales','23','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-24','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Torkoal V','24','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-25','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,'D','Victini V','25','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-26','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'There\'s a hole in its tail that allows it to draw in the air it needs to keep its fire burning. If the hole gets blocked, this Pokémon will fall ill.',110,'D','Heatmor','26','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-27','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its venom sacs produce a fluid that this Pokémon then heats up with the flame in its tail. This process creates Salandit\'s poisonous gas.',70,'D','Salandit','27','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-28','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Salandit','Only female Salazzle exist. They emit a gas laden with pheromones to captivate male Salandit.',120,'D','Salazzle','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-29','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Explosive substances coat the shell on its back. Enemies that dare attack it will be blown away by an immense detonation.',130,'D','Turtonator','29','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-3','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its flowers give off a relaxing fragrance. The stronger its aroma, the healthier the Roselia is.',70,'D','Roselia','3','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-30','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it\'s raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.',60,'D','Scorbunny','30','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-31','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A warm-up of running around gets fire energy coursing through this Pokémon\'s body. Once that happens, it\'s ready to fight at full power.',70,'D','Scorbunny','31','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-32','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Scorbunny','It kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork.',90,'D','Raboot','32','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-33','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Scorbunny','Its thick and fluffy fur protects it from the cold and enables it to use hotter fire moves.',90,'D','Raboot','33','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-34','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Raboot','It\'s skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.',170,'D','Cinderace','34','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh1-35','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,'Raboot','It juggles a pebble with its feet, turning it into a burning soccer ball. Its shots strike opponents hard and leave them scorched.',170,'D','Cinderace','35','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh1-36','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Raboot','It juggles a pebble with its feet, turning it into a burning soccer ball. Its shots strike opponents hard and leave them scorched.',170,'D','Cinderace','36','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-37','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores flammable gas in its body and uses it to generate heat. The yellow sections on its belly get particularly hot.',70,'D','Sizzlipede','37','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-38','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores flammable gas in its body and uses it to generate heat. The yellow sections on its belly get particularly hot.',70,'D','Sizzlipede','38','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-39','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Sizzlipede','When it heats up, its body temperature reaches about 1,500 degrees Fahrenheit. It lashes its body like a whip and launches itself at enemies.',130,'D','Centiskorch','39','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-4','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Roselia','After captivating opponents with its sweet scent, it lashes them with its thorny whips.',120,'D','Roserade','4','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-40','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It swims facing backward by opening and closing its two-piece shell. It is surprisingly fast.',70,'D','Shellder','40','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-41','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,2,'Shellder','Its shell is extremely hard. It cannot be shattered, even with a bomb. The shell opens only when it is attacking.',130,'D','Cloyster','41','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-42','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can be found near the sea. The large pincers grow back if they are torn out of their sockets.',80,'D','Krabby','42','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-43','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can be found near the sea. The large pincers grow back if they are torn out of their sockets.',80,'D','Krabby','43','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-44','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Krabby','The large and hard pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, being so big, it is unwieldy to move.',130,'D','Kingler','44','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-45','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its dorsal and pectoral fins are strongly developed like muscles. It can swim at a speed of five knots.',70,'D','Goldeen','45','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-46','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its dorsal, pectoral, and tail fins wave elegantly in water. That is why it is known as the Water Dancer.',70,'D','Goldeen','46','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-47','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,'Goldeen','Using its horn, it bores holes in riverbed boulders, making nests to prevent its eggs from washing away.',110,'D','Seaking','47','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-48','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'A smart and kindhearted Pokémon, it glides across the surface of the sea while its beautiful song echoes around it.',130,'D','Lapras','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-49','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Lapras V','49','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-5','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It shoots cotton from its body to protect itself. If it gets caught up in hurricane-strength winds, it can get sent to the other side of the Earth.',60,'D','Cottonee','5','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-50','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Lapras V',NULL,320,'D','Lapras VMAX','50','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh1-51','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The small spikes covering its body developed from scales. They inject a toxin that causes fainting.',90,'D','Qwilfish','51','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-52','Jumpei Akasaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can jump out above the waves and glide for over 300 feet.',110,'D','Mantine','52','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-53','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Keldeo V','53','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-54','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When scared, this Pokémon cries. Its tears pack the chemical punch of 100 onions, and attackers won\'t be able to resist weeping.',60,'D','Sobble','54','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-55','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When scared, this Pokémon cries. Its tears pack the chemical punch of 100 onions, and attackers won\'t be able to resist weeping.',70,'D','Sobble','55','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-56','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,'Sobble','A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles using water balloons created with moisture secreted from its palms.',90,'D','Drizzile','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-57','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Sobble','A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles using water balloons created with moisture secreted from its palms.',90,'D','Drizzile','57','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-58','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Drizzile','It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips that can shoot water and a membrane on its back that it can use to glide through the air.',160,'D','Inteleon','58','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh1-59','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Drizzile','It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips that can shoot water and a membrane on its back that it can use to glide through the air.',160,'D','Inteleon','59','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-6','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Cottonee','It scatters cotton all over the place as a prank. If it gets wet, it\'ll become too heavy to move and have no choice but to answer for its mischief.',100,'D','Whimsicott','6','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-60','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard horn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this Pokémon bites down and never lets go.',80,'D','Chewtle','60','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-61','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,3,'Chewtle','This Pokémon rapidly extends its retractable neck to sink its sharp fangs into distant enemies and take them down.',130,'D','Drednaw','61','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-62','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s so strong that it can knock out some opponents in a single hit, but it also may forget what it\'s battling midfight.',110,'D','Cramorant','62','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-63','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It eats snow that piles up on the ground. The more snow it eats, the bigger and more impressive the spikes on its back grow.',50,'D','Snom','63','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-64','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Snom','It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.',90,'D','Frosmoth','64','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh1-65','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Pikachu that can generate powerful electricity have cheek sacs that are extra soft and super stretchy.',60,'D','Pikachu','65','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-66','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Pikachu','Its long tail serves as a ground to protect itself from its own high-voltage power.',130,'D','Raichu','66','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-67','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'On the dark ocean floor, its only means of communication is its constantly flashing lights.',70,'D','Chinchou','67','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-68','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its antennae, which evolved from a fin, have both positive and negative charges flowing through them.',60,'D','Chinchou','68','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-69','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,'Chinchou','This Pokémon flashes a bright light that blinds its prey. This creates an opening for it to deliver an electrical attack.',120,'D','Lanturn','69','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-7','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'With noises that could be mistaken for the rattles of maracas, it creates an upbeat rhythm, startling bird Pokémon and making them fly off in a hurry.',110,'D','Maractus','7','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-70','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Joltik can be found clinging to other Pokémon. It\'s soaking up static electricity because it can\'t produce a charge on its own.',50,'D','Joltik','70','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-71','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,'Joltik','It launches electrified fur from its abdomen as its means of attack. Opponents hit by the fur could be in for three full days and nights of paralysis.',100,'D','Galvantula','71','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-72','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Tapu Koko V','72','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-73','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is very popular as a herding dog in the Galar region. As it runs, it generates electricity from the base of its tail.',70,'D','Yamper','73','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-74','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is very popular as a herding dog in the Galar region. As it runs, it generates electricity from the base of its tail.',70,'D','Yamper','74','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-75','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,'Yamper','This Pokémon generates electricity and channels it into its legs to keep them going strong. Boltund can run nonstop for three full days.',130,'D','Boltund','75','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh1-76','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yamper','This Pokémon generates electricity and channels it into its legs to keep them going strong. Boltund can run nonstop for three full days.',120,'D','Boltund','76','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh1-77','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.',80,'D','Pincurchin','77','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-78','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its constant hunger. It\'s also generating electricity.',90,'D','Morpeko','78','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-79','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,'D','Morpeko V','79','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-8','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They lay their eggs deep inside their nests. When attacked by Heatmor, they retaliate using their massive mandibles.',110,'D','Durant','8','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-80','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Morpeko V',NULL,300,'D','Morpeko VMAX','80','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh1-81','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon will look into your eyes and read the contents of your heart. If it finds evil there, it promptly hides away.',70,'D','Galarian Ponyta','81','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-82','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,1,'Galarian Ponyta','Brave and prideful, this Pokémon dashes airily through the forest, its steps aided by the psychic power stored in the fur on its fetlocks.',100,'D','Galarian Rapidash','82','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-83','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.',60,'D','Gastly','83','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-84','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,'Gastly','Its tongue is made of gas. If licked, its victim starts shaking constantly until death eventually comes.',70,'D','Haunter','84','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-85','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Haunter','On the night of a full moon, if shadows move on their own and laugh, it must be Gengar\'s doing.',110,'D','Gengar','85','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh1-86','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Wobbuffet V','86','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-87','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It eats dreams and releases mist. The mist is pink when it\'s eating a good dream, and black when it\'s eating a nightmare.',70,'D','Munna','87','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-88','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,3,'Munna','It drowses and dreams all the time. It\'s best to leave it be if it\'s just woken up, as it\'s a terrible grump when freshly roused from sleep.',120,'D','Musharna','88','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-89','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is said to have been born when a lonely spirit possessed a cold, leftover cup of tea.',30,'D','Sinistea','89','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-9','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Dhelmise V','9','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-90','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Sinistea','This species lives in antique teapots. Most pots are forgeries, but on rare occasions, an authentic work is found.',60,'D','Polteageist','90','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh1-91','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Indeedee V','91','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh1-92','Hasegawa Saki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If a Diglett digs through a field, it leaves the soil perfectly tilled and ideal for planting crops.',60,'D','Diglett','92','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-93','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,'Diglett','A team of Diglett triplets. It triggers huge earthquakes by burrowing 60 miles underground.',90,'D','Dugtrio','93','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-94','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick.',120,'D','Hitmonlee','94','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-95','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes.',120,'D','Hitmonchan','95','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-96','Sekio',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It can remember only one thing at a time. Once it starts rushing, it forgets why it started.',100,'D','Rhyhorn','96','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-97','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Strong, but not too bright, this Pokémon can shatter even a skyscraper with its charging tackles.',90,'D','Rhyhorn','97','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh1-98','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,4,'Rhyhorn','Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.',120,'D','Rhydon','98','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh1-99','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,4,'Rhydon','It relies on its carapace to deflect incoming attacks and throw its enemy off balance. As soon as that happens, it drives its drill into the foe.',190,'D','Rhyperior','99','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh10-1','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Beedrill V','1','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh10-10','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Kricketot','It uses its cutlass-like arms to produce sound, the melody of which varies from individual to individual. It is a worthwhile endeavor to seek out one\'s favorite tunes.',90,'F','Kricketune','10','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-100','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Dewott','Hard of heart and deft of blade, this rare form of Samurott is a product of the Pokémon\'s evolution in the region of Hisui. Its turbulent blows crash into foes like ceaseless pounding waves.',170,'F','Hisuian Samurott','100','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh10-101','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Hisuian Samurott V','101','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh10-102','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Hisuian Samurott V',NULL,270,'F','Hisuian Samurott VSTAR','102','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh10-103','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon. It survives off its ill-gotten gains.',60,'F','Nickit','103','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-104','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,'Nickit','It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.',100,'F','Thievul','104','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-105','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A bizarre Pokémon with but a single eye embedded in an iron sphere. I suspect this creature levitates due to the magnetism it emits from its arms, which resemble horseshoe-shaped magnets.',60,'F','Magnemite','105','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-106','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,'Magnemite','This Pokémon is three Magnemite that have linked together. Magneton sends out powerful radio waves to study its surroundings.',90,'F','Magneton','106','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-107','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,2,'Magneton','Some say that Magnezone receives signals from space via the antenna on its head and that it\'s being controlled by some mysterious being.',150,'F','Magnezone','107','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh10-108','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Registeel\'s body is made of a strange material that is flexible enough to stretch and shrink but also more durable than any metal.',130,'F','Registeel','108','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-109','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,3,'Unidentified Fossil','Although its fossils can be found in layers of primeval rock, nothing but its face has ever been discovered.',100,'F','Shieldon','109','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-11','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The members of the trio spend all their time together. Each one has a slightly different taste in nectar.',50,'F','Combee','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-110','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,4,'Shieldon','This Pokémon is from roughly 100 million years ago. Its terrifyingly tough face is harder than steel.',160,'F','Bastiodon','110','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh10-111','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Floats using a mysterious energy. The pattern engraved upon its back is held as sacred and can sometimes be found in imagery from ancient cemeteries and other such timeworn places.',60,'F','Bronzor','111','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-112','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,3,'Bronzor','Some believe it to be a deity that summons rain clouds. When angered, it lets out a warning cry that rings out like the tolling of a bell.',130,'F','Bronzong','112','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-113','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Origin Forme Dialga V','113','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh10-114','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Origin Forme Dialga V',NULL,280,'F','Origin Forme Dialga VSTAR','114','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh10-115','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses river stones to maintain the cutting edges of the blades covering its body. These sharpened blades allow it to bring down opponents.',60,'F','Pawniard','115','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-116','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,2,'Pawniard','It\'s accompanied by a large retinue of Pawniard. Bisharp keeps a keen eye on its minions, ensuring none of them even think of double-crossing it.',120,'F','Bisharp','116','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-117','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Garchomp V','117','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh10-118','DOM',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'An academic theory proposes that Regidrago\'s arms were once the head of an ancient dragon Pokémon. The theory remains unproven.',130,'F','Regidrago','118','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-119','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has the ability to alter the composition of its body to suit its surrounding environment.',50,'F','Eevee','119','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-12','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,'Combee','It skillfully commands its grubs in battles with its enemies. The grubs are willing to risk their lives to defend Vespiquen.',120,'F','Vespiquen','12','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-120','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It always stands on one foot. It changes feet so fast, the movement can rarely be seen.',50,'F','Hoothoot','120','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-121','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,1,'Hoothoot','Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.',100,'F','Noctowl','121','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-122','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It licks its paws because of the sweet honey that has soaked into them. It is cunning, stealing into the nests of Combee and taking for itself the honey that the Combee have amassed.',70,'F','Teddiursa','122','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-123','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,3,'Teddiursa','When the cold season arrives in Hisui, this Pokémon will wander fields and mountains alike in search of its favorite berries. Ursaring\'s hunger during this time makes it a ferocious danger.',130,'F','Ursaring','123','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-124','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,4,'Ursaring','I believe it was Hisui\'s swampy terrain that gave Ursaluna its burly physique and newfound capacity to manipulate peat at will.',180,'F','Ursaluna','124','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-125','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its strangely shaped antlers have the power to bewitch those who see them. Medicine made by grinding up the black orbs from fallen antlers is an effective treatment for insomnia.',100,'F','Stantler','125','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-126','saino misaki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Miltank produces highly nutritious milk, so it\'s been supporting the lives of people and other Pokémon since ancient times.',110,'F','Miltank','126','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh10-127','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Bewitches humans with its helical tail and piercing gaze. Its hidden claws are quite sharp as well, making this Pokémon an exceedingly tricky opponent if antagonized.',60,'F','Glameow','127','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-128','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,'Glameow','To make itself appear intimidatingly beefy, it tightly cinches its waist with its twin tails.',110,'F','Purugly','128','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh10-129','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A versatile performer skilled in the imitation of human speech. It is said that older, more experienced Chatot can even understand the meaning of the words they mimic.',70,'F','Chatot','129','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-13','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','Cells similar to those of plants have been found in its fur. Its hard tail can fell a large tree with one stroke, and the tail\'s sharpness exceeds even that of a sword crafted by a master.',110,'F','Leafeon','13','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-130','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes.',150,'F','Regigigas','130','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh10-131','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its chick-like looks belie its hotheadedness. It challenges its parents at every opportunity, desperate to prove its strength.',70,'F','Rufflet','131','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-132','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Rufflet','Screaming a bloodcurdling battle cry, this huge and ferocious bird Pokémon goes out on the hunt. It blasts lakes with shock waves, then scoops up any prey that float to the water\'s surface.',130,'F','Hisuian Braviary','132','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-133','Uta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Oranguru V','133','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh10-134','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Wyrdeer V','134','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh10-135','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Adaman','135','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh10-136','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Canceling Cologne','136','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-137','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Choy','137','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-138','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Cyllene','138','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-139','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Dark Patch','139','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-14','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When the turning of seasons brings the cruel winter to its end and the joyous people give thanks to the heavens, Shaymin appears and covers the withered land with flowers.',70,'F','Shaymin','14','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh10-140','ORBITALLINK Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Energy Loto','140','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-141','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Feather Ball','141','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-142','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Gapejaw Bog','142','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-143','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Gardenia\'s Vigor','143','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-144','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Grant','144','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-145','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Gutsy Pickaxe','145','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-146','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Hisuian Heavy Ball','146','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-147','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Irida','147','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh10-148','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Jubilife Village','148','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-149','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Kamado','149','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-15','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The leaves on its head are highly valued for medicinal purposes. Dry the leaves in the sun, boil them, and then drink the bitter decoction for remarkably effective relief from fatigue.',50,'F','Petilil','15','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh10-150','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Roxanne','150','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-151','AYUMI ODASHIMA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Spicy Seasoned Curry','151','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-152','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Supereffective Glasses','152','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-153','ORBITALLINK Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Sweet Honey','153','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-154','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Switch Cart','154','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-155','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Temple of Sinnoh','155','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh10-156','Toyste Beach',NULL,NU