90,'F','Relicanth','101','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-102','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,3,'Shellos','Its search for food sometimes leads it onto land, where it leaves behind a sticky trail of slime as it passes through.',130,'F','Gastrodon','102','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-103','yuu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In one minute, a well-trained Mienfoo can chop with its arms more than 100 times.',60,'F','Mienfoo','103','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-104','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,'Mienfoo','When Mienshao comes across a truly challenging opponent, it will lighten itself by biting off the fur on its arms.',90,'F','Mienshao','104','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-105','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'From the forces of lightning and wind, it creates energy to give nutrients to the soil and make the land abundant.',120,'F','Landorus','105','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-106','Scav',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'After two Binacle find a suitably sized rock, they adhere themselves to it and live together. They cooperate to gather food during high tide.',70,'F','Binacle','106','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-107','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,3,'Binacle','Seven Binacle come together to form one Barbaracle. The Binacle that serves as the head gives orders to those serving as the limbs.',130,'F','Barbaracle','107','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh11-108','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When beset by attackers, Carbink wipes them all out by firing high-energy beams from the gems embedded in its body.',90,'F','Carbink','108','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-109','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon can bond very strongly with its Trainer, but it also has a habit of biting. Raising a Rockruff for a long time can be challenging.',60,'F','Rockruff','109','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-11','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it remains still, it looks just like a real nut. It delights in surprising foraging Pokémon.',50,'F','Seedot','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-110','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Five of them are troopers, and one is the brass. The brass\'s orders are absolute.',100,'F','Falinks','110','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-111','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It stands in grasslands, watching the sun\'s descent from zenith to horizon. This Pokémon has a talent for delivering dynamic kicks.',140,'F','Stonjourner','111','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-112','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although the poison from its fangs isn\'t that strong, it\'s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web.',50,'F','Spinarak','112','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-113','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,1,'Spinarak','It spews threads from its mouth to catch its prey. When night falls, it leaves its web to go hunt aggressively.',90,'F','Ariados','113','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-114','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for shiny things for its boss. Murkrow\'s presence is said to be unlucky, so many people detest it.',60,'F','Murkrow','114','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-115','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,'Murkrow','Its goons take care of most of the fighting for it. The only time it dirties its own hands is in delivering a final blow to finish off an opponent.',120,'F','Honchkrow','115','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-116','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It\'s Zangoose\'s archrival.',110,'F','Seviper','116','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-117','sui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Exactly 108 spirits gathered to become this Pokémon. Apparently there are some ill-natured spirits in the mix.',60,'F','Spiritomb','117','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-118','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Drapion V','118','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh11-119','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Drapion V',NULL,270,'F','Drapion VSTAR','119','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh11-12','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,'Seedot','It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy.',80,'F','Nuzleaf','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-120','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'On a moonless night, a strange incident occurred in which every one of a village\'s inhabitants suffered nightmares. The villagers attested that Darkrai appeared before them in these nightmares.',120,'F','Darkrai','120','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh11-121','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It spins while making its luminescent spots flash. These spots allow it to communicate with others by using different patterns of light.',50,'F','Inkay','121','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-122','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place.',120,'F','Hoopa','122','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-123','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because of Sneasler\'s virulent poison and daunting physical prowess, no other species could hope to best it on the frozen highlands. Preferring solitude, this species does not form packs.',130,'F','Radiant Hisuian Sneasler','123','Radiant Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-124','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It is said that if an Onix lives for over 100 years, its composition changes to become diamond-like.',170,'F','Radiant Steelix','124','Radiant Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-125','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It appears in ancient ruins. The pattern on its body doesn\'t come from any culture in the Galar region, so it remains shrouded in mystery.',70,'F','Bronzor','125','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-126','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,3,'Bronzor','Some believe that its bell-like cry opens holes to another world. It has been revered as a deity since ancient times.',130,'F','Bronzong','126','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-127','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Living in mud with a high iron content has given it a strong steel body.',100,'F','Galarian Stunfisk','127','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-128','Rianti Hidayat',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Built roughly 500 years ago by a scientist, the part called the Soul-Heart is the actual life-form.',90,'F','Magearna','128','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-129','PLANETA Yamashita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Galarian Perrserker V','129','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh11-13','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Nuzleaf','A Pokémon that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe\'s mind and take preemptive action.',160,'F','Shiftry','13','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh11-130','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Giratina V','130','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh11-131','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Giratina V',NULL,280,'F','Giratina VSTAR','131','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh11-132','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Goomy hides away in the shade of trees, where it\'s nice and humid. If the slime coating its body dries out, the Pokémon instantly becomes lethargic.',60,'F','Goomy','132','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-133','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Goomy','A creature given to melancholy. I suspect its metallic shell developed as a result of the mucus on its skin reacting with the iron in Hisui\'s water.',90,'F','Hisuian Sliggoo','133','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-134','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,'Hisuian Sliggoo','Able to freely control the hardness of its metallic shell. It loathes solitude and is extremely clingy—it will fume and run riot if those dearest to it ever leave its side.',160,'F','Hisuian Goodra','134','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh11-135','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Hisuian Goodra V','135','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh11-136','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Hisuian Goodra V',NULL,270,'F','Hisuian Goodra VSTAR','136','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh11-137','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Pidgeot V','137','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh11-138','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'If this Pokémon\'s sticky saliva gets on you and you don\'t clean it off, an intense itch will set in. The itch won\'t go away, either.',110,'F','Lickitung','138','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-139','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,4,'Lickitung','Lickilicky\'s strange tongue can stretch to many times the length of its body. No one has figured out how Lickilicky\'s tongue can stretch so far.',140,'F','Lickilicky','139','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-14','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its flowers give off a relaxing fragrance. The stronger its aroma, the healthier the Roselia is.',70,'F','Roselia','14','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-140','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'State-of-the-art technology was used to create Porygon. It was the first artificial Pokémon to be created via computer programming.',60,'F','Porygon','140','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-141','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,'Porygon','This is a Porygon that was updated with special data. Porygon2 develops itself by learning about many different subjects all on its own.',90,'F','Porygon2','141','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-142','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,'Porygon2','Porygon-Z had a program installed to allow it to move between dimensions, but the program also caused instability in Porygon-Z\'s behavior.',150,'F','Porygon-Z','142','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh11-143','0313',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.',150,'F','Snorlax','143','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh11-144','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This treetop dweller possesses a tail as dexterous as a hand. Ancient writings describe this Pokémon as a one-armed oddity.',60,'F','Aipom','144','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh11-145','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Aipom','It uses its tails for everything. If it wraps both of its tails around you and gives you a squeeze, that\'s proof it really likes you.',90,'F','Ambipom','145','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh11-146','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Hisuian Zoroark V','146','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh11-147','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,'Hisuian Zoroark V',NULL,270,'F','Hisuian Zoroark VSTAR','147','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh11-148','Nisota 