',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Leafy Camo Poncho','214','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh12-215',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','V Guard Energy','215','Rare Secret','Energy'),('swsh12-22','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,1,'Ponyta','This Pokémon can be seen galloping through fields at speeds of up to 150 mph, its fiery mane fluttering in the wind.',100,'F','Rapidash','22','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12-23','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being\'s entire body will be overflowing with power.',70,'F','Victini','23','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-24','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Reshiram V','24','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-25','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it walks, it munches on a twig in place of a snack. It intimidates opponents by puffing hot air out of its ears.',60,'F','Fennekin','25','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-26','Ligton',NULL,NULL,1,'Fennekin','When the twig is plucked from its tail, friction sets the twig alight. The flame is used to send signals to its allies.',90,'F','Braixen','26','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-27','Uta',NULL,NULL,2,'Braixen','Using psychic power, it generates a fiery vortex of 5,400 degrees Fahrenheit, incinerating foes swept into this whirl of flame.',150,'F','Delphox','27','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-28','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,'Fletchling','Fletchinder launches embers into the den of its prey. When the prey comes leaping out, Fletchinder\'s sharp talons finish it off.',80,'F','Fletchinder','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-29','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,'Fletchinder','Talonflame mainly preys upon other bird Pokémon. To intimidate opponents, it sends embers spewing from gaps between its feathers.',140,'F','Talonflame','29','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-3','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although the poison from its fangs isn\'t that strong, it\'s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web.',60,'F','Spinarak','3','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-30','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its coat regrows twice a year. When the time comes, Litten sets its own body on fire and burns away the old fur.',70,'F','Litten','30','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-31','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,'Litten','When its mane is standing on end, you can tell it\'s feeling good. When it isn\'t feeling well, its fur will lie down flat.',80,'F','Torracat','31','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-32','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,3,'Torracat','When its fighting spirit is set alight, the flames around its waist become especially intense.',170,'F','Incineroar','32','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-33','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'F','Alolan Vulpix V','33','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-34','PLANETA Hiiragi',NULL,NULL,1,'Alolan Vulpix V',NULL,240,'F','Alolan Vulpix VSTAR','34','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12-35','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'F','Omastar V','35','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-36','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s said that this Pokémon\'s beautiful blue wings are made of ice. Articuno flies over snowy mountains, its long tail fluttering along behind it.',110,'F','Articuno','36','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12-37','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It shows off by spraying jets of seawater from the nostrils above its eyes. It eats a solid ton of Wishiwashi every day.',110,'F','Wailmer','37','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-38','Shinya Komatsu',NULL,NULL,4,'Wailmer','It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.',200,'F','Wailord','38','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-39','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although unattractive and unpopular, this Pokémon\'s marvelous vitality has made it a subject of research.',30,'F','Feebas','39','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-4','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Spinarak','It spews threads from its mouth to catch its prey. When night falls, it leaves its web to go hunt aggressively.',90,'F','Ariados','4','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12-40','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,'Feebas','Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all.',130,'F','Milotic','40','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-41','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s said that if they are seen at midnight, they\'ll cause heavy snow. They eat snow and ice to survive.',60,'F','Snorunt','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-42','Scav',NULL,NULL,2,'Snorunt','It has a body of ice that won\'t melt, even with fire. It can instantly freeze moisture in the atmosphere.',130,'F','Glalie','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-43','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Snorunt','After a woman met her end on a snowy mountain, her regrets lingered on. From them, this Pokémon was born. Its favorite food is frozen souls.',90,'F','Froslass','43','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-44','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Rock-hard scales and oil-filled swim bladders allow this Pokémon to survive the intense water pressure of the deep sea.',90,'F','Relicanth','44','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-45','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted.',70,'F','Phione','45','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-46','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow.',120,'F','Keldeo','46','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-47','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It forms a water bubble at the rear of its body and then covers its head with it. Meeting another Dewpider means comparing water-bubble sizes.',60,'F','Dewpider','47','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-48','DOM',NULL,NULL,2,'Dewpider','It launches water bubbles with its legs, drowning prey within the bubbles. This Pokémon can then take its time to savor its meal.',120,'F','Araquanid','48','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-49','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Pikachu that can generate powerful electricity have cheek sacs that are extra soft and super stretchy.',70,'F','Pikachu','49','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-5','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else.',40,'F','Sunkern','5','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-50','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,'Pikachu','Its long tail serves as a ground to protect itself from its own high-voltage power.',120,'F','Raichu','50','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-51','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its antennae, which evolved from a fin, have both positive and negative charges flowing through them.',60,'F','Chinchou','51','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-52','aoki',NULL,NULL,2,'Chinchou','The light it emits is so bright that it can illuminate the sea\'s surface from a depth of over three miles.',120,'F','Lanturn','52','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-53','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'One boy\'s invention led to the development of many different machines that take advantage of Rotom\'s unique capabilities.',80,'F','Rotom','53','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-54','sowsow',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'As Emolga flutters through the air, it crackles with electricity. This Pokémon is cute, but it can cause a lot of trouble.',70,'F','Emolga','54','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-55','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Thanks to bacteria that lived in the mud flats with it, this Pokémon developed the organs it uses to generate electricity.',110,'F','Stunfisk','55','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-56','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It approaches its enemies at the speed of lightning, then tears them limb from limb with its sharp claws.',110,'F','Zeraora','56','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-57','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Regieleki V','57','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-58','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Regieleki V',NULL,310,'F','Regieleki VMAX','58','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12-59','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has an incredibly high level of intelligence. Some say that Alakazam remembers everything that ever happens to it, from birth till death.',130,'F','Radiant Alakazam','59','Radiant Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-6','zig',NULL,NULL,2,'Sunkern','It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it.',90,'F','Sunflora','6','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-60','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It puts its prey to sleep and devours their dreams. It seems that bad dreams taste sour, so Drowzee doesn\'t particularly like eating them.',70,'F','Drowzee','60','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-61','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,2,'Drowzee','There are some Hypno that assist doctors with patients who can\'t sleep at night in hospitals.',110,'F','Hypno','61','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-62','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'In certain parts of Galar, Jynx was once feared and worshiped as the Queen of Ice.',100,'F','Jynx','62','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-63','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'What makes it happy is imitating the voices of weeping people and scaring everyone. It doesn\'t deal well with folks who aren\'t easily frightened.',60,'F','Misdreavus','63','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-64','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,'Misdreavus','Its muttered curses can cause awful headaches or terrifying visions that torment others.',90,'F','Mismagius','64','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-65','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'F','Unown V','65','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-66','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Unown V',NULL,250,'F','Unown VSTAR','66','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12-67','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is highly attuned to the emotions of people and Pokémon. It hides if it senses hostility.',60,'F','Ralts','67','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-68','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,2,'Ralts','If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.',80,'F','Kirlia','68','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-69','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,'Kirlia','It has the power to predict the future. Its power peaks when it is protecting its Trainer.',150,'F','Gardevoir','69','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-7','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Serperior V','7','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-70','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Mawile V','70','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-71','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Mawile V',NULL,260,'F','Mawile VSTAR','71','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12-72','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper.',60,'F','Meditite','72','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-73','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,2,'Meditite','Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe\'s next move.',120,'F','Medicham','73','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12-74','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.',70,'F','Chimecho','74','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-75','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Psychic power allows these Pokémon to fly. Some say they were the guardians of an ancient city. Others say they were the guardians\' emissaries.',100,'F','Sigilyph','75','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-76','Ligton',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It communicates with others telepathically. Its body is encapsulated in liquid, but if it takes a heavy blow, the liquid will leak out.',40,'F','Solosis','76','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-77','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,2,'Solosis','Its psychic power can supposedly cover a range of more than half a mile—but only if its two brains can agree with each other.',70,'F','Duosion','77','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-78','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Duosion','While it could use its psychic abilities in battle, this Pokémon prefers to swing its powerful arms around to beat opponents into submission.',120,'F','Reuniclus','78','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12-79','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If this Pokémon stands near a TV, strange scenery will appear on the screen. That scenery is said to be from its home.',60,'F','Elgyem','79','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-8','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Serperior V',NULL,270,'F','Serperior VSTAR','8','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12-80','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,1,'Elgyem','Whenever a Beheeyem visits a farm, a Dubwool mysteriously disappears.',90,'F','Beheeyem','80','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-81','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Though Espurr\'s expression never changes, behind that blank stare is an intense struggle to contain its devastating psychic power.',60,'F','Espurr','81','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-82','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Espurr','Females are a bit more selfish and aggressive than males. If they don\'t get what they want, they will torment you with their psychic abilities.',90,'F','Meowstic','82','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-83','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It eats its own weight in sugar every day. If it doesn\'t get enough sugar, it becomes incredibly grumpy.',60,'F','Swirlix','83','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-84','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,'Swirlix','By taking in a person\'s scent, it can sniff out their mental and physical condition. It\'s hoped that this skill will have many medical applications.',120,'F','Slurpuff','84','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-85','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A Dedenne\'s whiskers pick up electrical waves other Dedenne send out. These Pokémon share locations of food or electricity with one another.',60,'F','Dedenne','85','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-86','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'These intelligent Pokémon touch horns with each other to share information between them.',90,'F','Indeedee','86','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-87','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'After being reborn as a ghost Pokémon, Dreepy wanders the areas it used to inhabit back when it was alive in prehistoric seas.',60,'F','Dreepy','87','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-88','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Dreepy','It\'s capable of flying faster than 120 mph. It battles alongside Dreepy and dotes on them until they successfully evolve.',90,'F','Drakloak','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-89','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,'Drakloak','When it isn\'t battling, it keeps Dreepy in the holes on its horns. Once a fight starts, it launches the Dreepy like supersonic missiles.',150,'F','Dragapult','89','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12-9','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The leaves on its head are highly valued for medicinal purposes. Dry the leaves in the sun, boil them, and then drink the bitter decoction for remarkably effective relief from fatigue.',50,'F','Petilil','9','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-90','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,230,'F','Hisuian Arcanine V','90','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12-91','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.',80,'F','Phanpy','91','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-92','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Phanpy','The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow.',150,'F','Donphan','92','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-93','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It moves while spinning around on its single foot. Some Baltoy have been seen spinning on their heads.',50,'F','Baltoy','93','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-94','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,2,'Baltoy','This mysterious Pokémon started life as an ancient clay figurine made over 20,000 years ago.',110,'F','Claydol','94','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-95','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Unidentified Fossil','This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. Anorith lived in the ocean about 100,000,000 years ago, hunting with its pair of claws.',90,'F','Anorith','95','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12-96','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,'Anorith','After evolution, this Pokémon emerged onto land. Its lower body has become stronger, and blows from its tail are devastating.',150,'F','Armaldo','96','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12-97','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It has phenomenal power. It will mercilessly crush anyone or anything that bullies small Pokémon.',130,'F','Terrakion','97','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12-98','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It drives its opponents to exhaustion with its agile maneuvers, then ends the fight with a flashy finishing move.',80,'F','Hawlucha','98','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12-99','Sekio',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Grudges of the dead have possessed a mound of sand and become a Pokémon. Sandygast is fond of the shovel on its head.',80,'F','Sandygast','99','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-1','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If exposed to moonlight, it starts to move. It roams far and wide at night to scatter its seeds.',50,'F','Oddish','1','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-10','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When its antennae hit each other, it sounds like the music of a xylophone.',60,'F','Kricketot','10','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-100','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Rayquaza V','100','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-101','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Rayquaza V',NULL,320,'E','Rayquaza VMAX','101','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-102','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Rayquaza V',NULL,320,'E','Rayquaza VMAX','102','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-103','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Duraludon V','103','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-104','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Duraludon V',NULL,330,'E','Duraludon VMAX','104','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-105','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The core on its chest absorbs energy emanating from the lands of the Galar region. This energy is what allows Eternatus to stay active.',170,'F','Radiant Eternatus','105','Radiant Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-106','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When Tauros begins whipping itself with its tails, it\'s a warning that the Pokémon is about to charge with astounding speed.',110,'F','Tauros','106','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-107','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can reconstitute its entire cellular structure to change into what it sees, but it returns to normal when it relaxes.',70,'F','Ditto','107','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-108','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Eevee V','108','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-109','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This Pokémon\'s stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it.',160,'E','Snorlax','109','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-11','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The deeper a Cherubi\'s red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!',50,'E','Cherubi','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-110','Ligton',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying.',60,'F','Starly','110','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-111','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It constantly gnaws on logs and rocks to whittle down its front teeth. It nests alongside water.',60,'F','Bidoof','111','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-112','sui',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying.',70,'F','Chatot','112','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-113','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,240,'F','Regigigas V','113','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-114','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,4,'Regigigas V',NULL,300,'F','Regigigas VSTAR','114','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-115','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers.',70,'F','Shaymin','115','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-116','MUGENUP',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Stoutland V','116','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-117','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although it will eat anything, it prefers fresh living things, so it marches down streets in search of prey.',70,'F','Yungoos','117','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-118','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Yungoos','Patient by nature, this Pokémon loses control of itself and pounces when it spots its favorite meal—Rattata!',120,'F','Gumshoos','118','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-119','Sekio',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'With waves of its fan—made from leaves and its own fur—Oranguru skillfully gives instructions to other Pokémon.',110,'F','Oranguru','119','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-12','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down.',90,'F','Carnivine','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-120','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Greedent V','120','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-121','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its curly fleece is such an effective cushion that this Pokémon could fall off a cliff and stand right back up at the bottom, unharmed.',70,'F','Wooloo','121','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-122','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,'Wooloo','Weave a carpet from its springy wool, and you end up with something closer to a trampoline. You\'ll start to bounce the moment you set foot on it.',120,'F','Dubwool','122','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-123','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bea','123','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-124','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bede','124','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-125','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Crushing Hammer','125','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-126','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Digging Duo','126','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-127','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Energy Retrieval','127','Common','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-128','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Energy Search','128','Common','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-129','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Energy Switch','129','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-13','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Leafeon V','13','Ra