,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Elesa\'s Sparkle','147','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-148','Kinu Nishimura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Friends in Hisui','148','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-149','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Friends in Sinnoh','149','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-15','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It uses its big jaws to dig nests into the forest floor, and it loves to feed on sweet tree sap.',70,'E','Grubbin','15','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-150','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Professor Rowan',NULL,'F','Professor\'s Research','150','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-151','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Volo','151','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12pt5-152',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Grass Energy','152','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-153',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Fire Energy','153','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-154',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Water Energy','154','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-155',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Lightning Energy','155','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-156',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Psychic Energy','156','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-157',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Fighting Energy','157','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-158',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Darkness Energy','158','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-159',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Metal Energy','159','Rare Ultra','Energy'),('swsh12pt5-16','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Within dense forests, this Pokémon lives in a pack with others of its kind. It\'s incredibly aggressive, and the other Pokémon of the forest fear it.',120,'F','Zarude','16','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-160','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Pikachu that can generate powerful electricity have cheek sacs that are extra soft and super stretchy.',70,'F','Pikachu','160','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-17','Nurikabe',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Calyrex is a merciful Pokémon, capable of providing healing and blessings. It reigned over the Galar region in times of yore.',110,'F','Calyrex','17','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-18','N-DESIGN Inc.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Charizard V','18','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-19','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Charizard V',NULL,280,'F','Charizard VSTAR','19','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-2','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,'Oddish','Its pistils exude an incredibly foul odor. The horrid stench can cause fainting at a distance of 1.25 miles.',70,'F','Gloom','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-20','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It spits fire that is hot enough to melt boulders. It may cause forest fires by blowing flames.',160,'F','Radiant Charizard','20','Radiant Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-21','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.',120,'F','Entei','21','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-22','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Simisear V','22','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-23','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Simisear V',NULL,260,'F','Simisear VSTAR','23','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-24','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The people of ancient times believed that Larvesta fell from the sun.',80,'F','Larvesta','24','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-25','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,2,'Larvesta','Volcarona scatters burning scales. Some say it does this to start fires. Others say it\'s trying to rescue those that suffer in the cold.',130,'F','Volcarona','25','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-26','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain.',130,'F','Volcanion','26','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-27','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its venom sacs produce a fluid that this Pokémon then heats up with the flame in its tail. This process creates Salandit\'s poisonous gas.',70,'F','Salandit','27','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-28','aoki',NULL,NULL,1,'Salandit','Only female Salazzle exist. They emit a gas laden with pheromones to captivate male Salandit.',120,'F','Salazzle','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-29','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thanks to its thick fat, cold seas don\'t bother it at all, but it gets tired pretty easily in warm waters.',70,'F','Seel','29','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-3','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,1,'Gloom','Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound.',120,'F','Bellossom','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-30','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can radiate chilliness from the bottoms of its feet. It\'ll spend the whole day tap-dancing on a frozen floor.',80,'E','Galarian Mr. Mime','30','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-31','kodama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It shows off by spraying jets of seawater from the nostrils above its eyes. It eats a solid ton of Wishiwashi every day.',120,'F','Wailmer','31','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-32','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,4,'Wailmer','It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.',220,'F','Wailord','32','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-33','0313',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive.',70,'F','Corphish','33','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-34','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as -150 degrees Fahrenheit.',60,'E','Snorunt','34','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-35','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Luvdisc makes its home in coral reefs in warm seas. It especially likes sleeping in the space between Corsola\'s branches.',70,'F','Luvdisc','35','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-36','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.',140,'F','Kyogre','36','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-37','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,230,'F','Kyogre V','37','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-38','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Glaceon V','38','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-39','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.',60,'E','Shinx','39','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-4','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Hidden beneath a tangle of vines that grows nonstop even if the vines are torn off, this Pokémon\'s true appearance remains a mystery.',80,'F','Tangela','4','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-40','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon generates electricity by contracting its muscles. Excited trembling is a sign that Shinx is generating a tremendous amount of electricity.',60,'F','Shinx','40','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-41','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,'Shinx','Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.',80,'E','Luxio','41','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-42','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Shinx','By joining its tail with that of another Luxio, this Pokémon can receive some of the other Luxio\'s electricity and power up its own electric blasts.',90,'F','Luxio','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-43','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Luxio','Luxray\'s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it\'s scouting for danger.',150,'E','Luxray','43','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-44','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Luxio','Luxray can see through solid objects. It will instantly spot prey trying to hide behind walls, even if the walls are thick.',160,'F','Luxray','44','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-45','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'F','Rotom V','45','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-46','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Rotom V',NULL,250,'F','Rotom VSTAR','46','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-47','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'As it flies, it scatters electricity around, so bird Pokémon keep their distance. That\'s why Emolga can keep all its food to itself.',70,'E','Emolga','47','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-48','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,2,'Tynamo','These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.',80,'F','Eelektrik','48','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-49','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When spread, the frills on its head act like solar panels, generating the power behind this Pokémon\'s electric moves.',70,'F','Helioptile','49','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-5','zig',NULL,NULL,4,'Tangela','Tangrowth has two arms that it can extend as it pleases. Recent research has shown that these arms are, in fact, bundles of vines.',150,'F','Tangrowth','5','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-50','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Helioptile','A now-vanished desert culture treasured these Pokémon. Appropriately, when Heliolisk came to the Galar region, treasure came with them.',120,'F','Heliolisk','50','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-51','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'While its durable shell protects it from attacks, Charjabug strikes at enemies with jolts of electricity discharged from the tips of its jaws.',90,'F','Radiant Charjabug','51','Radiant Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-52','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It approaches its enemies at the speed of lightning, then tears them limb from limb with its sharp claws.',120,'E','Zeraora','52','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-53','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Zeraora V','53','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-54','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,2,'Zeraora V',NULL,320,'F','Zeraora VMAX','54','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-55','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zeraora V',NULL,270,'F','Zeraora VSTAR','55','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-56','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.',80,'F','Pincurchin','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-57','zig',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Though it may look like it\'s just a bunch of eggs, it\'s a proper Pokémon. Exeggcute communicates with others of its kind via telepathy, apparently.',60,'F','Exeggcute','57','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-58','Toshinao Aoki',NULL,NULL,2,'Exeggcute','Each of Exeggutor\'s three heads is thinking different thoughts. The three don\'t seem to be very interested in one another.',130,'F','Exeggutor','58','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-59','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A Pokémon created by recombining Mew\'s genes. It\'s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.',130,'F','Mewtwo','59','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-6','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As Scyther fights more and more battles, its scythes become sharper and sharper. With a single slice, Scyther can fell a massive tree.',80,'F','Scyther','6','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-60','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,180,'E','Mew V','60','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-61','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting.',90,'F','Girafarig','61','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-62','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It\'s active on the night of a full moon.',90,'F','Lunatone','62','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-63','DOM',NULL,NULL,2,'Duskull','Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.',90,'F','Dusclops','63','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-64','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although called a guardian deity, Tapu Lele is devoid of guilt about its cruel disposition and can be described as nature incarnate.',110,'F','Tapu Lele','64','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-65','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Hatterene V','65','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-66','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Hatterene V',NULL,320,'F','Hatterene VMAX','66','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-67','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When it flies to this land from across the sea, the bitter winter comes to an end. According to legend, this Pokémon\'s love gives rise to the budding of fresh life across Hisui.',120,'F','Enamorus','67','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-68','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,4,'Geodude','It travels by rolling down cliffs. If it falls into a river, it will explode with its last gasp.',110,'E','Graveler','68','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-69','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.',90,'F','Solrock','69','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-7','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else.',40,'F','Sunkern','7','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-70','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.',60,'E','Baltoy','70','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-71','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience.',60,'F','Riolu','71','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-72','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It chooses a Pangoro as its master and then imitates its master\'s actions. This is how it learns to battle and hunt for prey.',70,'F','Pancham','72','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-73','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon can bond very strongly with its Trainer, but it also has a habit of biting. Raising a Rockruff for a long time can be challenging.',60,'F','Rockruff','73','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-74','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Rockruff','This form of Lycanroc is reckless. It charges headlong at its opponents, attacking without any care about what injuries it might receive.',120,'F','Lycanroc','74','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-75','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It adores polluted air. Some claim that Koffing used to be more plentiful in the Galar region than they are now.',70,'E','Koffing','75','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-76','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters.',100,'F','Absol','76','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-77','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It steals things from people just to amuse itself with their frustration. A rivalry exists between this Pokémon and Nickit.',60,'F','Purrloin','77','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-78','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,'Purrloin','Don\'t be fooled by its gorgeous fur and elegant figure. This is a moody and vicious Pokémon.',100,'F','Liepard','78','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-79','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Sandile','It buries some of its prey in the sand to use as emergency meals when its hunts are unsuccessful.',90,'D','Krokorok','79','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-8','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area.',70,'F','Yanma','8','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-80','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,'Pancham','This Pokémon is quick to anger, and it has no problem using its prodigious strength to get its way. It lives for duels against Obstagoon.',140,'F','Pangoro','80','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-81','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It drifts in the ocean, blending in with floating seaweed. When other Pokémon come to feast on the seaweed, Skrelp feasts on them instead.',60,'F','Skrelp','81','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-82','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,'Skrelp','Dragalge uses a poisonous liquid capable of corroding metal to send tankers that enter its territory to the bottom of the sea.',120,'F','Dragalge','82','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-83','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place.',120,'D','Hoopa','83','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-84','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémon\'s body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.',70,'F','Galarian Meowth','84','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-85','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Meowth','What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.',120,'F','Galarian Perrserker','85','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-86','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Scyther','Bulky pincers account for one third of Scizor\'s body weight. A single swing of one of these pincers will crush a boulder completely.',130,'F','Scizor','86','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-87','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It eats iron ore—and sometimes railroad tracks— to build up the steel armor that protects its body.',70,'F','Aron','87','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-88','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,3,'Aron','Lairon live in mountains brimming with spring water and iron ore, so these Pokémon often came into conflict with humans in the past.',90,'F','Lairon','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-89','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,4,'Lairon','Aggron has a horn sharp enough to perforate thick iron sheets. It brings down its opponents by ramming into them horn first.',180,'F','Aggron','89','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-9','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yanma','This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced.',130,'F','Yanmega','9','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-90','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,2,'Beldum','Two Beldum have become stuck together via their own magnetic forces. With two brains, the resulting Metang has doubled psychic powers.',100,'F','Metang','90','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-91','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses river stones to maintain the cutting edges of the blades covering its body. These sharpened blades allow it to bring down opponents.',60,'F','Pawniard','91','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-92','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses river stones to maintain the cutting edges of the blades covering its body. These sharpened blades allow it to bring down opponents.',70,'F','Pawniard','92','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-93','DOM',NULL,NULL,1,'Pawniard','It\'s accompanied by a large retinue of Pawniard. Bisharp keeps a keen eye on its minions, ensuring none of them even think of double-crossing it.',110,'F','Bisharp','93','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-94','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Now armed with a weapon it used in ancient times, this Pokémon needs only a single strike to fell even Gigantamax Pokémon.',130,'F','Zacian','94','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-95','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Zacian V','95','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-96','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Zacian V',NULL,270,'F','Zacian VSTAR','96','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-97','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its ability to deflect any attack led to it being known as the Fighting Master\'s Shield. It was feared and respected by all.',130,'F','Zamazenta','97','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-98','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Zamazenta V','98','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5-99','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Zamazenta V',NULL,270,'F','Zamazenta VSTAR','99','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG01','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'An enigmatic Pokémon that happens to bear a resemblance to a Poké Ball. When excited, it discharges the electric current it has stored in its belly, then lets out a great, uproarious laugh.',50,'F','Hisuian Voltorb','GG01','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG02','Nurikabe',NULL,NULL,1,'Kricketot','It signals its emotions with its melodies. Scientists are studying these melodic patterns.',90,'F','Kricketune','GG02','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG03','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,3,'Magmar','When Magmortar inhales deeply, the fire burning in its belly intensifies, rising in temperature to over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.',140,'F','Magmortar','GG03','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG04','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Oricorio has drunk red nectar. If its Trainer gives the wrong order, this passionate Pokémon becomes fiercely angry.',90,'E','Oricorio','GG04','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG05','zig',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A smart and kindhearted Pokémon, it glides across the surface of the sea while its beautiful song echoes around it.',130,'F','Lapras','GG05','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG06','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It starts its life with a wondrous power that permits it to bond with any kind of Pokémon.',70,'F','Manaphy','GG06','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG07','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow.',110,'F','Keldeo','GG07','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG08','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,3,'Electabuzz','The amount of electrical energy this Pokémon produces is proportional to the rate of its pulse. The voltage jumps while Electivire is battling.',140,'F','Electivire','GG08','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG09','Nelnal',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel','It has an electrical organ on its chest. While generating electricity, it fills its surroundings with what sounds like the strumming of a bass guitar.',120,'E','Toxtricity','GG09','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG10','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its DNA is said to contain the genetic codes of all Pokémon, so it can use all kinds of techniques.',60,'E','Mew','GG10','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG11','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It\'s active on the night of a full moon.',90,'F','Lunatone','GG11','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG12','Scav',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen.',120,'E','Deoxys','GG12','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG13','Haruko Ichikawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.',90,'F','Diancie','GG13','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG14','Yano Keiji',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Comfey picks flowers with its vine and decorates itself with them. For some reason, flowers won\'t wither once they\'re attached to a Comfey.',70,'F','Comfey','GG14','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG15','Nobuhiro Imagawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.',90,'F','Solrock','GG15','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG16','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters.',100,'F','Absol','GG16','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG17','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,'Nickit','It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.',100,'F','Thievul','GG17','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG18','Shinya Komatsu',NULL,NULL,2,'Magneton','Some say that Magnezone receives signals from space via the antenna on its head and that it\'s being controlled by some mysterious being.',150,'F','Magnezone','GG18','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG19','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Swablu','On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.',90,'E','Altaria','GG19','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG20','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light.',120,'E','Latias','GG20','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG21','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,3,'Hisuian Sliggoo','Able to freely control the hardness of its metallic shell. It loathes solitude and is extremely clingy— it will fume and run riot if those dearest to it ever leave its side.',160,'F','Hisuian Goodra','GG21','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG22','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can reconstitute its entire cellular structure to change into what it sees, but it returns to normal when it relaxes.',70,'F','Ditto','GG22','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG23','Kurata So',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it sees a person, it digs a hole with its tail to make its escape. If you happen to find one, consider yourself lucky.',60,'E','Dunsparce','GG23','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG24','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Miltank produces highly nutritious milk, so it\'s been supporting the lives of people and other Pokémon since ancient times.',110,'F','Miltank','GG24','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG25','Amelicart',NULL,NULL,2,'Bidoof','It makes its nest by damming streams with bark and mud. It is known as an industrious worker.',120,'F','Bibarel','GG25','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG26','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience.',60,'F','Riolu','GG26','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG27','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.',50,'E','Swablu','GG27','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG28','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it finds bad children who won\'t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away—or so it\'s said.',60,'F','Duskull','GG28','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG29','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It constantly gnaws on logs and rocks to whittle down its front teeth. It nests alongside water.',60,'F','Bidoof','GG29','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG30','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Pikachu that can generate powerful electricity have cheek sacs that are extra soft and super stretchy.',60,'F','Pikachu','GG30','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG31','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It undertakes photosynthesis with its body, making oxygen. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty.',80,'F','Turtwig','GG31','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG32','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The mushrooms, known as tochukaso, are controlling the bug. Even if the bug bugs the mushrooms, they tell it to bug off.',70,'F','Paras','GG32','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG33','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.',60,'F','Poochyena','GG33','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG34','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. You\'ll want to pet it because it\'s cute, but if you use your bare hand, you\'ll get a painful shock.',60,'E','Mareep','GG34','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG35','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,2,'Leafeon V',NULL,260,'F','Leafeon VSTAR','GG35','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG36','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,230,'F','Entei V','GG36','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG37','nagano',NULL,NULL,2,'Simisear V',NULL,260,'F','Simisear VSTAR','GG37','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh12pt5gg-GG38','Atsushi 