','Braixen','TG01','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG02','chibi',NULL,NULL,2,'Feebas','Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all.',130,'F','Milotic','TG02','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG03','saino misaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Mareep','It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches.',90,'E','Flaaffy','TG03','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG04','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'In certain parts of Galar, Jynx was once feared and worshiped as the Queen of Ice.',100,'F','Jynx','TG04','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG05','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,'Kirlia','It has the power to predict the future. Its power peaks when it is protecting its Trainer.',150,'F','Gardevoir','TG05','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG06','Fumie Kittaka',NULL,NULL,3,'Inkay','It\'s said that Malamar\'s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events.',120,'E','Malamar','TG06','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG07','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you, that\'s proof of its love for you. However, the rocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!',70,'E','Rockruff','TG07','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG08','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Passimian live in groups of about 20, with each member performing an assigned role. Through cooperation, the group survives.',110,'E','Passimian','TG08','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG09','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Druddigon are vicious and cunning. They take up residence in nests dug out by other Pokémon, treating the stolen nests as their own lairs.',120,'E','Druddigon','TG09','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG10','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It draws symbols with the fluid that oozes from the tip of its tail. Depending on the symbol, Smeargle fanatics will pay big money for them.',70,'F','Smeargle','TG10','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG11','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,'Swablu','As it flies in a calm and relaxed manner, Altaria performs a humming song that would enrapture any audience.',110,'F','Altaria','TG11','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG12','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'E','Kricketune V','TG12','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG13','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Serperior V','TG13','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG14','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Blaziken V','TG14','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG15','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,2,'Blaziken V',NULL,320,'E','Blaziken VMAX','TG15','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG16','yuu',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Zeraora V','TG16','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG17','saino misaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Mawile V','TG17','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG18','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Corviknight V','TG18','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG19','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Corviknight V',NULL,320,'E','Corviknight VMAX','TG19','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG20','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Rayquaza V',NULL,320,'E','Rayquaza VMAX','TG20','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG21','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,3,'Duraludon V',NULL,330,'E','Duraludon VMAX','TG21','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG22','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,250,'E','Blissey V','TG22','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG23','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Friends in Galar','TG23','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12tg-TG24','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Gordie','TG24','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12tg-TG25','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Judge','TG25','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12tg-TG26','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Professor Burnet','TG26','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12tg-TG27','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Raihan','TG27','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12tg-TG28','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Sordward & Shielbert','TG28','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh12tg-TG29','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Rayquaza V',NULL,320,'E','Rayquaza VMAX','TG29','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh12tg-TG30','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Duraludon V',NULL,330,'E','Duraludon VMAX','TG30','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh2-1','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antenna on its head to drive away enemies.',50,'D','Caterpie','1','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-10','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lives in ponds and marshes that feature lots of plant life. It often fights with Dewpider, whose habitat and diet are similar.',50,'D','Surskit','10','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-100','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,'Barboach','It makes its nest at the bottom of swamps. It will eat anything—if it is alive, Whiscash will eat it.',140,'D','Whiscash','100','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-101','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A clay slab with cursed engravings took possession of a Yamask. The slab is said to be absorbing the Yamask\'s dark power.',70,'D','Galarian Yamask','101','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-102','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Yamask','A powerful curse was woven into an ancient painting. After absorbing the spirit of a Yamask, the painting began to move.',100,'D','Galarian Runerigus','102','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-103','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'After two Binacle find a suitably sized rock, they adhere themselves to it and live together. They cooperate to gather food during high tide.',80,'D','Binacle','103','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-104','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Binacle','Seven Binacle come together to form one Barbaracle. The Binacle that serves as the head gives orders to those serving as the limbs.',120,'D','Barbaracle','104','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-105','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Most of its body has the same composition as coal. Fittingly, this Pokémon was first discovered in coal mines about 400 years ago.',70,'D','Rolycoly','105','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-106','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Rolycoly','It forms coal inside its body. Coal dropped by this Pokémon once helped fuel the lives of people in the Galar region.',100,'D','Carkol','106','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-107','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,'Carkol','It\'s usually peaceful, but the vandalism of mines enrages it. Offenders will be incinerated with flames that reach 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit.',160,'D','Coalossal','107','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-108','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Sandaconda V','108','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-109','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Five of them are troopers, and one is the brass. The brass\'s orders are absolute.',90,'D','Falinks','109','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-11','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Surskit','Its thin, winglike antennae are highly absorbent. It waits out rainy days in tree hollows.',90,'D','Masquerain','11','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-110','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,160,'D','Falinks V','110','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-111','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It stands in grasslands, watching the sun\'s descent from zenith to horizon. This Pokémon has a talent for delivering dynamic kicks.',140,'D','Stonjourner','111','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-112','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is full of poisonous gas. It floats into garbage dumps, seeking out the fumes of raw, rotting trash.',70,'D','Koffing','112','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-113','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Koffing','This Pokémon consumes particles that contaminate the air. Instead of leaving droppings, it expels clean air.',130,'D','Galarian Weezing','113','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-114','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'From its rear, it sprays a foul-smelling liquid at opponents. It aims for their faces, and it can hit them from over 16 feet away.',70,'D','Stunky','114','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-115','sowsow',NULL,NULL,3,'Stunky','In its belly, it reserves stinky fluid that it shoots from its tail during battle. As this Pokémon\'s diet varies, so does the stench of its fluid.',120,'D','Skuntank','115','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-116','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It was bound to a fissure in an Odd Keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago.',60,'D','Spiritomb','116','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-117','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room.',60,'D','Trubbish','117','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-118','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,'Trubbish','This Pokémon eats trash, which turns into poison inside its body. The main component of the poison depends on what sort of trash was eaten.',120,'D','Garbodor','118','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-119','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It wears a bone to protect its rear. It often squabbles with others of its kind over particularly comfy bones.',60,'D','Vullaby','119','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-12','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It lives on snowy mountains. It sinks its legs into the snow to absorb water and keep its own temperature down.',90,'D','Snover','12','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-120','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Vullaby','Although it\'s a bit of a ruffian, this Pokémon will take lost Vullaby under its wing and care for them till they\'re ready to leave the nest.',120,'D','Mandibuzz','120','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-121','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Malamar V','121','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-122','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Malamar V',NULL,310,'D','Malamar VMAX','122','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh2-123','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Through its nose, it sucks in the emanations produced by people and Pokémon when they feel annoyed. It thrives off this negative energy.',70,'D','Impidimp','123','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-124','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,2,'Impidimp','When it gets down on all fours as if to beg for forgiveness, it\'s trying to lure opponents in so that it can stab them with its spear-like hair.',90,'D','Morgrem','124','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-125','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,'Morgrem','With the hair wrapped around its body helping to enhance its muscles, this Pokémon can overwhelm even Machamp.',170,'D','Grimmsnarl','125','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-126','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémon\'s body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.',60,'D','Galarian Meowth','126','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-127','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Meowth','What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.',120,'D','Galarian Perrserker','127','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-128','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,1,'Scyther','Once it has identified something as an enemy, it will continue beating them with its steel-hard pincers until there\'s nothing left but scraps.',130,'D','Scizor','128','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-129','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It appears in ancient ruins. The pattern on its body doesn\'t come from any culture in the Galar region, so it remains shrouded in mystery.',60,'D','Bronzor','129','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-13','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,3,'Snover','If it sees any packs of Darumaka going after Snover, it chases them off, swinging its sizable arms like hammers.',140,'D','Abomasnow','13','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-130','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,3,'Bronzor','Some believe it to be a deity that summons rain clouds. When angered, it lets out a warning cry that rings out like the tolling of a bell.',130,'D','Bronzong','130','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-131','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,4,'Nosepass','It uses three small units to catch prey and battle enemies. The main body mostly just gives orders.',140,'D','Probopass','131','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-132','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They lay their eggs deep inside their nests. When attacked by Heatmor, they retaliate using their massive mandibles.',100,'D','Durant','132','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-133','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Honedge\'s soul once belonged to a person who was killed a long time ago by the sword that makes up Honedge\'s body.',60,'D','Honedge','133','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-134','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,2,'Honedge','Honedge evolves into twins. The two blades rub together to emit a metallic sound that unnerves opponents.',90,'D','Doublade','134','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-135','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,'Doublade','In this defensive stance, Aegislash uses its steel body and a force field of spectral power to reduce the damage of any attack.',140,'D','Aegislash','135','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-136','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Copperajah V','136','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-137','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Copperajah V',NULL,340,'D','Copperajah VMAX','137','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh2-138','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its body resembles polished metal, and it\'s both lightweight and strong. The only drawback is that it rusts easily.',130,'D','Duraludon','138','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-139','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Now armed with a weapon it used in ancient times, this Pokémon needs only a single strike to fell even Gigantamax Pokémon.',120,'D','Zacian','139','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-14','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'After a lost child perished in the forest, their spirit possessed a tree stump, causing the spirit\'s rebirth as this Pokémon.',60,'D','Phantump','14','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-140','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its ability to deflect any attack led to it being known as the Fighting Master\'s Shield. It was feared and respected by all.',120,'D','Zamazenta','140','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-141','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.',150,'D','Snorlax','141','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-142','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying.',70,'D','Chatot','142','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-143','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Where people go, these Pokémon follow. If you\'re scattering food for them, be careful—several hundred of them can gather at once.',60,'D','Pidove','143','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-144','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,'Pidove','It can fly moderately quickly. No matter how far it travels, it can always find its way back to its master and its nest.',80,'D','Tranquill','144','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-145','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,'Tranquill','Unfezant are exceptional fliers. The females are known for their stamina, while the males outclass them in terms of speed.',150,'D','Unfezant','145','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-146','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It excels at digging holes. Using its ears, it can dig a nest 33 feet deep in one night.',70,'D','Bunnelby','146','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-147','kodama',NULL,NULL,3,'Bunnelby','With power equal to an excavator, it can dig through dense bedrock. It\'s a huge help during tunnel construction.',130,'D','Diggersby','147','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-148','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It drives its opponents to exhaustion with its agile maneuvers, then ends the fight with a flashy finishing move.',90,'D','Hawlucha','148','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-149','so-taro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its fluffy fur is a delight to pet, but carelessly reaching out to touch this Pokémon could result in painful retaliation.',80,'D','Stufful','149','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-15','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,'Phantump','People fear it due to a belief that it devours any who try to cut down trees in its forest, but to the Pokémon it shares its woods with, it\'s kind.',130,'D','Trevenant','15','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-150','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,'Stufful','Once it accepts you as a friend, it tries to show its affection with a hug. Letting it do that is dangerous—it could easily shatter your bones.',140,'D','Bewear','150','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-151','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Found throughout the Galar region, this Pokémon becomes uneasy if its cheeks are ever completely empty of berries.',70,'D','Skwovet','151','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-152','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Skwovet','It stashes berries in its tail—so many berries that they fall out constantly. But this Pokémon is a bit slow-witted, so it doesn\'t notice the loss.',120,'D','Greedent','152','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-153','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Dubwool V','153','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-154','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Boss\'s Orders','154','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh2-155','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Burning Scarf','155','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh2-156','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Capacious Bucket','156','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh2-157','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Cursed Shovel','157','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh2-158','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Dan','158','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh2-159','Yoshinobu Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Full Heal','159','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh2-16','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its natural enemies, like Rookidee, may flee rather than risk getting caught in its large mandibles that can snap thick tree branches.',60,'D','Grubbin','16','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-160','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Galar Mine','160','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh2-161','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Milo','161','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh2-162','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Nugget','162','Uncommon'