cs',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Inteleon V','180','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-181','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Boltund V','181','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-182','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Toxtricity V','182','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-183','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Dragapult V','183','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-184','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Sandaconda V','184','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-185','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,160,'D','Falinks V','185','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-186','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Malamar V','186','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-187','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Copperajah V','187','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-188','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Dubwool V','188','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh2-189','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Boss\'s Orders','189','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh2-19','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Eldegoss V','19','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-190','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Milo','190','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh2-191','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Oleana','191','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh2-192','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Sonia','192','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh2-193','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Rillaboom V',NULL,330,'D','Rillaboom VMAX','193','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh2-194','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Cinderace V',NULL,320,'D','Cinderace VMAX','194','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh2-195','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Inteleon V',NULL,320,'D','Inteleon VMAX','195','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh2-196','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxtricity V',NULL,320,'D','Toxtricity VMAX','196','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh2-197','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,'Dragapult V',NULL,320,'D','Dragapult VMAX','197','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh2-198','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Malamar V',NULL,310,'D','Malamar VMAX','198','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh2-199','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Copperajah V',NULL,340,'D','Copperajah VMAX','199','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh2-2','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,3,'Caterpie','It is waiting for the moment to evolve. At this stage, it can only harden, so it remains motionless to avoid attack.',80,'D','Metapod','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-20','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It spends its entire life inside an apple. It hides from its natural enemies, bird Pokémon, by pretending it\'s just an apple and nothing more.',40,'D','Applin','20','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-200','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Boss\'s Orders','200','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh2-201','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Milo','201','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh2-202','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Oleana','202','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh2-203','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Sonia','203','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh2-204','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Snom','It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.',90,'D','Frosmoth','204','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh2-205','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Meowth','What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.',120,'D','Galarian Perrserker','205','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh2-206','inose yukie',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Big Charm','206','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh2-207','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Scoop Up Net','207','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh2-208','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Tool Scrapper','208','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh2-209',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Twin Energy','209','Rare Secret','Energy'),('swsh2-21','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It spends its entire life inside an apple. It hides from its natural enemies, bird Pokémon, by pretending it\'s just an apple and nothing more.',40,'D','Applin','21','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-22','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Applin','It ate a sour apple, and that induced its evolution. In its cheeks, it stores an acid capable of causing chemical burns.',80,'D','Flapple','22','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-23','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,'Applin','Eating a sweet apple caused its evolution. A nectarous scent wafts from its body, luring in the bug Pokémon it preys on.',90,'D','Appletun','23','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-24','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While young, it has six gorgeous tails. When it grows, several new tails are sprouted.',60,'D','Vulpix','24','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-25','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Vulpix','It is said to live 1,000 years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers.',120,'D','Ninetales','25','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-26','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Ninetales V','26','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-27','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has a brave and trustworthy nature. It fearlessly stands up to bigger and stronger foes.',80,'D','Growlithe','27','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-28','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,'Growlithe','The sight of it running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night has captivated many people.',130,'D','Arcanine','28','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-29','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its entire body is burning. When it breathes, the temperature rises. When it sneezes, flames shoot out!',90,'D','Magmar','29','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-3','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Metapod','In battle, it flaps its wings at great speed to release highly toxic dust into the air.',140,'D','Butterfree','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-30','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,3,'Magmar','Magmortar takes down its enemies by shooting fireballs, which burn them to a blackened crisp. It avoids this method when hunting prey.',140,'D','Magmortar','30','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-31','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The flame on its head keeps its body slightly warm. This Pokémon takes lost children by the hand to guide them to the spirit world.',60,'D','Litwick','31','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-32','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,'Litwick','This Pokémon appears just before someone passes away, so it\'s feared as an emissary of death.',80,'D','Lampent','32','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-33','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,2,'Lampent','This Pokémon haunts dilapidated mansions. It sways its arms to hypnotize opponents with the ominous dancing of its flames.',140,'D','Chandelure','33','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-34','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'There\'s a hole in its tail that allows it to draw in the air it needs to keep its fire burning. If the hole gets blocked, this Pokémon will fall ill.',120,'D','Heatmor','34','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-35','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Cinderace V','35','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-36','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Cinderace V',NULL,320,'D','Cinderace VMAX','36','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh2-37','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its talent is tap-dancing. It can also manipulate temperatures to create a floor of ice, which this Pokémon can kick up to use as a barrier.',80,'D','Galarian Mr. Mime','37','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-38','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Galarian Mr. Mime','It\'s highly skilled at tap-dancing. It waves its cane of ice in time with its graceful movements.',110,'D','Galarian Mr. Rime','38','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-39','kanahei',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is virtually worthless in terms of both power and speed. It is the most weak and pathetic Pokémon in the world.',30,'D','Magikarp','39','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-4','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its two sharp scythes are more than just weapons. It uses them with dexterity to dress its prey before eating.',80,'D','Scyther','4','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-40','hatachu',NULL,NULL,4,'Magikarp','It has an extremely aggressive nature. The Hyper Beam it shoots from its mouth totally incinerates all targets.',180,'D','Gyarados','40','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-41','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It makes its nest on sheer cliffs. Riding the sea breeze, it glides up into the expansive skies.',70,'D','Wingull','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-42','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Wingull','It is a messenger of the skies, carrying small Pokémon and eggs to safety in its bill.',120,'D','Pelipper','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-43','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Milotic V','43','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-44','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Graceful ripples running across the water\'s surface are a sure sign that Tympole are singing in high-pitched voices below.',60,'D','Tympole','44','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-45','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,2,'Tympole','It weakens its prey with sound waves intense enough to cause headaches, then entangles them with its sticky tongue.',90,'D','Palpitoad','45','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-46','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,3,'Palpitoad','The vibrating of the bumps all over its body causes earthquake-like tremors. Seismitoad and Croagunk are similar species.',170,'D','Seismitoad','46','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-47','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It lived in snowy areas for so long that its fire sac cooled off and atrophied. It now has an organ that generates cold instead.',80,'D','Galarian Darumaka','47','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-48','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Darumaka','On days when blizzards blow through, it comes down to where people live. It stashes food in the snowball on its head, taking it home for later.',140,'D','Galarian Darmanitan','48','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-49','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Inteleon V','49','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-5','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores berries inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still.',80,'D','Shuckle','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-50','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Inteleon V',NULL,320,'D','Inteleon VMAX','50','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh2-51','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s so strong that it can knock out some opponents in a single hit, but it also may forget what it\'s battling midfight.',110,'D','Cramorant','51','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-52','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it sees any movement around it, this Pokémon charges for it straightaway, leading with its sharply pointed jaw. It\'s very proud of that jaw.',60,'D','Arrokuda','52','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-53','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Arrokuda','This Pokémon has a jaw that\'s as sharp as a spear and as strong as steel. Apparently Barraskewda\'s flesh is surprisingly tasty, too.',120,'D','Barraskewda','53','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-54','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It drifted in on the flow of ocean waters from a frigid place. It keeps its head iced constantly to make sure it stays nice and cold.',120,'D','Eiscue','54','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-55','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Eiscue V','55','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-56','Hasegawa Saki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a Poké Ball, it has zapped many people.',50,'D','Voltorb','56','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-57','otumami',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Voltorb','It stores an overflowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode.',90,'D','Electrode','57','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-58','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'While it\'s often blamed for power outages, the truth is the cause of outages is more often an error on the part of the electric company.',90,'D','Electabuzz','58','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-59','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,'Electabuzz','A single Electivire can provide enough electricity for all the buildings in a big city for a year.',140,'D','Electivire','59','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-6','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It roams through forests searching for sweet nectar. Although it boasts fantastic physical strength, it\'s not that good at flying.',130,'D','Heracross','6','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-60','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.',60,'D','Shinx','60','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-61','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,'Shinx','Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.',90,'D','Luxio','61','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-62','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Luxio','Luxray\'s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it\'s scouting for danger.',160,'D','Luxray','62','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-63','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When spread, the frills on its head act like solar panels, generating the power behind this Pokémon\'s electric moves.',70,'D','Helioptile','63','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-64','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,'Helioptile','A now-vanished desert culture treasured these Pokémon. Appropriately, when Heliolisk came to the Galar region, treasure came with them.',110,'D','Heliolisk','64','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-65','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Grubbin','While its durable shell protects it from attacks, Charjabug strikes at enemies with jolts of electricity discharged from the tips of its jaws.',90,'D','Charjabug','65','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-66','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Charjabug','It builds up electricity in its abdomen, focuses it through its jaws, and then fires the electricity off in concentrated beams.',150,'D','Vikavolt','66','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-67','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Boltund V','67','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-68','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It stores poison in an internal poison sac and secretes that poison through its skin. If you touch this Pokémon, a tingling sensation follows.',70,'D','Toxel','68','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-69','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel','When this Pokémon sounds as if it\'s strumming a guitar, it\'s actually clawing at the protrusions on its chest to generate electricity.',130,'D','Toxtricity','69','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-7','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts.',60,'D','Lotad','7','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-70','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Toxtricity V','70','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-71','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxtricity V',NULL,320,'D','Toxtricity VMAX','71','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh2-72','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,'D','Pincurchin V','72','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-73','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its constant hunger. It\'s also generating electricity.',80,'D','Morpeko','73','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-74','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.',60,'D','Clefairy','74','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-75','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,'Clefairy','A timid fairy Pokémon that is rarely seen, it will run and hide the moment it senses people.',110,'D','Clefable','75','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-76','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is extremely good at climbing tree trunks and likes to eat the new sprouts on the trees.',60,'D','Natu','76','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-77','so-taro',NULL,NULL,1,'Natu','They say that it stays still and quiet because it is seeing both the past and future at the same time.',120,'D','Xatu','77','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-78','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Watch your step when wandering areas oceans once covered. What looks like a stone could be this Pokémon, and it will curse you if you kick it.',80,'D','Galarian Corsola','78','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-79','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Corsola','Its shell is overflowing with its heightened otherworldly energy. The ectoplasm serves as protection for this Pokémon\'s core spirit.',100,'D','Galarian Cursola','79','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-8','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,'Lotad','It is nocturnal and becomes active at nightfall. It feeds on aquatic mosses that grow in the riverbed.',90,'D','Lombre','8','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-80','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Psychic power allows these Pokémon to fly. Some say they were the guardians of an ancient city. Others say they were the guardians\' emissaries.',110,'D','Sigilyph','80','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-81','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'If you build sand mounds when you\'re playing, destroy them before you go home, or they may get possessed and become Sandygast.',80,'D','Sandygast','81','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-82','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,4,'Sandygast','Once it has whipped up a sandstorm to halt its opponents in their tracks, this terrifying Pokémon snatches away their vitality.',140,'D','Palossand','82','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-83','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Via the protrusion on its head, it senses other creatures\' emotions. If you don\'t have a calm disposition, it will never warm up to you.',60,'D','Hatenna','83','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-84','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Hatenna','No matter who you are, if you bring strong emotions near this Pokémon, it will silence you violently.',80,'D','Hattrem','84','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-85','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Hattrem','It emits psychic power strong enough to cause headaches as a deterrent to the approach of others.',150,'D','Hatterene','85','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-86','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon was born from sweet-smelling particles in the air. Its body is made of cream.',50,'D','Milcery','86','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-87','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Milcery','When it trusts a Trainer, it will treat them to berries it\'s decorated with cream.',110,'D','Alcremie','87','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-88','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'These intelligent Pokémon touch horns with each other to share information between them.',100,'D','Indeedee','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-89','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'After being reborn as a ghost Pokémon, Dreepy wanders the areas it used to inhabit back when it was alive in prehistoric seas.',60,'D','Dreepy','89','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-9','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Lombre','The rhythm of bright, festive music activates Ludicolo\'s cells, making it more powerful.',160,'D','Ludicolo','9','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh2-90','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Dreepy','It\'s capable of flying faster than 120 mph. It battles alongside Dreepy and dotes on them until they successfully evolve.',90,'D','Drakloak','90','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-91','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Drakloak','When it isn\'t battling, it keeps Dreepy in the holes on its horns. Once a fight starts, it launches the Dreepy like supersonic missiles.',150,'D','Dragapult','91','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-92','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Dragapult V','92','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh2-93','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,'Dragapult V',NULL,320,'D','Dragapult VMAX','93','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh2-94','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The Farfetch\'d of the Galar region are brave warriors, and they wield thick, tough leeks in battle.',80,'D','Galarian Farfetch\'d','94','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-95','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Farfetch\'d','Only Farfetch\'d that have survived many battles can attain this evolution. When this Pokémon\'s leek withers, it will retire from combat.',130,'D','Galarian Sirfetch\'d','95','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh2-96','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It hunts without twitching a muscle by pulling in its prey with powerful magnetism. But sometimes it pulls natural enemies in close.',80,'D','Nosepass','96','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-97','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper.',70,'D','Meditite','97','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh2-98','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,'Meditite','Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe\'s next move.',110,'D','Medicham','98','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh2-99','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.',70,'D','Barboach','99','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-1','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'D','Butterfree V','1','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-10','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Shelmet','It moves with blinding speed and lobs poison at foes. Featuring Accelgor as a main character is a surefire way to make a movie or comic popular.',90,'D','Accelgor','10','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-100','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The wastewater coming from factories is clean these days, so Grimer have nothing to eat. They\'re said to be on the verge of extinction.',80,'D','Grimer','100','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-101','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,4,'Grimer','Because they scatter germs everywhere, they\'ve long been targeted for extermination, leading to a steep decline in their population.',140,'D','Muk','101','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-102','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although the poison from its fangs isn\'t that strong, it\'s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web.',60,'D','Spinarak','102','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-103','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Spinarak','It spews threads from its mouth to catch its prey. When night falls, it leaves its web to go hunt aggressively.',110,'D','Ariados','103','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-104','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Crobat V','104','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-105','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.',120,'D','Darkrai','105','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-106','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It steals things from people just to amuse itself with their frustration. A rivalry exists between this Pokémon and Nickit.',70,'D','Purrloin','106','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-107','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Purrloin','Don\'t be fooled by its gorgeous fur and elegant figure. This is a moody and vicious Pokémon.',100,'D','Liepard','107','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-108','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it encounters something, its first urge is usually to bite it. If it likes what it tastes, it will commit the associated scent to memory.',60,'D','Deino','108','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-109','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Deino','While hunting for prey, Zweilous wanders its territory, its two heads often bickering over which way to go.',100,'D','Zweilous','109','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-11','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'At a distance, it launches its sharp feathers while flying about. If the enemy gets too close, Rowlet switches tactics and delivers vicious kicks.',50,'D','Rowlet','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-110','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,'Zweilous','There are a slew of stories about villages that were destroyed by Hydreigon. It bites anything that moves.',160,'D','Hydreigon','110','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-111','so-taro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place.',120,'D','Hoopa','111','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-112','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon. It survives off its ill-gotten gains.',70,'D','Nickit','112','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-113','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Nickit','It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.',100,'D','Thievul','113','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-114','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Grimmsnarl V','114','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-115','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Grimmsnarl V',NULL,330,'D','Grimmsnarl VMAX','115','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh3-116','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Eternatus V','116','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-117','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Eternatus V',NULL,340,'D','Eternatus VMAX','117','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh3-118','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Scizor V','118','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-119','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Scizor V',NULL,320,'D','Scizor VMAX','119','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh3-12','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Rowlet','It throws one knifelike feather after another at its enemies, and each one precisely strikes a weak point. These feathers are known as blade quills.',80,'D','Dartrix','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-120','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is draped in steel armor. It looks heavy, but it can fly at speeds of up to 185 miles an hour!',120,'D','Skarmory','120','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-121','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When it evolves, it sheds the steel carapace that covered its whole body and develops a new one.',70,'D','Aron','121','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-122','Mizue',NULL,NULL,3,'Aron','It habitually shows off its strength with the sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders.',100,'D','Lairon','122','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-123','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,3,'Lairon','While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.',160,'D','Aggron','123','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-124','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Karrablast','They use shells they\'ve stolen from Shelmet to arm and protect themselves. They\'re very popular Pokémon in the Galar region.',120,'D','Escavalier','124','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-125','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The two minigears that compose this Pokémon are closer than twins. They mesh well only with each other.',60,'D','Klink','125','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-126','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,3,'Klink','When Klang goes all out, the minigear links up perfectly with the outer part of the big gear, and this Pokémon\'s rotation speed increases sharply.',90,'D','Klang','126','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-127','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Klang','From its spikes, it launches powerful blasts of electricity. Its red core contains an enormous amount of energy.',150,'D','Klinklang','127','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-128','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Galarian Stunfisk V','128','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-129','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It dissolves and eats metal. Circulating liquid metal within its body is how it generates energy.',70,'D','Meltan','129','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-13','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Dartrix','As if wielding a bow, it launches the arrow quills hidden among the feathers of its wings. Decidueye\'s shots never miss.',140,'D','Decidueye','13','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-130','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,4,'Meltan','At the end of its life-span, Melmetal will rust and fall apart. The small shards left behind will eventually be reborn as Meltan.',150,'D','Melmetal','130','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-131','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It digs up the ground with its trunk. It\'s also very strong, being able to carry loads of over five tons without any problem at all.',100,'D','Cufant','131','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-132','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,4,'Cufant','They came over from another region long ago and worked together with humans. Their green skin is resistant to water.',190,'D','Copperajah','132','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-133','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'You shouldn\'t get close to the child when it\'s playing outside its mother\'s pouch. Its mother is always nearby watching over it.',130,'D','Kangaskhan','133','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-134','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'They live in groups. The one with the longest, thickest, and most-scarred horns is the boss of the herd.',110,'D','Tauros','134','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-135','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind.',60,'D','Sentret','135','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-136','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,'Sentret','It makes a nest to suit its long and skinny body. The nest is impossible for other Pokémon to enter.',110,'D','Furret','136','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-137','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it sees a person, it digs a hole with its tail to make its escape. If you happen to find one, consider yourself lucky.',60,'D','Dunsparce','137','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-138','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Before food becomes scarce in wintertime, its habit is to hoard food in many hidden locations.',70,'D','Teddiursa','138','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-139','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,'Teddiursa','Although it has a large body, it is quite skilled at climbing trees. It eats and sleeps in the treetops.',140,'D','Ursaring','139','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-14','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body gives off a sweet, fruity scent that is extremely appetizing to bird Pokémon.',60,'D','Bounsweet','14','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-140','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm.',130,'D','Lugia','140','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-141','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy.',60,'D','Skitty','141','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-142','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Skitty','It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.',100,'D','Delcatty','142','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-143','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Salamence V','143','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-144','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Salamence V',NULL,320,'D','Salamence VMAX','144','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh3-145','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying.',50,'D','Starly','145','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-146','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Starly','It lives in forests and fields. Squabbles over territory occur when flocks collide.',80,'D','Staravia','146','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-147','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Staravia','When Staravia evolve into Staraptor, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings.',150,'D','Staraptor','147','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-148','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.',50,'D','Ducklett','148','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-149','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ducklett','Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock.',110,'D','Swanna','149','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-15','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Bounsweet','As it twirls like a dancer, a sweet smell spreads out around it. Anyone who inhales the scent will feel a surge of happiness.',80,'D','Steenee','15','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-150','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It excels at digging holes. Using its ears, it can dig a nest 33 feet deep in one night.',40,'D','Bunnelby','150','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-151','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is always warm. Trainers who live in cold areas apparently sleep with it in their bed.',60,'D','Fletchling','151','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-152','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Found throughout the Galar region, this Pokémon becomes uneasy if its cheeks are ever completely empty of berries.',70,'D','Skwovet','152','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-153','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,'Skwovet','It stashes berries in its tail—so many berries that they fall out constantly. But this Pokémon is a bit slow-witted, so it doesn\'t notice the loss.',120,'D','Greedent','153','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-154','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It will bravely challenge any opponent, no matter how powerful. This Pokémon benefits from every battle—even a defeat increases its strength a bit.',60,'D','Rookidee','154','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-155','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Rookidee','Smart enough to use tools in battle, these Pokémon have been seen picking up rocks and flinging them or using ropes to wrap up enemies.',80,'D','Corvisquire','155','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-156','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Corvisquire','This Pokémon reigns supreme in the skies of the Galar region. The black luster of its steel body could drive terror into the heart of any foe.',160,'D','Corviknight','156','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-157','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Big Parasol','157','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-158','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Billowing Smoke','158','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-159','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bird Keeper','159','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-16','so-taro',NULL,NULL,2,'Steenee','This feared Pokémon has long, slender legs and a cruel heart. It shows no mercy as it stomps on its opponents.',150,'D','Tsareena','16','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-160','inose yukie',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Cape of Toughness','160','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-161','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Familiar Bell','161','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-162','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Glimwood Tangle','162','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-163','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Kabu','163','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-164','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Old PC','164','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-165','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Piers','165','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-166','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Pokémon Breeder\'s Nurturing','166','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-167','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,70,'D','Rare Fossil','167','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-168','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rose','168','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-169','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rose Tower','169','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-17','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It\'s nature\'s cleaner—it eats anything and everything, including garbage and rotten things. The ground near its nest is always clean.',70,'D','Wimpod','17','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-170','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Spikemuth','170','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-171','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Struggle Gloves','171','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-172','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Turbo Patch','172','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-173','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Yell Horn','173','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh3-174',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Heat Fire Energy','174','Uncommon','Energy'),('swsh3-175',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Hiding Darkness Energy','175','Uncommon','Energy'),('swsh3-176',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Powerful Colorless Energy','176','Uncommon','Energy'),('swsh3-177','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'D','Butterfree V','177','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-178','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Houndoom V','178','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-179','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Centiskorch V','179','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-18','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Wimpod','It will do anything to win, taking advantage of every opening and finishing opponents off with the small claws on its front legs.',130,'D','Golisopod','18','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-180','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Vikavolt V','180','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-181','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,230,'D','Rhyperior V','181','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-182','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Crobat V','182','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-183','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Scizor V','183','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-184','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Galarian Stunfisk V','184','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-185','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Salamence V','185','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh3-186','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Kabu','186','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh3-187','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Piers','187','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh3-188','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Pokémon Breeder\'s Nurturing','188','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh3-189','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rose','189','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh3-19','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Charizard V','19','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-190','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Butterfree V',NULL,300,'D','Butterfree VMAX','190','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh3-191','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Centiskorch V',NULL,320,'D','Centiskorch VMAX','191','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh3-192','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Eternatus V',NULL,340,'D','Eternatus VMAX','192','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh3-193','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Scizor V',NULL,320,'D','Scizor VMAX','193','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh3-194','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Salamence V',NULL,320,'D','Salamence VMAX','194','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh3-195','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Pokémon Breeder\'s Nurturing','195','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh3-196','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rose','196','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh3-197','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Thwackey','By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.',170,'D','Rillaboom','197','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh3-198','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,4,'Carkol','It\'s usually peaceful, but the vandalism of mines enrages it. Offenders will be incinerated with flames that reach 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit.',160,'D','Coalossal','198','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh3-199','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Big Parasol','199','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh3-2','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Butterfree V',NULL,300,'D','Butterfree VMAX','2','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh3-20','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,'Charizard V',NULL,330,'D','Charizard VMAX','20','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh3-200','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Turbo Patch','200','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh3-201',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Capture Energy','201','Rare Secret','Energy'),('swsh3-21','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Houndoom V','21','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-22','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit.',60,'D','Torchic','22','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-23','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Torchic','During a battle, the hot flame in its body increases. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power.',90,'D','Combusken','23','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-24','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Combusken','When facing a tough foe, it looses flames from its wrists. Its powerful legs let it jump clear over buildings.',170,'D','Blaziken','24','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-25','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Boiling blood, like magma, circulates through its body. It makes its dwelling place in volcanic caves.',130,'D','Heatran','25','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-26','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon lives in caves in volcanoes. The fire within the tuft on its head can reach 600 degrees Fahrenheit.',60,'D','Pansear','26','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-27','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Pansear','When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets.',100,'D','Simisear','27','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-28','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Darumaka','Anger has reignited its atrophied flame sac. This Pokémon spews fire everywhere as it rampages indiscriminately.',140,'D','Galarian Darmanitan','28','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-29','Uta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It protects itself with flame. Long years ago, people believed Larvesta had a nest on the sun.',70,'D','Larvesta','29','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-3','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The mushrooms, known as tochukaso, are controlling the bug. Even if the bug bugs the mushrooms, they tell it to bug off.',60,'D','Paras','3','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-30','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,'Larvesta','According to legends, it was hatched from a flaming cocoon to save people and Pokémon that were suffering from the cold.',120,'D','Volcarona','30','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-31','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,'Fletchling','Its speed right after takeoff already puts it in the top speed class of all bird Pokémon.',70,'D','Fletchinder','31','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-32','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,'Fletchinder','Bird Pokémon make up most of its diet. It approaches at high speeds and smacks them down to the ground with its powerful kick.',140,'D','Talonflame','32','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-33','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Centiskorch V','33','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-34','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Centiskorch V',NULL,320,'D','Centiskorch VMAX','34','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh3-35','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its talent is tap-dancing. It can also manipulate temperatures to create a floor of ice, which this Pokémon can kick up to use as a barrier.',80,'D','Galarian Mr. Mime','35','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-36','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Mr. Mime','It\'s highly skilled at tap-dancing. It waves its cane of ice in time with its graceful movements.',120,'D','Galarian Mr. Rime','36','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-37','so-taro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Said to be the embodiment of north winds, it can instantly purify filthy, murky water.',120,'D','Suicune','37','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-38','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although unattractive and unpopular, this Pokémon\'s marvelous vitality has made it a subject of research.',30,'D','Feebas','38','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-39','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,'Feebas','Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all.',120,'D','Milotic','39','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-4','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Paras','The bug is mostly dead, with the mushroom on its back having become the main body. If the mushroom comes off, the bug stops moving.',120,'D','Parasect','4','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-40','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The reason it hasn\'t changed at all in a hundred million years is that it\'s apparently already a perfect life-form.',90,'D','Relicanth','40','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-41','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large.',60,'D','Panpour','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-42','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,'Panpour','It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail.',100,'D','Simipour','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-43','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It lived in snowy areas for so long that its fire sac cooled off and atrophied. It now has an organ that generates cold instead.',70,'D','Galarian Darumaka','43','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-44','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Darumaka','On days when blizzards blow through, it comes down to where people live. It stashes food in the snowball on its head, taking it home for later.',140,'D','Galarian Darmanitan','44','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-45','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Unable to survive in hot areas, it makes itself comfortable by breathing out air cold enough to cause snow. It burrows into the snow to sleep.',60,'D','Vanillite','45','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-46','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,'Vanillite','By drinking pure water, it grows its icy body. This Pokémon can be hard to find on days with warm, sunny weather.',80,'D','Vanillish','46','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-47','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Vanillish','When its anger reaches a breaking point, this Pokémon unleashes a fierce blizzard that freezes every creature around it, be they friend or foe.',150,'D','Vanilluxe','47','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-48','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When this Pokémon is in good health, its snot becomes thicker and stickier. It will smear its snot on anyone it doesn\'t like.',70,'D','Cubchoo','48','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-49','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Cubchoo','It swims through frigid seas, searching for prey. From its frozen breath, it forms icy fangs that are harder than steel.',140,'D','Beartic','49','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-5','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down.',90,'D','Carnivine','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-50','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Individually, they\'re incredibly weak. It\'s by gathering up into schools that they\'re able to confront opponents.',30,'D','Wishiwashi','50','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-51','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The first symptom of its sting is numbness. The next is an itching sensation so intense that it\'s impossible to resist the urge to claw at your skin.',70,'D','Mareanie','51','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-52','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Mareanie','To survive in the cold waters of Galar, this Pokémon forms a dome with its legs, enclosing its body so it can capture its own body heat.',130,'D','Toxapex','52','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-53','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,3,'Rare Fossil','Powerful legs and jaws made it the apex predator of its time. Its own overhunting of its prey was what drove it to extinction.',150,'D','Dracovish','53','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-54','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Rare Fossil','Though it\'s able to capture prey by freezing its surroundings, it has trouble eating the prey afterward because its mouth is on top of its head.',150,'D','Arctovish','54','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-55','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. You\'ll want to pet it because it\'s cute, but if you use your bare hand, you\'ll get a painful shock.',60,'D','Mareep','55','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-56','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Mareep','It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches.',90,'D','Flaaffy','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-57','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Flaaffy','Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors.',150,'D','Ampharos','57','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-58','Yumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches.',60,'D','Electrike','58','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-59','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Electrike','It stimulates its own muscles with electricity, so it can move quickly. It eases its soreness with electricity, too, so it can recover quickly as well.',110,'D','Manectric','59','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-6','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It\'s kind enough to share them with friends.',60,'D','Pansage','6','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-60','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Vikavolt V','60','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-61','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'The lightning-wielding guardian deity of Melemele, Tapu Koko is brimming with curiosity and appears before people from time to time.',110,'D','Tapu Koko','61','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-62','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It stores poison in an internal poison sac and secretes that poison through its skin. If you touch this Pokémon, a tingling sensation follows.',70,'D','Toxel','62','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-63','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel','Capable of generating 15,000 volts of electricity, this Pokémon looks down on all that would challenge it.',120,'D','Toxtricity','63','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-64','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.',80,'D','Pincurchin','64','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-65','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,4,'Rare Fossil','In ancient times, it was unbeatable thanks to its powerful lower body, but it went extinct anyway after it depleted all its plant-based food sources.',160,'D','Dracozolt','65','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-66','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,2,'Rare Fossil','The shaking of its freezing upper half is what generates its electricity. It has a hard time walking around.',130,'D','Arctozolt','66','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-67','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The songs they sing are totally different depending on the region they live in. Some even sound like they\'re shouting!',70,'D','Jigglypuff','67','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-68','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,2,'Jigglypuff','When it gets angry, it inhales with all its might, and its body gradually inflates. Sometimes they can grow 20 times larger!',120,'D','Wigglytuff','68','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-69','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Mew V','69','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-7','Hasegawa Saki',NULL,NULL,1,'Pansage','Ill tempered, it fights by swinging its barbed tail around wildly. The leaf growing on its head is very bitter.',100,'D','Simisage','7','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-70','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'In contrast to its appearance, it\'s quite timid. When playing with other puppy Pokémon, it sometimes gets bullied.',80,'D','Snubbull','70','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-71','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,'Snubbull','Although it\'s popular with young people, Granbull is timid and sensitive, so it\'s totally incompetent as a watchdog.',130,'D','Granbull','71','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-72','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It\'s active on the night of a full moon.',90,'D','Lunatone','72','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-73','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Though they\'re still only babies, there\'s psychic power stored in their ribbonlike feelers, and sometimes they use that power to fight.',60,'D','Gothita','73','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-74','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,'Gothita','It\'s said that when stars shine in the night sky, this Pokémon will spirit away sleeping children. Some call it the Witch of Punishment.',80,'D','Gothorita','74','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-75','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Gothorita','It has tremendous psychic power, but it dislikes conflict. It\'s also able to predict the future based on the movement of the stars.',140,'D','Gothitelle','75','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-76','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'They were sculpted from clay in ancient times. No one knows why, but some of them are driven to continually line up boulders.',90,'D','Golett','76','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-77','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,4,'Golett','Artillery platforms built into the walls of ancient castles served as perches from which Golurk could fire energy beams.',150,'D','Golurk','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-78','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its upper whiskers are sensors that survey its surroundings. Its lower whiskers are organs that shoot electricity.',70,'D','Dedenne','78','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-79','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Pokémon living in the forest eat the delicious caps on Morelull\'s head. The caps regrow overnight.',60,'D','Morelull','79','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-8','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its strange physiology reacts to electrical energy in interesting ways. The presence of a Shelmet will cause this Pokémon to evolve.',60,'D','Karrablast','8','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-80','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,'Morelull','Its flickering spores lure in prey and put them to sleep. Once this Pokémon has its prey snoozing, it drains their vitality with its fingertips.',110,'D','Shiinotic','80','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-81','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It wears a rag fashioned into a Pikachu costume in an effort to look less scary. Unfortunately, the costume only makes it creepier.',70,'D','Mimikyu','81','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-82','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is said to have been born when a lonely spirit possessed a cold, leftover cup of tea.',30,'D','Sinistea','82','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-83','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Sinistea','This species lives in antique teapots. Most pots are forgeries, but on rare occasions, an authentic work is found.',60,'D','Polteageist','83','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-84','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If a Diglett digs through a field, it leaves the soil perfectly tilled and ideal for planting crops.',50,'D','Diglett','84','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-85','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,'Diglett','A team of Diglett triplets. It triggers huge earthquakes by burrowing 60 miles underground.',90,'D','Dugtrio','85','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-86','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil.',70,'D','Larvitar','86','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-87','Sekio',NULL,NULL,3,'Larvitar','Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power.',80,'D','Pupitar','87','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-88','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,4,'Pupitar','Its body can\'t be harmed by any sort of attack, so it is very eager to make challenges against enemies.',180,'D','Tyranitar','88','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh3-89','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape.',60,'D','Trapinch','89','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-9','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When attacked, it tightly shuts the lid of its shell. This reaction fails to protect it from Karrablast, however, because they can still get into the shell.',70,'D','Shelmet','9','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-90','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Trapinch','The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches.',80,'D','Vibrava','90','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-91','hatachu',NULL,NULL,1,'Vibrava','This Pokémon hides in the heart of sandstorms it creates and seldom appears where people can see it.',150,'D','Flygon','91','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-92','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.',90,'D','Solrock','92','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh3-93','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It moves through the sands with its mouth open, swallowing sand along with its prey. It gets rid of the sand by spouting it from its nose.',100,'D','Hippopotas','93','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-94','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,4,'Hippopotas','Stones can get stuck in the ports on their bodies. Dwebble help dislodge such stones, so Hippowdon look after these Pokémon.',150,'D','Hippowdon','94','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-95','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,230,'D','Rhyperior V','95','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh3-96','0313',NULL,NULL,3,'Bunnelby','With power equal to an excavator, it can dig through dense bedrock. It\'s a huge help during tunnel construction.',130,'D','Diggersby','96','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-97','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Displaying amazing teamwork, they follow the orders of their boss as they all help out in the search for their favorite berries.',110,'D','Passimian','97','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh3-98','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Farfetch\'d','Only Farfetch\'d that have survived many battles can attain this evolution. When this Pokémon\'s leek withers, it will retire from combat.',130,'D','Galarian Sirfetch\'d','98','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh3-99','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Galarian Slowbro V','99','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-1','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Venusaur V','1','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-10','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,'Sizzlipede','When it heats up, its body temperature reaches about 1,500 degrees Fahrenheit. It lashes its body like a whip and launches itself at enemies.',130,'D','Centiskorch','10','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-11','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its sturdy jaws and fangs, it can easily chomp wooden boats to splinters. It fights with Basculin over food.',60,'D','Carvanha','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-12','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,1,'Carvanha','It drinks in seawater and jets it from its rear to propel itself. It\'s very sensitive to the scent of blood.',110,'D','Sharpedo','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-13','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,280,'D','Wailord V','13','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-14','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Drednaw V','14','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-15','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,4,'Drednaw V',NULL,320,'D','Drednaw VMAX','15','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh35-16','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Gardevoir V','16','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-17','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Gardevoir V',NULL,320,'D','Gardevoir VMAX','17','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh35-18','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Via the protrusion on its head, it senses other creatures\' emotions. If you don\'t have a calm disposition, it will never warm up to you.',60,'D','Hatenna','18','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-19','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,2,'Hatenna','No matter who you are, if you bring strong emotions near this Pokémon, it will silence you violently.',90,'D','Hattrem','19','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-2','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its poison stinger is very powerful. Its bright-colored body is intended to warn off its enemies.',60,'D','Weedle','2','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-20','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,'Hattrem','It emits psychic power strong enough to cause headaches as a deterrent to the approach of others.',150,'D','Hatterene','20','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-21','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,'D','Galarian Cursola V','21','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-22','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,'D','Alcremie V','22','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-23','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Alcremie V',NULL,310,'D','Alcremie VMAX','23','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh35-24','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its whole body is composed of muscles. Even though it\'s the size of a human child, it can hurl 100 grown-ups.',70,'D','Machop','24','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-25','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,3,'Machop','Its muscular body is so powerful, it must wear a power-save belt to be able to regulate its motions.',110,'D','Machoke','25','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-26','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Machoke','It quickly swings its four arms to rock its opponents with ceaseless punches and chops from all angles.',170,'D','Machamp','26','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-27','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Lucario V','27','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-28','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Some say it can change to an even more powerful form when battling those who threaten the ecosystem.',140,'D','Zygarde','28','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-29','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you, that\'s proof of its love for you. However, the rocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!',70,'D','Rockruff','29','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-3','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,3,'Weedle','While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.',80,'D','Kakuna','3','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-30','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','The rocks in its mane are sharper than a knife. Fragments that break off are treasured as good luck charms.',120,'D','Lycanroc','30','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-31','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Most of its body has the same composition as coal. Fittingly, this Pokémon was first discovered in coal mines about 400 years ago.',70,'D','Rolycoly','31','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-32','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Grapploct V','32','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-33','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The eggs of bird Pokémon are its favorite food. It swallows eggs whole, so sometimes an egg gets stuck, and Ekans faints.',70,'D','Ekans','33','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-34','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Ekans','After stunning its opponents with the pattern on its stomach, it quickly wraps them up in its body and waits for them to stop moving.',120,'D','Arbok','34','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-35','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its restlessness has it constantly running around. If it sees another Pokémon, it will purposely run into them in order to start a fight.',70,'D','Galarian Zigzagoon','35','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-36','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Zigzagoon','It uses its long tongue to taunt opponents. Once the opposition is enraged, this Pokémon hurls itself at the opponent, tackling them forcefully.',100,'D','Galarian Linoone','36','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-37','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Linoone','Its voice is staggering in volume. Obstagoon has a tendency to take on a threatening posture and shout—this move is known as Obstruct.',170,'D','Galarian Obstagoon','37','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-38','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise.',100,'D','Absol','38','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-39','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It steals things from people just to amuse itself with their frustration. A rivalry exists between this Pokémon and Nickit.',70,'D','Purrloin','39','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-4','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Kakuna','May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.',140,'D','Beedrill','4','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-40','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Purrloin','Don\'t be fooled by its gorgeous fur and elegant figure. This is a moody and vicious Pokémon.',100,'D','Liepard','40','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-41','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it locks eyes with you, watch out! Nothing and no one is safe from the reckless headbutts of this troublesome Pokémon.',70,'D','Scraggy','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-42','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Scraggy','As halfhearted as this Pokémon\'s kicks may seem, they pack enough power to shatter Conkeldurr\'s concrete pillars.',120,'D','Scrafty','42','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-43','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room.',60,'D','Trubbish','43','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-44','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It spins while making its luminescent spots flash. These spots allow it to communicate with others by using different patterns of light.',60,'D','Inkay','44','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-45','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,'Inkay','Gazing at its luminescent spots will quickly induce a hypnotic state, putting the observer under Malamar\'s control.',120,'D','Malamar','45','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-46','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon. It survives off its ill-gotten gains.',70,'D','Nickit','46','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-47','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Duraludon V','47','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-48','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.',50,'D','Swablu','48','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-49','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Swablu','On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.',110,'D','Altaria','49','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh35-5','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Eldegoss V','5','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-50','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bede','50','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-51','Yoshinobu Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Full Heal','51','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-52','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Great Ball','52','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-53','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Hop','53','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-54','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Hyper Potion','54','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-55','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Kabu','55','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-56','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Marnie','56','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh35-57','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Milo','57','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-58','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Piers','58','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-59','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Poké Ball','59','Common','Trainer'),('swsh35-6','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While young, it has six gorgeous tails. When it grows, several new tails are sprouted.',60,'D','Vulpix','6','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh35-60','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Pokémon Center Lady','60','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-61','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Potion','61','Common','Trainer'),('swsh35-62','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Professor\'s Research (Professor Magnolia)','62','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh35-63','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rotom Bike','63','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-64','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rotom Phone','64','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-65','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Sonia','65','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-66','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Suspicious Food Tin','66','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-67','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Team Yell Grunt','67','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-68','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Turffield Stadium','68','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh35-69','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Drednaw V','69','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh35-7','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being\'s entire body will be overflowing with power.',70,'D','Victini','7','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh35-70','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Gardevoir V','70','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh35-71','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,'D','Galarian Cursola V','71','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh35-72','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Grapploct V','72','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh35-73','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Hop','73','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh35-74','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,'Charizard V',NULL,330,'D','Charizard VMAX','74','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh35-75','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,4,'Drednaw V',NULL,320,'D','Drednaw VMAX','75','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh35-76','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Gardevoir V',NULL,320,'D','Gardevoir VMAX','76','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh35-77','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Kabu','77','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh35-78','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Piers','78','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh35-79','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Charizard V','79','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh35-8','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Incineroar V','8','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh35-80','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Suspicious Food Tin','80','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh35-9','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores flammable gas in its body and uses it to generate heat. The yellow sections on its belly get particularly hot.',70,'D','Sizzlipede','9','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-1','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its poison stinger is very powerful. Its bright-colored body is intended to warn off its enemies.',40,'D','Weedle','1','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-10','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it remains still, it looks just like a real nut. It delights in surprising foraging Pokémon.',60,'D','Seedot','10','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-100','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s very curious, but its means of investigating things is to try to punch them with its tentacles. The search for food is what brings it onto land.',80,'D','Clobbopus','100','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-101','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,2,'Clobbopus','A body made up of nothing but muscle makes the grappling moves this Pokémon performs with its tentacles tremendously powerful.',130,'D','Grapploct','101','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-102','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its ability to deflect any attack led to it being known as the Fighting Master\'s Shield. It was feared and respected by all.',110,'D','Zamazenta','102','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-103','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.',70,'D','Poochyena','103','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-104','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,'Poochyena','It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.',110,'D','Mightyena','104','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-105','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is feared. When its gemstone eyes begin to glow with a sinister shine, it\'s believed that Sableye will steal people\'s spirits away.',70,'D','Sableye','105','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-106','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Drapion V','106','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-107','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Sandile\'s still not good at hunting, so it mostly eats things that have collapsed in the desert. It\'s called \"the cleaner of the desert.\"',70,'D','Sandile','107','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-108','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,'Sandile','It buries some of its prey in the sand to use as emergency meals when its hunts are unsuccessful.',90,'D','Krokorok','108','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-109','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,'Krokorok','It conceals itself in sandstorms that Flygon whip up and waits patiently for prey to appear.',150,'D','Krookodile','109','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-11','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,'Seedot','It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy.',80,'D','Nuzleaf','11','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-110','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room.',70,'D','Trubbish','110','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-111','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,3,'Trubbish','This Pokémon eats trash, which turns into poison inside its body. The main component of the poison depends on what sort of trash was eaten.',120,'D','Garbodor','111','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-112','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémon\'s body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.',70,'D','Galarian Meowth','112','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-113','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Meowth','What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.',120,'D','Galarian Perrserker','113','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-114','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,3,'Pineco','In the moment that it gulps down its prey, the inside of its shell is exposed, but to this day, no one has ever seen that sight.',120,'D','Forretress','114','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-115','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,250,'D','Steelix V','115','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-116','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'If you anger it, it will do more than rampage. It will also burst out strong magnetism, causing nearby machines to break.',70,'D','Beldum','116','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-117','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,3,'Beldum','It flies at high speeds around the skies. When it finds its prey, Metang takes a firm grip with its sharp claws and never lets go.',100,'D','Metang','117','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-118','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,'Metang','It analyzes its opponents with more accuracy than a supercomputer, which enables it to calmly back them into a corner.',170,'D','Metagross','118','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-119','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Once every 1,000 years, the singing of a pure voice will rouse this Pokémon from its near-perpetual slumber. It wakes for only seven days.',70,'D','Jirachi','119','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-12','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,'Nuzleaf','A Pokémon that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe\'s mind and take preemptive action.',150,'D','Shiftry','12','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-120','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Riolu','It controls waves known as auras, which are powerful enough to pulverize huge rocks. It uses these waves to take down its prey.',130,'D','Lucario','120','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-121','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has the power to control time. It appears in Sinnoh-region myths as an ancient deity.',130,'D','Dialga','121','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-122','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Drilbur','It\'s not uncommon for tunnels that appear to have formed naturally to actually be a result of Excadrill\'s rampant digging.',130,'D','Excadrill','122','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-123','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It defends itself by launching spikes, but its aim isn\'t very good at first. Only after a lot of practice will it improve.',60,'D','Ferroseed','123','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-124','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,3,'Ferroseed','This Pokémon scrapes its spikes across rocks, and then uses the tips of its feelers to absorb the nutrients it finds within the stone.',110,'D','Ferrothorn','124','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-125','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Living in mud with a high iron content has given it a strong steel body.',120,'D','Galarian Stunfisk','125','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-126','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Aegislash V','126','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-127','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,'Aegislash V',NULL,320,'D','Aegislash VMAX','127','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh4-128','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Built roughly 500 years ago by a scientist, the part called the Soul-Heart is the actual life-form.',90,'D','Magearna','128','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-129','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its body resembles polished metal, and it\'s both lightweight and strong. The only drawback is that it rusts easily.',130,'D','Duraludon','129','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-13','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead.',40,'D','Nincada','13','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-130','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has the ability to alter the composition of its body to suit its surrounding environment.',70,'D','Eevee','130','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-131','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.',130,'D','Snorlax','131','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-132','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm.',130,'D','Lugia','132','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-133','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It dislikes cold seasons. They migrate to other lands in search of warmth, flying over 180 miles a day.',60,'D','Taillow','133','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-134','kodama',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Taillow','It dives at a steep angle as soon as it spots its prey. It catches its prey with sharp claws.',90,'D','Swellow','134','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-135','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it senses danger, it scares the foe by crying out with the volume of a jet-plane engine.',60,'D','Whismur','135','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-136','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,'Whismur','The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.',100,'D','Loudred','136','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-137','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,3,'Loudred','Its roar in battle shakes the ground like a tremor—or like an earthquake has struck.',160,'D','Exploud','137','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-138','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It flies in the ozone layer, way up high in the sky. Until recently, no one had ever seen it.',120,'D','Rayquaza','138','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-139','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying.',70,'D','Chatot','139','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-14','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nincada','Its cry leaves a lasting headache if heard for too long. It moves so quickly that it is almost invisible.',60,'D','Ninjask','14','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-140','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Togekiss V','140','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-141','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Togekiss V',NULL,310,'D','Togekiss VMAX','141','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh4-142','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Tornadus expels massive energy from its tail, causing severe storms. Its power is great enough to blow houses away.',120,'D','Tornadus','142','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-143','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It may look spindly, but its neck muscles are heavy-duty. It can peck at a tree 16 times per second!',60,'D','Pikipek','143','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-144','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,'Pikipek','From its mouth, it fires the seeds of berries it has eaten. The scattered seeds give rise to new plants.',80,'D','Trumbeak','144','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-145','Sekio',NULL,NULL,2,'Trumbeak','Known for forming harmonious couples, this Pokémon is brought to wedding ceremonies as a good luck charm.',150,'D','Toucannon','145','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-146','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Allister','146','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-147','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bea','147','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-148','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Beauty','148','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-149','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Cara Liss','149','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-15','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers.',70,'D','Shaymin','15','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-150','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Circhester Bath','150','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-151','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Drone Rotom','151','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-152','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Hero\'s Medal','152','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-153','Emi Ando',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','League Staff','153','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-154','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Leon','154','Rare Holo','Trainer'),('swsh4-155','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Memory Capsule','155','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-156','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Moomoo Cheese','156','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-157','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Nessa','157','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-158','take',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Opal','158','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-159','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rocky Helmet','159','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh4-16','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back.',120,'D','Genesect','16','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-160','Toy