-192','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Allister','192','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh4-193','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bea','193','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh4-194','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Beauty','194','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh4-195','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Leon','195','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh4-196','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Nessa','196','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh4-197','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Opal','197','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh4-198','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Linoone','It evolved after experiencing numerous fights. While crossing its arms, it lets out a shout that would make any opponent flinch.',160,'D','Galarian Obstagoon','198','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh4-199','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It knows the forest inside and out. If it comes across a wounded Pokémon, Oranguru will gather medicinal herbs to treat it.',120,'D','Oranguru','199','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh4-2','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,3,'Weedle','While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.',80,'D','Kakuna','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-20','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Orbeetle V','20','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-200','inose yukie',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Cape of Toughness','200','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh4-201','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Hero\'s Medal','201','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh4-202','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Memory Capsule','202','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh4-203','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Telescopic Sight','203','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh4-21','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Orbeetle V',NULL,310,'D','Orbeetle VMAX','21','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh4-22','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Zarude V','22','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-23','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a preference for hot things. When it rains, steam is said to spout from the tip of its tail.',70,'D','Charmander','23','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-24','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,'Charmander','It has a barbaric nature. In battle, it whips its fiery tail around and slashes away with sharp claws.',90,'D','Charmeleon','24','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-25','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,'Charmeleon','It spits fire that is hot enough to melt boulders. It may cause forest fires by blowing flames.',170,'D','Charizard','25','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-26','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','Once it has stored up enough heat, this Pokémon\'s body temperature can reach up to 1,700 degrees Fahrenheit.',110,'D','Flareon','26','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-27','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its body is made of magma. If it doesn\'t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.',70,'D','Slugma','27','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-28','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Slugma','Its body is as hot as lava and is always billowing. Flames will occasionally burst from its shell.',130,'D','Magcargo','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-29','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,190,'D','Talonflame V','29','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-3','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Kakuna','May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.',130,'D','Beedrill','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-30','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','When Vaporeon\'s fins begin to vibrate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours.',110,'D','Vaporeon','30','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-31','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It shows off by spraying jets of seawater from the nostrils above its eyes. It eats a solid ton of Wishiwashi every day.',100,'D','Wailmer','31','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-32','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,4,'Wailmer','It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.',200,'D','Wailord','32','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-33','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing.',70,'D','Oshawott','33','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-34','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,2,'Oshawott','As a result of strict training, each Dewott learns different forms for using the scalchops.',90,'D','Dewott','34','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-35','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Dewott','One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody.',160,'D','Samurott','35','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-36','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Galarian Darmanitan V','36','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-37','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Darmanitan V',NULL,320,'D','Galarian Darmanitan VMAX','37','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh4-38','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Apparently the itch of its teething impels it to snap its jaws at anything in front of it.',80,'D','Chewtle','38','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-39','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,4,'Chewtle','With jaws that can shear through steel rods, this highly aggressive Pokémon chomps down on its unfortunate prey.',140,'D','Drednaw','39','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-4','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Six of them form a single Pokémon. Should one of the six be lost, the next morning there will once more be six.',60,'D','Exeggcute','4','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-40','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Cramorant\'s gluttony led it to try to swallow an Arrokuda whole, which in turn led to Cramorant getting an Arrokuda stuck in its throat.',110,'D','Cramorant','40','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-41','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it sees any movement around it, this Pokémon charges for it straightaway, leading with its sharply pointed jaw. It\'s very proud of that jaw.',60,'D','Arrokuda','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-42','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,'Arrokuda','This Pokémon has a jaw that\'s as sharp as a spear and as strong as steel. Apparently Barraskewda\'s flesh is surprisingly tasty, too.',120,'D','Barraskewda','42','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-43','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'D','Pikachu V','43','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-44','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,'Pikachu V',NULL,310,'D','Pikachu VMAX','44','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh4-45','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a Poké Ball, it has zapped many people.',60,'D','Voltorb','45','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-46','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Voltorb','It stores an overflowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode.',90,'D','Electrode','46','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-47','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee','If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes.',100,'D','Jolteon','47','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-48','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.',110,'D','Zapdos','48','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-49','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Ampharos V','49','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-5','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,3,'Exeggcute','Each of its three heads has its own thoughts. When they want to go in different directions, Exeggutor becomes unable to move.',140,'D','Exeggutor','5','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-50','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This rough Pokémon stores energy inside its body, then sweeps across the land, shooting off electricity.',110,'D','Raikou','50','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-51','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches.',60,'D','Electrike','51','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-52','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Electrike','It stimulates its own muscles with electricity, so it can move quickly. It eases its soreness with electricity, too, so it can recover quickly as well.',120,'D','Manectric','52','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-53','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.',60,'D','Blitzle','53','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-54','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Blitzle','They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.',110,'D','Zebstrika','54','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-55','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Joltik can be found clinging to other Pokémon. It\'s soaking up static electricity because it can\'t produce a charge on its own.',40,'D','Joltik','55','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-56','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,'Joltik','It launches electrified fur from its abdomen as its means of attack. Opponents hit by the fur could be in for three full days and nights of paralysis.',90,'D','Galvantula','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-57','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'One alone can emit only trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock.',40,'D','Tynamo','57','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-58','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Tynamo','These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.',90,'D','Eelektrik','58','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-59','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,'Eelektrik','They crawl out of the ocean using their arms. They will attack prey on shore and immediately drag it into the ocean.',160,'D','Eelektross','59','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-6','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area.',80,'D','Yanma','6','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-60','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When the interior part of its tail spins like a motor, Zekrom can generate many bolts of lightning to blast its surroundings.',130,'D','Zekrom','60','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-61','so-taro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It runs as fast as lightning strikes, shredding its opponents with its high-voltage claws.',100,'D','Zeraora','61','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-62','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.',80,'D','Pincurchin','62','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-63','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.',60,'D','Clefairy','63','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-64','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,'Clefairy','A timid fairy Pokémon that is rarely seen, it will run and hide the moment it senses people.',100,'D','Clefable','64','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-65','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting.',90,'D','Girafarig','65','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-66','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A most peculiar Pokémon that somehow appears in a Poké Ball when a Nincada evolves.',30,'D','Shedinja','66','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-67','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'There\'s a proverb that says, \"Shun the house where Shuppet gather in the growing dusk.\"',60,'D','Shuppet','67','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-68','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Shuppet','Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy.',90,'D','Banette','68','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-69','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it finds bad children who won\'t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away—or so it\'s said.',60,'D','Duskull','69','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-7','Uta',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yanma','This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced.',130,'D','Yanmega','7','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-70','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,2,'Duskull','Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.',90,'D','Dusclops','70','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-71','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,'Dusclops','At the bidding of transmissions from the spirit world, it steals people and Pokémon away. No one knows whether it has a will of its own.',150,'D','Dusknoir','71','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-72','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.',70,'D','Chimecho','72','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-73','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'While inside a cave, if you look up and see lots of heart-shaped marks lining the walls, it\'s evidence that Woobat live there.',60,'D','Woobat','73','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-74','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Woobat','Emitting powerful sound waves tires it out. Afterward, it won\'t be able to fly for a little while.',100,'D','Swoobat','74','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-75','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It shoots cotton from its body to protect itself. If it gets caught up in hurricane-strength winds, it can get sent to the other side of the Earth.',60,'D','Cottonee','75','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-76','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cottonee','It scatters cotton all over the place as a prank. If it gets wet, it\'ll become too heavy to move and have no choice but to answer for its mischief.',90,'D','Whimsicott','76','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-77','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its upper whiskers are sensors that survey its surroundings. Its lower whiskers are organs that shoot electricity.',70,'D','Dedenne','77','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-78','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When the horns on its head shine in seven different colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life.',130,'D','Xerneas','78','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-79','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.',90,'D','Diancie','79','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-8','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It sticks tree bark to itself with its saliva, making itself thicker and larger. Elderly Pineco are ridiculously huge.',60,'D','Pineco','8','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-80','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon was born from sweet-smelling particles in the air. Its body is made of cream.',50,'D','Milcery','80','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-81','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Milcery','When it trusts a Trainer, it will treat them to berries it\'s decorated with cream.',90,'D','Alcremie','81','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-82','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Now armed with a weapon it used in ancient times, this Pokémon needs only a single strike to fell even Gigantamax Pokémon.',110,'D','Zacian','82','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-83','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon lives in cold water. It will leave the water to search for food when it gets cold outside.',70,'D','Wooper','83','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-84','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,'Wooper','It has an easygoing nature. It doesn\'t care if it bumps its head on boats and boulders while swimming.',120,'D','Quagsire','84','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-85','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores berries inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still.',70,'D','Shuckle','85','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-86','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.',70,'D','Phanpy','86','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-87','Hasegawa Saki',NULL,NULL,4,'Phanpy','The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow.',150,'D','Donphan','87','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-88','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It launches kicks while spinning. If it spins at high speed, it may bore its way into the ground.',90,'D','Hitmontop','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh4-89','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world.',130,'D','Regirock','89','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-9','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon has the ability to move through time. Records describing it as a forest deity can be found from many different eras.',60,'D','Celebi','9','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-90','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience.',70,'D','Riolu','90','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-91','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It brings its claws together and whirls around at high speed before rushing toward its prey.',70,'D','Drilbur','91','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-92','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It has phenomenal power. It will mercilessly crush anyone or anything that bullies small Pokémon.',140,'D','Terrakion','92','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-93','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'Born when all of Zygarde\'s cells have been gathered together, it uses force to neutralize those who harm the ecosystem.',150,'D','Zygarde','93','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh4-94','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you, that\'s proof of its love for you. However, the rocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!',70,'D','Rockruff','94','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-95','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','They live alone without forming packs. They will only listen to orders from Trainers who can draw out their true power.',120,'D','Lycanroc','95','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-96','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Loads weighing up to 50 times as much as its own body weight pose no issue for this Pokémon. It\'s skilled at making use of mud.',80,'D','Mudbray','96','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh4-97','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,'Mudbray','Mud that hardens around a Mudsdale\'s legs sets harder than stone. It\'s so hard that it allows this Pokémon to scrap a truck with a single kick.',140,'D','Mudsdale','97','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh4-98','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Coalossal V','98','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh4-99','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Coalossal V',NULL,330,'D','Coalossal VMAX','99','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45-1','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area.',80,'E','Yanma','1','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-10','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Dhelmise V',NULL,330,'D','Dhelmise VMAX','10','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45-11','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it uses its special stick to strike up a beat, the sound waves produced carry revitalizing energy to the plants and flowers in the area.',60,'D','Grookey','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-12','0313',NULL,NULL,2,'Grookey','The faster a Thwackey can beat out a rhythm with its two sticks, the more respect it wins from its peers.',90,'D','Thwackey','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-13','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Thwackey','By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.',170,'D','Rillaboom','13','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh45-14','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It whirls around in the wind while singing a joyous song. This delightful display has charmed many into raising this Pokémon.',60,'E','Gossifleur','14','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-15','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Gossifleur','The cotton on the head of this Pokémon can be spun into a glossy, gorgeous yarn—a Galar regional specialty.',90,'E','Eldegoss','15','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-16','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Once the vines on Zarude\'s body tear off, they become nutrients in the soil. This helps the plants of the forest grow.',120,'E','Zarude','16','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-17','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When Reshiram\'s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world\'s weather.',120,'D','Reshiram','17','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-18','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Cinderace V','18','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45-19','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Cinderace V',NULL,320,'D','Cinderace VMAX','19','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45-2','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yanma','This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced.',120,'E','Yanmega','2','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-20','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.',40,'E','Horsea','20','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-21','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.',120,'D','Kyogre','21','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-22','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It inflates the flotation sac around its neck and pokes its head out of the water to see what is going on.',70,'E','Buizel','22','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-23','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Buizel','Its flotation sac developed as a result of pursuing aquatic prey. It can double as a rubber raft.',110,'E','Floatzel','23','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-24','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It starts its life with a wondrous power that permits it to bond with any kind of Pokémon.',70,'E','Manaphy','24','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-25','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain.',130,'E','Volcanion','25','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-26','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard horn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this Pokémon bites down and never lets go.',80,'E','Chewtle','26','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-27','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Chewtle','This Pokémon rapidly extends its retractable neck to sink its sharp fangs into distant enemies and take them down.',140,'E','Drednaw','27','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-28','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This hungry Pokémon swallows Arrokuda whole. Occasionally, it makes a mistake and tries to swallow a Pokémon other than its preferred prey.',90,'E','Cramorant','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-29','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It spits out thread imbued with a frigid sort of energy and uses it to tie its body to branches, disguising itself as an icicle while it sleeps.',50,'D','Snom','29','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-3','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.',70,'E','Celebi','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-30','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Snom','It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.',90,'D','Frosmoth','30','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh45-31','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.',60,'D','Shinx','31','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-32','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,'Shinx','Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.',90,'D','Luxio','32','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-33','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Luxio','Luxray\'s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it\'s scouting for danger.',160,'D','Luxray','33','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh45-34','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'One boy\'s invention led to the development of many different machines that take advantage of Rotom\'s unique capabilities.',80,'D','Rotom','34','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-35','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its constant hunger. It\'s also generating electricity.',80,'D','Morpeko','35','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-36','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its constant hunger. It\'s also generating electricity.',80,'D','Morpeko','36','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-37','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,'D','Morpeko V','37','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45-38','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,'Morpeko V',NULL,300,'D','Morpeko VMAX','38','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45-39','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Indeedee V','39','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45-4','Uta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body.',70,'E','Cacnea','4','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-40','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape.',60,'D','Trapinch','40','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-41','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is full of poisonous gas. It floats into garbage dumps, seeking out the fumes of raw, rotting trash.',60,'D','Koffing','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-42','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Koffing','This Pokémon consumes particles that contaminate the air. Instead of leaving droppings, it expels clean air.',130,'D','Galarian Weezing','42','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh45-43','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although the poison from its fangs isn\'t that strong, it\'s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web.',60,'D','Spinarak','43','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-44','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Crobat V','44','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45-45','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,1,'Crobat V',NULL,300,'D','Crobat VMAX','45','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45-46','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.',110,'D','Yveltal','46','Amazing Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh45-47','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon. It survives off its ill-gotten gains.',70,'D','Nickit','47','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-48','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Nickit','It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.',100,'D','Thievul','48','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh45-49','0313',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It digs up the ground with its trunk. It\'s also very strong, being able to carry loads of over five tons without any problem at all.',100,'D','Cufant','49','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-5','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Bunches of delicious fruit grow around its neck. In warm areas, many ranches raise Tropius.',110,'E','Tropius','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-50','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,'D','Ditto V','50','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45-51','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,'Ditto V',NULL,320,'D','Ditto VMAX','51','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45-52','so-taro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has the ability to alter the composition of its body to suit its surrounding environment.',60,'D','Eevee','52','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-53','PLANETA Igarashi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Greedent V','53','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45-54','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'D','Cramorant V','54','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45-55','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Cramorant V',NULL,320,'D','Cramorant VMAX','55','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45-56','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses the horns on its head to sense the emotions of others. Males will act as valets for those they serve, looking after their every need.',100,'D','Indeedee','56','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh45-57','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Ball Guy','57','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh45-58','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Boss\'s Orders','58','Rare','Trainer'),('swsh45-59','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Gym Trainer','59','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh45-6','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'At a distance, it launches its sharp feathers while flying about. If the enemy gets too close, Rowlet switches tactics and delivers vicious kicks.',50,'D','Rowlet','6','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh45-60','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Professor\'s Research','60','Rare','Trainer'),('swsh45-61','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rusted Shield','61','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh45-62','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rusted Sword','62','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh45-63','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Team Yell Towel','63','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh45-64','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,'D','Alcremie V','64','Rare Ultra','Pokémon'),('swsh45-65','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Ball Guy','65','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-66','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Bird Keeper','66','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-67','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Cara Liss','67','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-68','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Gym Trainer','68','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-69','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Piers','69','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-7','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Rowlet','It throws one knifelike feather after another at its enemies, and each one precisely strikes a weak point. These feathers are known as blade quills.',80,'D','Dartrix','7','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh45-70','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Poké Kid','70','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-71','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Rose','71','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-72','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Skyla','72','Rare Ultra','Trainer'),('swsh45-73','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Alcremie V',NULL,310,'D','Alcremie VMAX','73','Rare Rainbow','Pokémon'),('swsh45-8','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Dartrix','As if wielding a bow, it launches the arrow quills hidden among the feathers of its wings. Decidueye\'s shots never miss.',140,'D','Decidueye','8','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh45-9','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Dhelmise V','9','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV001','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'At a distance, it launches its sharp feathers while flying about. If the enemy gets too close, Rowlet switches tactics and delivers vicious kicks.',50,'D','Rowlet','SV001','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV002','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Rowlet','It throws one knifelike feather after another at its enemies, and each one precisely strikes a weak point. These feathers are known as blade quills.',80,'D','Dartrix','SV002','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV003','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,'Dartrix','As if wielding a bow, it launches the arrow quills hidden among the feathers of its wings. Decidueye\'s shots never miss.',140,'D','Decidueye','SV003','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV004','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it uses its special stick to strike up a beat, the sound waves produced carry revitalizing energy to the plants and flowers in the area.',60,'D','Grookey','SV004','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV005','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Grookey','The faster a Thwackey can beat out a rhythm with its two sticks, the more respect it wins from its peers.',90,'D','Thwackey','SV005','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV006','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,'Thwackey','By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.',170,'D','Rillaboom','SV006','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV007','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Often found in gardens, this Pokémon has hairs on its body that it uses to assess its surroundings.',50,'D','Blipbug','SV007','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV008','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Blipbug','As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.',70,'D','Dottler','SV008','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV009','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,'Dottler','It emits psychic energy to observe and study what\'s around it—and what\'s around it can include things over six miles away.',130,'D','Orbeetle','SV009','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV010','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It whirls around in the wind while singing a joyous song. This delightful display has charmed many into raising this Pokémon.',50,'D','Gossifleur','SV010','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV011','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Gossifleur','The cotton on the head of this Pokémon can be spun into a glossy, gorgeous yarn—a Galar regional specialty.',80,'D','Eldegoss','SV011','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV012','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It spends its entire life inside an apple. It hides from its natural enemies, bird Pokémon, by pretending it\'s just an apple and nothing more.',40,'D','Applin','SV012','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV013','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,'Applin','It ate a sour apple, and that induced its evolution. In its cheeks, it stores an acid capable of causing chemical burns.',80,'D','Flapple','SV013','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV014','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Applin','Eating a sweet apple caused its evolution. A nectarous scent wafts from its body, luring in the bug Pokémon it preys on.',90,'D','Appletun','SV014','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV015','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it\'s raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.',60,'D','Scorbunny','SV015','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV016','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,'Scorbunny','It kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork.',90,'D','Raboot','SV016','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV017','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,'Raboot','It\'s skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.',170,'D','Cinderace','SV017','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV018','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It stores flammable gas in its body and uses it to generate heat. The yellow sections on its belly get particularly hot.',70,'D','Sizzlipede','SV018','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV019','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,3,'Sizzlipede','When it heats up, its body temperature reaches about 1,500 degrees Fahrenheit. It lashes its body like a whip and launches itself at enemies.',130,'D','Centiskorch','SV019','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV020','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its talent is tap-dancing. It can also manipulate temperatures to create a floor of ice, which this Pokémon can kick up to use as a barrier.',80,'D','Galarian Mr. Mime','SV020','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV021','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Mr. Mime','It\'s highly skilled at tap-dancing. It waves its cane of ice in time with its graceful movements.',120,'D','Galarian Mr. Rime','SV021','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV022','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Said to be the embodiment of north winds, it can instantly purify filthy, murky water.',120,'D','Suicune','SV022','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV023','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It lived in snowy areas for so long that its fire sac cooled off and atrophied. It now has an organ that generates cold instead.',80,'D','Galarian Darumaka','SV023','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV024','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Darumaka','On days when blizzards blow through, it comes down to where people live. It stashes food in the snowball on its head, taking it home for later.',140,'D','Galarian Darmanitan','SV024','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV025','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When scared, this Pokémon cries. Its tears pack the chemical punch of 100 onions, and attackers won\'t be able to resist weeping.',60,'D','Sobble','SV025','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV026','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,1,'Sobble','A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles using water balloons created with moisture secreted from its palms.',90,'D','Drizzile','SV026','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV027','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Drizzile','It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips that can shoot water and a membrane on its back that it can use to glide through the air.',160,'D','Inteleon','SV027','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV028','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard horn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this Pokémon bites down and never lets go.',80,'D','Chewtle','SV028','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV029','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,3,'Chewtle','This Pokémon rapidly extends its retractable neck to sink its sharp fangs into distant enemies and take them down.',130,'D','Drednaw','SV029','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV030','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s so strong that it can knock out some opponents in a single hit, but it also may forget what it\'s battling midfight.',110,'D','Cramorant','SV030','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV031','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it sees any movement around it, this Pokémon charges for it straightaway, leading with its sharply pointed jaw. It\'s very proud of that jaw.',60,'D','Arrokuda','SV031','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV032','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,'Arrokuda','This Pokémon has a jaw that\'s as sharp as a spear and as strong as steel. Apparently Barraskewda\'s flesh is surprisingly tasty, too.',120,'D','Barraskewda','SV032','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV033','Yumi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It spits out thread imbued with a frigid sort of energy and uses it to tie its body to branches, disguising itself as an icicle while it sleeps.',50,'D','Snom','SV033','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV034','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Snom','It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.',90,'D','Frosmoth','SV034','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV035','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It drifted in on the flow of ocean waters from a frigid place. It keeps its head iced constantly to make sure it stays nice and cold.',120,'D','Eiscue','SV035','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV036','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,3,'Rare Fossil','Powerful legs and jaws made it the apex predator of its time. Its own overhunting of its prey was what drove it to extinction.',150,'D','Dracovish','SV036','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV037','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Rare Fossil','Though it\'s able to capture prey by freezing its surroundings, it has trouble eating the prey afterward because its mouth is on top of its head.',150,'D','Arctovish','SV037','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV038','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'One boy\'s invention led to the development of many different machines that take advantage of Rotom\'s unique capabilities.',80,'D','Rotom','SV038','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV039','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is very popular as a herding dog in the Galar region. As it runs, it generates electricity from the base of its tail.',70,'D','Yamper','SV039','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV040','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Yamper','This Pokémon generates electricity and channels it into its legs to keep them going strong. Boltund can run nonstop for three full days.',130,'D','Boltund','SV040','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV041','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It stores poison in an internal poison sac and secretes that poison through its skin. If you touch this Pokémon, a tingling sensation follows.',70,'D','Toxel','SV041','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV042','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel','When this Pokémon sounds as if it\'s strumming a guitar, it\'s actually clawing at the protrusions on its chest to generate electricity.',120,'D','Toxtricity','SV042','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV043','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.',80,'D','Pincurchin','SV043','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV044','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its constant hunger. It\'s also generating electricity.',80,'D','Morpeko','SV044','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV045','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,'Rare Fossil','In ancient times, it was unbeatable thanks to its powerful lower body, but it went extinct anyway after it depleted all its plant-based food sources.',160,'D','Dracozolt','SV045','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV046','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,'Rare Fossil','The shaking of its freezing upper half is what generates its electricity. It has a hard time walking around.',130,'D','Arctozolt','SV046','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV047','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon will look into your eyes and read the contents of your heart. If it finds evil there, it promptly hides away.',70,'D','Galarian Ponyta','SV047','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV048','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Galarian Ponyta','Brave and prideful, this Pokémon dashes airily through the forest, its steps aided by the psychic power stored in the fur on its fetlocks.',100,'D','Galarian Rapidash','SV048','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV049','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Watch your step when wandering areas oceans once covered. What looks like a stone could be this Pokémon, and it will curse you if you kick it.',80,'D','Galarian Corsola','SV049','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV050','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Corsola','Its shell is overflowing with its heightened otherworldly energy. The ectoplasm serves as protection for this Pokémon\'s core spirit.',100,'D','Galarian Cursola','SV050','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV051','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its upper whiskers are sensors that survey its surroundings. Its lower whiskers are organs that shoot electricity.',70,'D','Dedenne','SV051','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV052','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is said to have been born when a lonely spirit possessed a cold, leftover cup of tea.',30,'D','Sinistea','SV052','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV053','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,'Sinistea','This species lives in antique teapots. Most pots are forgeries, but on rare occasions, an authentic work is found.',60,'D','Polteageist','SV053','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV054','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Via the protrusion on its head, it senses other creatures\' emotions. If you don\'t have a calm disposition, it will never warm up to you.',60,'D','Hatenna','SV054','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV055','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,'Hatenna','No matter who you are, if you bring strong emotions near this Pokémon, it will silence you violently.',80,'D','Hattrem','SV055','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV056','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Hattrem','It emits psychic power strong enough to cause headaches as a deterrent to the approach of others.',150,'D','Hatterene','SV056','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV057','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon was born from sweet-smelling particles in the air. Its body is made of cream.',50,'D','Milcery','SV057','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV058','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,'Milcery','When it trusts a Trainer, it will treat them to berries it\'s decorated with cream.',110,'D','Alcremie','SV058','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV059','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'These intelligent Pokémon touch horns with each other to share information between them.',100,'D','Indeedee','SV059','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV060','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'After being reborn as a ghost Pokémon, Dreepy wanders the areas it used to inhabit back when it was alive in prehistoric seas.',60,'D','Dreepy','SV060','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV061','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,'Dreepy','It\'s capable of flying faster than 120 mph. It battles alongside Dreepy and dotes on them until they successfully evolve.',90,'D','Drakloak','SV061','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV062','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Drakloak','When it isn\'t battling, it keeps Dreepy in the holes on its horns. Once a fight starts, it launches the Dreepy like supersonic missiles.',150,'D','Dragapult','SV062','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV063','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The Farfetch\'d of the Galar region are brave warriors, and they wield thick, tough leeks in battle.',80,'D','Galarian Farfetch\'d','SV063','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV064','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Farfetch\'d','Only Farfetch\'d that have survived many battles can attain this evolution. When this Pokémon\'s leek withers, it will retire from combat.',130,'D','Galarian Sirfetch\'d','SV064','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV065','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A clay slab with cursed engravings took possession of a Yamask. The slab is said to be absorbing the Yamask\'s dark power.',70,'D','Galarian Yamask','SV065','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV066','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Yamask','A powerful curse was woven into an ancient painting. After absorbing the spirit of a Yamask, the painting began to move.',100,'D','Galarian Runerigus','SV066','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV067','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Most of its body has the same composition as coal. Fittingly, this Pokémon was first discovered in coal mines about 400 years ago.',70,'D','Rolycoly','SV067','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV068','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,'Rolycoly','It forms coal inside its body. Coal dropped by this Pokémon once helped fuel the lives of people in the Galar region.',100,'D','Carkol','SV068','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV069','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,4,'Carkol','It\'s usually peaceful, but the vandalism of mines enrages it. Offenders will be incinerated with flames that reach 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit.',160,'D','Coalossal','SV069','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV070','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It spews sand from its nostrils. While the enemy is blinded, it burrows into the ground to hide.',80,'D','Silicobra','SV070','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV071','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Silicobra','Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand out of its sand sac more efficiently.',140,'D','Sandaconda','SV071','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV072','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s very curious, but its means of investigating things is to try to punch them with its tentacles. The search for food is what brings it onto land.',60,'D','Clobbopus','SV072','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV073','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,2,'Clobbopus','A body made up of nothing but muscle makes the grappling moves this Pokémon performs with its tentacles tremendously powerful.',130,'D','Grapploct','SV073','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV074','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Five of them are troopers, and one is the brass. The brass\'s orders are absolute.',90,'D','Falinks','SV074','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV075','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It stands in grasslands, watching the sun\'s descent from zenith to horizon. This Pokémon has a talent for delivering dynamic kicks.',140,'D','Stonjourner','SV075','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV076','Yumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is full of poisonous gas. It floats into garbage dumps, seeking out the fumes of raw, rotting trash.',60,'D','Koffing','SV076','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV077','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Koffing','This Pokémon consumes particles that contaminate the air. Instead of leaving droppings, it expels clean air.',130,'D','Galarian Weezing','SV077','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV078','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thought to be the oldest form of Zigzagoon, it moves in zigzags and wreaks havoc upon its surroundings.',70,'D','Galarian Zigzagoon','SV078','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV079','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Zigzagoon','This very aggressive Pokémon will recklessly challenge opponents stronger than itself.',100,'D','Galarian Linoone','SV079','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV080','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Linoone','It evolved after experiencing numerous fights. While crossing its arms, it lets out a shout that would make any opponent flinch.',160,'D','Galarian Obstagoon','SV080','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV081','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon. It survives off its ill-gotten gains.',70,'D','Nickit','SV081','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV082','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Nickit','It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.',100,'D','Thievul','SV082','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV083','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Through its nose, it sucks in the emanations produced by people and Pokémon when they feel annoyed. It thrives off this negative energy.',70,'D','Impidimp','SV083','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV084','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,'Impidimp','When it gets down on all fours as if to beg for forgiveness, it\'s trying to lure opponents in so that it can stab them with its spear-like hair.',90,'D','Morgrem','SV084','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV085','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,'Morgrem','With the hair wrapped around its body helping to enhance its muscles, this Pokémon can overwhelm even Machamp.',170,'D','Grimmsnarl','SV085','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV086','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémon\'s body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.',60,'D','Galarian Meowth','SV086','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV087','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Meowth','What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.',120,'D','Galarian Perrserker','SV087','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV088','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Living in mud with a high iron content has given it a strong steel body.',120,'D','Galarian Stunfisk','SV088','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV089','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Corvisquire','This Pokémon reigns supreme in the skies of the Galar region. The black luster of its steel body could drive terror into the heart of any foe.',170,'D','Corviknight','SV089','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV090','sowsow',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It digs up the ground with its trunk. It\'s also very strong, being able to carry loads of over five tons without any problem at all.',100,'D','Cufant','SV090','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV091','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,'Cufant','They came over from another region long ago and worked together with humans. Their green skin is resistant to water.',190,'D','Copperajah','SV091','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV092','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its body resembles polished metal, and it\'s both lightweight and strong. The only drawback is that it rusts easily.',130,'D','Duraludon','SV092','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV093','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The way it brushes away grime with its tail can be helpful when cleaning. But its focus on spotlessness can make cleaning more of a hassle.',70,'D','Minccino','SV093','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV094','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Minccino','Its body secretes oil that this Pokémon spreads over its nest as a coating to protect it from dust. Cinccino won\'t tolerate even a speck of the stuff.',90,'D','Cinccino','SV094','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV095','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.',50,'D','Ducklett','SV095','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV096','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ducklett','Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock.',110,'D','Swanna','SV096','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV097','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It excels at digging holes. Using its ears, it can dig a nest 33 feet deep in one night.',40,'D','Bunnelby','SV097','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV098','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It knows the forest inside and out. If it comes across a wounded Pokémon, Oranguru will gather medicinal herbs to treat it.',120,'D','Oranguru','SV098','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV099','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Found throughout the Galar region, this Pokémon becomes uneasy if its cheeks are ever completely empty of berries.',70,'D','Skwovet','SV099','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV100','Hideki Ishikawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Skwovet','It stashes berries in its tail—so many berries that they fall out constantly. But this Pokémon is a bit slow-witted, so it doesn\'t notice the loss.',120,'D','Greedent','SV100','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV101','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It will bravely challenge any opponent, no matter how powerful. This Pokémon benefits from every battle—even a defeat increases its strength a bit.',60,'D','Rookidee','SV101','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV102','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Rookidee','Smart enough to use tools in battle, these Pokémon have been seen picking up rocks and flinging them or using ropes to wrap up enemies.',80,'D','Corvisquire','SV102','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV103','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If its fleece grows too long, Wooloo won\'t be able to move. Cloth made with the wool of this Pokémon is surprisingly strong.',70,'D','Wooloo','SV103','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV104','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Wooloo','Its majestic horns are meant only to impress the opposite gender. They never see use in battle.',130,'D','Dubwool','SV104','Rare Shiny','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV105','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Rillaboom V','SV105','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV106','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Rillaboom V',NULL,330,'D','Rillaboom VMAX','SV106','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV107','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,'Charizard V',NULL,330,'D','Charizard VMAX','SV107','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV108','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Centiskorch V','SV108','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV109','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Centiskorch V',NULL,320,'D','Centiskorch VMAX','SV109','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV110','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Lapras V','SV110','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV111','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Lapras V',NULL,320,'D','Lapras VMAX','SV111','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV112','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'D','Toxtricity V','SV112','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV113','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxtricity V',NULL,320,'D','Toxtricity VMAX','SV113','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV114','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,180,'D','Indeedee V','SV114','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV115','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,160,'D','Falinks V','SV115','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV116','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'D','Grimmsnarl V','SV116','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV117','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Grimmsnarl V',NULL,330,'D','Grimmsnarl VMAX','SV117','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV118','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,'D','Ditto V','SV118','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh45sv-SV119','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,'Ditto V',NULL,320,'D','