Honedge','105','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-106','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Honedge','The two swords employ a strategy of rapidly alternating between offense and defense to bring down their prey.',80,'E','Doublade','106','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-107','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,3,'Doublade','Once upon a time, a king with an Aegislash reigned over the land. His Pokémon eventually drained him of life, and his kingdom fell with him.',150,'E','Aegislash','107','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-108','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,3,'Doublade','Its potent spectral powers allow it to manipulate others. It once used its powers to force people and Pokémon to build a kingdom to its liking.',150,'E','Aegislash','108','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-109','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Corviknight V','109','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-11','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The powder that covers its body regulates its temperature, so it can live in any region or climate.',40,'E','Scatterbug','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-110','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Corviknight V',NULL,320,'E','Corviknight VMAX','110','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh5-111','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Due to its short wings, it can\'t fly long distances. It wanders about restlessly and pecks at bug Pokémon.',50,'E','Spearow','111','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-112','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Spearow','Carrying food through Fearow\'s territory is dangerous. It will snatch the food away from you in a flash!',90,'E','Fearow','112','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-113','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It licks filth clean with its tongue. Whatever it licks always stinks afterward, so whether it\'s really clean is…questionable.',110,'E','Lickitung','113','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-114','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,4,'Lickitung','It uses its tongue much more skillfully than its hands or its feet. It can deftly pick up a single small bean with its tongue.',140,'E','Lickilicky','114','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-115','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it\'s happy, Glameow demonstrates beautiful movements of its tail, like a dancing ribbon.',60,'E','Glameow','115','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-116','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,'Glameow','To make itself appear intimidatingly beefy, it tightly cinches its waist with its twin tails.',120,'E','Purugly','116','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-117','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Stoutland V','117','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-118','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Their fluffy fur absorbs damage, even if they strike foes with a fierce headbutt.',120,'E','Bouffalant','118','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-119','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Drampa is a kind and friendly Pokémon—up until it\'s angered. When that happens, it stirs up a gale and flattens everything around.',120,'E','Drampa','119','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-12','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Scatterbug','The beaks of birds can\'t begin to scratch its stalwart body. To defend itself, it spews powder.',80,'E','Spewpa','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-120','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Through its horns, it can pick up on the emotions of creatures around it. Positive emotions are the source of its strength.',90,'E','Indeedee','120','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-121','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Bruno','121','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh5-122','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Camping Gear','122','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh5-123','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Cheryl','123','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh5-124','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Energy Recycler','124','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh5-125','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Escape Rope','125','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh5-126','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Exp. Share','126','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh5-127','sadaji',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Fan of Waves','127','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh5