,'E','Bruno','172','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh5-173','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Cheryl','173','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh5-174','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Korrina\'s Focus','174','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh5-175','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Phoebe','175','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh5-176','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Rapid Strike Style Mustard','176','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh5-177','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Single Strike Style Mustard','177','Rare Rainbow','Trainer'),('swsh5-178','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Remoraid','It traps enemies with its suction-cupped tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head.',110,'E','Octillery','178','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh5-179','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Houndour','Identifiable by its eerie howls, people a long time ago thought it was the grim reaper and feared it.',130,'E','Houndoom','179','Rare Secret','Pokémon'),('swsh5-18','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'E','Flapple V','18','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-180','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Exp. Share','180','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh5-181','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Level Ball','181','Rare Secret','Trainer'),('swsh5-182',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Rapid Strike Energy','182','Rare Secret','Energy'),('swsh5-183',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Single Strike Energy','183','Rare Secret','Energy'),('swsh5-19','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,'Flapple V',NULL,320,'E','Flapple VMAX','19','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh5-2','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,'Bellsprout','It spits out Poison Powder to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of Acid.',80,'E','Weepinbell','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-20','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.',130,'E','Entei','20','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-21','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'E','Victini V','21','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-22','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Victini V',NULL,310,'E','Victini VMAX','22','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh5-23','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp.',80,'E','Tepig','23','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-24','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,'Tepig','When its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke.',100,'E','Pignite','24','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-25','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,4,'Pignite','It has mastered fast and powerful fighting moves. It grows a beard of fire.',180,'E','Emboar','25','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-26','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A flame serves as its tongue, melting through the hard shell of Durant so that Heatmor can devour their insides.',120,'E','Heatmor','26','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-27','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This sneaky Pokémon will slink behind its prey and immobilize it with poisonous gas before the prey even realizes Salandit is there.',70,'E','Salandit','27','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-28','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,'Salandit','The winner of competitions between Salazzle is decided by which one has the most male Salandit with it.',90,'E','Salazzle','28','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-29','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It wraps prey up with its heated body, cooking them in its coils. Once they\'re well-done, it will voraciously nibble them down to the last morsel.',70,'E','Sizzlipede','29','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-3','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,3,'Weepinbell','Once ingested into this Pokémon\'s body, even the hardest object will melt into nothing.',150,'E','Victreebel','3','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-30','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,'Sizzlipede','While its burning body is already dangerous on its own, this excessively hostile Pokémon also has large and very sharp fangs.',130,'E','Centiskorch','30','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-31','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.',60,'E','Horsea','31','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-32','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Horsea','It is capable of swimming backwards by rapidly flapping its winglike pectoral fins and stout tail.',90,'E','Seadra','32','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-33','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,'Seadra','It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life forms can survive.',150,'E','Kingdra','33','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-34','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can radiate chilliness from the bottoms of its feet. It\'ll spend the whole day tap-dancing on a frozen floor.',80,'E','Galarian Mr. Mime','34','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-35','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Mr. Mime','Its amusing movements make it very popular. It releases its psychic power from the pattern on its belly.',110,'E','Galarian Mr. Rime','35','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-36','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Using its dorsal fin as a suction pad, it clings to a Mantine\'s underside to scavenge for leftovers.',60,'E','Remoraid','36','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-37','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,'Remoraid','It traps enemies with its suction-cupped tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head.',110,'E','Octillery','37','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-38','chibi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It was originally a Pokémon from afar that escaped to the wild. It can adapt to the dirtiest river.',70,'E','Corphish','38','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-39','Hasegawa Saki',NULL,NULL,3,'Corphish','A brutish Pokémon that loves to battle. It will crash itself into any foe that approaches its nest.',130,'E','Crawdaunt','39','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-4','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body.',70,'E','Cacnea','4','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-40','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Empoleon V','40','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-41','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Legend has it that the residents of a sunken ancient city changed into these Pokémon.',80,'E','Frillish','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-42','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,3,'Frillish','Whenever a full moon hangs in the night sky, schools of Jellicent gather near the surface of the sea, waiting for their prey to appear.',120,'E','Jellicent','42','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-43','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its skin is thick enough to fend off Mareanie\'s spikes. With its robust teeth, Bruxish crunches up the spikes and eats them.',110,'E','Bruxish','43','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-44','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'While it\'s often blamed for power outages, the truth is the cause of outages is more often an error on the part of the electric company.',80,'E','Electabuzz','44','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-45','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,3,'Electabuzz','A single Electivire can provide enough electricity for all the buildings in a big city for a year.',140,'E','Electivire','45','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-46','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.',60,'E','Shinx','46','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-47','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,1,'Shinx','Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.',80,'E','Luxio','47','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-48','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,1,'Luxio','Luxray\'s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it\'s scouting for danger.',150,'E','Luxray','48','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-49','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.',70,'E','Pachirisu','49','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-5','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,'Cacnea','Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move.',120,'E','Cacturne','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-50','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Tapu Koko V','50','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-51','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,1,'Tapu Koko V',NULL,320,'E','Tapu Koko VMAX','51','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh5-52','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This gluttonous Pokémon only assists people with their work because it wants treats. As it runs, it crackles with electricity.',60,'E','Yamper','52','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-53','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Yamper','It sends electricity through its legs to boost their strength. Running at top speed, it easily breaks 50 mph.',130,'E','Boltund','53','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-54','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Because Galarian Slowpoke eat the seeds of a plant that grows only in Galar, their tails have developed a spicy flavor.',70,'E','Galarian Slowpoke','54','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-55','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from Clamperl on its head.',60,'E','Spoink','55','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-56','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,3,'Spoink','It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.',130,'E','Grumpig','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-57','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.',60,'E','Baltoy','57','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-58','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,'Baltoy','It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move.',120,'E','Claydol','58','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-59','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.',70,'E','Chimecho','59','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-6','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,180,'E','Kricketune V','6','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-60','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'There\'s enough psychic power in Espurr to send a wrestler flying, but because this power can\'t be controlled, Espurr finds it troublesome.',60,'E','Espurr','60','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-61','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,'Espurr','The defensive instinct of the males is strong. It\'s when they\'re protecting themselves or their partners that they unleash their full power.',90,'E','Meowstic','61','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-62','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,160,'E','Mimikyu V','62','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-63','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Necrozma V','63','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-64','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,2,'Blipbug','As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.',70,'E','Dottler','64','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-65','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Dottler','It emits psychic energy to observe and study what\'s around it—and what\'s around it can include things over six miles away.',110,'E','Orbeetle','65','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-66','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey.',60,'E','Mankey','66','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-67','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Mankey','The blood vessels in its brain are sturdier than those of other Pokémon, so it can stay healthy despite its constant raging.',120,'E','Primeape','67','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-68','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.',110,'E','Onix','68','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-69','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It wears its mother\'s skull on its head, so no one knows what its bare face looks like. However, it\'s clear that it\'s always crying.',70,'E','Cubone','69','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-7','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The deeper a Cherubi\'s red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!',50,'E','Cherubi','7','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-70','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,2,'Cubone','They thump their bones rhythmically to communicate among themselves. There are nearly 50 different rhythmic patterns.',110,'E','Marowak','70','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-71','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It flies straight at its target\'s face then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison.',70,'E','Gligar','71','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-72','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,'Gligar','Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey… Then its elongated fangs do the rest.',120,'E','Gliscor','72','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-73','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Timburr that have started carrying logs that are about three times their size are nearly ready to evolve.',80,'E','Timburr','73','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-74','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,'Timburr','Gurdurr excels at demolition—construction is not its forte. In any case, there\'s skill in the way this Pokémon wields its metal beam.',100,'E','Gurdurr','74','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-75','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,3,'Gurdurr','When going all out, this Pokémon throws aside its concrete pillars and leaps at opponents to pummel them with its fists.',160,'E','Conkeldurr','75','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-76','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They seclude themselves in the mountains and devote themselves to training. The form of their kicks and chops differs from pack to pack.',60,'E','Mienfoo','76','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-77','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Mienfoo','When Mienshao lets out a bizarre wail, you\'re in danger. A flurry of kicks and chops too fast to see is about to be unleashed!',90,'E','Mienshao','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-78','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can race around like a unicycle, even on rough, rocky terrain. Burning coal sustains it.',70,'E','Rolycoly','78','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-79','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,'Rolycoly','By rapidly rolling its legs, it can travel at over 18 mph. The temperature of the flames it breathes exceeds 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit.',100,'E','Carkol','79','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-8','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,'Cherubi','The faint scent that emanates from its full blossom entices bug Pokémon to it.',80,'E','Cherrim','8','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-80','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,4,'Carkol','While it\'s engaged in battle, its mountain of coal will burn bright red, sending off sparks that scorch the surrounding area.',180,'E','Coalossal','80','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-81','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It spews sand from its nostrils. While the enemy is blinded, it burrows into the ground to hide.',80,'E','Silicobra','81','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-82','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,'Silicobra','Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand out of its sand sac more efficiently.',130,'E','Sandaconda','82','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-83','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The six of them work together as one Pokémon. Teamwork is also their battle strategy, and they constantly change their formation as they fight.',110,'E','Falinks','83','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-84','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Once a year, on a specific date and at a specific time, they gather out of nowhere and form up in a circle.',130,'E','Stonjourner','84','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-85','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Single Strike Urshifu V','85','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-86','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,'Single Strike Urshifu V',NULL,330,'E','Single Strike Urshifu VMAX','86','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh5-87','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Rapid Strike Urshifu V','87','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-88','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Rapid Strike Urshifu V',NULL,330,'E','Rapid Strike Urshifu VMAX','88','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh5-89','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Their skin is so thin that they\'ll be burned if sunlight hits them. When it gets cold out, they gather together to warm one another\'s bodies.',50,'E','Zubat','89','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-9','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down.',110,'E','Carnivine','9','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-90','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Zubat','They can suck down over 10 ounces of blood in one go. They have been known to drink so much blood that they can no longer fly.',80,'E','Golbat','90','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-91','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Golbat','It feeds on the blood of living people and Pokémon. If it can\'t drink any blood for even a short while, it becomes weak and unable to fly.',130,'E','Crobat','91','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-92','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Slowpoke','If this Pokémon squeezes the tongue of the Shellder biting it, the Shellder will launch a toxic liquid from the tip of its shell.',130,'E','Galarian Slowbro','92','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh5-93','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It searches for shiny things for its boss. Murkrow\'s presence is said to be unlucky, so many people detest it.',70,'E','Murkrow','93','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-94','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Murkrow','Its goons take care of most of the fighting for it. The only time it dirties its own hands is in delivering a final blow to finish off an opponent.',130,'E','Honchkrow','94','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-95','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They make repeated eerie howls before dawn to call attention to their pack.',60,'E','Houndour','95','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh5-96','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Houndour','Identifiable by its eerie howls, people a long time ago thought it was the grim reaper and feared it.',130,'E','Houndoom','96','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh5-97','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,230,'E','Tyranitar V','97','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh5-98','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Hunger hormones affect its temperament. Until its hunger is appeased, it gets up to all manner of evil deeds.',80,'E','Morpeko','98','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh5-99','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,4,'Onix','It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.',190,'E','Steelix','99','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-1','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its poison stinger is very powerful. Its bright-colored body is intended to warn off its enemies.',40,'E','Weedle','1','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-10','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,'Snover','This Pokémon is known to bring blizzards. A shake of its massive body is enough to cause whiteout conditions.',140,'E','Abomasnow','10','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-100','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Slowking V',NULL,320,'E','Galarian Slowking VMAX','100','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh6-101','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The small spikes covering its body developed from scales. They inject a toxin that causes fainting.',90,'E','Qwilfish','101','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-102','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It\'s Zangoose\'s archrival.',110,'E','Seviper','102','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-103','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It was bound to a fissure in an Odd Keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago.',70,'E','Spiritomb','103','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-104','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'E','Liepard V','104','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-105','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its bite injects a potent poison, enough to paralyze large bird Pokémon that try to prey on it.',70,'E','Venipede','105','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-106','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,'Venipede','It is usually motionless, but when attacked, it rotates at high speed and then crashes into its opponent.',90,'E','Whirlipede','106','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-107','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,3,'Whirlipede','With quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails.',160,'E','Scolipede','107','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-108','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,'Kubfu','Inhabiting the mountains of a distant region, this Pokémon races across sheer cliffs, training its legs and refining its moves.',140,'E','Single Strike Urshifu','108','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-109','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When it evolves, it sheds the steel carapace that covered its whole body and develops a new one.',70,'E','Aron','109','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-11','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon\'s fur. People use it to mark the seasons.',60,'E','Deerling','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-110','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,3,'Aron','It habitually shows off its strength with the size of sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders.',100,'E','Lairon','110','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-111','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,4,'Lairon','While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.',180,'E','Aggron','111','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-112','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Metagross V','112','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-113','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,3,'Metagross V',NULL,330,'E','Metagross VMAX','113','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh6-114','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has a body and heart of steel. It worked with its allies to punish people when they hurt Pokémon.',120,'E','Cobalion','114','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-115','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'They live in groups. The one with the longest, thickest, and most-scarred horns is the boss of the herd.',130,'E','Tauros','115','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-116','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It was built 20 years ago by scientists who dreamed of exploring space. Their dreams have yet to come true.',60,'E','Porygon','116','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-117','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,2,'Porygon','Even though it doesn\'t die in the vacuum of space, it can\'t move around very well in zero gravity.',90,'E','Porygon2','117','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-118','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,'Porygon2','A faulty update was added to its programming. Its behavior is noticeably strange, so the experiment may have been a failure.',140,'E','Porygon-Z','118','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-119','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,250,'E','Blissey V','119','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-12','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,'Deerling','They migrate according to the seasons. People can tell the season by looking at Sawsbuck\'s horns.',110,'E','Sawsbuck','12','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-120','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its fur would all stand on end if it smelled a Seviper nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes.',110,'E','Zangoose','120','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-121','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Its form changes depending on the weather. The rougher conditions get, the rougher Castform\'s disposition!',70,'E','Castform','121','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-122','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its color changes for concealment and also when its mood or health changes. The darker the color, the healthier it is.',90,'E','Kecleon','122','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-123','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers.',70,'E','Shaymin','123','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-124','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Tornadus V','124','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-125','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,'Tornadus V',NULL,320,'E','Tornadus VMAX','125','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh6-126','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Left alone, its fur will grow longer and longer, but it will only allow someone it trusts to cut it.',90,'E','Furfrou','126','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-127','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It eats berries nonstop—a habit that has made it more resilient than it looks. It\'ll show up on farms, searching for yet more b