NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Fighting Energy','233','Rare Secret','Energy'),('swsh6-24','Mika Pikazo',NULL,NULL,2,'Larvesta','According to legends, it was hatched from a flaming cocoon to save people and Pokémon that were suffering from the cold.',130,'E','Volcarona','24','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-25','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Volcanion V','25','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-26','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it\'s raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.',60,'E','Scorbunny','26','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-27','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,'Scorbunny','It kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork.',90,'E','Raboot','27','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-28','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,1,'Raboot','It\'s skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.',170,'E','Cinderace','28','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-29','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Crossing icy seas is no issue for this cold-resistant Pokémon. Its smooth skin is a little cool to the touch.',110,'E','Lapras','29','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-3','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,'Kakuna','May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.',130,'E','Beedrill','3','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-30','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a cunning yet savage disposition. It waits for parents to leave their nests, and then it sneaks in to steal their eggs.',70,'E','Sneasel','30','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-31','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Sneasel','With its claws, it leaves behind signs for its friends to find. The number of distinct signs is said to be over 500.',110,'E','Weavile','31','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-32','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has a generous habit of sharing its food with people and Pokémon, so it\'s always scrounging around for more food.',90,'E','Delibird','32','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-33','sowsow',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'This is Castform\'s form when pelted by rain. In an experiment where it was placed in a shower, this Pokémon didn\'t change to this form.',70,'E','Castform Rainy Form','33','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-34','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'This is Castform\'s form when caught in a hailstorm. Its whole body is chilled, and its skin is partially frozen!',70,'E','Castform Snowy Form','34','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-35','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as −150 degrees Fahrenheit.',60,'E','Snorunt','35','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-36','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,'Snorunt','It spits out cold air of nearly −60 degrees Fahrenheit to freeze its quarry. It brings frozen prey back to its lair and neatly lines them up.',90,'E','Froslass','36','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-37','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its body is covered in fluffy fur. The fur keeps it from feeling cold while it is rolling on ice.',70,'E','Spheal','37','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-38','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,4,'Spheal','Be it Spheal or a Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.',110,'E','Sealeo','38','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-39','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,4,'Sealeo','It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks.',170,'E','Walrein','39','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-4','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'These very cowardly Pokémon join together and use Reflect to protect their nest.',60,'E','Ledyba','4','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-40','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Although it\'s called a guardian deity, terrible calamities sometimes befall those who recklessly approach Tapu Fini.',120,'E','Tapu Fini','40','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-41','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it gets wet, its skin changes color, and this Pokémon becomes invisible as if it were camouflaged.',60,'E','Sobble','41','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-42','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Sobble','Highly intelligent but also very lazy, it keeps enemies out of its territory by laying traps everywhere.',90,'E','Drizzile','42','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-43','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,'Drizzile','Its nictitating membranes let it pick out foes\' weak points so it can precisely blast them with water that shoots from its fingertips at Mach 3.',150,'E','Inteleon','43','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-44','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,'Kubfu','This form of Urshifu is a strong believer in defeating foes by raining many blows down on them. Its strikes are nonstop, flowing like a river.',140,'E','Rapid Strike Urshifu','44','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-45','D.A.G Inc.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Ice Rider Calyrex V','45','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-46','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Ice Rider Calyrex V',NULL,320,'E','Ice Rider Calyrex VMAX','46','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh6-47','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. You\'ll want to pet it because it\'s cute, but if you use your bare hand, you\'ll get a painful shock.',70,'E','Mareep','47','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-48','sui',NULL,NULL,2,'Mareep','It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches.',100,'E','Flaaffy','48','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-49','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,2,'Flaaffy','Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors.',160,'E','Ampharos','49','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-5','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,'Ledyba','It flies through the night sky, sprinkling sparkly dust. According to some, if that dust sticks to you, good things will happen to you.',90,'E','Ledian','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-50','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.',60,'E','Blitzle','50','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-51','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Blitzle','They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.',120,'E','Zebstrika','51','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-52','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked.',120,'E','Thundurus','52','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-53','chibi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Zeraora V','53','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-54','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Because Galarian Slowpoke eat the seeds of a plant that grows only in Galar, their tails have developed a spicy flavor.',70,'E','Galarian Slowpoke','54','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-55','Motofumi Fujiwara',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its gas-like body, it can sneak into any place it desires. However, it can be blown away by wind.',50,'E','Gastly','55','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-56','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Gastly','If you get the feeling of being watched in darkness when nobody is around, Haunter is there.',80,'E','Haunter','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-57','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,'Haunter','It is said to emerge from darkness to steal the lives of those who become lost in mountains.',130,'E','Gengar','57','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-58','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Galarian Articuno V','58','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-59','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.',60,'E','Ralts','59','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-6','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It roams through forests searching for sweet nectar. Although it boasts fantastic physical strength, it\'s not that good at flying.',120,'E','Heracross','6','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-60','0313',NULL,NULL,1,'Ralts','It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.',80,'E','Kirlia','60','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-61','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Kirlia','To protect its Trainer, it will expend all its psychic power to create a small black hole.',140,'E','Gardevoir','61','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-62','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'There\'s a proverb that says, \"Shun the house where Shuppet gather in the growing dusk.\"',50,'E','Shuppet','62','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-63','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,1,'Shuppet','Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy.',80,'E','Banette','63','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-64','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Those who sleep holding Cresselia\'s feather are assured of joyful dreams. It is said to represent the crescent moon.',120,'E','Cresselia','64','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-65','0313',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This Pokémon was created from clay. It received orders from its master many thousands of years ago, and it still follows those orders to this day.',90,'E','Golett','65','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-66','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,4,'Golett','There\'s a theory that inside Golurk is a perpetual motion machine that produces limitless energy, but this belief hasn\'t been proven.',150,'E','Golurk','66','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-67','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The sweet smell of cotton candy perfumes Swirlix\'s fluffy fur. This Pokémon spits out sticky string to tangle up its enemies.',60,'E','Swirlix','67','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-68','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,'Swirlix','Slurpuff\'s fur contains a lot of air, making it soft to the touch and lighter than it looks.',110,'E','Slurpuff','68','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-69','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'By exposing foes to the blinking of its luminescent spots, Inkay demoralizes them, and then it seizes the chance to flee.',50,'E','Inkay','69','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-7','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'E','Celebi V','7','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-70','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,3,'Inkay','It\'s said that Malamar\'s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events.',120,'E','Malamar','70','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-71','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If this Pokémon senses a strong emotion, it will run away as fast as it can. It prefers areas without people.',60,'E','Hatenna','71','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-72','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,'Hatenna','Using the braids on its head, it pummels foes to get them to quiet down. One blow from those braids would knock out a professional boxer.',80,'E','Hattrem','72','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-73','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Hattrem','If you\'re too loud around it, you risk being torn apart by the claws on its tentacle. This Pokémon is also known as the Forest Witch.',130,'E','Hatterene','73','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-74','D.A.G Inc.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Shadow Rider Calyrex V','74','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-75','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Shadow Rider Calyrex V',NULL,320,'E','Shadow Rider Calyrex VMAX','75','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh6-76','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It burrows through the ground at a shallow depth. It leaves raised earth in its wake, making it easy to spot.',50,'E','Diglett','76','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-77','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,'Diglett','These Diglett triplets dig over 60 miles below sea level. No one knows what it\'s like underground.',90,'E','Dugtrio','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-78','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The stalks of leeks are thicker and longer in the Galar region. Farfetch\'d that adapted to these stalks took on a unique form.',80,'E','Galarian Farfetch\'d','78','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-79','Uta',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Farfetch\'d','After deflecting attacks with its hard leaf shield, it strikes back with its sharp leek stalk. The leek stalk is both weapon and food.',130,'E','Galarian Sirfetch\'d','79','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-8','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,1,'Celebi V',NULL,310,'E','Celebi VMAX','8','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh6-80','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Galarian Zapdos V','80','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-81','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,2,'Kirlia','Sharply attuned to others\' wishes for help, this Pokémon seeks out those in need and aids them in battle.',170,'E','Gallade','81','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-82','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s said that this Pokémon was formed when an ancient clay tablet was drawn to a vengeful spirit.',60,'E','Galarian Yamask','82','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-83','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Yamask','Never touch its shadowlike body, or you\'ll be shown the horrific memories behind the picture carved into it.',120,'E','Galarian Runerigus','83','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-84','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Crabrawler has been known to mistake Exeggutor for a coconut tree and climb it. The enraged Exeggutor shakes it off and stomps it.',80,'E','Crabrawler','84','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-85','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,4,'Crabrawler','Before it stops to think, it just starts pummeling. There are records of its turning back avalanches with a flurry of punches.',150,'E','Crabominable','85','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh6-86','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you, that\'s proof of its love for you. However, the rocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!',70,'E','Rockruff','86','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-87','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,2,'Rockruff','They live alone without forming packs. They will only listen to orders from Trainers who can draw out their true power.',120,'E','Lycanroc','87','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-88','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Passimian live in groups of about 20, with each member performing an assigned role. Through cooperation, the group survives.',110,'E','Passimian','88','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-89','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Sandaconda V','89','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-9','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The berries that grow around its belly are like ice pops. Galarian Darumaka absolutely love these berries.',80,'E','Snover','9','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-90','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,3,'Sandaconda V',NULL,320,'E','Sandaconda VMAX','90','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh6-91','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its tentacles tear off easily, but it isn\'t alarmed when that happens—it knows they\'ll grow back. It\'s about as smart as a three-year-old.',70,'E','Clobbopus','91','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-92','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,3,'Clobbopus','Searching for an opponent to test its skills against, it emerges onto land. Once the battle is over, it returns to the sea.',140,'E','Grapploct','92','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-93','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If Kubfu pulls the long white hair on its head, its fighting spirit heightens and power wells up from the depths of its belly.',70,'E','Kubfu','93','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-94','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It adores polluted air. Some claim that Koffing used to be more plentiful in the Galar region than they are now.',70,'E','Koffing','94','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh6-95','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Koffing','Very rarely, a sudden mutation can result in two small Koffing twins becoming conjoined as a Weezing.',130,'E','Weezing','95','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-96','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Koffing','Long ago, during a time when droves of factories fouled the air with pollution, Weezing changed into this form for some reason.',130,'E','Galarian Weezing','96','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh6-97','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Galarian Moltres V','97','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh6-98','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Galarian Slowpoke','While chanting strange spells, this Pokémon combines its internal toxins with what it\'s eaten, creating strange potions.',120,'E','Galarian Slowking','98','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh6-99','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Galarian Slowking V','99','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-1','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Although it\'s tough, it can\'t handle cold well. When night falls, it buries itself in leafage and sleeps.',120,'E','Pinsir','1','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-10','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Petilil','It\'s well liked by other Pokémon because of its beauty. The flower on its head needs constant care, or it will soon wither and rot.',100,'E','Lilligant','10','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-100','Uta',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Garbodor V','100','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-101','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Garbodor V',NULL,330,'E','Garbodor VMAX','101','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-102','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If a normally talkative child suddenly stops talking, it may have been replaced by Zorua.',70,'E','Zorua','102','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-103','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,'Zorua','If it thinks humans are going to discover its den, Zoroark shows them visions that make them wander around in the woods.',120,'E','Zoroark','103','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-104','Hasegawa Saki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Cunning and cautious, this Pokémon survives by stealing food from others. It erases its tracks with swipes of its tail as it makes off with its plunder.',70,'E','Nickit','104','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-105','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,'Nickit','With a lithe body and sharp claws, it goes around stealing food and eggs. Boltund is its natural enemy.',100,'E','Thievul','105','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-106','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Swablu','On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.',90,'E','Altaria','106','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-107','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Some theories suggest that its behavior of forcefully bashing its head into things stimulates cells that affect its evolution.',70,'E','Bagon','107','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-108','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,'Bagon','Shelgon lives deep within caves. It stays shut up in its hard shell, dreaming of the day it will be able to fly.',90,'E','Shelgon','108','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-109','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Shelgon','Thanks to its fervent wishes, the cells in its body finally mutated, and at last it has its heart\'s desire—wings.',170,'E','Salamence','109','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-11','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It first tries to find a rock to live in, but if there are no suitable rocks to be found, Dwebble may move in to the ports of a Hippowdon.',60,'E','Dwebble','11','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-110','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Rayquaza V','110','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-111','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,'Rayquaza V',NULL,320,'E','Rayquaza VMAX','111','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-112','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has the power to control time. It appears in Sinnoh-region myths as an ancient deity.',130,'E','Dialga','112','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-113','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because it can\'t see, this Pokémon is constantly biting at everything it touches, trying to keep track of its surroundings.',60,'E','Deino','113','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-114','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Deino','Their two heads will fight each other over a single piece of food. Zweilous are covered in scars even without battling others.',100,'E','Zweilous','114','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-115','hatachu',NULL,NULL,3,'Zweilous','The three heads take turns sinking their teeth into the opponent. Their attacks won\'t slow until their target goes down.',170,'E','Hydreigon','115','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-116','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.',120,'E','Kyurem','116','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-117','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Noivern V','117','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-118','otumami',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Some say it can change to an even more powerful form when battling those who threaten the ecosystem.',130,'E','Zygarde','118','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-119','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Drampa is a kind and friendly Pokémon—up until it\'s angered. When that happens, it stirs up a gale and flattens everything around.',120,'E','Drampa','119','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-12','sowsow',NULL,NULL,3,'Dwebble','Its thick claws are its greatest weapons. They\'re mighty enough to crack Rhyperior\'s carapace.',130,'E','Crustle','12','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-120','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,'Applin','It flies on wings of apple skin and spits a powerful acid. It can also change its shape into that of an apple.',80,'E','Flapple','120','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-121','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,3,'Applin','Its body is covered in sweet nectar, and the skin on its back is especially yummy. Children used to have it as a snack.',90,'E','Appletun','121','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-122','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Duraludon V','122','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-123','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Duraludon V',NULL,330,'E','Duraludon VMAX','123','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-124','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Its body is composed of crystallized dragon energy. Regidrago is said to have the powers of every dragon Pokémon.',130,'E','Regidrago','124','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-125','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.',70,'E','Eevee','125','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-126','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Before food becomes scarce in wintertime, its habit is to hoard food in many hidden locations.',70,'E','Teddiursa','126','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-127','Hasegawa Saki',NULL,NULL,3,'Teddiursa','Although it has a large body, it is quite skilled at climbing trees. It eats and sleeps in the treetops.',140,'E','Ursaring','127','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-128','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It draws symbols with the fluid that oozes from the tip of its tail. Depending on the symbol, Smeargle fanatics will pay big money for them.',80,'E','Smeargle','128','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-129','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'If it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day.',70,'E','Slakoth','129','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-13','MUGENUP',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Trevenant V','13','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-130','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Slakoth','Its stress level rises if it cannot keep moving constantly. Too much stress makes it feel sick.',90,'E','Vigoroth','130','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-131','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,4,'Vigoroth','It is the world\'s most slothful Pokémon. However, it can exert horrifying power by releasing pent-up energy all at once.',180,'E','Slaking','131','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-132','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.',50,'E','Swablu','132','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-133','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon is popular with beginners because it\'s intelligent, obedient to its Trainer\'s commands, and easy to raise.',60,'E','Lillipup','133','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-134','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Lillipup','It has been living with people for so long that portrayals of it can be found on the walls of caves from long, long ago.',100,'E','Herdier','134','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-135','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Herdier','Its fur is long and thick. A long time ago in cold regions, every household kept a Stoutland.',160,'E','Stoutland','135','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-136','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A combative Pokémon, it\'s ready to pick a fight with anyone. It has talons that can crush hard berries.',60,'E','Rufflet','