hat makes its poison.',60,'E','Tentacool','26','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-27','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,'Tentacool','It communicates with others of its kind by lighting up the red orbs on its head. When the orbs are blinking, it\'s a warning sign.',120,'E','Tentacruel','27','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-28','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Gyarados V','28','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-29','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,4,'Gyarados V',NULL,330,'E','Gyarados VMAX','29','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-3','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hoppip','It spreads its petals to absorb sunlight. It also floats in the air to get closer to the sun.',60,'E','Skiploom','3','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-30','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Vaporeon V',NULL,320,'E','Vaporeon VMAX','30','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-31','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Suicune V','31','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-32','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its leaf grew too large for it to live on land. That is how it began to live floating in the water.',60,'E','Lotad','32','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-33','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,1,'Lotad','It lives at the water\'s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night.',90,'E','Lombre','33','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-34','sowsow',NULL,NULL,2,'Lombre','If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in order to amplify its power.',140,'E','Ludicolo','34','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-35','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its sturdy jaws and fangs, it can easily chomp wooden boats to splinters. It fights with Basculin over food.',50,'E','Carvanha','35','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-36','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,1,'Carvanha','It drinks in seawater and jets it from its rear to propel itself. It\'s very sensitive to the scent of blood.',120,'E','Sharpedo','36','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-37','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.',30,'E','Feebas','37','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-38','sui',NULL,NULL,2,'Feebas','It\'s said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you\'re feeling.',120,'E','Milotic','38','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-39','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Luvdisc makes its home in coral reefs in warm seas. It especially likes sleeping in the space between Corsola\'s branches.',70,'E','Luvdisc','39','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-4','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Skiploom','Even in the fiercest wind, it can control its fluff to make its way to any place in the world it wants.',90,'E','Jumpluff','4','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-40','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Glaceon V','40','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-41','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Glaceon V',NULL,310,'E','Glaceon VMAX','41','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-42','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It uses sound waves to communicate with others of its kind. People and other Pokémon species can\'t hear its cries of warning.',70,'E','Tympole','42','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-43','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148 degrees Fahrenheit.',90,'E','Cryogonal','43','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-44','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon lives in areas of frigid cold. It secures itself to the back of an Avalugg by freezing its feet in place.',70,'E','Bergmite','44','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-45','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,4,'Bergmite','As Avalugg moves about during the day, the cracks in its body deepen. The Pokémon\'s body returns to a pristine state overnight.',150,'E','Avalugg','45','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-46','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it senses danger, its eyes tear up. The sparkle of its tears signals other Wishiwashi to gather.',30,'E','Wishiwashi','46','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-47','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon keeps its heat-sensitive head cool with ice. It fishes for its food, dangling its single hair into the sea to lure in prey.',120,'E','Eiscue','47','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-48','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Arctovish V','48','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-49','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When Pikachu meet, they\'ll touch their tails together and exchange electricity through them as a form of greeting.',60,'E','Pikachu','49','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-5','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall.',50,'E','Seedot','5','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-50','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,'Pikachu','If its electric pouches run empty, it raises its tail to gather electricity from the atmosphere.',130,'E','Raichu','50','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-51','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Jolteon V',NULL,300,'E','Jolteon VMAX','51','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-52','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'On the dark ocean floor, its only means of communication is its constantly flashing lights.',70,'E','Chinchou','52','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-53','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,2,'Chinchou','This Pokémon flashes a bright light that blinds its prey. This creates an opening for it to deliver an electrical attack.',120,'E','Lanturn','53','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-54','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. You\'ll want to pet it because it\'s cute, but if you use your bare hand, you\'ll get a painful shock.',60,'E','Mareep','54','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-55','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,2,'Mareep','It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches.',90,'E','Flaaffy','55','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-56','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,'Flaaffy','Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors.',150,'E','Ampharos','56','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-57','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'As it flies, it scatters electricity around, so bird Pokémon keep their distance. That\'s why Emolga can keep all its food to itself.',70,'E','Emolga','57','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-58','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Dracozolt V','58','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-59','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Dracozolt V',NULL,330,'E','Dracozolt VMAX','59','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-6','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Bunches of delicious fruit grow around its neck. In warm areas, many ranches raise Tropius.',110,'E','Tropius','6','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-60','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its entire body is made up of a single organ that generates electrical energy. Regieleki is capable of creating all Galar\'s electricity.',120,'E','Regieleki','60','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-61','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It puts its prey to sleep and devours their dreams. It seems that bad dreams taste sour, so Drowzee doesn\'t particularly like eating them.',70,'E','Drowzee','61','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-62','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,2,'Drowzee','There are some Hypno that assist doctors with patients who can\'t sleep at night in hospitals.',110,'E','Hypno','62','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-63','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Known as Articuno, this Pokémon fires beams that can immobilize opponents as if they had been frozen solid.',120,'E','Galarian Articuno','63','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-64','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Espeon V','64','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-65','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Espeon V',NULL,310,'E','Espeon VMAX','65','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-66','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack.',120,'E','Wobbuffet','66','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-67','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels.',70,'E','Sableye','67','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-68','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It emits ultrasonic waves as it flutters about, searching for its prey—bug Pokémon.',60,'E','Woobat','68','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-69','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Woobat','The auspicious shape of this Pokémon\'s nose apparently led some regions to consider Swoobat a symbol of good luck.',90,'E','Swoobat','69','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-7','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Leafeon V','7','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-70','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Golurk V','70','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-71','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it\'s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties.',40,'E','Flabébé','71','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-72','chibi',NULL,NULL,1,'Flabébé','It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.',70,'E','Floette','72','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-73','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Floette','Its life can span several hundred years. It\'s said to devote its entire life to protecting gardens.',130,'E','Florges','73','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-74','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Sylveon V','74','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-75','Ryota Murayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Sylveon V',NULL,310,'E','Sylveon VMAX','75','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-76','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The light that streams out from the holes in the pumpkin can hypnotize and control the people and Pokémon that see it.',60,'E','Pumpkaboo','76','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-77','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,2,'Pumpkaboo','In the darkness of a new-moon night, Gourgeist will come knocking. Whoever answers the door will be swept off to the afterlife.',120,'E','Gourgeist','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-78','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'An opponent\'s aura can tell Cutiefly what that opponent\'s next move will be. Then Cutiefly can glide around the attack and strike back.',30,'E','Cutiefly','78','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-79','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cutiefly','Ribombee absolutely hate getting wet or rained on. In the cloudy Galar region, they are very seldom seen.',70,'E','Ribombee','79','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-8','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Leafeon V',NULL,310,'E','Leafeon VMAX','8','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-80','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sinks into the shadows of people and Pokémon, where it can understand their feelings and copy their capabilities.',80,'E','Marshadow','80','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-81','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes.',110,'E','Hitmonchan','81','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-82','kodama',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'One kick from its powerful legs will pulverize a dump truck. Supposedly, this Pokémon runs through the mountains at over 180 mph.',110,'E','Galarian Zapdos','82','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-83','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Medicham V','83','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-84','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'This Pokémon is active during the day and passes the cold desert nights burrowed snugly into the sand.',100,'E','Hippopotas','84','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-85','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,4,'Hippopotas','When roused to violence by its rage, it spews out the quantities of sand it has swallowed and whips up a sandstorm.',150,'E','Hippowdon','85','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-86','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When it detects a noise, it starts to move. The energy core inside it makes this Pokémon slightly warm to the touch.',70,'E','Roggenrola','86','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-87','otumami',NULL,NULL,4,'Roggenrola','It relies on sound in order to monitor what\'s in its vicinity. When angered, it will attack without ever changing the direction it\'s facing.',110,'E','Boldore','87','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-88','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,4,'Boldore','Although its energy blasts can blow away a dump truck, they have a limitation— they can only be fired when the sun is out.',180,'E','Gigalith','88','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-89','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,3,'Tympole','On occasion, their cries are sublimely pleasing to the ear. Palpitoad with larger lumps on their bodies can sing with a wider range of sounds.',100,'E','Palpitoad','89','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-9','Mika Pikazo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They prefer clean water and soil. When the environment they live in turns bad, the whole bunch will up and move to a new area.',60,'E','Petilil','9','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-90','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,3,'Palpitoad','This Pokémon is popular among the elderly, who say the vibrations of its lumps are great for massages.',170,'E','Seismitoad','90','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-91','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Lycanroc V','91','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-92','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Lycanroc V',NULL,320,'E','Lycanroc VMAX','92','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-93','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The sinister aura that blazes like molten fire around this Pokémon is what inspired the name Moltres.',120,'E','Galarian Moltres','93','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh7-94','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Umbreon V','94','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh7-95','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,2,'Umbreon V',NULL,310,'E','Umbreon VMAX','95','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh7-96','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,'Seedot','They live in holes bored in large trees. The sound of Nuzleaf\'s grass flute fills listeners with dread.',80,'E','Nuzleaf','96','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh7-97','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Nuzleaf','It lives quietly in the deep forest. It is said to create chilly winter winds with the fans it holds.',150,'E','Shiftry','97','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh7-98','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It protects itself with its durable skin. It\'s thought that this Pokémon will evolve once its skin has completely stretched out.',70,'E','Scraggy','98','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh7-99','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,2,'Scraggy','While mostly known for having the temperament of an aggressive ruffian, this Pokémon takes very good care of its family, friends, and territory.',120,'E','Scrafty','99','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-1','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls.',50,'E','Caterpie','1','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-10','0313',NULL,NULL,2,'Sewaddle','It protects itself from the cold by wrapping up in leaves. It stays on the move, eating leaves in forests.',80,'E','Swadloon','10','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-100','sowsow',NULL,NULL,3,'Grubbin','Its digestive processes convert the leaves it eats into electricity. An electric sac in its belly stores the electricity for later use.',100,'E','Charjabug','100','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-101','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Charjabug','If it carries a Charjabug to use as a spare battery, a flying Vikavolt can rapidly fire high-powered beams of electricity.',150,'E','Vikavolt','101','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-102','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It approaches its enemies at the speed of lightning, then tears them limb from limb with its sharp claws.',120,'E','Zeraora','102','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-103','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Boltund V','103','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-104','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,'Boltund V',NULL,320,'E','Boltund VMAX','104','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh8-105','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It manipulates the chemical makeup of its poison to produce electricity. The voltage is weak, but it can cause a tingling paralysis.',70,'E','Toxel','105','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-106','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It manipulates the chemical makeup of its poison to produce electricity. The voltage is weak, but it can cause a tingling paralysis.',60,'E','Toxel','106','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-107','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel','This short-tempered and aggressive Pokémon chugs stagnant water to absorb any toxins it might contain.',130,'E','Toxtricity','107','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-108','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,2,'Toxel','It has an electrical organ on its chest. While generating electricity, it fills its surroundings with sounds like the strumming of a bass guitar.',120,'E','Toxtricity','108','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-109','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It carries electrically roasted seeds with it as if they\'re precious treasures. No matter how much it eats, it always gets hungry again in short order.',80,'E','Morpeko','109','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-11','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Swadloon','It keeps its eggs warm with heat from fermenting leaves. It also uses leaves to make warm wrappings for Sewaddle.',130,'E','Leavanny','11','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-110','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The songs they sing are totally different depending on the region they live in. Some even sound like they\'re shouting!',60,'E','Jigglypuff','110','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-111','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,2,'Jigglypuff','When it gets angry, it inhales with all its might, and its body gradually inflates. Sometimes they can grow 20 times larger!',120,'E','Wigglytuff','111','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-112','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its strange cries sound like human language. There are some musicians who compose songs for Jynx to sing.',100,'E','Jynx','112','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-113','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,180,'E','Mew V','113','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-114','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mew V',NULL,310,'E','Mew VMAX','114','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh8-115','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'In contrast to its appearance, it\'s quite timid. When playing with other puppy Pokémon, it sometimes gets bullied.',70,'E','Snubbull','115','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-116','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Snubbull','Although it\'s popular with young people, Granbull is timid and sensitive, so it\'s totally incompetent as a watchdog.',120,'E','Granbull','116','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-117','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Sudden climate change wiped out this ancient kind of Corsola. This Pokémon absorbs others\' life-force through its branches.',70,'E','Galarian Corsola','117','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-118','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Corsola','Be cautious of the ectoplasmic body surrounding its soul. You\'ll become stiff as stone if you touch it.',100,'E','Galarian Cursola','118','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-119','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It chomps with its gaping mouth. Its huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed.',90,'E','Mawile','119','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-12','0313',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Once each year, this Pokémon scatters its seeds. They\'re jam-packed with nutrients, making them a precious food source out in the desert.',110,'E','Maractus','12','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-120','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen.',120,'E','Deoxys','120','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-121','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It eats dreams and releases mist. The mist is pink when it\'s eating a good dream, and black when it\'s eating a nightmare.',80,'E','Munna','121','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-122','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,2,'Munna','It drowses and dreams all the time. It\'s best to leave it be if it\'s just woken up, as it\'s a terrible grump when freshly roused from sleep.',120,'E','Musharna','122','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-123','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A discovery was made in the desert where Sigilyph fly. The ruins of what may have been an ancient city were found beneath the sands.',100,'E','Sigilyph','123','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-124','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its melodies are sung with a special vocalization method that can control the feelings of those who hear it.',90,'E','Meloetta','124','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-125','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'If you build sand mounds when you\'re playing, destroy them before you go home, or they may get possessed and become Sandygast.',80,'E','Sandygast','125','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-126','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,4,'Sandygast','Once it has whipped up a sandstorm to halt its opponents in their tracks, this terrifying Pokémon snatches away their vitality.',140,'E','Palossand','126','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-127','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They diligently serve people and Pokémon so they can gather feelings of gratitude. The females are particularly good at babysitting.',100,'E','Indeedee','127','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-128','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If this weak Pokémon is by itself, a mere child could defeat it. But if Dreepy has friends to help it train, it can evolve and become much stronger.',60,'E','Dreepy','128','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-129','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,'Dreepy','Without a Dreepy to place on its head and care for, it gets so uneasy it\'ll try to substitute any Pokémon it finds for the missing Dreepy.',90,'E','Drakloak','129','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-13','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It has a strange physiology that responds to electricity. When together with Karrablast, Shelmet evolves for some reason.',70,'E','Shelmet','13','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-130','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Drakloak','Apparently the Dreepy inside Dragapult\'s horns eagerly look forward to being launched out at Mach speeds.',150,'E','Dragapult','130','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-131','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When its skin gets wrinkled from moisture, it heads for a volcano. It lies flat on a spot with a lot of geothermal heat and dries itself out.',60,'E','Sandshrew','131','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-132','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,'Sandshrew','Thanks to its thick claws, it\'s good at climbing trees. There are plenty of Sandslash that park themselves in trees and go right to sleep.',120,'E','Sandslash','132','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-133','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey.',60,'E','Mankey','133','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-134','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,'Mankey','The blood vessels in its brain are sturdier than those of other Pokémon, so it can stay healthy despite its constant raging.',100,'E','Primeape','134','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-135','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It uses both hands to climb precipitous cliffs. People who see it in action have been known to take up bouldering.',80,'E','Geodude','135','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-136','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,4,'Geodude','It travels by rolling down cliffs. If it falls into a river, it will explode with its last gasp.',110,'E','Graveler','136','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-137','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,4,'Graveler','It detonates its own body. The power from that explosion can propel it up steep mountain paths with amazing speed.',180,'E','Golem','137','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-138','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.',110,'E','Onix','138','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-139','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,4,'Onix','It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.',190,'E','Steelix','139','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-14','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,'Shelmet','Discarding its shell made it nimble. To keep itself from dehydrating, it wraps its body in bands of membrane.',90,'E','Accelgor','14','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-140','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It flies straight at its target\'s face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison.',70,'E','Gligar','140','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-141','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,'Gligar','Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest.',110,'E','Gliscor','141','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-142','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'There\'s a rumor of a traditional recipe for stew that Trainers can use to raise strong Makuhita.',90,'E','Makuhita','142','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-143','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,4,'Makuhita','Hariyama that are big and fat aren\'t necessarily strong. There are some small ones that move nimbly and use moves skillfully.',140,'E','Hariyama','143','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-144','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.',60,'E','Baltoy','144','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-145','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,'Baltoy','It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move.',120,'E','Claydol','145','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-146','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Lucario V','146','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-147','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It\'s a digger, using its claws to burrow through the ground. It causes damage to vegetable crops, so many farmers have little love for it.',60,'E','Drilbur','147','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-148','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'From the forces of lightning and wind, it creates energy to give nutrients to the soil and make the land abundant.',120,'E','Landorus','148','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-149','Mina Nakai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Wanting to make sure it\'s taken seriously, Pancham\'s always giving others a glare. But if it\'s not focusing, it ends up smiling.',60,'E','Pancham','149','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-15','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements.',110,'E','Virizion','15','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-150','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The way it protects itself by flailing its arms may be an adorable sight, but stay well away. This is flailing that can snap thick tree trunks.',70,'E','Stufful','150','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-151','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,3,'Stufful','The moves it uses to take down its prey would make a martial artist jealous. It tucks subdued prey under its arms to carry them to its nest.',130,'E','Bewear','151','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-152','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its tentacles tear off easily, but it isn\'t alarmed when that happens—it knows they\'ll grow back. It\'s about as smart as a three-year-old.',80,'E','Clobbopus','152','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-153','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,'Clobbopus','Searching for an opponent to test its skills against, it emerges onto land. Once the battle is over, it returns to the sea.',130,'E','Grapploct','153','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-154','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'The six of them work together as one Pokémon. Teamwork is also their battle strategy, and they constantly change their formation as they fight.',90,'E','Falinks','154','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-155','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The six of them work together as one Pokémon. Teamwork is also their battle strategy, and they constantly change their formation as they fight.',90,'E','Falinks','155','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-156','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Gengar V','156','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-157','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Gengar V',NULL,320,'E','Gengar VMAX','157','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh8-158','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,230,'E','Tyranitar V','158','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-159','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thought to be the oldest form of Zigzagoon, it moves in zigzags and wreaks havoc upon its surroundings.',60,'E','Galarian Zigzagoon','159','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-16','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With a voice like a human child\'s, it cries out to lure adults deep into the forest, getting them lost among the trees.',60,'E','Phantump','16','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-160','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,'Galarian Zigzagoon','This very aggressive Pokémon will recklessly challenge opponents stronger than itself.',90,'E','Galarian Linoone','160','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-161','kodama',NULL,NULL,2,'Galarian Linoone','It evolved after experiencing numerous fights. While crossing its arms, it lets out a shout that would make any opponent flinch.',170,'E','Galarian Obstagoon','161','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-162','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its sturdy jaws and fangs, it can easily chomp wooden boats to splinters. It fights with Basculin over food.',50,'E','Carvanha','162','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-163','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Carvanha','It drinks in seawater and jets it from its rear to propel itself. It\'s very sensitive to the scent of blood.',100,'E','Sharpedo','163','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-164','Eri Yamaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise.',100,'E','Absol','164','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-165','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Once diluted, its poison becomes medicinal. This Pokémon came into popularity after a pharmaceutical company chose it as a mascot.',60,'E','Croagunk','165','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-166','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Croagunk','It booms out a victory croak when its prey goes down in defeat. This Pokémon and Seismitoad are related species.',110,'E','Toxicroak','166','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-167','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.',110,'E','Darkrai','167','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-168','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'This Pokémon was born from a bag stuffed with trash. Galarian Weezing relish the fumes belched by Trubbish.',70,'E','Trubbish','168','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-169','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,3,'Trubbish','The toxic liquid it launches from its right arm is so virulent that it can kill a weakened creature instantly.',120,'E','Garbodor','169','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-17','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,2,'Phantump','Small roots that extend from the tips of this Pokémon\'s feet can tie into the trees of the forest and give Trevenant control over them.',120,'E','Trevenant','17','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-170','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If a normally talkative child suddenly stops talking, it may have been replaced by Zorua.',60,'E','Zorua','170','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-171','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Zorua','If it thinks humans are going to discover its den, Zoroark shows them visions that make them wander around in the woods.',120,'E','Zoroark','171','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-172','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Vullaby grow quickly. Bones that have gotten too small for older Vullaby to wear often get passed down to younger ones in the nest.',60,'E','Vullaby','172','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-173','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,2,'Vullaby','They adorn themselves with bones. There seem to be fashion trends among them, as different bones come into and fall out of popularity.',120,'E','Mandibuzz','173','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-174','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,4,'Pancham','Using its leaf, Pangoro can predict the moves of its opponents. It strikes with punches that can turn a dump truck into scrap with just one hit.',140,'E','Pangoro','174','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-175','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.',130,'E','Yveltal','175','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-176','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It sneaks into people\'s homes, stealing things and feasting on the negative energy of the frustrated occupants.',70,'E','Impidimp','176','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-177','tetsuya koizumi',NULL,NULL,2,'Impidimp','With sly cunning, it tries to lure people into the woods. Some believe it to have the power to make crops grow.',90,'E','Morgrem','177','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-178','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,3,'Morgrem','Its hairs work like muscle fibers. When its hairs unfurl, they latch on to opponents, ensnaring them as tentacles would.',170,'E','Grimmsnarl','178','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-179','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Hunger hormones affect its temperament. Until its hunger is appeased, it gets up to all manner of evil deeds.',50,'E','Morpeko','179','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-18','Asako Ito',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It uses its big jaws to dig nests into the forest floor, and it loves to feed on sweet tree sap.',70,'E','Grubbin','18','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-180','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'These daring Pokémon have coins on their foreheads. Darker coins are harder, and harder coins garner more respect among Meowth.',70,'E','Galarian Meowth','180','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-181','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,'Galarian Meowth','After many battles, it evolved dangerous claws that come together to form daggers when extended.',120,'E','Galarian Perrserker','181','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-182','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its body is draped in steel armor. It looks heavy, but it can fly at speeds of up to 185 miles an hour!',120,'E','Skarmory','182','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-183','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,2,'Drilbur','Known as the Drill King, this Pokémon can tunnel through the terrain at speeds of over 90 mph.',130,'E','Excadrill','183','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-184','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With their large mandibles, these Pokémon can crunch their way through rock. They work together to protect their eggs from Sandaconda.',70,'E','Durant','184','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-185','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,190,'E','Genesect V','185','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-186','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Long ago it lived in mines, but once the minerals that make up its diet became scarcer, Klefki began appearing in human settlements.',70,'E','Klefki','186','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-187','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it\'s in trouble, it curls up into a ball, makes its fur spikes stand on end, and then discharges electricity indiscriminately.',80,'E','Togedemaru','187','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-188','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It melts particles of iron and other metals found in the subsoil, so it can absorb them into its body of molten steel.',70,'E','Meltan','188','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-189','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,4,'Meltan','Revered long ago for its capacity to create iron from nothing, for some reason it has come back to life after 3,000 years.',150,'E','Melmetal','189','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh8-19','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Dewpider normally lives underwater. When it comes onto land in search of food, it takes water with it in the form of a bubble on its head.',50,'E','Dewpider','19','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-190','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,2,'Corvisquire','With their great intellect and flying skills, these Pokémon very successfully act as the Galar region\'s airborne taxi service.',170,'E','Corviknight','190','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-191','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'If a job requires serious strength, this Pokémon will excel at it. Its copper body tarnishes in the rain, turning a vibrant green color.',100,'E','Cufant','191','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-192','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,4,'Cufant','These Pokémon live in herds. Their trunks have incredible grip strength, strong enough to crush giant rocks into powder.',190,'E','Copperajah','192','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-193','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light.',120,'E','Latias','193','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-194','hatachu',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting.',130,'E','Latios','194','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-195','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Their horns are powerful sensors. As soon as Goomy pick up any sign of enemies, they go into hiding. This is how they\'ve survived.',50,'E','Goomy','195','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-196','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,3,'Goomy','The lump on its back contains its tiny brain. It thinks only of food and escaping its enemies.',80,'E','Sliggoo','196','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-197','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,3,'Sliggoo','Its form of offense is forcefully stretching out its horns. The strikes land 100 times harder than any blow from a heavyweight boxer.',160,'E','Goodra','197','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-198','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'Eating sulfur in its volcanic habitat is what causes explosive compounds to develop in its shell. Its droppings are also dangerously explosive.',130,'E','Turtonator','198','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-199','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn\'t get along with Galarian Meowth.',70,'E','Meowth','199','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-2','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,3,'Caterpie','Even though it is encased in a sturdy shell, the body inside is tender. It can\'t withstand a harsh attack.',80,'E','Metapod','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-20','KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA',NULL,NULL,2,'Dewpider','It acts as a caretaker for Dewpider, putting them inside its bubble and letting them eat any leftover food.',120,'E','Araquanid','20','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-200','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,1,'Meowth','Its elegant and refined behavior clashes with that of the barbaric Perrserker. The relationship between the two is one of mutual disdain.',110,'E','Persian','200','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-201','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Dodrio V','201','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-202','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Because the eggs on their bellies have been overharvested by people in the past, the Chansey population remains very small.',110,'E','Chansey','202','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-203','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,'Chansey','This Pokémon is overflowing with love. Only Chansey that share a strong bond with their Trainer can evolve, so people say.',130,'E','Blissey','203','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-204','Souichirou Gunjima',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'You shouldn\'t get close to the child when it\'s playing outside its mother\'s pouch. Its mother is always nearby watching over it.',120,'E','Kangaskhan','204','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh8-205','0313',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.',50,'E','Eevee','205','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-206','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'This Pokémon\'s stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it.',160,'E','Snorlax','206','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-207','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When it sees a person, it digs a hole with its tail to make its escape. If you happen to find one, consider yourself lucky.',60,'E','Dunsparce','207','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-208','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted.',110,'E','Stantler','208','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-209','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It draws symbols with the fluid that oozes from the tip of its tail. Depending on the symbol, Smeargle fanatics will pay big money for them.',70,'E','Smeargle','209','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-21','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,200,'E','Tsareena V','21','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-210','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy.',60,'E','Skitty','210','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-211','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Skitty','It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.',100,'E','Delcatty','211','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-212','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The reason it keeps one ear rolled up is so it can launch a swift counterattack if it\'s attacked by an enemy.',50,'E','Buneary','212','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-213','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Buneary','It\'s notably wary and has a dislike of fighting, but at the same time, it can deliver powerful kicks with its lithe legs.',110,'E','Lopunny','213','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-214','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s very sensitive to danger. The sound of Corviknight\'s flapping will have Bunnelby digging a hole to hide underground in moments.',60,'E','Bunnelby','214','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-215','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,4,'Bunnelby','The fur on its belly retains heat exceptionally well. People used to make heavy winter clothing from fur shed by this Pokémon.',140,'E','Diggersby','215','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-216','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It always strikes a pose before going for its finishing move. Sometimes opponents take advantage of that time to counterattack.',90,'E','Hawlucha','216','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-217','PLANETA Yamashita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'E','Greedent V','217','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-218','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,'Greedent V',NULL,320,'E','Greedent VMAX','218','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh8-219','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Jumping nimbly about, this small-bodied Pokémon takes advantage of even the slightest opportunity to disorient larger opponents.',60,'E','Rookidee','219','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-22','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'E','Rillaboom V','22','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh8-220','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,'Rookidee','The lessons of many harsh battles have taught it how to accurately judge an opponent\'s strength.',80,'E','Corvisquire','220','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-221','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If its fleece grows too long, Wooloo won\'t be able to move. Cloth made with the wool of this Pokémon is surprisingly strong.',60,'E','Wooloo','221','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-222','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If its fleece grows too long, Wooloo won\'t be able to move. Cloth made with the wool of this Pokémon is surprisingly strong.',70,'E','Wooloo','222','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh8-223','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,2,'Wooloo','Its majestic horns are meant only to impress the opposite gender. They never see use in battle.',130,'E','Dubwool','223','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh8-224','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Adventurer\'s Discovery','224','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-225','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Battle VIP Pass','225','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-226','Yuu Nishida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Bug Catcher','226','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-227','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Chili & Cilan & Cress','227','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-228','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Cook','228','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-229','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Cram-o-matic','229','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-23','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Rillaboom V',NULL,330,'E','Rillaboom VMAX','23','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh8-230','inose yukie',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Cross Switcher','230','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-231','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Crossceiver','231','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-232','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Dancer','232','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-233','Yusuke Ohmura',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Elesa\'s Sparkle','233','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-234','AYUMI ODASHIMA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Farewell Bell','234','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-235','Ryuta Fuse',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Judge','235','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-236','Toyste Beach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Power Tablet','236','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-237','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'D','Quick Ball','237','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-238','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E','Schoolboy','238','Uncommon','Trainer'),('swsh8-239','kirisAki