eggcute','Each of Exeggutor\'s three heads is thinking different thoughts. The three don\'t seem to be very interested in one another.',140,'F','Exeggutor','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-20','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,3,'Magmar','When Magmortar inhales deeply, the fire burning in its belly intensifies, rising in temperature to over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.',140,'F','Magmortar','20','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-21','otumami',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s one of the legendary bird Pokémon. When Moltres flaps its flaming wings, they glimmer with a dazzling red glow.',120,'F','Moltres','21','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9-22','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,230,'F','Entei V','22','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-23','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.',120,'F','Torkoal','23','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-24','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The gas made in its belly burns from its rear end. The fire burns weakly when it feels sick.',50,'F','Chimchar','24','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-25','KEIICHIRO ITO',NULL,NULL,1,'Chimchar','It uses ceilings and walls to launch aerial attacks. Its fiery tail is but one weapon.',80,'F','Monferno','25','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-26','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,1,'Monferno','It tosses its enemies around with agility. It uses all its limbs to fight in its own unique style.',150,'F','Infernape','26','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9-27','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Simisear V','27','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-28','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Kingler V','28','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-29','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Kingler V',NULL,330,'F','Kingler VMAX','29','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh9-3','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.',50,'F','Shroomish','3','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-30','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If you visit a beach at the end of summer, you\'ll be able to see groups of Staryu lighting up in a steady rhythm.',60,'F','Staryu','30','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-31','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A smart and kindhearted Pokémon, it glides across the surface of the sea while its beautiful song echoes around it.',130,'F','Lapras','31','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-32','Sekio',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive.',70,'F','Corphish','32','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-33','Shibuzoh.',NULL,NULL,3,'Corphish','A rough customer that wildly flails its giant claws. It is said to be extremely hard to raise.',130,'F','Crawdaunt','33','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-34','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as -150 degrees Fahrenheit.',60,'E','Snorunt','34','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-35','Atsushi Furusawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because it is very proud, it hates accepting food from people. Its thick down guards it from cold.',60,'F','Piplup','35','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-36','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Piplup','It lives a solitary life. Its wings deliver wicked blows that can snap even the thickest of trees.',90,'F','Prinplup','36','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-37','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,'Prinplup','The three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. The leader has the biggest horns.',160,'F','Empoleon','37','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9-38','Tika Matsuno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It inflates the flotation sac around its neck and pokes its head out of the water to see what is going on.',60,'F','Buizel','38','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-39','kodama',NULL,NULL,1,'Buizel','Its flotation sac developed as a result of pursuing aquatic prey. It can double as a rubber raft.',110,'F','Floatzel','39','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-4','Sekio',NULL,NULL,1,'Shroomish','It scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores.',110,'F','Breloom','4','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-40','takuyoa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,'F','Lumineon V','40','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-41','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It starts its life with a wondrous power that permits it to bond with any kind of Pokémon.',70,'F','Manaphy','41','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-42','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'When this Pokémon is in good health, its snot becomes thicker and stickier. It will smear its snot on anyone it doesn\'t like.',60,'F','Cubchoo','42','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-43','Rianti Hidayat',NULL,NULL,3,'Cubchoo','It swims through frigid seas, searching for prey. From its frozen breath, it forms icy fangs that are harder than steel.',140,'F','Beartic','43','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-44','nagimiso',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The hair on its head connects to the surface of its brain. When this Pokémon has something on its mind, its hair chills the air around it.',110,'E','Eiscue','44','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-45','MUGENUP',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Raichu V','45','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-46','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Many power plants keep Ground-type Pokémon around as a defense against Electabuzz that come seeking electricity.',80,'F','Electabuzz','46','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-47','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,3,'Electabuzz','The amount of electrical energy this Pokémon produces is proportional to the rate of its pulse. The voltage jumps while Electivire is battling.',140,'F','Electivire','47','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-48','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Raikou V','48','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-49','Mizue',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'This Pokémon generates electricity by contracting its muscles. Excited trembling is a sign that Shinx is generating a tremendous amount of electricity.',40,'F','Shinx','49','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-5','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Bunches of delicious fruit grow around its neck. In warm areas, many ranches raise Tropius.',110,'F','Tropius','5','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-50','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,1,'Shinx','By joining its tail with that of another Luxio, this Pokémon can receive some of the other Luxio\'s electricity and power up its own electric blasts.',90,'F','Luxio','50','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-51','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,'Luxio','Luxray can see through solid objects. It will instantly spot prey trying to hide behind walls, even if the walls are thick.',150,'F','Luxray','51','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-52','HYOGONOSUKE',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.',70,'F','Pachirisu','52','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-53','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.',60,'F','Clefairy','53','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-54','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,'Clefairy','A timid fairy Pokémon that is rarely seen, it will run and hide the moment it senses people.',100,'F','Clefable','54','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-55','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Staryu','This Pokémon has an organ known as its core. The organ glows in seven colors when Starmie is unleashing its potent psychic powers.',90,'F','Starmie','55','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-56','Anesaki Dynamic',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A Pokémon created by recombining Mew\'s genes. It\'s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.',130,'F','Mewtwo','56','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-57','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Granbull V','57','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-58','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It moves while spinning around on its single foot. Some Baltoy have been seen spinning on their heads.',50,'F','Baltoy','58','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-59','Kazuma Koda',NULL,NULL,2,'Baltoy','This mysterious Pokémon started life as an ancient clay figurine made over 20,000 years ago.',110,'F','Claydol','59','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-6','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It undertakes photosynthesis with its body, making oxygen. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty.',80,'F','Turtwig','6','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-60','SATOSHI NAKAI',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it finds bad children who won\'t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away—or so it\'s said.',60,'F','Duskull','60','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-61','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,2,'Duskull','Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.',90,'F','Dusclops','61','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-62','otumami',NULL,NULL,3,'Dusclops','At the bidding of transmissions from the spirit world, it steals people and Pokémon away. No one knows whether it has a will of its own.',160,'F','Dusknoir','62','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9-63','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.',70,'F','Chimecho','63','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-64','Saki Hayashiro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'F','Whimsicott V','64','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-65','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Whimsicott V',NULL,250,'F','Whimsicott VSTAR','65','Rare Holo VSTAR','Pokémon'),('swsh9-66','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Psychic power allows these Pokémon to fly. Some say they were the guardians of an ancient city. Others say they were the guardians\' emissaries.',110,'F','Sigilyph','66','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-67','Nagomi Nijo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Since Dedenne can\'t generate as much electricity on its own, it steals electricity from outlets or other electric Pokémon.',70,'E','Dedenne','67','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-68','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,160,'E','Mimikyu V','68','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-69','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,NULL,1,'Mimikyu V',NULL,300,'E','Mimikyu VMAX','69','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh9-7','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,3,'Turtwig','It knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.',100,'F','Grotle','7','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-70','Misa Tsutsui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They say that any patisserie visited by Milcery is guaranteed success and good fortune.',50,'E','Milcery','70','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-71','sowsow',NULL,NULL,1,'Milcery','When Alcremie is content, the cream it secretes from its hands becomes sweeter and richer.',90,'E','Alcremie','71','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-72','ryoma uratsuka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It launches kicks while spinning. If it spins at high speed, it may bore its way into the ground.',100,'F','Hitmontop','72','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-73','miki kudo',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It hunts without twitching a muscle by pulling in its prey with powerful magnetism. But sometimes it pulls natural enemies in close.',90,'F','Nosepass','73','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-74','zig',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape.',60,'F','Trapinch','74','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-75','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Trapinch','The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches.',90,'F','Vibrava','75','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-76','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Vibrava','This Pokémon hides in the heart of sandstorms it creates and seldom appears where people can see it.',150,'F','Flygon','76','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-77','Lee HyunJung',NULL,NULL,2,'Burmy','When Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémon\'s body. The cloak is never shed.',110,'F','Wormadam','77','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-78','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience.',60,'F','Riolu','78','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-79','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,'Riolu','It controls waves known as auras, which are powerful enough to pulverize huge rocks. It uses these waves to take down its prey.',120,'F','Lucario','79','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9-8','Oswaldo KATO',NULL,NULL,4,'Grotle','Small Pokémon occasionally gather on its unmoving back to begin building their nests.',190,'F','Torterra','8','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9-80','Teeziro',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It performs throwing moves with first-rate skill. Over the course of many battles, Throh\'s belt grows darker as it absorbs its wearer\'s sweat.',120,'F','Throh','80','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-81','Shinji Kanda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If you see a Sawk training in the mountains in its single-minded pursuit of strength, it\'s best to quietly pass by.',90,'F','Sawk','81','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-82','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'They were sculpted from clay in ancient times. No one knows why, but some of them are driven to continually line up boulders.',100,'F','Golett','82','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-83','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,4,'Golett','Artillery platforms built into the walls of ancient castles served as perches from which Golurk could fire energy beams.',150,'F','Golurk','83','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-84','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'The wastewater coming from factories is clean these days, so Grimer have nothing to eat. They\'re said to be on the verge of extinction.',80,'F','Grimer','84','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-85','Scav',NULL,NULL,3,'Grimer','Because they scatter germs everywhere, they\'ve long been targeted for extermination, leading to a steep decline in their population.',130,'F','Muk','85','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-86','yuu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its paws conceal sharp claws. If attacked, it suddenly extends the claws and startles its enemy.',70,'F','Sneasel','86','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-87','Hasuno',NULL,NULL,1,'Sneasel','They attack their quarry in packs. Prey as large as Mamoswine easily fall to the teamwork of a group of Weavile.',90,'F','Weavile','87','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-88','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Honchkrow V','88','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-89','Uta',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Exactly 108 spirits gathered to become this Pokémon. Apparently there are some ill-natured spirits in the mix.',70,'F','Spiritomb','89','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-9','Miki Tanaka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If its cloak is broken in battle, it quickly remakes the cloak with materials nearby.',60,'F','Burmy','9','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-90','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It steals things from people just to amuse itself with their frustration. A rivalry exists between this Pokémon and Nickit.',60,'F','Purrloin','90','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-91','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,1,'Purrloin','Don\'t be fooled by its gorgeous fur and elegant figure. This is a moody and vicious Pokémon.',100,'F','Liepard','91','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-92','Rianti Hidayat',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Through its nose, it sucks in the emanations produced by people and Pokémon when they feel annoyed. It thrives off this negative energy.',60,'F','Impidimp','92','Common','Pokémon'),('swsh9-93','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,1,'Impidimp','When it gets down on all fours as if to beg for forgiveness, it\'s trying to lure opponents in so that it can stab them with its spear-like hair.',90,'F','Morgrem','93','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9-94','DOM',NULL,NULL,2,'Morgrem','With the hair wrapped around its body helping to enhance its muscles, this Pokémon can overwhelm even Machamp.',160,'F','Grimmsnarl','94','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-95','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,190,'F','Morpeko V','95','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-96','PLANETA Mochizuki',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,230,'F','Aggron V','96','Rare Holo V','Pokémon'),('swsh9-97','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Aggron V',NULL,330,'F','Aggron VMAX','97','Rare Holo VMAX','Pokémon'),('swsh9-98','Ryo Ueda',NULL,NULL,2,'Burmy','When Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémon\'s body. The cloak is never shed.',110,'F','Wormadam','98','Rare','Pokémon'),('swsh9-99','Pani Kobayashi',NULL,NULL,4,'Nosepass','It uses three small units to catch prey and battle enemies. The main body mostly just gives orders.',140,'F','Probopass','99','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG01','You Iribi',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','Once it has stored up enough heat, this Pokémon\'s body temperature can reach up to 1,700 degrees Fahrenheit.',110,'D','Flareon','TG01','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG02','Jiro Sasumo',NULL,NULL,2,'Eevee','When Vaporeon\'s fins begin to vibrate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours.',110,'D','Vaporeon','TG02','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG03','Shinya Komatsu',NULL,NULL,2,'Remoraid','It traps enemies with its suction-cupped tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head.',110,'E','Octillery','TG03','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG04','DOM',NULL,NULL,1,'Eevee','If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes.',100,'D','Jolteon','TG04','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG05','AKIRA EGAWA',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'When the interior part of its tail spins like a motor, Zekrom can generate many bolts of lightning to blast its surroundings.',130,'D','Zekrom','TG05','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG06','Megumi Higuchi',NULL,NULL,2,'Dusclops','At the bidding of transmissions from the spirit world, it steals people and Pokémon away. No one knows whether it has a will of its own.',150,'D','Dusknoir','TG06','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG07','kurumitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Since Dedenne can\'t generate as much electricity on its own, it steals electricity from outlets or other electric Pokémon.',70,'E','Dedenne','TG07','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG08','OKACHEKE',NULL,NULL,1,'Milcery','When Alcremie is content, the cream it secretes from its hands becomes sweeter and richer.',90,'E','Alcremie','TG08','Trainer Gallery Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('swsh9tg-TG09','Shiburingaru',NULL,NULL,2,'Spinarak','It spews threads from its mouth to catch its prey. When night falls, it lea