rs with its vine and decorates itself with them. For some reason, flowers won\'t wither once they\'re attached to a Comfey.',70,'F','Comfey','SWSH242','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH243','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,2,'Machoke','It quickly swings its four arms to rock its opponents with ceaseless punches and chops from all angles.',150,'F','Machamp','SWSH243','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH244','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it\'s raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.',60,'E','Scorbunny','SWSH244','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH245','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Once diluted, its poison becomes medicinal. This Pokémon came into popularity after a pharmaceutical company chose it as a mascot.',60,'E','Croagunk','SWSH245','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH246','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,'Sneasel','They attack their quarry in packs. Prey as large as Mamoswine easily fall to the teamwork of a group of Weavile.',110,'F','Weavile','SWSH246','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH247','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes.',150,'F','Regigigas','SWSH247','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH248','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,210,'F','Kleavor V','SWSH248','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH249','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Kleavor V',NULL,270,'F','Kleavor VSTAR','SWSH249','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH250','PLANETA Tsuji',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,170,'F','Lumineon V','SWSH250','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH251','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'F','Boss\'s Orders','SWSH251','Promo','Trainer'),('swshp-SWSH252','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,200,'F','Infernape V','SWSH252','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH253','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,220,'F','Origin Forme Palkia V','SWSH253','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH254','aky CG Works',NULL,NULL,2,'Origin Forme Palkia V',NULL,280,'F','Origin Forme Palkia VSTAR','SWSH254'