kémon'),('swshp-SWSH271','Taira Akitsu',NULL,NULL,2,'Ralts','If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.',80,'F','Kirlia','SWSH271','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH272','Nisota Niso',NULL,NULL,1,'Archen','It needs a running start to take off. If Archeops wants to fly, it first needs to run nearly 25 mph, building speed over a course of about 2.5 miles.',150,'F','Archeops','SWSH272','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH273','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor - this one is gentle - I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities.',50,'F','Hisuian Basculin','SWSH273','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH274','GIDORA',NULL,NULL,2,'Unidentified Fossil','Its hard skull is its distinguishing feature. It snapped trees by headbutting them, and then it fed on their ripe berries.',90,'F','Cranidos','SWSH274','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH275','NC Empire',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It starts life with a wondrous power that permits it to bond with any kind of Pokémon.',70,'F','Manaphy','SWSH275','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH276','Narumi Sato',NULL,NULL,1,'Togepi','They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness.',80,'F','Togetic','SWSH276','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH277','DOM',NULL,NULL,3,'Thwackey','The one with the best drumming techniques becomes the boss of the troop. It has a gentle disposition and values harmony among its group.',180,'E','Rillaboom','SWSH277','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH278','Yuya Oka',NULL,NULL,1,'Raboot','It\'s skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.',170,'E','Cinderace','SWSH278','Promo','Pokémon'),('swshp-SWSH279','GOSSAN',NULL,NULL,1,'Drizzile','Its nictitating membranes let it pick out foes\' weak points so it can precisely blast them with water that shoots