0,NULL,'Panpour','11',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-12','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It secretes flexible bubbles from its chest and back. The bubbles reduce the damage it would otherwise take when attacked.',60,NULL,'Froakie','12',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-13','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Froakie','It can throw bubble-covered pebbles with precise control, hitting empty cans up to a hundred feet away.',80,NULL,'Frogadier','13',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-14','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,'Frogadier','It creates throwing stars out of compressed water. When it spins them and throws them at high speed, these stars can split metal in two.',140,NULL,'Greninja','14',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-15','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They knock down flying prey by firing compressed water from their massive claws like shooting a pistol.',70,NULL,'Clauncher','15',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-16','Mizue',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.',60,NULL,'Poochyena','16',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-17','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Poochyena','It will always obey the commands of a skilled Trainer. Its behavior arises from its living in packs in ancient times.',90,NULL,'Mightyena','17',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-18','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Opponents who stare at the flashing of the light-emitting spots on its body become dazed and lose their will to fight.',60,NULL,'Inkay','18',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-19','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Blades comprise this Pokémon\'s entire body. If battling dulls the blades, it sharpens them on stones by the river.',60,NULL,'Pawniard','19',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-2','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It shares the leaf on its head with weary-looking Pokémon. These leaves are known to relieve stress.',70,NULL,'Pansage','2',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-20','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Pawniard','This pitiless Pokémon commands a group of Pawniard to hound prey into immobility. It then moves in to finish the prey off.',90,NULL,'Bisharp','20',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-21','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Apparently this Pokémon is born when a departed spirit inhabits a sword. It attaches itself to people and drinks their life force.',60,NULL,'Honedge','21',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-22','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways.',70,NULL,'Snubbull','22',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-23','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,3,'Snubbull','It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.',100,NULL,'Granbull','23',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-24','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To entangle its opponents in battle, it extrudes white threads as sweet and sticky as cotton candy.',60,NULL,'Swirlix','24',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-25','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The plant stalk it holds is its weapon. The stalk is used like a sword to cut all sorts of things.',70,NULL,'Farfetch\'d','25',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-26','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.',120,NULL,'Snorlax','26',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-27','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'If it is around babies, it milk it produces contains much more nutrition than usual.',100,NULL,'Miltank','27',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-28','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It can\'t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail.',60,NULL,'Skitty','28',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-29','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'With nerves of steel, nothing can perturb it. It is more agile and active than it appears.',70,NULL,'Bidoof','29',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-3','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The quills on its head are usually soft. When it flexes them, the points become so hard and sharp that they can pierce rock.',60,NULL,'Chespin','3',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-30','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They use their large ears to dig burrows. They will dig the whole night through.',60,NULL,'Bunnelby','30',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-31','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'These friendly Pokémon send signals to one another with beautiful chirps and tail-feather movements.',50,NULL,'Fletchling','31',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-32','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Trimming its fluffy fur not only makes it more elegant but also increases the swiftness of its movements.',90,NULL,'Furfrou','32',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-33','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Trimming its fluffy fur not only makes it more elegant but also increases the swiftness of its movements.',90,NULL,'Furfrou','33',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-34','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Crushing Hammer','34',NULL,'Trainer'),('xy0-35','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Poké Ball','35',NULL,'Trainer'),('xy0-36','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pokémon Catcher','36',NULL,'Trainer'),('xy0-37','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Potion','37',NULL,'Trainer'),('xy0-38','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Switch','38',NULL,'Trainer'),('xy0-39','Ken Sugimori',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Tierno','39',NULL,'Trainer'),('xy0-4','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Chespin','It relies on its sturdy shell to deflect predators\' attacks. It counterattacks with its sharp quills.',90,NULL,'Quilladin','4',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-5','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,4,'Quilladin','Its Tackle is forceful enough to flip a 50-ton tank. It shields its allies from danger with its own body.',150,NULL,'Chesnaught','5',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-6','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a constant search for warm places.',80,NULL,'Slugma','6',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-7','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Very intelligent, it roasts berries before eating them. It likes to help people.',70,NULL,'Pansear','7',NULL,'Pokémon'),('xy0-8','5ba