8-27','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its dorsal, pectoral and tail fins wave elegantly in water. That is why it is known as the water dancer.',60,NULL,'Goldeen','27','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-28','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,'Goldeen','It makes its nest by hollowing out boulders in streams with its horn. It defends its eggs with its life.',90,NULL,'Seaking','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-29','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It appears in large numbers by seashores. At night, its central core flashes with a red light.',60,NULL,'Staryu','29','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-3','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It swings its long antlers wildly to attack. During cold periods, it hides deep in forests.',100,NULL,'Pinsir','3','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-30','Mitsuhiro Arita',NULL,NULL,1,'Staryu','At the center of its body is a red core, which sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.',90,NULL,'Starmie','30','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-31','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Using its dorsal fin as a suction pad, it clings to a Mantine\'s underside to scavenge for leftovers.',60,NULL,'Remoraid','31','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-32','Suwama Chiaki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Using its dorsal fin as a suction pad, it clings to a Mantine\'s underside to scavenge for leftovers.',60,NULL,'Remoraid','32','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-33','Kyoko Umemoto',NULL,NULL,2,'Remoraid','It traps foes with the suction cups on its tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head.',90,NULL,'Octillery','33','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-34','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Glalie-EX','34','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy8-35','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Glalie-EX',NULL,220,NULL,'M Glalie-EX','35','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy8-36','Kanako Eo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Because it is very proud, it hates accepting food from people. Its thick down guards it from cold.',60,NULL,'Piplup','36','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-37','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,'Piplup','It lives a solitary life. Its wings deliver wicked blows that can snap even the thickest of trees.',80,NULL,'Prinplup','37','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-38','Satoshi Shirai',NULL,NULL,2,'Prinplup','The three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. The leader has the biggest horns.',140,NULL,'Empoleon','38','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-39','Yukiko Baba',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'In the spring, it grows berries with the texture of frozen treats around its belly.',80,NULL,'Snover','39','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-4','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body.',60,NULL,'Cacnea','4','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-40','Naoyo Kimura',NULL,NULL,4,'Snover','It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards.',130,NULL,'Abomasnow','40','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-41','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large.',60,NULL,'Panpour','41','Common','Pokémon');
INSERT INTO `card` VALUES ('xy8-42','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Panpour','It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail.',90,NULL,'Simipour','42','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-43','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This Pokémon formed from icicles bathed in energy from the morning sun. It sleeps buried in snow.',50,NULL,'Vanillite','43','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-44','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,2,'Vanillite','Snowy mountains are this Pokémon\'s habitat. During an ancient ice age, they moved to southern areas.',70,NULL,'Vanillish','44','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-45','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,'Vanillish','Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards.',130,NULL,'Vanilluxe','45','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-46','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It protects its skin by covering its body in delicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air, it keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings.',50,NULL,'Froakie','46','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-47','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,1,'Froakie','Its swiftness is unparalleled. It can scale a tower of more than 2,000 feet in a minute\'s time.',70,NULL,'Frogadier','47','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-48','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It has small electric sacs on both its cheeks. If threatened, it looses electric charges from the sacs.',60,NULL,'Pikachu','48','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-49','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pikachu','It can loose 100,000-volt bursts of electricity instantly downing foes several times its size.',90,NULL,'Raichu','49','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-5','Hajime Kusajima',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It\'s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It\'s kind enough to share them with friends.',60,NULL,'Pansage','5','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-50','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Raichu',NULL,130,NULL,'Raichu BREAK','50','Rare BREAK','Pokémon'),('xy8-51','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It moves while constantly hovering. It discharges Thunder Wave and so on from the units at its sides.',60,NULL,'Magnemite','51','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-52','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It moves while constantly hovering. It discharges Thunder Wave and so on from the units at its sides.',60,NULL,'Magnemite','52','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-53','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Magnemite','Generates strange radio signals. It raises the temperature by 3.6 degrees Fahrenheit within 3,300 feet.',80,NULL,'Magneton','53','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-54','Hajime Kusajima',NULL,NULL,3,'Magneton','It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism.',140,NULL,'Magnezone','54','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-55','Shin Nagasawa',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'This rough Pokémon stores energy inside its body, then sweeps across the land, shooting off electricity.',120,NULL,'Raikou','55','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-56','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity.',110,NULL,'Stunfisk','56','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-57','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses its tail to absorb electricity from power plants or from outlets in houses, and then it fires the electricity from its whiskers.',60,NULL,'Dedenne','57','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-58','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.',50,NULL,'Gastly','58','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-59','Midori Harada',NULL,NULL,1,'Gastly','It licks with its gaseous tongue to steal the victim\'s life force. It lurks in darkness for prey.',70,NULL,'Haunter','59','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-6','Kagemaru Himeno',NULL,NULL,1,'Pansage','Ill tempered, it fights by swinging its barbed tail around wildly. The leaf growing on its head is very bitter.',90,NULL,'Simisage','6','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-60','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Haunter','Hiding in people\'s shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake.',130,NULL,'Gengar','60','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-61','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Mewtwo-EX','61','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy8-62','PLANETA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,170,NULL,'Mewtwo-EX','62','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy8-63','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,3,'Mewtwo-EX',NULL,230,NULL,'M Mewtwo-EX','63','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy8-64','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Mewtwo-EX',NULL,210,NULL,'M Mewtwo-EX','64','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy8-65','sui',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It likes playing mischievous tricks, such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night.',60,NULL,'Misdreavus','65','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-66','Ayaka Yoshida',NULL,NULL,1,'Misdreavus','Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it.',90,NULL,'Mismagius','66','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-67','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack.',100,NULL,'Wobbuffet','67','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-68','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is highly attuned to the emotions of people and Pokémon. It hides if it senses hostility.',60,NULL,'Ralts','68','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-69','Sanosuke Sakuma',NULL,NULL,1,'Ralts','It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.',80,NULL,'Kirlia','69','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-7','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Such a thick shell of wood covers its head and back that even a direct hit from a truck wouldn\'t faze it.',60,NULL,'Chespin','7','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-70','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Those who sleep holding Cresselia\'s feather are assured of joyful dreams. It is said to represent the crescent moon.',110,NULL,'Cresselia','70','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-71','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The heart-shaped mark left on a body after a woobat has been attached to it is said to bring good fortune.',60,NULL,'Woobat','71','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-72','sui',NULL,NULL,1,'Woobat','Anyone who comes into contact with the ultrasonic waves emitted by a courting male experiences a positive mood shift.',90,NULL,'Swoobat','72','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-73','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago.',50,NULL,'Elgyem','73','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-74','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,1,'Elgyem','It uses psychic power to control an opponent\'s brain and tamper with its memories.',90,NULL,'Beheeyem','74','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-75','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Disliking water, it lives in deep burrows in arid areas. It can roll itself instantly into a ball.',60,NULL,'Sandshrew','75','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-76','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,1,'Sandshrew','Curls up into a spiny ball when threatened. It can roll while curled up to attack or escape.',90,NULL,'Sandslash','76','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-77','Sumiyoshi Kizuki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It always wears the skull of its dead mother, so no one has any idea what its hidden face looks like.',70,NULL,'Cubone','77','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-78','match',NULL,NULL,2,'Cubone','The bone it holds is its key weapon. It throws the bone skillfully like a boomerang to KO targets.',100,NULL,'Marowak','78','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-79','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Marowak',NULL,140,NULL,'Marowak BREAK','79','Rare BREAK','Pokémon'),('xy8-8','Megumi Mizutani',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Such a thick shell of wood covers its head and back that even a direct hit from a truck wouldn\'t faze it.',60,NULL,'Chespin','8','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-80','Atsuko Nishida',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'If it smells something enticing, it dashes off headlong to find the source of the aroma.',60,NULL,'Swinub','80','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-81','MAHOU',NULL,NULL,2,'Swinub','Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly.',100,NULL,'Piloswine','81','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-82','Masakazu Fukuda',NULL,NULL,4,'Piloswine','Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age.',160,NULL,'Mamoswine','82','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-83','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'It enshrouds itself with sand to protect itself from germs. It does not enjoy getting wet.',80,NULL,'Hippopotas','83','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-84','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Kirlia','A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows.',150,NULL,'Gallade','84','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-85','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Its melodies are sung with a special vocalization method that can control the feelings of those who hear it.',90,NULL,'Meloetta','85','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-86','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It does its level best to glare and pull a scary face, but it can\'t help grinning if anyone pats its head.',60,NULL,'Pancham','86','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-87','match',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against.',80,NULL,'Hawlucha','87','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-88','match',NULL,NULL,1,'Cacnea','Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move.',100,NULL,'Cacturne','88','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy8-89','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon.',60,NULL,'Zorua','89','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-9','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'The quills on its head are usually soft. When it flexes them, the points become so hard and sharp that they can pierce rock.',60,NULL,'Chespin','9','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-90','Hitoshi Ariga',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon.',60,NULL,'Zorua','90','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-91','kawayoo',NULL,NULL,2,'Zorua','Bonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents.',100,NULL,'Zoroark','91','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-92','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zoroark',NULL,140,NULL,'Zoroark BREAK','92','Rare BREAK','Pokémon'),('xy8-93','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It flashes the light-emitting spots on its body, which drains its opponent\'s will to fight. It takes the opportunity to scuttle away and hide.',50,NULL,'Inkay','93','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-94','TOKIYA',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.',130,NULL,'Yveltal','94','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy8-95','Shigenori Negishi',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Implements shaped like it were discovered in ancient tombs. It is unknown if they are related.',60,NULL,'Bronzor','95','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-96','Tomokazu Komiya',NULL,NULL,3,'Bronzor','Ancient people believed that petitioning Bronzong for rain was the way to make crops grow.',110,NULL,'Bronzong','96','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-97','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able to create walls out of thin air by miming.',70,NULL,'Mr. Mime','97','Rare','Pokémon'),('xy8-98','Yuka Morii',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.',70,NULL,'Snubbull','98','Common','Pokémon'),('xy8-99','Naoki Saito',NULL,NULL,3,'Snubbull','It can make most any Pokémon run away simply by opening its mouth wide to reveal its big fangs.',120,NULL,'Granbull','99','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy9-1','Akira Komayama',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.',60,NULL,'Chikorita','1','Common','Pokémon'),('xy9-10','match',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'It has a brave and trustworthy nature. It fearlessly stands up to bigger and stronger foes.',70,NULL,'Growlithe','10','Common','Pokémon'),('xy9-100','Toyste Beach',NULL,NUL