,'It lazes vacantly near water. If something bites its tail, it won\'t even notice for a whole day.',70,NULL,'Slowpoke','19','Common','Pokémon'),('xy9-2','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,'Chikorita','The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.',90,NULL,'Bayleef','2','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy9-20','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,'Slowpoke','When a Slowpoke went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a Shellder. That made it evolve into Slowbro.',100,NULL,'Slowbro','20','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy9-21','Aya Kusube',NULL,NULL,2,'Slowpoke','When its head was bitten, toxins entered Slowpoke\'s head and unlocked an extraordinary power.',100,NULL,'Slowking','21','Rare Holo','Pokémon'),('xy9-22','Mizue',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Clamping on to an opponent reveals its vulnerable parts, so it uses this move only as a last resort.',60,NULL,'Shellder','22','Common','Pokémon'),('xy9-23','Kouki Saitou',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'Clamping on to an opponent reveals its vulnerable parts, so it uses this move only as a last resort.',60,NULL,'Shellder','23','Common','Pokémon'),('xy9-24','Saya Tsuruta',NULL,NULL,2,'Shellder','Its shell is extremely hard. It cannot be shattered, even with a bomb. The shell opens only when it is attacking.',100,NULL,'Cloyster','24','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy9-25','Hiroki Asanuma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'It appears in large numbers by seashores. At night, its central core flashes with a red light.',40,NULL,'Staryu','25','Common','Pokémon'),('xy9-26','Eske Yoshinob',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,180,NULL,'Gyarados-EX','26','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy9-27','5ban Graphics',NULL,NULL,2,'Gyarados-EX',NULL,240,NULL,'M Gyarados-EX','27','Rare Holo EX','Pokémon'),('xy9-28','kirisAki',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'Its high intelligence enables it to understand human speech. It likes to ferry people on its back.',120,NULL,'Lapras','28','Uncommon','Pokémon'),('xy9-29','Kanako Eo',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'They prefer unpolluted southern seas. Their coral branches lose their color and deteriorate in 